(188156, 10847, 5212, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE b/w.  I especially like the look of the trees to the right.  It looks a bit like everything is leaning a tad to the right, and I''m not sure what the object is buried below the tree on the left?</td>', 'VERY NICE b/w.  I especially like the look of the trees to the right.  It looks a bit like everything is leaning a tad to the right, and I''m not sure what the object is buried below the tree on the left?', '2003-01-13 00:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
