(188175, 10877, 5964, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge perfectly but it is a bit out of focus and the sky looks grainy.5</td>', 'This fits the challenge perfectly but it is a bit out of focus and the sky looks grainy.5', '2003-01-13 00:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(188178, 10728, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the texture in the snow. Beautiful lighting and good exposure. Composition is wonderful too. Well done.</td>', 'Nice capture of the texture in the snow. Beautiful lighting and good exposure. Composition is wonderful too. Well done.', '2003-01-13 00:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(188180, 10755, 5212, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, the house on the right distracts me just a bit if I was to be picky.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Pretty shot, the house on the right distracts me just a bit if I was to be picky.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-01-13 00:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(188182, 10747, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful....</td>', 'Beautiful....', '2003-01-13 00:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(188183, 10810, 5212, '<td valign="top">Looks really cold, even in red!</td>', 'Looks really cold, even in red!', '2003-01-13 00:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(188184, 10990, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great use of contrast and composition, as well as mood. 8</td>', 'Great use of contrast and composition, as well as mood. 8', '2003-01-13 00:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(188187, 10762, 3419, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if this a photo taken from the air (hills and valley), or from the ground (bumps in the snow). Nice use of light and shadows to create pattern and texture.</td>', 'I can''t decide if this a photo taken from the air (hills and valley), or from the ground (bumps in the snow). Nice use of light and shadows to create pattern and texture.', '2003-01-13 00:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(188189, 11037, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, 7</td>', 'Very pretty, 7', '2003-01-13 00:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(188190, 10995, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting. Well done.', '2003-01-13 00:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(188191, 11026, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrasting colors.  Curious what the forgotten object is?</td>', 'Nice use of contrasting colors.  Curious what the forgotten object is?', '2003-01-13 00:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(188193, 10925, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I can see this on a postcard.</td>', 'Very nice composition. I can see this on a postcard.', '2003-01-13 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(188194, 10837, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very nice, like the shadow and the footprints in the foreground to add a little interest and depth.</td>', 'Very nice, like the shadow and the footprints in the foreground to add a little interest and depth.', '2003-01-13 00:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(188195, 10972, 3419, '<td valign="top">While the branches hanging down in front create a nice texture pattern, the photo is a little too busy.</td>', 'While the branches hanging down in front create a nice texture pattern, the photo is a little too busy.', '2003-01-13 00:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(188196, 10866, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting, composition, colors.  One of my favorites so far.  10</td>', 'Great use of lighting, composition, colors.  One of my favorites so far.  10', '2003-01-13 00:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(188197, 10908, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Nice side-lighting and capture of the mist.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Nice side-lighting and capture of the mist.', '2003-01-13 00:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(188199, 10859, 5964, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, I think I would have cropped a bit of the night sky out and mabey put the center of the trees a bit off center, but still I like it. 7.</td>', 'Nice effect, I think I would have cropped a bit of the night sky out and mabey put the center of the trees a bit off center, but still I like it. 7.', '2003-01-13 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(188201, 10772, 3419, '<td valign="top">The foreground is rather dark, and I would prefer less of it and more of the cactus.</td>', 'The foreground is rather dark, and I would prefer less of it and more of the cactus.', '2003-01-13 00:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(188202, 10811, 5212, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, great use of lighting and colors.  Not sure if it meets the challenge, however, as there is little land in the shot.</td>', 'Interesting photo, great use of lighting and colors.  Not sure if it meets the challenge, however, as there is little land in the shot.', '2003-01-13 00:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(188204, 10950, 5212, '<td valign="top">I like this composition, but would prefer less sharpening around the branches, and a bit more clarity in the background trees.</td>', 'I like this composition, but would prefer less sharpening around the branches, and a bit more clarity in the background trees.', '2003-01-13 00:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(188205, 11020, 3419, '<td valign="top">A very pretty scen but the foreground is very blurry and therefore distracting. Nice capture of detail on the snow-covered mountains.</td>', 'A very pretty scen but the foreground is very blurry and therefore distracting. Nice capture of detail on the snow-covered mountains.', '2003-01-13 00:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(188206, 10795, 5212, '<td valign="top">Unusual way to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Unusual way to meet the challenge.', '2003-01-13 00:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(188208, 10756, 5964, '<td valign="top">I wish this photo was bigger! Oh well, 5.</td>', 'I wish this photo was bigger! Oh well, 5.', '2003-01-13 01:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(188210, 10809, 3419, '<td valign="top">The canopy of branches makes this an interesting composition. The snow looks pink to me, overexposed, and not in focus. If your camera has an exposure compensation feature, you might want to try experimenting with that in conjunction with the aperture setting and shutter speed. Snow is very challenging to capture it just right.</td>', 'The canopy of branches makes this an interesting composition. The snow looks pink to me, overexposed, and not in focus. If your camera has an exposure compensation feature, you might want to try experimenting with that in conjunction with the aperture setting and shutter speed. Snow is very challenging to capture it just right.', '2003-01-13 01:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(188212, 10756, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this would be a great photo if it was only larger :( - setzler</td>', 'I''m sure this would be a great photo if it was only larger :( - setzler', '2003-01-13 01:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(188213, 10928, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition - I like how the branches in front frame the tree on the hill. Colors are very bold. Good eye.</td>', 'Very nice composition - I like how the branches in front frame the tree on the hill. Colors are very bold. Good eye.', '2003-01-13 01:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(188217, 10928, 5964, '<td valign="top">I think the blue border adds a bit too much blue to this shot. 6.</td>', 'I think the blue border adds a bit too much blue to this shot. 6.', '2003-01-13 01:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(188233, 10864, 5964, '<td valign="top">How long was the exposure? I think it was a bit too long, too much light picked up. Neat idea though.6.</td>', 'How long was the exposure? I think it was a bit too long, too much light picked up. Neat idea though.6.', '2003-01-13 01:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(188254, 10835, 1143, '<td valign="top">Top half of this is beautiful. I would personally crop off in the middle of the large black mass. I don''t think the bottom water adds much - it just detracts from the drama of the top where the colors and silhouettes are so strong.</td>', 'Top half of this is beautiful. I would personally crop off in the middle of the large black mass. I don''t think the bottom water adds much - it just detracts from the drama of the top where the colors and silhouettes are so strong.', '2003-01-13 01:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(188259, 10717, 5964, '<td valign="top">Man the snow was sure coming down. The shot almost looks like it is in B&amp;W except for the bench. That gives it a cool effect. Considering the circumstances Good job. 7.</td>', 'Man the snow was sure coming down. The shot almost looks like it is in B&W except for the bench. That gives it a cool effect. Considering the circumstances Good job. 7.', '2003-01-13 01:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(188264, 11007, 2058, '<td valign="top">This photo really makes me want to get an infrared filter for my camera.  Beautiful!  The tones are fantastic.</td>', 'This photo really makes me want to get an infrared filter for my camera.  Beautiful!  The tones are fantastic.', '2003-01-13 01:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(188266, 11032, 2058, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but I think you placed to much focus on the silo, and you don''t really show a lot of the surrounding landscape.  I would also have chosen a different border color.  Light blue doesnt compliment the rest of the photo.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but I think you placed to much focus on the silo, and you don''t really show a lot of the surrounding landscape.  I would also have chosen a different border color.  Light blue doesnt compliment the rest of the photo.', '2003-01-13 01:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(188287, 10885, 5964, '<td valign="top">This shot is almost too busy(the trees) for black and white. It was a bit hard on the eye to look and figure out what it is I am looking at. The reflection in the river helped.5.</td>', 'This shot is almost too busy(the trees) for black and white. It was a bit hard on the eye to look and figure out what it is I am looking at. The reflection in the river helped.5.', '2003-01-13 01:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(188293, 10822, 5964, '<td valign="top">My guess is that this was taken from the car. The blue on the right upper corner looks like that of a windshield. It would have ruined the shot to crop it, but still it is distracting.4.</td>', 'My guess is that this was taken from the car. The blue on the right upper corner looks like that of a windshield. It would have ruined the shot to crop it, but still it is distracting.4.', '2003-01-13 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(188296, 10909, 5964, '<td valign="top">I liked the shot, but subtracted a bit due to the reflections(hot spots?) in the shot.5.</td>', 'I liked the shot, but subtracted a bit due to the reflections(hot spots?) in the shot.5.', '2003-01-13 02:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(188300, 11040, 6011, '<td valign="top">The title is perfect. Nice picture</td>', 'The title is perfect. Nice picture', '2003-01-13 02:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(188310, 10902, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but for the purposes of this challenge I would rather see more through the portal and less of the rock frame.  Maybe you could also have tilted the camera so that the rock outline was straighter and the horizon obviously on an angle.</td>', 'Nice photo but for the purposes of this challenge I would rather see more through the portal and less of the rock frame.  Maybe you could also have tilted the camera so that the rock outline was straighter and the horizon obviously on an angle.', '2003-01-13 02:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(188311, 10746, 6172, '<td valign="top">You know, it''s not fair, you get photos at Hawaii!  It''s too easy!  The photo practically makes itself.  Nice job.</td>', 'You know, it''s not fair, you get photos at Hawaii!  It''s too easy!  The photo practically makes itself.  Nice job.', '2003-01-13 02:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
