(188783, 10873, 3294, '<td valign="top">I would really like to see more of this scene.  For me, the tight vertical crop hurts this image since the sharpness just isn''t there.  But, wow... what a pretty town! (6)</td>', 'I would really like to see more of this scene.  For me, the tight vertical crop hurts this image since the sharpness just isn''t there.  But, wow... what a pretty town! (6)', '2003-01-13 11:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(188785, 10827, 2011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the clouds. Love the reflection. Love the color. Love the perspective. 10</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the clouds. Love the reflection. Love the color. Love the perspective. 10', '2003-01-13 11:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(188787, 10793, 3294, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I would have preferred less shadows.. as if you could grab the sun and move it around.  heh  I like the fact that you copped this portrait-style and not landscape-style... new perspective.</td>', 'Nice colors.  I would have preferred less shadows.. as if you could grab the sun and move it around.  heh  I like the fact that you copped this portrait-style and not landscape-style... new perspective.', '2003-01-13 11:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(188788, 10941, 3294, '<td valign="top">I hate you people who live near pretty places like this.  The clouds give a sense of scale, I like it!  (7)</td>', 'I hate you people who live near pretty places like this.  The clouds give a sense of scale, I like it!  (7)', '2003-01-13 11:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(188789, 10881, 3294, '<td valign="top">Slightly dark for me.  A lot appears to be lost in the shadows.</td>', 'Slightly dark for me.  A lot appears to be lost in the shadows.', '2003-01-13 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(188790, 10874, 3294, '<td valign="top">My eyes are playing tricks on me.  Very nice twist here.  The colors you''ve captured are amazing.  Nice job!  (8)</td>', 'My eyes are playing tricks on me.  Very nice twist here.  The colors you''ve captured are amazing.  Nice job!  (8)', '2003-01-13 11:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(188792, 10833, 4852, '<td valign="top">Boy, if you could''ve taken this without the group of tree''s in the left background, this would be a ten.   9</td>', 'Boy, if you could''ve taken this without the group of tree''s in the left background, this would be a ten.   9', '2003-01-13 11:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(188794, 10892, 3294, '<td valign="top">So many photos are of land, and most have so little clarity... nice to see your photo with such vibrant colors and focus.  It just _looks_ cold too!  (8)</td>', 'So many photos are of land, and most have so little clarity... nice to see your photo with such vibrant colors and focus.  It just _looks_ cold too!  (8)', '2003-01-13 11:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(188795, 10867, 3294, '<td valign="top">Looks like Texas to me.  Flat and brown!  hehe</td>', 'Looks like Texas to me.  Flat and brown!  hehe', '2003-01-13 11:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(188798, 11023, 4852, '<td valign="top">Red Rock Canyon ?, I know this place. The colors here are fun to catch. Great shot  8</td>', 'Red Rock Canyon ?, I know this place. The colors here are fun to catch. Great shot  8', '2003-01-13 11:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(188799, 10884, 3294, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it amazing how the sun makes the land come alive?  I see a b/w photo until I notice the golden reds of the trees in the background.  Wonderful contrast.</td>', 'Isn''t it amazing how the sun makes the land come alive?  I see a b/w photo until I notice the golden reds of the trees in the background.  Wonderful contrast.', '2003-01-13 11:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
