(188801, 10962, 3127, '<td valign="top">The reflection is great as is the intimacy and solitude that it conveys. Looks like a peaceful place to be.</td>', 'The reflection is great as is the intimacy and solitude that it conveys. Looks like a peaceful place to be.', '2003-01-13 11:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(188802, 10809, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great shot witht he vibrant white against the colored building. Wow.</td>', 'Great shot witht he vibrant white against the colored building. Wow.', '2003-01-13 11:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(188803, 10833, 3127, '<td valign="top">The sun coming through the trees is wonderful. Makes the photo warm in spite of the snow.</td>', 'The sun coming through the trees is wonderful. Makes the photo warm in spite of the snow.', '2003-01-13 11:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(188806, 10711, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great color changes. Very good photo.</td>', 'Great color changes. Very good photo.', '2003-01-13 11:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(188807, 10737, 3127, '<td valign="top">A little pixelated, but still a great shot.</td>', 'A little pixelated, but still a great shot.', '2003-01-13 11:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(188810, 10881, 117, '<td valign="top">I like this half way hidden good concept and idea--8 for concept</td>', 'I like this half way hidden good concept and idea--8 for concept', '2003-01-13 11:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(188811, 10714, 3294, '<td valign="top">You probably drive on this road everyday, yet somehow you''ve captured a unique and beautiful moment.  The mountains in the background really sell this photo... reveals that there are things back behind the fog.  The fog also splits this photo into two... against the rule of thirds.  But it still seems balanced, although you could have cropped out some of the road and still be effective.  I see lots of purple... gives me a sense of the cold.  Well done!  You should be proud of this one.  (9)</td>', 'You probably drive on this road everyday, yet somehow you''ve captured a unique and beautiful moment.  The mountains in the background really sell this photo... reveals that there are things back behind the fog.  The fog also splits this photo into two... against the rule of thirds.  But it still seems balanced, although you could have cropped out some of the road and still be effective.  I see lots of purple... gives me a sense of the cold.  Well done!  You should be proud of this one.  (9)', '2003-01-13 11:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(188813, 10882, 3294, '<td valign="top">Pretty thumbnail.</td>', 'Pretty thumbnail.', '2003-01-13 11:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(188815, 10933, 3127, '<td valign="top">Good eye to capture the colors in the building against the blue sky. Nice shot!</td>', 'Good eye to capture the colors in the building against the blue sky. Nice shot!', '2003-01-13 11:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(188816, 10869, 3127, '<td valign="top">Seems a little blurry, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Seems a little blurry, but still a nice shot.', '2003-01-13 11:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(188819, 10995, 3294, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition... the land swings the eyes back to the left when so much of the land is on the right.  Although it does seem a little dark to me. (7)</td>', 'Excellent composition... the land swings the eyes back to the left when so much of the land is on the right.  Although it does seem a little dark to me. (7)', '2003-01-13 11:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(188823, 10957, 3127, '<td valign="top">Very interesting tree - nice shot.</td>', 'Very interesting tree - nice shot.', '2003-01-13 11:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(188825, 10908, 3127, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo with the clouds on the top and bottom.</td>', 'Beautiful photo with the clouds on the top and bottom.', '2003-01-13 11:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(188826, 11023, 3294, '<td valign="top">This would make a nice three-series photo sets.  Know what I mean?  Three photos side by side.  If I did that I would wait for different times of the days to get the different colors.  Can''t go wrong with mountains. (7)</td>', 'This would make a nice three-series photo sets.  Know what I mean?  Three photos side by side.  If I did that I would wait for different times of the days to get the different colors.  Can''t go wrong with mountains. (7)', '2003-01-13 11:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(188827, 10940, 3127, '<td valign="top">The shadows create and interesting feel. Nice color contrast.</td>', 'The shadows create and interesting feel. Nice color contrast.', '2003-01-13 11:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(188829, 10746, 3294, '<td valign="top">Is that a cloud up there? Wow!  I hate you for living there, by the way.  Send me a postcard dammit!  ;)  (8)</td>', 'Is that a cloud up there? Wow!  I hate you for living there, by the way.  Send me a postcard dammit!  ;)  (8)', '2003-01-13 11:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
