(189068, 10835, 5822, '<td valign="top">I would prefer that there be more tonal seperation in the foreground boulder between it and it''s reflection in the water.  Without more detail in the rock, it looks like a black blob in the middle of your picture. Also, would prefer a landscape photo such as this not have any border, especially one so thick and black, as this limits the mind''s eye from imagining that the scene stretches indefinitely.  I do like the color of the sunset, and the background hills, though.</td>', 'I would prefer that there be more tonal seperation in the foreground boulder between it and it''s reflection in the water.  Without more detail in the rock, it looks like a black blob in the middle of your picture. Also, would prefer a landscape photo such as this not have any border, especially one so thick and black, as this limits the mind''s eye from imagining that the scene stretches indefinitely.  I do like the color of the sunset, and the background hills, though.', '2003-01-13 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
