(189157, 10801, 5964, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about this shot...I guess the title says it all. My only suggestion woudl be to have cropped out the visible powerpole on the left, you would not have removed barely any of the shot and one less man made thing to take away from such beauty. 8.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about this shot...I guess the title says it all. My only suggestion woudl be to have cropped out the visible powerpole on the left, you would not have removed barely any of the shot and one less man made thing to take away from such beauty. 8.', '2003-01-13 16:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(189159, 10958, 3112, '<td valign="top">I very much like the composition.  I might have been tempted to push the saturation and contrast a bit.</td>', 'I very much like the composition.  I might have been tempted to push the saturation and contrast a bit.', '2003-01-13 16:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(189160, 10957, 3112, '<td valign="top">It is very difficult, I know, to shoot into the sun with the mist.  Good job, despite.</td>', 'It is very difficult, I know, to shoot into the sun with the mist.  Good job, despite.', '2003-01-13 16:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(189161, 10914, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really well composed image. Good use of 3rds with a really nice blue sky in just the right place :) It isnt totally my definition of a landscape but its very good. Maybe neatimage could fix the little bit of grain in the sky. All in all great shot, 8.</td>', 'Really well composed image. Good use of 3rds with a really nice blue sky in just the right place :) It isnt totally my definition of a landscape but its very good. Maybe neatimage could fix the little bit of grain in the sky. All in all great shot, 8.', '2003-01-13 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(189164, 10947, 3112, '<td valign="top">The moving sea looks almost like a morph. I like it. And, for the record, this IS a landscape, no matter what *they* say.</td>', 'The moving sea looks almost like a morph. I like it. And, for the record, this IS a landscape, no matter what *they* say.', '2003-01-13 16:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(189165, 10891, 3112, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Good work!  Could maybe be a little sharper, but I''m not docking points for that.</td>', 'Great colors!  Good work!  Could maybe be a little sharper, but I''m not docking points for that.', '2003-01-13 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
