(189214, 10827, 5869, '<td valign="top">when the clouds come out to play....fantastic reflections, midnight sun etc...</td>', 'when the clouds come out to play....fantastic reflections, midnight sun etc...', '2003-01-13 16:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(189217, 10904, 5561, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape!  One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape!  One of my favorites this week.', '2003-01-13 16:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(189225, 11026, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the aspect ratio of this photo, and I love the contrast between the rust and the green.  The tank is quite well focused, and the border works well (especially given the sky is virtually white).  Good work.</td>', 'I like the aspect ratio of this photo, and I love the contrast between the rust and the green.  The tank is quite well focused, and the border works well (especially given the sky is virtually white).  Good work.', '2003-01-13 16:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(189226, 10768, 5561, '<td valign="top">I like the use of B&amp;W here.</td>', 'I like the use of B&W here.', '2003-01-13 16:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(189231, 11007, 1647, '<td valign="top">Very moody photo - especially with the black looking clouds in the sky.  It looks like a potential scene for a Tim Burton movie.  My only negative comment is that perhaps the black at the bottom is too much - I think the photo could have been very effective if cropped at the bottom of the whitish hill (or even taken from a closer point).  Good work</td>', 'Very moody photo - especially with the black looking clouds in the sky.  It looks like a potential scene for a Tim Burton movie.  My only negative comment is that perhaps the black at the bottom is too much - I think the photo could have been very effective if cropped at the bottom of the whitish hill (or even taken from a closer point).  Good work', '2003-01-13 16:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(189235, 10972, 3112, '<td valign="top">I like it, but much like my own photo, it may be a bit too busy.  It''s obvious you were trying to focus on the broken tree, but there''s not a way to do so in this lighting situation.  No way to isolate the tree.</td>', 'I like it, but much like my own photo, it may be a bit too busy.  It''s obvious you were trying to focus on the broken tree, but there''s not a way to do so in this lighting situation.  No way to isolate the tree.', '2003-01-13 16:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(189236, 10851, 3569, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful in all ways!</td>', 'simply beautiful in all ways!', '2003-01-13 16:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(189238, 10917, 1041, '<td valign="top">very nice photo.  i like how the shade and the sun divide the picture, great texture.  it''s not the closest to my interpretation of a "landscape" (which really doesn''t include macros/close-ups), but i''ll give you the benefit of the doubt here as i can see where you are coming from.  just slightly reducing your score.</td>', 'very nice photo.  i like how the shade and the sun divide the picture, great texture.  it''s not the closest to my interpretation of a "landscape" (which really doesn''t include macros/close-ups), but i''ll give you the benefit of the doubt here as i can see where you are coming from.  just slightly reducing your score.', '2003-01-13 17:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(189239, 10879, 5561, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2003-01-13 17:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(189240, 11026, 3569, '<td valign="top">The rusty tank and green grass contrasts are perfectly done.</td>', 'The rusty tank and green grass contrasts are perfectly done.', '2003-01-13 17:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(189241, 10981, 3569, '<td valign="top">This is the definition of Landscape.  Beuatiful.</td>', 'This is the definition of Landscape.  Beuatiful.', '2003-01-13 17:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(189242, 10941, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts green/white.</td>', 'Great contrasts green/white.', '2003-01-13 17:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(189244, 10909, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The reflections on the lens from the sun are a (small) shame - Perhaps you could shade the lens (or even buy a lens hood depending on the camera).  The river and valley lends itself to a portrait orientation - well done.  Finally, the ground appears purple on the almost-bottom right - is this a camera glitch or something growing on the ground?</td>', 'Nice photo.  The reflections on the lens from the sun are a (small) shame - Perhaps you could shade the lens (or even buy a lens hood depending on the camera).  The river and valley lends itself to a portrait orientation - well done.  Finally, the ground appears purple on the almost-bottom right - is this a camera glitch or something growing on the ground?', '2003-01-13 17:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(189245, 11010, 3569, '<td valign="top">I know the rule of thirds, but would have rated it higher if there were less sky, the subject isn''t the sky.  Otherwise nice capture</td>', 'I know the rule of thirds, but would have rated it higher if there were less sky, the subject isn''t the sky.  Otherwise nice capture', '2003-01-13 17:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(189248, 10753, 1647, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone works really well in this photo - the old bridge, with the sailing ship in the foreground suit it.  It looks like the framework for the fireworks is still on the bridge, but it doesn''t distract that much.  Well done.</td>', 'Sepia tone works really well in this photo - the old bridge, with the sailing ship in the foreground suit it.  It looks like the framework for the fireworks is still on the bridge, but it doesn''t distract that much.  Well done.', '2003-01-13 17:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189250, 10773, 1647, '<td valign="top">Your composition and framing is very good - especially having the tree on the right edge given the way it is wind blown.  The photo looks just marginally out of focus - perhaps a tiny bit of camera shake.  The border suits the image well.</td>', 'Your composition and framing is very good - especially having the tree on the right edge given the way it is wind blown.  The photo looks just marginally out of focus - perhaps a tiny bit of camera shake.  The border suits the image well.', '2003-01-13 17:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(189252, 10853, 3942, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but why so small?</td>', 'Nice shot, but why so small?', '2003-01-13 17:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(189253, 10942, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Was the building blown out on purpose?  Nice and sharp.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Was the building blown out on purpose?  Nice and sharp.', '2003-01-13 17:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(189255, 10902, 3018, '<td valign="top">I love this composition, wonderful!  I think it is a little too dark on the stone.  You may try to meter the light on the stone instead of on the sea and sky, so that you have a better lighted picture, I think. Nice shot!</td>', 'I love this composition, wonderful!  I think it is a little too dark on the stone.  You may try to meter the light on the stone instead of on the sea and sky, so that you have a better lighted picture, I think. Nice shot!', '2003-01-13 17:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(189257, 10937, 3569, '<td valign="top">I liked the verticle, but would have rated it higher is more foreground and less trees.</td>', 'I liked the verticle, but would have rated it higher is more foreground and less trees.', '2003-01-13 17:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(189258, 10875, 3112, '<td valign="top">Could be very good, if the sun were on the leading edge of the storm instead. Excellent effort.</td>', 'Could be very good, if the sun were on the leading edge of the storm instead. Excellent effort.', '2003-01-13 17:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(189259, 10746, 5964, '<td valign="top">Wow what scenary....I love the smoke on the top of the mountains. I don''t know if you even needed to include the water, I think the mountains speak for themselves.9.</td>', 'Wow what scenary....I love the smoke on the top of the mountains. I don''t know if you even needed to include the water, I think the mountains speak for themselves.9.', '2003-01-13 17:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(189262, 10877, 3112, '<td valign="top">Framing needs to make the casino complex more monolithic.  The casino running off the edge is a little distracting.  I suspect, however that this is as far as you could get to take the shot.</td>', 'Framing needs to make the casino complex more monolithic.  The casino running off the edge is a little distracting.  I suspect, however that this is as far as you could get to take the shot.', '2003-01-13 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(189263, 10812, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great landscape subject.  I would have rated it higher if the trees would have been cropped to have them on the left, not sure what your subject is the way you cropped it.</td>', 'Great landscape subject.  I would have rated it higher if the trees would have been cropped to have them on the left, not sure what your subject is the way you cropped it.', '2003-01-13 17:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(189267, 10855, 1041, '<td valign="top">personally, i''m not a big fan of b&amp;w for landscapes (yes, i know of Ansel Adams, i''m still not a fan ;), but i guess this is one of the pix that i can actually work for.  gives it an even more desolate feeling.  i like the sky, the contrast of the white clouds against the black at the top, and the tree definitely gives your eyes something to focus on.  i think i would like to see all of it though.  the white border works well, the black around that does, too, except i think it''s a little too wide.</td>', 'personally, i''m not a big fan of b&w for landscapes (yes, i know of Ansel Adams, i''m still not a fan ;), but i guess this is one of the pix that i can actually work for.  gives it an even more desolate feeling.  i like the sky, the contrast of the white clouds against the black at the top, and the tree definitely gives your eyes something to focus on.  i think i would like to see all of it though.  the white border works well, the black around that does, too, except i think it''s a little too wide.', '2003-01-13 17:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(189269, 11007, 2759, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this shot. It''s great.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this shot. It''s great.', '2003-01-13 17:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(189270, 10984, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice enough photo, however the horse steals the show a little.  The composition and framing is good - perhaps a little more of the leftmost tree could be left in shot.  The colours are very natural and easy to look at.  Well done.</td>', 'It''s a nice enough photo, however the horse steals the show a little.  The composition and framing is good - perhaps a little more of the leftmost tree could be left in shot.  The colours are very natural and easy to look at.  Well done.', '2003-01-13 17:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(189271, 11018, 3569, '<td valign="top">The road going off the edge of the picture moves your eye off the road.  It would look better to have the road end at your subject or go back into the picture.</td>', 'The road going off the edge of the picture moves your eye off the road.  It would look better to have the road end at your subject or go back into the picture.', '2003-01-13 17:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(189272, 10854, 3112, '<td valign="top">Very snapshottish,  Not bad, necessarily, but no clear subject, and color adjustments are going to be necessary.  Please continue to submit...  I can see a little bit about where you were trying to go with this, and it will be nice to see you get more adept at relating what you see.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very snapshottish,  Not bad, necessarily, but no clear subject, and color adjustments are going to be necessary.  Please continue to submit...  I can see a little bit about where you were trying to go with this, and it will be nice to see you get more adept at relating what you see.  Good luck!', '2003-01-13 17:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(189275, 10838, 2759, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this shot, one of 3 tens this week.</td>', 'I love everything about this shot, one of 3 tens this week.', '2003-01-13 17:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(189276, 10851, 3112, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Recommend: Drop the brightness, and up contrast... or adjust levels such that the sky is a bit darker.</td>', 'Very nice.  Recommend: Drop the brightness, and up contrast... or adjust levels such that the sky is a bit darker.', '2003-01-13 17:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(189278, 11043, 3569, '<td valign="top">It would have been a better shot if you''d cropped the powerpole out, just to right of tree.  Also, the sun wouldn''t have been so centered.</td>', 'It would have been a better shot if you''d cropped the powerpole out, just to right of tree.  Also, the sun wouldn''t have been so centered.', '2003-01-13 17:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(189279, 10925, 3112, '<td valign="top">BW was a good choice for this one...  I might have shot from an angle where the sidewalk was less presented.<br/> <br/></td>', 'BW was a good choice for this one...  I might have shot from an angle where the sidewalk was less presented. ', '2003-01-13 17:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(189280, 10814, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Boost the saturation and sharpening a little bit, and you are going to have a picture that snaps!</td>', 'Excellent composition. Boost the saturation and sharpening a little bit, and you are going to have a picture that snaps!', '2003-01-13 17:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(189281, 10756, 3942, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, but why so small???</td>', 'Really nice shot, but why so small???', '2003-01-13 17:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(189283, 10849, 3569, '<td valign="top">It appears that the focus is soft and next time try cropping the sun away from the center.</td>', 'It appears that the focus is soft and next time try cropping the sun away from the center.', '2003-01-13 17:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(189285, 10978, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous of your deck - what a lovely view.  The framing of the trees is very good.  You could have cropped some of the top of the image perhaps - although I''m not sure I can find a good height to stop at.  The trees in the foreground are a little dark, but only a little.  Finally, if you plan on making a print I think there are filters which could smooth the sky out a little.  Still a great photo though.</td>', 'I''m jealous of your deck - what a lovely view.  The framing of the trees is very good.  You could have cropped some of the top of the image perhaps - although I''m not sure I can find a good height to stop at.  The trees in the foreground are a little dark, but only a little.  Finally, if you plan on making a print I think there are filters which could smooth the sky out a little.  Still a great photo though.', '2003-01-13 17:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(189287, 10894, 3569, '<td valign="top">The powerploe ruined it for me.  try to avoid man-mad objects if possible...</td>', 'The powerploe ruined it for me.  try to avoid man-mad objects if possible...', '2003-01-13 17:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(189295, 10753, 1135, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo but I would like it better in color. The flags at the bottom are a bit distracting but maybe there was nothing you could do about it. Nice Job</td>', 'This is a great photo but I would like it better in color. The flags at the bottom are a bit distracting but maybe there was nothing you could do about it. Nice Job', '2003-01-13 17:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(189296, 11018, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is the first "stunning" photo I''ve voted on so far.  It''s such a simple photo, yet is says so much.  The road/path is composed perfectly, the trees on the left are perfect and putting the horizon centered all work well.  The colours are also lovely and natural, which suit the subject.</td>', 'This is the first "stunning" photo I''ve voted on so far.  It''s such a simple photo, yet is says so much.  The road/path is composed perfectly, the trees on the left are perfect and putting the horizon centered all work well.  The colours are also lovely and natural, which suit the subject.', '2003-01-13 17:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(189299, 10948, 933, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot and kind of a cool effect, but a little too photoshopped for my tastes.</td>', 'A very interesting shot and kind of a cool effect, but a little too photoshopped for my tastes.', '2003-01-13 17:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(189300, 10777, 1135, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had better weather than we did. The Phoenix area was very hazy last week making it difficult to get a good shot. I like how the fence leads the eye, nice job.</td>', 'Looks like you had better weather than we did. The Phoenix area was very hazy last week making it difficult to get a good shot. I like how the fence leads the eye, nice job.', '2003-01-13 17:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(189303, 10958, 5266, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - you capture the coldness of the moment, and the contrast of the red on the lighthouses (?) brings a little life to the photo.</td>', 'I like this shot - you capture the coldness of the moment, and the contrast of the red on the lighthouses (?) brings a little life to the photo.', '2003-01-13 17:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(189305, 10784, 1135, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful! Where is it? I don''t care for the window frame though, I find it distracting. Otherwise I like it.</td>', 'This is just beautiful! Where is it? I don''t care for the window frame though, I find it distracting. Otherwise I like it.', '2003-01-13 17:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(189307, 10903, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think that the plants in the foreground are a little too distracting.  I would''ve prefer to see only one branch in the foreground instead of a lot of them.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice, but I think that the plants in the foreground are a little too distracting.  I would''ve prefer to see only one branch in the foreground instead of a lot of them.  Good luck!', '2003-01-13 17:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(189308, 10933, 5266, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the little old houses and the shiny new big buildings, but it''s a bit cramped.  Not too crazy about trees on either side as well - cropping out the fir tree on the left side would have helped anyway.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the little old houses and the shiny new big buildings, but it''s a bit cramped.  Not too crazy about trees on either side as well - cropping out the fir tree on the left side would have helped anyway.', '2003-01-13 17:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(189309, 10762, 1135, '<td valign="top">Looks too cold. Where is it? Nice job.</td>', 'Looks too cold. Where is it? Nice job.', '2003-01-13 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(189310, 11023, 5266, '<td valign="top">Love the misty mountains.  nice composition</td>', 'Love the misty mountains.  nice composition', '2003-01-13 17:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(189311, 10827, 5266, '<td valign="top">Pretty!!   I love the sun (is that a star filter) and the clouds - so pretty!! Nice composition</td>', 'Pretty!!   I love the sun (is that a star filter) and the clouds - so pretty!! Nice composition', '2003-01-13 17:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(189312, 10837, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I think, even though it seems difficult to get, that the tree in the foreground was more distinguishable or more contrasting with the background, as its detail seems to get lost within.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I think, even though it seems difficult to get, that the tree in the foreground was more distinguishable or more contrasting with the background, as its detail seems to get lost within.  Good luck!', '2003-01-13 17:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(189315, 10959, 5266, '<td valign="top">Don\''t really think this is a \"landscape\" -- more of a reflection - think we should see at least some non-reflection land.   But it''s very nice, just doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Don\''t really think this is a \"landscape\" -- more of a reflection - think we should see at least some non-reflection land.   But it''s very nice, just doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2003-01-13 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(189316, 10745, 2158, '<td valign="top">The mountains are beautiful but I''m not too keen on the rocks.</td>', 'The mountains are beautiful but I''m not too keen on the rocks.', '2003-01-13 17:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(189317, 10971, 5266, '<td valign="top">A little dreary - a sunny day would have been better, but I know it''s hard to come across one in the winter.</td>', 'A little dreary - a sunny day would have been better, but I know it''s hard to come across one in the winter.', '2003-01-13 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(189319, 11011, 1647, '<td valign="top">Personally I think this image is cropped to tightly on top, and too loosely on the bottom.  Perhaps a wider shot to indicate what the eagle could see would work well.  It''s still a good photo though.</td>', 'Personally I think this image is cropped to tightly on top, and too loosely on the bottom.  Perhaps a wider shot to indicate what the eagle could see would work well.  It''s still a good photo though.', '2003-01-13 17:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189320, 10770, 1135, '<td valign="top">Looks like last weeks winner, same place? Just tipping a little to the left, nice job.</td>', 'Looks like last weeks winner, same place? Just tipping a little to the left, nice job.', '2003-01-13 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(189321, 10992, 5266, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky to watch while you chill!!</td>', 'Beautiful sky to watch while you chill!!', '2003-01-13 17:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(189323, 10808, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice, but needs more DOF.  Look how the sand in the foreground and the sea in the background are out of focus.  Try to have the stones and the sea in focus, and crop a little from the bottom.</td>', 'Nice, but needs more DOF.  Look how the sand in the foreground and the sea in the background are out of focus.  Try to have the stones and the sea in focus, and crop a little from the bottom.', '2003-01-13 17:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(189325, 10753, 5266, '<td valign="top">Try heading to Taronga Zoo for a shot - there''s a beautiful one.  Not crazy abou this angle.</td>', 'Try heading to Taronga Zoo for a shot - there''s a beautiful one.  Not crazy abou this angle.', '2003-01-13 17:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(189326, 10907, 1135, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get the title. Looks manmade to me.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get the title. Looks manmade to me.', '2003-01-13 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(189327, 10833, 5266, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!  I love the shadows on the snow.  You get the "cold" feeling from this photo!!</td>', 'Very nice!!  I love the shadows on the snow.  You get the "cold" feeling from this photo!!', '2003-01-13 17:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189328, 10798, 4494, '<td valign="top">Did you adjust the Hue of the mountains to make them more blue/magenta?  Cause I can see it a little in the close-up trees at the top of the mountain on the left.</td>', 'Did you adjust the Hue of the mountains to make them more blue/magenta?  Cause I can see it a little in the close-up trees at the top of the mountain on the left.', '2003-01-13 17:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(189330, 10786, 5266, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft.</td>', 'Focus is soft.', '2003-01-13 17:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(189331, 11007, 3018, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I would love to see this in color, but B&amp;W looks good in this picture.  Good luck!</td>', 'Cool shot.  I would love to see this in color, but B&W looks good in this picture.  Good luck!', '2003-01-13 17:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
