(189345, 10905, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The overall coloring with the dark tree and relatively dark ground is stunning.  I love this pic!!</td>', 'Very nice.  The overall coloring with the dark tree and relatively dark ground is stunning.  I love this pic!!', '2003-01-13 17:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(189346, 10895, 5266, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot!!!  Very interesting tree, great sky - love the wispy clouds that just give it a bit of texture.</td>', 'I like this a lot!!!  Very interesting tree, great sky - love the wispy clouds that just give it a bit of texture.', '2003-01-13 17:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(189347, 10747, 5266, '<td valign="top">oh, so pretty!!!!!  I love the reflection, the color, the composition - EVERYTHING!!!  Must visit Kansas City!!</td>', 'oh, so pretty!!!!!  I love the reflection, the color, the composition - EVERYTHING!!!  Must visit Kansas City!!', '2003-01-13 17:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(189350, 10853, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ack, why is the picture so small?  You can have up to 640 pixels.  This looks like 200 at the most. :(  Sorry but have to give a 3.</td>', 'Ack, why is the picture so small?  You can have up to 640 pixels.  This looks like 200 at the most. :(  Sorry but have to give a 3.', '2003-01-13 17:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(189352, 10791, 5266, '<td valign="top">I like the signpost and the people, to give us a bit of idea the perspectives.  Nice composition</td>', 'I like the signpost and the people, to give us a bit of idea the perspectives.  Nice composition', '2003-01-13 17:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(189354, 10747, 4494, '<td valign="top">The tree''s aren''t very interesting but the sky is awesome.</td>', 'The tree''s aren''t very interesting but the sky is awesome.', '2003-01-13 17:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(189355, 10784, 5266, '<td valign="top">I am such a sucker for a sunset!!!  Absolutely wonderful colors - do you think you could talk the power company into taking down those lines for you?</td>', 'I am such a sucker for a sunset!!!  Absolutely wonderful colors - do you think you could talk the power company into taking down those lines for you?', '2003-01-13 17:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(189356, 10914, 5266, '<td valign="top">Don''t like that the top of the tree is cut off</td>', 'Don''t like that the top of the tree is cut off', '2003-01-13 17:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(189359, 11007, 1863, '<td valign="top">This photo is truly amazing in my eyes. I love the darkness, and how the buildings stand out, and the way the road seems to lead up to the mansions. The only way I can fault it, is in the left hand side. Had you either made the photo wider to accomodate what the structure on the left is cut off, or just cut that out completely, I think maybe the picture would be more harmonious. Nonetheless, it''s a 9!! thank you for submitting :) -Annida</td>', 'This photo is truly amazing in my eyes. I love the darkness, and how the buildings stand out, and the way the road seems to lead up to the mansions. The only way I can fault it, is in the left hand side. Had you either made the photo wider to accomodate what the structure on the left is cut off, or just cut that out completely, I think maybe the picture would be more harmonious. Nonetheless, it''s a 9!! thank you for submitting :) -Annida', '2003-01-13 17:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(189360, 10950, 5266, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, but I think a view of only the "other side of the river" would be nice - get rid of the trees &amp; shrubs directly in front of you.</td>', 'I love the colors, but I think a view of only the "other side of the river" would be nice - get rid of the trees & shrubs directly in front of you.', '2003-01-13 17:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(189361, 10929, 5266, '<td valign="top">Wow!! Now that''s a view!!!</td>', 'Wow!! Now that''s a view!!!', '2003-01-13 17:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(189364, 10936, 4494, '<td valign="top">Usually a relatively boring picture (of the beach) but this one is pretty good.  Nice realistic colors.  7.</td>', 'Usually a relatively boring picture (of the beach) but this one is pretty good.  Nice realistic colors.  7.', '2003-01-13 17:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189365, 10996, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow nice picture, but why is so small?  Would be much better at 640 pixels tall.</td>', 'Wow nice picture, but why is so small?  Would be much better at 640 pixels tall.', '2003-01-13 17:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
