(189371, 10792, 1863, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous setting in a winter wonderland. Too bad you couldn''t give us more of what was going on with the area. Still beautiful. I give you an 8!! -Annida</td>', 'A gorgeous setting in a winter wonderland. Too bad you couldn''t give us more of what was going on with the area. Still beautiful. I give you an 8!! -Annida', '2003-01-13 17:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
