(189382, 10966, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites this week. The colouring, and just everything about it. My only wish was for more sky! I give you a 10! -Annida</td>', 'This is one of my favourites this week. The colouring, and just everything about it. My only wish was for more sky! I give you a 10! -Annida', '2003-01-13 18:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
