(189386, 10847, 1863, '<td valign="top">You know, I love the form of this photo,a nd how the line of trees on the right drag you deeply into the photograph, but there''s one distracting thing, and it''s the only way I can fault it. the thing sticking out of the ground on the left, it''s sooooo distracting! Get rid of it and take the photo again! Regardless, a cleverly taken photo, and after looking at it many times, I give you a 9!! -Annida</td>', 'You know, I love the form of this photo,a nd how the line of trees on the right drag you deeply into the photograph, but there''s one distracting thing, and it''s the only way I can fault it. the thing sticking out of the ground on the left, it''s sooooo distracting! Get rid of it and take the photo again! Regardless, a cleverly taken photo, and after looking at it many times, I give you a 9!! -Annida', '2003-01-13 18:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(189387, 10948, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture!!  I love the exaggerated colors in this!!  Yeah, a 9.  It looks like SF, Calif., but I''m trying to figure out where you were.</td>', 'Very cool picture!!  I love the exaggerated colors in this!!  Yeah, a 9.  It looks like SF, Calif., but I''m trying to figure out where you were.', '2003-01-13 18:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
