(189930, 10936, 811, '<td valign="top">Oh man, I would like to be there right now.  I understand why you cropped as you did (to keep the buildings in it_, but I think if you could have shown more of the beach, it would have given a more definite "entry" point to the picture, and would have given the eye a little stronger guidance into the center of the picture.  Very nice colors.</td>', 'Oh man, I would like to be there right now.  I understand why you cropped as you did (to keep the buildings in it_, but I think if you could have shown more of the beach, it would have given a more definite "entry" point to the picture, and would have given the eye a little stronger guidance into the center of the picture.  Very nice colors.', '2003-01-13 23:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(189931, 10838, 3018, '<td valign="top">Wow! Breathtaking.  Colors are great.  Good composition .  I wish I could see more detail on the mountains, but maybe you could loose some of the expanse.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow! Breathtaking.  Colors are great.  Good composition .  I wish I could see more detail on the mountains, but maybe you could loose some of the expanse.  Good luck!', '2003-01-13 23:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(189932, 10786, 4615, '<td valign="top">great abstract.   I don''t want to mark it down for not being a landscape, but to be fair I have to say 5.  In another challenge, could be an 8 or 9.</td>', 'great abstract.   I don''t want to mark it down for not being a landscape, but to be fair I have to say 5.  In another challenge, could be an 8 or 9.', '2003-01-13 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189933, 10910, 5561, '<td valign="top">I think a little more cropping of the sky would work well.  Beautiful colors.</td>', 'I think a little more cropping of the sky would work well.  Beautiful colors.', '2003-01-13 23:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(189934, 10737, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail.  What did you use to get this shot?</td>', 'Very nice detail.  What did you use to get this shot?', '2003-01-13 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(189935, 11041, 4615, '<td valign="top">good focus and exposure.</td>', 'good focus and exposure.', '2003-01-13 23:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189937, 10724, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the road leads into the picture, and the buildings in the distance add some interest.   Except for the one cloud on the far right, I almost think the sky could be cropped down as it is not real exciting.  Good exposure.</td>', 'I like the way the road leads into the picture, and the buildings in the distance add some interest.   Except for the one cloud on the far right, I almost think the sky could be cropped down as it is not real exciting.  Good exposure.', '2003-01-13 23:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189942, 10823, 5561, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nice clear shot.  I think a little more crop on the left, a little less ocean.  Still a nice photo.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nice clear shot.  I think a little more crop on the left, a little less ocean.  Still a nice photo.', '2003-01-13 23:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(189943, 10981, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very nice hills, but I would''ve like to see more color and detail on the background.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice hills, but I would''ve like to see more color and detail on the background.  Good luck!', '2003-01-13 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(189945, 10801, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the sign.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice composition with the sign.  Good luck!', '2003-01-13 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(189947, 10753, 6172, '<td valign="top">I guess I wonder if this is technically a LANDscape, because I see more water than land, and the bridge is the prominent subject.  I like the picture, I only rate it low because I don''t think it fits the category properly.  In "architecture" or "bridges" I would rate it much higher.</td>', 'I guess I wonder if this is technically a LANDscape, because I see more water than land, and the bridge is the prominent subject.  I like the picture, I only rate it low because I don''t think it fits the category properly.  In "architecture" or "bridges" I would rate it much higher.', '2003-01-13 23:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(189948, 10874, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very cool use of the reflection to compose your picture.  I think I would''ve cropped more from the top.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very cool use of the reflection to compose your picture.  I think I would''ve cropped more from the top.  Good luck!', '2003-01-13 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(189949, 10913, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice variation of our theme!</td>', 'Nice variation of our theme!', '2003-01-13 23:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189950, 10821, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like it. Can you tell me where this was taken?</td>', 'Nice, I like it. Can you tell me where this was taken?', '2003-01-13 23:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(189952, 10990, 6172, '<td valign="top">This is the only photo that contains less land than sky that I rated this high.  I think it''s a great photo, done in an unconventional manner.</td>', 'This is the only photo that contains less land than sky that I rated this high.  I think it''s a great photo, done in an unconventional manner.', '2003-01-13 23:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(189953, 10910, 6172, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Where is your town?</td>', 'Cute!  Where is your town?', '2003-01-13 23:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(189955, 10975, 6172, '<td valign="top">More of a still life</td>', 'More of a still life', '2003-01-13 23:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(189957, 11005, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent job at keeping the snow white! This shot is composed well, I think, and  I like the high contrast of this shot,  but I''m afraid it is causing some loss of details in the tree and background.</td>', 'Excellent job at keeping the snow white! This shot is composed well, I think, and  I like the high contrast of this shot,  but I''m afraid it is causing some loss of details in the tree and background.', '2003-01-13 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(189959, 10958, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice angle</td>', 'Nice angle', '2003-01-13 23:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(189961, 10788, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, but...</td>', 'Very colorful, but...', '2003-01-13 23:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(189963, 10733, 6172, '<td valign="top">I really question if this is a landscape</td>', 'I really question if this is a landscape', '2003-01-13 23:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(189964, 10918, 811, '<td valign="top">Arrrggghh, why can''t I ever get my tree shots to look this good.  You have strong vertical "movement" and I like the angle of the shadows.  Nice work.</td>', 'Arrrggghh, why can''t I ever get my tree shots to look this good.  You have strong vertical "movement" and I like the angle of the shadows.  Nice work.', '2003-01-13 23:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(189967, 10907, 6172, '<td valign="top">The photo really looks very bland, no emphasis on any thing in particular.  There''s nothing interesting about it.</td>', 'The photo really looks very bland, no emphasis on any thing in particular.  There''s nothing interesting about it.', '2003-01-13 23:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(189968, 10770, 6172, '<td valign="top">More of a seascape, otherwise it''s very nice, that''s the only reason I rated it low</td>', 'More of a seascape, otherwise it''s very nice, that''s the only reason I rated it low', '2003-01-14 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(189969, 10795, 714, '<td valign="top">Hey Nice picture.  Where did you take that shot.  <br/>Ok, it took me awhile to think about how I felt about this.  I am not upset that you used my photo.  I am a little flattered.  Does it meet the challenge?  yes.  Do I like the technique?  I would say ya to a point.  I wish I knew more about how you did this.  It almost looks like a t.v. screen.  Is it really reflecting off of the disc?  Very impressive if it is. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey Nice picture.  Where did you take that shot.  Ok, it took me awhile to think about how I felt about this.  I am not upset that you used my photo.  I am a little flattered.  Does it meet the challenge?  yes.  Do I like the technique?  I would say ya to a point.  I wish I knew more about how you did this.  It almost looks like a t.v. screen.  Is it really reflecting off of the disc?  Very impressive if it is. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(189970, 10925, 811, '<td valign="top">I think if you could have framed this so that the sidewalk entered at the bottom and wove through the picture it would have been really effective.</td>', 'I think if you could have framed this so that the sidewalk entered at the bottom and wove through the picture it would have been really effective.', '2003-01-14 00:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(189972, 11026, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and I like the colors, though I think the green might be a touch oversaturated.</td>', 'Good composition, and I like the colors, though I think the green might be a touch oversaturated.', '2003-01-14 00:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(189973, 11004, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely - very different from a lot of what I''ve seen so far.  The warm color of the sky grabs the viewer, and the composition pulls the eye in.  That curve of the hillside really makes it stand out.</td>', 'Lovely - very different from a lot of what I''ve seen so far.  The warm color of the sky grabs the viewer, and the composition pulls the eye in.  That curve of the hillside really makes it stand out.', '2003-01-14 00:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(189974, 11010, 6172, '<td valign="top">How long did you wait for that rainbow, or is it perpetually over the falls?  I''ve been there, but never seen a rainbow that vividly.</td>', 'How long did you wait for that rainbow, or is it perpetually over the falls?  I''ve been there, but never seen a rainbow that vividly.', '2003-01-14 00:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(189976, 10958, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I think you have composed it well in that you have the picture divided in thirds, horizontally, which really adds to the interest level of the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I think you have composed it well in that you have the picture divided in thirds, horizontally, which really adds to the interest level of the shot.', '2003-01-14 00:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(189977, 10837, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a very nice photo.  The exposure is lovely and the framing is very good also.  Focus and depth of field are also very good.  It''s a very natural and real looking photo - quite appropriate to your title.  Well done.</td>', 'That''s a very nice photo.  The exposure is lovely and the framing is very good also.  Focus and depth of field are also very good.  It''s a very natural and real looking photo - quite appropriate to your title.  Well done.', '2003-01-14 00:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(189978, 10975, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - beautiful.  Great detail in your foreground, enhanced by the landscape.  Even though it''s out of your focus area (which I imagine some people won''t like) - the barn and countryside really set a mood.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow - beautiful.  Great detail in your foreground, enhanced by the landscape.  Even though it''s out of your focus area (which I imagine some people won''t like) - the barn and countryside really set a mood.  Great job.', '2003-01-14 00:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(189979, 10975, 811, '<td valign="top">The blur in the background really helps to bring out the detail of the plants.  I like the coloring as well, very warm.</td>', 'The blur in the background really helps to bring out the detail of the plants.  I like the coloring as well, very warm.', '2003-01-14 00:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(189982, 10728, 811, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of shadows!  I like the tree on the right, but I found myself wanting ot see more of it.</td>', 'Very effective use of shadows!  I like the tree on the right, but I found myself wanting ot see more of it.', '2003-01-14 00:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(189983, 10741, 1647, '<td valign="top">What a lovely rolling landscape.  Photo-wise, your composition is quite good, and putting the pond edge at the centre vertically works very well.  Plus the still water provides a very strong reflection.  Great photo (one of the best this week - and it''s a strong competition)</td>', 'What a lovely rolling landscape.  Photo-wise, your composition is quite good, and putting the pond edge at the centre vertically works very well.  Plus the still water provides a very strong reflection.  Great photo (one of the best this week - and it''s a strong competition)', '2003-01-14 00:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(189984, 10932, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, can''t think of a thing I would change except to suggest going back in Spring or Summer and reshooting to get a color version!</td>', 'Excellent composition, can''t think of a thing I would change except to suggest going back in Spring or Summer and reshooting to get a color version!', '2003-01-14 00:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(189985, 10885, 6192, '<td valign="top">Where is this place?!!!!! Nice shot</td>', 'Where is this place?!!!!! Nice shot', '2003-01-14 00:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(189986, 10791, 714, '<td valign="top">The picture seems to be tilting a bit to the left.  Maybe try a tripod or to fix it put a frame around it and turn the photo.  :-)  I don''t like the sign.  It really takes my eyes off the landscape. It also seem to be the only thing in focus.  Did you try this in b/w.  That might be interesting.  Good luck!</td>', 'The picture seems to be tilting a bit to the left.  Maybe try a tripod or to fix it put a frame around it and turn the photo.  :-)  I don''t like the sign.  It really takes my eyes off the landscape. It also seem to be the only thing in focus.  Did you try this in b/w.  That might be interesting.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(189987, 10739, 714, '<td valign="top">Great Dof and nice lighting.  Maybe a little more contrast.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great Dof and nice lighting.  Maybe a little more contrast.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(189988, 10853, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, but I think if the dark section at the bottom had been sharper, it would have been more effective, and if there was more of it.  Also, was the small size intentional?</td>', 'Very nice colors, but I think if the dark section at the bottom had been sharper, it would have been more effective, and if there was more of it.  Also, was the small size intentional?', '2003-01-14 00:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(189989, 10704, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good job.  I wonder though if it is cropped just a little too tightly on the sides - perhaps a little surrond would have put the bridge into perspective.  Besides that the composition (height of bridge top, inclusion of foreground boats is very good.  Perhaps you could have rotated the image slightly to make the top of the bridge horizontal, although it''s not a big deal.</td>', 'Good job.  I wonder though if it is cropped just a little too tightly on the sides - perhaps a little surrond would have put the bridge into perspective.  Besides that the composition (height of bridge top, inclusion of foreground boats is very good.  Perhaps you could have rotated the image slightly to make the top of the bridge horizontal, although it''s not a big deal.', '2003-01-14 00:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(189990, 10811, 6172, '<td valign="top">Exactly, nice pic, but I rate it low because it doesn''t fit our parameters</td>', 'Exactly, nice pic, but I rate it low because it doesn''t fit our parameters', '2003-01-14 00:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(189991, 11025, 714, '<td valign="top">This picture is way to dark.  I wish I could see more of the landscape. The landscape seem tilted to the left.  maybe try useing a tripod and using a longer exsposure to get it brighter.  Good luck!</td>', 'This picture is way to dark.  I wish I could see more of the landscape. The landscape seem tilted to the left.  maybe try useing a tripod and using a longer exsposure to get it brighter.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(189992, 10965, 6192, '<td valign="top">Has this been retouched? if not good Job!</td>', 'Has this been retouched? if not good Job!', '2003-01-14 00:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(189993, 11040, 6172, '<td valign="top">the mountains are so out of focus, if not it might be much better</td>', 'the mountains are so out of focus, if not it might be much better', '2003-01-14 00:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(189994, 10906, 6172, '<td valign="top">More an "architecture" photo</td>', 'More an "architecture" photo', '2003-01-14 00:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(189995, 10736, 1647, '<td valign="top">The powerful ness of the dark hills and foreground is lost slightly by the lit bush in the bottom right corner - perhaps if your going to print wash that bush out to black first (I realise you can''t do that for the challenge).  Otherwise a good photo.</td>', 'The powerful ness of the dark hills and foreground is lost slightly by the lit bush in the bottom right corner - perhaps if your going to print wash that bush out to black first (I realise you can''t do that for the challenge).  Otherwise a good photo.', '2003-01-14 00:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(189996, 10893, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like how I can see the detail in everything.  Great sunset.  I love that tall grass!  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like how I can see the detail in everything.  Great sunset.  I love that tall grass!  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(189997, 11033, 6172, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W makes this photo</td>', 'B&W makes this photo', '2003-01-14 00:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(189998, 10942, 6172, '<td valign="top">Is this really a landscape themed photo?  It''s very nice, but I wonder...</td>', 'Is this really a landscape themed photo?  It''s very nice, but I wonder...', '2003-01-14 00:20:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(189999, 10990, 714, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  I just wish I didn''t have so much sky to look at.  Maybe crop a little smaller.  Not much, just some.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like this a lot.  I just wish I didn''t have so much sky to look at.  Maybe crop a little smaller.  Not much, just some.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(190000, 10917, 6172, '<td valign="top">I had to think about it a long time, but then I decided this doesn''t fit the category</td>', 'I had to think about it a long time, but then I decided this doesn''t fit the category', '2003-01-14 00:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(190001, 10904, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  Perhaps just a little more sky would be nice - the mountains are just too close to the top edge for my liking.  Composition otherwise is quite nice - New Zealand truly is a lovely place in terms of scenary.</td>', 'Nice work.  Perhaps just a little more sky would be nice - the mountains are just too close to the top edge for my liking.  Composition otherwise is quite nice - New Zealand truly is a lovely place in terms of scenary.', '2003-01-14 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(190003, 10869, 1647, '<td valign="top">The photo appears slightly blurry - was it handheld perhaps?  Your composition (branch on right, path on left) was nice and it could be a really nice shot if a little crisper (and perhaps a little more light without the sky being so bright).  Good work though.</td>', 'The photo appears slightly blurry - was it handheld perhaps?  Your composition (branch on right, path on left) was nice and it could be a really nice shot if a little crisper (and perhaps a little more light without the sky being so bright).  Good work though.', '2003-01-14 00:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(190004, 10699, 6172, '<td valign="top">And there''s no land in sight...</td>', 'And there''s no land in sight...', '2003-01-14 00:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(190005, 10786, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very dusky indeed</td>', 'Very dusky indeed', '2003-01-14 00:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(190006, 10925, 6172, '<td valign="top">Totally without originality</td>', 'Totally without originality', '2003-01-14 00:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(190008, 10975, 714, '<td valign="top">I would have given this a ten if the barns were in focus.  Really.  Maybe if you want to try to fix that you could change the f stop or aperture.  It tells you in the your instruction book how to do that.  I am assuming though that this was intentional.  Good luck!</td>', 'I would have given this a ten if the barns were in focus.  Really.  Maybe if you want to try to fix that you could change the f stop or aperture.  It tells you in the your instruction book how to do that.  I am assuming though that this was intentional.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(190009, 10808, 6172, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2003-01-14 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(190011, 10779, 714, '<td valign="top">This shot is just to busy.  I know it was probable hard to get one with out all those fences.  Good luck!</td>', 'This shot is just to busy.  I know it was probable hard to get one with out all those fences.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(190012, 10748, 714, '<td valign="top">Not a bad sunset, but I think the sunset is more of the subject then the landscape. Good luck!</td>', 'Not a bad sunset, but I think the sunset is more of the subject then the landscape. Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(190013, 10942, 6092, '<td valign="top">I love your shot.</td>', 'I love your shot.', '2003-01-14 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(190014, 10725, 1647, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo - I''m glad you chose to use the wall as a border and didn''t add an extra one.  The trees also have an almost poetic quality to them - they all look bent the same way on first inspection.  Good work.</td>', 'Lovely photo - I''m glad you chose to use the wall as a border and didn''t add an extra one.  The trees also have an almost poetic quality to them - they all look bent the same way on first inspection.  Good work.', '2003-01-14 00:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(190015, 11033, 714, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite.  Congrats.  I think this is a winner. Looks great in b/w and great DOF.   Good luck!</td>', 'This is my favorite.  Congrats.  I think this is a winner. Looks great in b/w and great DOF.   Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(190016, 10922, 6172, '<td valign="top">What would it look like in color?</td>', 'What would it look like in color?', '2003-01-14 00:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(190017, 10855, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot.  I love the clouds.  It looks like at big storm coming in and that poor tree is going to get dumped on again.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice simple shot.  I love the clouds.  It looks like at big storm coming in and that poor tree is going to get dumped on again.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(190019, 10788, 714, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. I love the colors and it is very interesting. Good luck!</td>', 'Awesome shot. I love the colors and it is very interesting. Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(190020, 10941, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice rich colors.  The clouds add to the photo.  You did a great job. Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice rich colors.  The clouds add to the photo.  You did a great job. Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(190021, 10841, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s an ok photo, but I''m having trouble fitting it to the landscape theme - perhaps a long shot showing all off boats would have been more "landscape" like, or you could try to get just the landscape of that rudder?</td>', 'It''s an ok photo, but I''m having trouble fitting it to the landscape theme - perhaps a long shot showing all off boats would have been more "landscape" like, or you could try to get just the landscape of that rudder?', '2003-01-14 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(190022, 10838, 714, '<td valign="top">Awesome framing!  Beautiful reflection  I didn''t think all white would be very pretty, but you captured it perfectly and got my vote.  ;-)  Good  luck!</td>', 'Awesome framing!  Beautiful reflection  I didn''t think all white would be very pretty, but you captured it perfectly and got my vote.  ;-)  Good  luck!', '2003-01-14 00:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(190023, 10822, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice, unfortunately, it doesn''t fit the definition of "landscape" I''ve understood</td>', 'Very nice, unfortunately, it doesn''t fit the definition of "landscape" I''ve understood', '2003-01-14 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(190024, 10966, 674, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!', '2003-01-14 00:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(190026, 10746, 714, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful!  Nice colors and wow luck at those mountians.  Nice shot.  Good luck!</td>', 'Just beautiful!  Nice colors and wow luck at those mountians.  Nice shot.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 00:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(190029, 10992, 674, '<td valign="top">Love the colour capture in the sky</td>', 'Love the colour capture in the sky', '2003-01-14 00:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(190031, 10916, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like this limited landscape. The shallow DOF really works. Seems a tad dark overall. Good detail and focus. 7</td>', 'I really like this limited landscape. The shallow DOF really works. Seems a tad dark overall. Good detail and focus. 7', '2003-01-14 00:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(190033, 10746, 674, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning</td>', 'Absolutely stunning', '2003-01-14 00:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(190035, 10773, 1143, '<td valign="top">Awesome tree. I like all the space around it. Focus seems soft to me, and  I''d prefer a little more ground. Nice colors. 7</td>', 'Awesome tree. I like all the space around it. Focus seems soft to me, and  I''d prefer a little more ground. Nice colors. 7', '2003-01-14 00:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(190036, 10788, 674, '<td valign="top">WOW!!</td>', 'WOW!!', '2003-01-14 00:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(190038, 10808, 1143, '<td valign="top">Awesome awesome use of DOF. Beautiful colors. I love the layers, color, and lighting. Beautiful, and I hope it isn''t penalized for not being a traditional landscape.</td>', 'Awesome awesome use of DOF. Beautiful colors. I love the layers, color, and lighting. Beautiful, and I hope it isn''t penalized for not being a traditional landscape.', '2003-01-14 00:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(190040, 10714, 1143, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color/tone. Nice composition. I especially love how the ridge in the background is just peeking out of the fog.</td>', 'Beautiful color/tone. Nice composition. I especially love how the ridge in the background is just peeking out of the fog.', '2003-01-14 00:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(190043, 10911, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the color/tone a lot. Nice lines move the eye into the image. Some detail has been lost in the shadows.</td>', 'I like the color/tone a lot. Nice lines move the eye into the image. Some detail has been lost in the shadows.', '2003-01-14 00:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(190044, 10942, 1143, '<td valign="top">Haunting image. I really like the contrast and composition. Cool cool tones. Is it IR? That bright white side of the building bothers me, but I love how the sky gradually fades.</td>', 'Haunting image. I really like the contrast and composition. Cool cool tones. Is it IR? That bright white side of the building bothers me, but I love how the sky gradually fades.', '2003-01-14 00:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(190047, 10948, 2058, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this, but I think you applied too much post processing to the image...</td>', 'I really like the composition of this, but I think you applied too much post processing to the image...', '2003-01-14 00:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(190048, 10815, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the area in the center. I wish the sky weren''t so white though. The trees are interesting without leaves, but I think this would be much prettier in the fall or summer. Cute title.</td>', 'I like the lighting on the area in the center. I wish the sky weren''t so white though. The trees are interesting without leaves, but I think this would be much prettier in the fall or summer. Cute title.', '2003-01-14 00:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(190049, 10940, 1143, '<td valign="top">This looks like every summer house that I have ever seen in Sweden.  I like the colors. Main problem for me is that the house is smack dab in the center of the shot. I think you could crop quite a bit off the bottom and show a little more to the right.</td>', 'This looks like every summer house that I have ever seen in Sweden.  I like the colors. Main problem for me is that the house is smack dab in the center of the shot. I think you could crop quite a bit off the bottom and show a little more to the right.', '2003-01-14 00:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(190050, 11026, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great color. I like the placement of the ... err... thing.  Would be even cooler without the white sky.</td>', 'Great color. I like the placement of the ... err... thing.  Would be even cooler without the white sky.', '2003-01-14 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(190051, 10838, 1143, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I like having the top and bottom so even. I think I would rather see more sky and a little less along the bottom maybe. Very cool winter shot. Nice exposure. Great color.</td>', 'I''m not sure that I like having the top and bottom so even. I think I would rather see more sky and a little less along the bottom maybe. Very cool winter shot. Nice exposure. Great color.', '2003-01-14 00:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(190053, 11042, 1143, '<td valign="top">I love the water color feel of this shot. I think the barn and tree are the real stars of this shot and would almost rather see it as a vertical crop of just those two - although lots of the traditional landscape voters might disagree. Needs a tad more ground so that the trunk isn''t cut off.</td>', 'I love the water color feel of this shot. I think the barn and tree are the real stars of this shot and would almost rather see it as a vertical crop of just those two - although lots of the traditional landscape voters might disagree. Needs a tad more ground so that the trunk isn''t cut off.', '2003-01-14 00:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(190054, 10876, 1143, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the lines of the barn. I feel like it is cropped too closely though. The barn is almost sitting on the bottom of the frame. Back off some and include the more of the tree on the left and more of the grass in the foreground. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Love the colors and the lines of the barn. I feel like it is cropped too closely though. The barn is almost sitting on the bottom of the frame. Back off some and include the more of the tree on the left and more of the grass in the foreground. Nice lighting.', '2003-01-14 01:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(190056, 10821, 1143, '<td valign="top">That sunset is just great. The image as a whole seems a little too hazy. Was this cropped out of a much larger shot? Needs a little more clarity and sharper focus maybe. I like how the building dome mimics the sunset.</td>', 'That sunset is just great. The image as a whole seems a little too hazy. Was this cropped out of a much larger shot? Needs a little more clarity and sharper focus maybe. I like how the building dome mimics the sunset.', '2003-01-14 01:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(190058, 10919, 1143, '<td valign="top">Overall, seems very dark although there don''t seem to be many threatening clouds. That little bit of branch along the left side detracts from the shot''s simplicity. Also, the pair of trees are a little too close to the left side of the frame.</td>', 'Overall, seems very dark although there don''t seem to be many threatening clouds. That little bit of branch along the left side detracts from the shot''s simplicity. Also, the pair of trees are a little too close to the left side of the frame.', '2003-01-14 01:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(190061, 10867, 1143, '<td valign="top">The real beauty in this shot is the sky. I think that you should have included more of it and lowered the horizon in the frame. Composing it so that you show less of the ridge from the left and then the trees on the right are further into the shot with a vast expanse of sky above ... THAT would be really cool.</td>', 'The real beauty in this shot is the sky. I think that you should have included more of it and lowered the horizon in the frame. Composing it so that you show less of the ridge from the left and then the trees on the right are further into the shot with a vast expanse of sky above ... THAT would be really cool.', '2003-01-14 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(190063, 11010, 1143, '<td valign="top">The horizon is a little too centered. Love the rainbow! Including the ice in the foreground is nice though you might have shown even more of it. Tough lighting conditions. A square crop might work as well and showcase the rainbow a little more. There''s just a tad too much sky.</td>', 'The horizon is a little too centered. Love the rainbow! Including the ice in the foreground is nice though you might have shown even more of it. Tough lighting conditions. A square crop might work as well and showcase the rainbow a little more. There''s just a tad too much sky.', '2003-01-14 01:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(190065, 11017, 1143, '<td valign="top">Would like to see this from a different angle so that the moon isn''t directly above the trees - makes the left side of the shot a little heavy. Pretty good exposure given the conditions. Love the clouds and snow.</td>', 'Would like to see this from a different angle so that the moon isn''t directly above the trees - makes the left side of the shot a little heavy. Pretty good exposure given the conditions. Love the clouds and snow.', '2003-01-14 01:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(190067, 10881, 1143, '<td valign="top">This photo seems more drab than it should be. I think that you might have improved the composition some by focusing more on the tree/barn/cow triad. The left side of the shot isn''t all that great and the tree is very centered. Might be able to adjust the black level some to help the colors. The dark border doesn''t help bring out the nice colors of the sky and barn.</td>', 'This photo seems more drab than it should be. I think that you might have improved the composition some by focusing more on the tree/barn/cow triad. The left side of the shot isn''t all that great and the tree is very centered. Might be able to adjust the black level some to help the colors. The dark border doesn''t help bring out the nice colors of the sky and barn.', '2003-01-14 01:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(190069, 10993, 1143, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could be helped with *groan* a rule of thirds placement of the subjects. They are just too centered and the eye doesn''t move around the frame. I would crop off the bottom and left.</td>', 'I think this shot could be helped with *groan* a rule of thirds placement of the subjects. They are just too centered and the eye doesn''t move around the frame. I would crop off the bottom and left.', '2003-01-14 01:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(190072, 10840, 1143, '<td valign="top">Those are some cool trees. I like the color. The horses are too close to the edge of the frame. Would work better if they were headed INto the shot instead of out.</td>', 'Those are some cool trees. I like the color. The horses are too close to the edge of the frame. Would work better if they were headed INto the shot instead of out.', '2003-01-14 01:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(190073, 10748, 1143, '<td valign="top">Why so small??? That is a gorgeous color in the sky! The horizon is too centered, but I''m glad that the sun isn''t in the middle of the shot. I''d crop a lot of the bottom as the real drama is in the sky.</td>', 'Why so small??? That is a gorgeous color in the sky! The horizon is too centered, but I''m glad that the sun isn''t in the middle of the shot. I''d crop a lot of the bottom as the real drama is in the sky.', '2003-01-14 01:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(190074, 10853, 1143, '<td valign="top">Not another cool shot that is too small!! ARGHHH!  I love the sky and color here. Nice tree placement.</td>', 'Not another cool shot that is too small!! ARGHHH!  I love the sky and color here. Nice tree placement.', '2003-01-14 01:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(190076, 10882, 1143, '<td valign="top">This could stand to be a lot bigger. I think the perspective is a tad low as the grass is swallowing the building. It also seems too dark or underexposed. I would like to see more lighting for sure. Otherwise, it has a LOT of potential. Great photographic spot.</td>', 'This could stand to be a lot bigger. I think the perspective is a tad low as the grass is swallowing the building. It also seems too dark or underexposed. I would like to see more lighting for sure. Otherwise, it has a LOT of potential. Great photographic spot.', '2003-01-14 01:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(190077, 10712, 1143, '<td valign="top">Really cool, pumped-up colors. I think you could stand to crop off the left side where the sun is fading out the shot.</td>', 'Really cool, pumped-up colors. I think you could stand to crop off the left side where the sun is fading out the shot.', '2003-01-14 01:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(190079, 10925, 1143, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like this in black and white as there is too much grey and not enough contrast.  This would be a great spot in summer (of course) because then the path would stand out more and lead the eye back into the shot.</td>', 'I don''t really like this in black and white as there is too much grey and not enough contrast.  This would be a great spot in summer (of course) because then the path would stand out more and lead the eye back into the shot.', '2003-01-14 01:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(190081, 10966, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal. Would be cool if you could use that more in the shot. Those trees in the middle are just awesome. They look like a painting. Great lines and layers.</td>', 'Nice diagonal. Would be cool if you could use that more in the shot. Those trees in the middle are just awesome. They look like a painting. Great lines and layers.', '2003-01-14 01:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(190082, 10746, 1143, '<td valign="top">Could stand to see more of that gorgeous water and less of the white sky. That cloud in the center is just weird! Neat cliffs.</td>', 'Could stand to see more of that gorgeous water and less of the white sky. That cloud in the center is just weird! Neat cliffs.', '2003-01-14 01:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(190083, 11011, 1143, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful creature. I would like to see this taken from a lower angle so that the bird isn''t cut in half by the horizon. Could also stand to see more of the sky so that he isn''t so close to the top of the frame.</td>', 'What a beautiful creature. I would like to see this taken from a lower angle so that the bird isn''t cut in half by the horizon. Could also stand to see more of the sky so that he isn''t so close to the top of the frame.', '2003-01-14 01:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(190085, 10702, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great colors. The trees are just a little too small. I think they should be more important to the shot so that it isn''t so abstract. It is more a study of color and line as is. ahhhhh... green grass</td>', 'Great colors. The trees are just a little too small. I think they should be more important to the shot so that it isn''t so abstract. It is more a study of color and line as is. ahhhhh... green grass', '2003-01-14 01:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(190086, 10821, 51167, '<td valign="top">that''s cool.  How did you get the sun so big?  I think this is neat.</td>', 'that''s cool.  How did you get the sun so big?  I think this is neat.', '2003-01-14 01:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(190088, 10725, 1143, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of framing. The trees and background are just not clear and distinct enough. I''m not sure if there is anything to be done about that - probably not. I''d like to see this same shot in summer.</td>', 'Excellent use of framing. The trees and background are just not clear and distinct enough. I''m not sure if there is anything to be done about that - probably not. I''d like to see this same shot in summer.', '2003-01-14 01:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(190089, 10852, 1143, '<td valign="top">Excellent moon shot. A few blown out areas maybe but the area that fades from light to dark is really cool.</td>', 'Excellent moon shot. A few blown out areas maybe but the area that fades from light to dark is really cool.', '2003-01-14 01:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(190090, 11010, 3976, '<td valign="top">Very captivating.  Niagra with the rainbow, which is a "once in a blue moon" type of shot.</td>', 'Very captivating.  Niagra with the rainbow, which is a "once in a blue moon" type of shot.', '2003-01-14 01:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(190092, 10703, 1143, '<td valign="top">I wish this didn''t have to be so short so that I could see it better. Interesting wide angle. I like the sky.</td>', 'I wish this didn''t have to be so short so that I could see it better. Interesting wide angle. I like the sky.', '2003-01-14 01:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(190093, 10840, 51167, '<td valign="top">I like everything in this shot.  I think that it should have cropped more of the grass though.  I like the sky and the angle of the shot.</td>', 'I like everything in this shot.  I think that it should have cropped more of the grass though.  I like the sky and the angle of the shot.', '2003-01-14 01:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(190096, 10762, 933, '<td valign="top">I like patterns in nature, but sometimes capturing them can be difficult.  I think this photo is difficult to rate high because there is not distinguishable pattern,and because there is minimal clarity and focus to the image.</td>', 'I like patterns in nature, but sometimes capturing them can be difficult.  I think this photo is difficult to rate high because there is not distinguishable pattern,and because there is minimal clarity and focus to the image.', '2003-01-14 01:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(190097, 11024, 933, '<td valign="top">I think this photo suffers from a lack of focus.  It also seems to lack a subject, mood or pattern to it.  The trees sticking up in the lower right also detract from the image.</td>', 'I think this photo suffers from a lack of focus.  It also seems to lack a subject, mood or pattern to it.  The trees sticking up in the lower right also detract from the image.', '2003-01-14 01:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(190100, 10855, 933, '<td valign="top">This is without question one of the best images I have seen to date on dpc, and easily the best of the week imho.  Fantastic job!  The mood and compostion of this are excellent!  10.  No, make that 11.</td>', 'This is without question one of the best images I have seen to date on dpc, and easily the best of the week imho.  Fantastic job!  The mood and compostion of this are excellent!  10.  No, make that 11.', '2003-01-14 01:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(190101, 10725, 5044, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. Shooting through the window has made this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. Shooting through the window has made this shot.', '2003-01-14 01:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(190103, 10966, 933, '<td valign="top">An eerie, almost surreal image.  That rock in the river in the lower right distracts a bit, but just a tiny bit.  The words "Ghostly Beauty" seem appropriate for this. Very well done!</td>', 'An eerie, almost surreal image.  That rock in the river in the lower right distracts a bit, but just a tiny bit.  The words "Ghostly Beauty" seem appropriate for this. Very well done!', '2003-01-14 01:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(190104, 10784, 5044, '<td valign="top">Too bad you had to shot through the window. Take away the frame and the telephone poles and this would have been absolutely awesome. What colours!</td>', 'Too bad you had to shot through the window. Take away the frame and the telephone poles and this would have been absolutely awesome. What colours!', '2003-01-14 01:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(190105, 10990, 933, '<td valign="top">Utterly cool image.  Great use of negative space.  Good lighting and moody.  The clouds really cooperate with you that day.</td>', 'Utterly cool image.  Great use of negative space.  Good lighting and moody.  The clouds really cooperate with you that day.', '2003-01-14 01:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(190106, 10701, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset. I wish your foreground had been more intereesting than a paved road. Trees seem a bit blured. Was this shot from a moving car?</td>', 'Nice sunset. I wish your foreground had been more intereesting than a paved road. Trees seem a bit blured. Was this shot from a moving car?', '2003-01-14 01:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(190108, 10821, 5044, '<td valign="top">That sun is HUGE! Where was this taken?</td>', 'That sun is HUGE! Where was this taken?', '2003-01-14 01:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(190109, 10808, 933, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this photo.  Great colors, dof, and while the composure is a little unorthodox, it works extremely well here. I think the exaggerated verticle cropping really benefits this image.  Great job!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this photo.  Great colors, dof, and while the composure is a little unorthodox, it works extremely well here. I think the exaggerated verticle cropping really benefits this image.  Great job!', '2003-01-14 01:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(190110, 10852, 3900, '<td valign="top">Perfectly framed .. and beautiful.  I wish I could take a shot like this.  One of my favs...</td>', 'Perfectly framed .. and beautiful.  I wish I could take a shot like this.  One of my favs...', '2003-01-14 01:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(190111, 10728, 3900, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ...lovely shadows on the pure unmarked snow, I just wish i could see more.  One of my favs...</td>', 'Beautiful ...lovely shadows on the pure unmarked snow, I just wish i could see more.  One of my favs...', '2003-01-14 01:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(190114, 10992, 2279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset. Nice angle. Where is this anyway?</td>', 'Beautiful sunset. Nice angle. Where is this anyway?', '2003-01-14 01:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(190115, 10978, 2279, '<td valign="top">Wow what a beautiful view. Nice framing. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow what a beautiful view. Nice framing. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 01:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(190116, 10966, 3900, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Where in Japan is this?</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Where in Japan is this?', '2003-01-14 01:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(190117, 10893, 5044, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Great composition. But I find there to be a little too much sun and not enough land in your landscape.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Great composition. But I find there to be a little too much sun and not enough land in your landscape.', '2003-01-14 01:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(190118, 10908, 933, '<td valign="top">Great mood and feeling to this image.  Very dramatic lighting.  Nicely composed.  Might have been better if the mountain were not in shadow - but then, it''s always easy t control the opportunity for taking such a photo.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great mood and feeling to this image.  Very dramatic lighting.  Nicely composed.  Might have been better if the mountain were not in shadow - but then, it''s always easy t control the opportunity for taking such a photo.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 01:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(190119, 11005, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but it seems a bit underexposed.</td>', 'Nice composition but it seems a bit underexposed.', '2003-01-14 01:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(190120, 10831, 3900, '<td valign="top">Wonderful backdrop and composition.</td>', 'Wonderful backdrop and composition.', '2003-01-14 01:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(190121, 10876, 5313, '<td valign="top">I love barns--especially older ones.  Nice framing!</td>', 'I love barns--especially older ones.  Nice framing!', '2003-01-14 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(190122, 11044, 2279, '<td valign="top">It seems like its a little crooked. Nice composition and colors but I could do without the reflection near the bottom.</td>', 'It seems like its a little crooked. Nice composition and colors but I could do without the reflection near the bottom.', '2003-01-14 01:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
