(190129, 10895, 5044, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a little less sky to the right and a little more land down on the lower right. Great shot. Good landscape.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a little less sky to the right and a little more land down on the lower right. Great shot. Good landscape.', '2003-01-14 02:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
