(190548, 10937, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like where I live.  Technically, this is a well done shot.  You got a nice snow photo, which is often difficult to do. I like the dark trees, and the bright ground.  It''s a nice balance there.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  You put your ''horizon'' line in a nice spot.  Focus and clarity look good as well.. not a shot to make me jump out of my seat with excitement, but still very well done. Good job, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like where I live.  Technically, this is a well done shot.  You got a nice snow photo, which is often difficult to do. I like the dark trees, and the bright ground.  It''s a nice balance there.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  You put your ''horizon'' line in a nice spot.  Focus and clarity look good as well.. not a shot to make me jump out of my seat with excitement, but still very well done. Good job, and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 12:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(190549, 10919, 4182, '<td valign="top">if i saw a tractor on the top of that hill i would be sold .. but sorry , it needs something else for me .. 4</td>', 'if i saw a tractor on the top of that hill i would be sold .. but sorry , it needs something else for me .. 4', '2003-01-14 12:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(190550, 10712, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to see the original color to this.  Looks too fake like this.  I mean, colors are good, but maybe a bit too oversaturated?  I love the shot though.  All the bales, the smoothe ground and the smoothe horizon line.  Very nice composition.  Focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  Color just seems off.  Very nice find. Good landscape.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think I would like to see the original color to this.  Looks too fake like this.  I mean, colors are good, but maybe a bit too oversaturated?  I love the shot though.  All the bales, the smoothe ground and the smoothe horizon line.  Very nice composition.  Focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  Color just seems off.  Very nice find. Good landscape.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 12:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(190553, 10928, 3080, '<td valign="top">That is a nice shot and I like how it''s framed by the branches.  That blue border though is just too much.  Maybe if you put the black border first, and then the blue it might be better.  Having something that seperates the blue of the sky from the blue of the border.  I don''t mark down for borders, but something to think about anyway.  The angle and framig/cropping are nice.  I like the blue of the sky.  A nice landscape.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That is a nice shot and I like how it''s framed by the branches.  That blue border though is just too much.  Maybe if you put the black border first, and then the blue it might be better.  Having something that seperates the blue of the sky from the blue of the border.  I don''t mark down for borders, but something to think about anyway.  The angle and framig/cropping are nice.  I like the blue of the sky.  A nice landscape.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 12:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(190570, 10864, 6007, '<td valign="top">Love this picture...Although you know it is winter, the warm colors create a nice contrast.I like it...</td>', 'Love this picture...Although you know it is winter, the warm colors create a nice contrast.I like it...', '2003-01-14 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(190571, 10873, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Its kind of hazy.  Too bad about that.  Hard to get good shooting weather this time of year. - Inspzil</td>', 'Interesting.  Its kind of hazy.  Too bad about that.  Hard to get good shooting weather this time of year. - Inspzil', '2003-01-14 13:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
