(190577, 10882, 2123, '<td valign="top">The small size hurts this photo.  I like the seagrass in the foreground, but I tend to think of a landscape as more of a wide angle type shot. It is also a bit dim, but has potential.</td>', 'The small size hurts this photo.  I like the seagrass in the foreground, but I tend to think of a landscape as more of a wide angle type shot. It is also a bit dim, but has potential.', '2003-01-14 13:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(190579, 10856, 3540, '<td valign="top">Hard to expose these bright pictures just right.  I think this one is too exposed.  The sunflares are really hard to look past.  There really isn''t too much going on for subjects.   It''s sort of a background waiting for something to show up, besides the sunflares.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Hard to expose these bright pictures just right.  I think this one is too exposed.  The sunflares are really hard to look past.  There really isn''t too much going on for subjects.   It''s sort of a background waiting for something to show up, besides the sunflares.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2003-01-14 13:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(190580, 10702, 2123, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple, clean. Being left handed, the trees would look more natural to me on the left side ;-) This is an effective photo.</td>', 'Beautiful, simple, clean. Being left handed, the trees would look more natural to me on the left side ;-) This is an effective photo.', '2003-01-14 13:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
