(190585, 10701, 3540, '<td valign="top">Was this taken while driving?  The biggest tree looks blurry.  Cool sky.  It looks overprocessed to me though.  The grey clouds in the distance look like they are pretty grainy as do some of the darker spots on the more foreground clouds.  This happens to me a lot when trying to increase the saturation too much.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Was this taken while driving?  The biggest tree looks blurry.  Cool sky.  It looks overprocessed to me though.  The grey clouds in the distance look like they are pretty grainy as do some of the darker spots on the more foreground clouds.  This happens to me a lot when trying to increase the saturation too much.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2003-01-14 13:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
