(190622, 10940, 3080, '<td valign="top">A very lovely winter scene.  I like how the snow coats everything.   The color is nice and vivid in this shot.  Sky is great, and I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose as well.  I like how the back end of the barn is hidden in the trees.  I also like the shadow.  I don''t think the shot would be as nice without it.  Good choice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very lovely winter scene.  I like how the snow coats everything.   The color is nice and vivid in this shot.  Sky is great, and I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose as well.  I like how the back end of the barn is hidden in the trees.  I also like the shadow.  I don''t think the shot would be as nice without it.  Good choice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 13:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
