(190678, 11026, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo of the forgotten item, but the landscape is kind of washed out by the lighting.  The sky is quite washed out.  The grass is a beautiful color though, and I like the rust color of the thing against that bright green. It''s too bad for the lighting conditions though, I would like to see that green extend into the horizon.  I love the angle and framing/cropping.  The object is nicely placed, as is the ''horizon'' line.  Focus and clarity are great as well.  The detail in the metal is very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice photo of the forgotten item, but the landscape is kind of washed out by the lighting.  The sky is quite washed out.  The grass is a beautiful color though, and I like the rust color of the thing against that bright green. It''s too bad for the lighting conditions though, I would like to see that green extend into the horizon.  I love the angle and framing/cropping.  The object is nicely placed, as is the ''horizon'' line.  Focus and clarity are great as well.  The detail in the metal is very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 14:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
