(190684, 10909, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing lots of harsh skies in the landscape challenge.  I don''t mind the sun flares at all, but I wish that the trees in the back (which are an important part of this landscape) weren''t washed out by the sky.  The brook is very pretty, and colors are nice in the bottom half of the shot.  Good focus and clarity on the brook as well.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  I like how the brook sends you into the photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m seeing lots of harsh skies in the landscape challenge.  I don''t mind the sun flares at all, but I wish that the trees in the back (which are an important part of this landscape) weren''t washed out by the sky.  The brook is very pretty, and colors are nice in the bottom half of the shot.  Good focus and clarity on the brook as well.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  I like how the brook sends you into the photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 14:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
