(190704, 10764, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the blue tint when you take pics of snow.  I get the same thing with my camera.  I''m not really sure what the focal point is here.  If it were the trees, I would like to see more of the trees.  If it were the house, then i would like to see more of the house.  I don''t think your focal point is the house though considering the challenge.  So definately more of the trees.  Lighting appears to be good though for your shot, and focus and clarity are also good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the blue tint when you take pics of snow.  I get the same thing with my camera.  I''m not really sure what the focal point is here.  If it were the trees, I would like to see more of the trees.  If it were the house, then i would like to see more of the house.  I don''t think your focal point is the house though considering the challenge.  So definately more of the trees.  Lighting appears to be good though for your shot, and focus and clarity are also good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
