(190709, 10963, 3080, '<td valign="top">i love it!  Very nice patterns in the snow.  What was under there, I wonder.I think the fence is a good addition to the shot.  kind of gives it a mock horizon line.  Lighting is very nice, and focus and clarity are ok as well.  Is the photo grainy, or is that the texture of the snow?  Hard to tell.  You did a nice job of not getting a horrible white glare from the snow.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'i love it!  Very nice patterns in the snow.  What was under there, I wonder.I think the fence is a good addition to the shot.  kind of gives it a mock horizon line.  Lighting is very nice, and focus and clarity are ok as well.  Is the photo grainy, or is that the texture of the snow?  Hard to tell.  You did a nice job of not getting a horrible white glare from the snow.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(190712, 10840, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the simplicity of this shot.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice.  I''m glad you were able to get the horses and the trees in the photo.  The colors are very nice.  You have placed the horses, trees, and ''horizon'' line very nicely within the photo.  I like the seperation of blue/gree.  Focus and clarity are very nice.  I like this shot very much.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the simplicity of this shot.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice.  I''m glad you were able to get the horses and the trees in the photo.  The colors are very nice.  You have placed the horses, trees, and ''horizon'' line very nicely within the photo.  I like the seperation of blue/gree.  Focus and clarity are very nice.  I like this shot very much.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 14:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
