(190716, 10833, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I love the shadows that are cast by the sun being behind the trees.  The angle and framing/cropping are very ncie, and color is also good.  I like the different blues.This does look like an oasis, just sitting in the middle of no where.  Focus and clarity are good.  the trees look like they were sharpened though, they seem a little strange, but I like the silhouettes.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I love the shadows that are cast by the sun being behind the trees.  The angle and framing/cropping are very ncie, and color is also good.  I like the different blues.This does look like an oasis, just sitting in the middle of no where.  Focus and clarity are good.  the trees look like they were sharpened though, they seem a little strange, but I like the silhouettes.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 14:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
