(190962, 11006, 3575, '<td valign="top">Shame on you!!! You beat me! I haven''t seen all of the photographs yet but this is the winner in my book. I sure hope you send us a link to the full-siize photo. Now, what do I like about it. First, the panorama, second the colors are beautifully saturated, third, the layer, the golden plain, rolling hills, snow capped mountains and finally incredible sky. The photo is excellent quality, beautifully sharp and expertly exposed, and then the composition. They say never to cut anything in half (I don''t listen to what they say) but you have done exactly that It''s brilliant. Congratulations!</td>', 'Shame on you!!! You beat me! I haven''t seen all of the photographs yet but this is the winner in my book. I sure hope you send us a link to the full-siize photo. Now, what do I like about it. First, the panorama, second the colors are beautifully saturated, third, the layer, the golden plain, rolling hills, snow capped mountains and finally incredible sky. The photo is excellent quality, beautifully sharp and expertly exposed, and then the composition. They say never to cut anything in half (I don''t listen to what they say) but you have done exactly that It''s brilliant. Congratulations!', '2003-01-14 18:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
