(191073, 10728, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great angle!  I wonder what it would have looked like as a vertical image with more of the spruce tree...?</td>', 'Great angle!  I wonder what it would have looked like as a vertical image with more of the spruce tree...?', '2003-01-14 19:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(191075, 11042, 4852, '<td valign="top">If you could take out the power lines, center the tree . It would help . But they might have arrested you for chopping down power pole''s.  Power lines and sometimes wire fences are a big negative .</td>', 'If you could take out the power lines, center the tree . It would help . But they might have arrested you for chopping down power pole''s.  Power lines and sometimes wire fences are a big negative .', '2003-01-14 19:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191077, 10748, 3102, '<td valign="top">Why so small...?</td>', 'Why so small...?', '2003-01-14 20:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(191081, 10810, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not sure the tint enhances this one...</td>', 'Not sure the tint enhances this one...', '2003-01-14 20:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(191087, 10701, 4411, '<td valign="top">A great sunset shot but unfortunately the landscape, the part of the image we''re voting on, is mostly silhouetted. Nice work, just not for this challenge.</td>', 'A great sunset shot but unfortunately the landscape, the part of the image we''re voting on, is mostly silhouetted. Nice work, just not for this challenge.', '2003-01-14 20:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(191090, 10831, 4411, '<td valign="top">There''s a real feeling of depth to this shot which I like.<br/>The tree is probably taking up too much of the frame. I think a landscape ratio rather than square would have been better here, though I understand your wanting to use as much space as possible to show off this scenery.<br/>Nice work.</td>', 'There''s a real feeling of depth to this shot which I like.The tree is probably taking up too much of the frame. I think a landscape ratio rather than square would have been better here, though I understand your wanting to use as much space as possible to show off this scenery.Nice work.', '2003-01-14 20:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(191097, 10811, 4267, '<td valign="top">heh, I think I need to go look up "landscape" in the dictionary... I will get back to ya :o) good luck</td>', 'heh, I think I need to go look up "landscape" in the dictionary... I will get back to ya :o) good luck', '2003-01-14 20:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(191102, 10966, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is a spectacular image. A magical delicate atmosphere emmanates from this photo. I am very impressed by the frost textures on the layers of branches contrasting so elegantly with the background evergreens. The cool haze in the distance really accentuates the mood. And the water is a lovely gentle hue that is so complimentary to the other colors in the image. A deep brooding blue brook certainly would not be appropriate. I like the accent of ice rock in the lower right corner. A nice touch of interest that anchors the eye roving down the stream. I guess you could fairly call this the " Made my first million on this calendar shot". If not that than at least endless raving reviews from other drolling envious DPC participants. A magnificent work.</td>', 'This is a spectacular image. A magical delicate atmosphere emmanates from this photo. I am very impressed by the frost textures on the layers of branches contrasting so elegantly with the background evergreens. The cool haze in the distance really accentuates the mood. And the water is a lovely gentle hue that is so complimentary to the other colors in the image. A deep brooding blue brook certainly would not be appropriate. I like the accent of ice rock in the lower right corner. A nice touch of interest that anchors the eye roving down the stream. I guess you could fairly call this the " Made my first million on this calendar shot". If not that than at least endless raving reviews from other drolling envious DPC participants. A magnificent work.', '2003-01-14 20:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(191109, 10716, 4411, '<td valign="top">Ooh nice. Seems the rest of the photographers live in the most beautiful places and you live in the middle of a shroud of fog! I feel for you.<br/>I do quite like this shot. It has a simplicity to it, and I like the use of the grass in the foreground to give it some colour. Hope the weather gets better soon.</td>', 'Ooh nice. Seems the rest of the photographers live in the most beautiful places and you live in the middle of a shroud of fog! I feel for you.I do quite like this shot. It has a simplicity to it, and I like the use of the grass in the foreground to give it some colour. Hope the weather gets better soon.', '2003-01-14 20:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(191111, 10748, 4793, '<td valign="top">I shot is to small.</td>', 'I shot is to small.', '2003-01-14 20:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(191113, 10838, 4811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light conditions, and very good composition! I wonder if a less harsher light woukd produce a more evocative picture. Perhaps you''d lose the remarkable reflection in the lake, I''m not sure. But I''m pretty sure a little use of the rule of thirds could add a litte to the photo (by cropping so that the horizon line is higher or lower than the center of the photo) I find copping more of the sky and leaving the reflection as is makes a more dynamic photo...</td>', 'Beautiful light conditions, and very good composition! I wonder if a less harsher light woukd produce a more evocative picture. Perhaps you''d lose the remarkable reflection in the lake, I''m not sure. But I''m pretty sure a little use of the rule of thirds could add a litte to the photo (by cropping so that the horizon line is higher or lower than the center of the photo) I find copping more of the sky and leaving the reflection as is makes a more dynamic photo...', '2003-01-14 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(191114, 10712, 4967, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject, perfect for the challenge, one big problem I see here was that you were shooting into the sun which caused the white spot more in the left hand corner... too bad, because I love the rich colors of the land, and the sky.  Also I think your horizion is a little tilted.... fixing that in photoshop might have worked... cool idea though.</td>', 'Lovely subject, perfect for the challenge, one big problem I see here was that you were shooting into the sun which caused the white spot more in the left hand corner... too bad, because I love the rich colors of the land, and the sky.  Also I think your horizion is a little tilted.... fixing that in photoshop might have worked... cool idea though.', '2003-01-14 20:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(191118, 10753, 4811, '<td valign="top">The sepia toning works well here, along with the crop and placement of the elements, except for one that keeps getting in the way... the flag pole.  There''s likely a different angle/viewpoint that could have been used that would have excluded this small distraction. Well, at least you can always clone it out :)</td>', 'The sepia toning works well here, along with the crop and placement of the elements, except for one that keeps getting in the way... the flag pole.  There''s likely a different angle/viewpoint that could have been used that would have excluded this small distraction. Well, at least you can always clone it out :)', '2003-01-14 20:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191120, 10971, 4811, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the background background doesn''t have much going for it. I like the muted colors and winter scene, just don''t find much that grabs the eye. What this photo really has going for it is the fence, which draws your eye seamlessly from foreground to background. Leading lines like this always add tremendously to any composition :)</td>', 'Perhaps the background background doesn''t have much going for it. I like the muted colors and winter scene, just don''t find much that grabs the eye. What this photo really has going for it is the fence, which draws your eye seamlessly from foreground to background. Leading lines like this always add tremendously to any composition :)', '2003-01-14 20:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(191124, 10919, 2352, '<td valign="top">I would prefer to see something that stands out as the main subject.<br/>Perhaps better lighting to help bring out the color of the land would improve the contrast against the sky.</td>', 'I would prefer to see something that stands out as the main subject.Perhaps better lighting to help bring out the color of the land would improve the contrast against the sky.', '2003-01-14 20:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191125, 10911, 4815, '<td valign="top">A very good effort. Some of my favorite elements in this image are the character of that noble pine tree, the grey shadows and tones of the river ice and the searing shafts of sun blazing in from the left. The width of the river and the chunk of pasture are quite broad. But that may be the optimun vantage point in your circumstance. There appear to be some figures lurking in the midground (?) and a hint of a structure in the background. A touch more of the human presence would not be offensive to my tastes. Although this may not have been practical or of your intent I would like to see a little more texture in the midground trees. Those are two minor quibbling points in an otherwise noteworthy image. To me this is a quiet interesting picture that will speak well to the patient viewer. I am glad that you have trodden down the B&amp;W route instead of the nuclear hue calander attempt. Continue with your wonderful vision quest.</td>', 'A very good effort. Some of my favorite elements in this image are the character of that noble pine tree, the grey shadows and tones of the river ice and the searing shafts of sun blazing in from the left. The width of the river and the chunk of pasture are quite broad. But that may be the optimun vantage point in your circumstance. There appear to be some figures lurking in the midground (?) and a hint of a structure in the background. A touch more of the human presence would not be offensive to my tastes. Although this may not have been practical or of your intent I would like to see a little more texture in the midground trees. Those are two minor quibbling points in an otherwise noteworthy image. To me this is a quiet interesting picture that will speak well to the patient viewer. I am glad that you have trodden down the B&W route instead of the nuclear hue calander attempt. Continue with your wonderful vision quest.', '2003-01-14 20:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(191126, 11028, 4162, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, colour saturation is quite strong here, but I like that that.</td>', 'Lovely shot, colour saturation is quite strong here, but I like that that.', '2003-01-14 20:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(191131, 10895, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love the simple composition here, lovely balance. I wonder if shooting later in the day would add a bit more interest to the sky, but at the same time it was a good idea not to include a sunset!</td>', 'I love the simple composition here, lovely balance. I wonder if shooting later in the day would add a bit more interest to the sky, but at the same time it was a good idea not to include a sunset!', '2003-01-14 20:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(191134, 10823, 4162, '<td valign="top">Oh to be there right now! Looks like Australia, is it? Lovely quiet scene, very calming.</td>', 'Oh to be there right now! Looks like Australia, is it? Lovely quiet scene, very calming.', '2003-01-14 20:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(191135, 10940, 4162, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene, wondering if they are your shadows? Not sure about the shadows, but they do add depth to the picture.</td>', 'Very pretty scene, wondering if they are your shadows? Not sure about the shadows, but they do add depth to the picture.', '2003-01-14 20:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(191136, 10912, 2999, '<td valign="top">Inspired by Meyerowitz. Very Nice Composition! Direct to the point. Lively!</td>', 'Inspired by Meyerowitz. Very Nice Composition! Direct to the point. Lively!', '2003-01-14 20:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191139, 10975, 4967, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this perspective on landscape.  IMHO this is one of the most creative photos in the challenge.  It''s really beautiful.  It fit in the landscape, but it''s excellent photography as well.  The horizon looks maybe a tad bit slanted, but this is still a really cool photo.  Nice job, and good luck!  -9-</td>', 'I LOVE this perspective on landscape.  IMHO this is one of the most creative photos in the challenge.  It''s really beautiful.  It fit in the landscape, but it''s excellent photography as well.  The horizon looks maybe a tad bit slanted, but this is still a really cool photo.  Nice job, and good luck!  -9-', '2003-01-14 20:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(191143, 10932, 4815, '<td valign="top">Now this is a photographer with a mature vision. This says volumes differently than a blazing sunrise of multi colors. Give the gritty rough edges of those boulders, the wispy tree texture of the branches and the mercurial sun dappled water anyday thank you. Really well felt rock shadows. The perfect exposure for the power of the waterfall itself and my fav rav those absolutely gorgeous brook wavelets. Thank you for including the snippet of sky in the upper left. I think that the photo would feel to dark and cramped without it. That patch of light gives breathing space and life to the image. I am sure that you will receive many other compliments and encouragement.  But I will wish you a redundant good luck anyways.</td>', 'Now this is a photographer with a mature vision. This says volumes differently than a blazing sunrise of multi colors. Give the gritty rough edges of those boulders, the wispy tree texture of the branches and the mercurial sun dappled water anyday thank you. Really well felt rock shadows. The perfect exposure for the power of the waterfall itself and my fav rav those absolutely gorgeous brook wavelets. Thank you for including the snippet of sky in the upper left. I think that the photo would feel to dark and cramped without it. That patch of light gives breathing space and life to the image. I am sure that you will receive many other compliments and encouragement.  But I will wish you a redundant good luck anyways.', '2003-01-14 21:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191144, 11017, 4162, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones here, beautiful serenity. Perhaps the snow is a bit blue, but not sure how you could have made it look whiter, perhaps a fill in flash would have made the foreground lighter? Gorgeous scene!</td>', 'Lovely tones here, beautiful serenity. Perhaps the snow is a bit blue, but not sure how you could have made it look whiter, perhaps a fill in flash would have made the foreground lighter? Gorgeous scene!', '2003-01-14 21:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(191145, 10811, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lovely lighting and warm tones here. Great picture!</td>', 'Great composition and lovely lighting and warm tones here. Great picture!', '2003-01-14 21:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(191149, 10963, 4162, '<td valign="top">Fantastic patterns and composition. I think the snow is a little grey, did you use exposure bracketing? I tried using +1.5 to get cleaner snow. However the different colours to the snow adds dimension. Great shot.</td>', 'Fantastic patterns and composition. I think the snow is a little grey, did you use exposure bracketing? I tried using +1.5 to get cleaner snow. However the different colours to the snow adds dimension. Great shot.', '2003-01-14 21:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(191150, 11004, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great photo - I love the colours and the feeling of openness.  Your composition of the house on the left, the hill back right and the fence in the foreground is wonderful.  Focus is brilliant and there is very little not to like about this photo.  If anything, having the post on the left marginally cropped is annoying - but if that''s my worst point you''ve done very well.</td>', 'Great photo - I love the colours and the feeling of openness.  Your composition of the house on the left, the hill back right and the fence in the foreground is wonderful.  Focus is brilliant and there is very little not to like about this photo.  If anything, having the post on the left marginally cropped is annoying - but if that''s my worst point you''ve done very well.', '2003-01-14 21:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(191151, 11023, 4628, '<td valign="top">Youre making me look bad for thinking i cuoldnt get a good landscape around here ;-).Good job</td>', 'Youre making me look bad for thinking i cuoldnt get a good landscape around here ;-).Good job', '2003-01-14 21:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(191152, 10874, 2999, '<td valign="top">Very nice balance and composition. Great colors!</td>', 'Very nice balance and composition. Great colors!', '2003-01-14 21:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(191154, 10925, 4967, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition on this photo!  I love the way the lines of the sidewalk and the line of the creek cross paths, that is where your eye is drawn to.  I think this might have been cooler with just slightly more contrast but it''s a really neat photo.  I like your perspective of looking down rather then up... it looks like a very peaceful walk!  You get a 9 from me!  Nice job and good luck!</td>', 'Excellent composition on this photo!  I love the way the lines of the sidewalk and the line of the creek cross paths, that is where your eye is drawn to.  I think this might have been cooler with just slightly more contrast but it''s a really neat photo.  I like your perspective of looking down rather then up... it looks like a very peaceful walk!  You get a 9 from me!  Nice job and good luck!', '2003-01-14 21:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(191155, 10768, 4162, '<td valign="top">What a great desolate feel to this, great use of B/W.</td>', 'What a great desolate feel to this, great use of B/W.', '2003-01-14 21:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(191157, 10856, 4162, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and great composition. I think it would have helped a lot to have cropped out the green flare at the bottom.</td>', 'Lovely shot and great composition. I think it would have helped a lot to have cropped out the green flare at the bottom.', '2003-01-14 21:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191158, 10882, 527, '<td valign="top">This photo has nice composition and a nice feeling about it. The quality is difficult to gauge at this size but it looks pretty clean to me. The color seems a little flat and could really use some saturation. You should keep this scene in mind for when the sky is real dramatic.  5<br/></td>', 'This photo has nice composition and a nice feeling about it. The quality is difficult to gauge at this size but it looks pretty clean to me. The color seems a little flat and could really use some saturation. You should keep this scene in mind for when the sky is real dramatic.  5', '2003-01-14 21:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(191160, 10983, 4967, '<td valign="top">I\''m not sure this was the best choice for a landscape entry.  The entry seems to focus more on the building then on the land around it... especially because that is what the lines lead to.  Also it looks like the sun was coming from behind the building creating that glary white you get sorrounding the building which is fairly destracting.  Very intresting building though?  what is it?</td>', 'I\''m not sure this was the best choice for a landscape entry.  The entry seems to focus more on the building then on the land around it... especially because that is what the lines lead to.  Also it looks like the sun was coming from behind the building creating that glary white you get sorrounding the building which is fairly destracting.  Very intresting building though?  what is it?', '2003-01-14 21:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(191165, 10998, 1647, '<td valign="top">This seems to be taken late in the day.  Unfortunately I find it a little too dark to look at easily - especially around the house.  Focus is very good, and it works as a portrait orientation.  Composition is also good.  I wonder if there is enough detail in the original image to lighten it slightly?</td>', 'This seems to be taken late in the day.  Unfortunately I find it a little too dark to look at easily - especially around the house.  Focus is very good, and it works as a portrait orientation.  Composition is also good.  I wonder if there is enough detail in the original image to lighten it slightly?', '2003-01-14 21:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(191168, 10810, 2999, '<td valign="top">Nice desaturation and composition.</td>', 'Nice desaturation and composition.', '2003-01-14 21:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(191169, 10966, 4162, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!! Where did you go for this one? This really has a beautiful, romantic feel to it and great composition.  I went to Fukushima a few weeks ago, bad timing cause I would have loved to have used some of the landscpes for this challenge! This should do really well! A true winter wonderland! Great work!</td>', 'Fantastic!! Where did you go for this one? This really has a beautiful, romantic feel to it and great composition.  I went to Fukushima a few weeks ago, bad timing cause I would have loved to have used some of the landscpes for this challenge! This should do really well! A true winter wonderland! Great work!', '2003-01-14 21:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(191171, 10948, 5250, '<td valign="top">The effect that you tried with altering the colors was inneffective. A more natural colouring would be in order. I liked the overhanging tree framing the shot. jgillard4</td>', 'The effect that you tried with altering the colors was inneffective. A more natural colouring would be in order. I liked the overhanging tree framing the shot. jgillard4', '2003-01-14 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(191172, 10773, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though my personal preference for this one would be converted to black and white with the contrast increased a bit.</td>', 'Nice shot, though my personal preference for this one would be converted to black and white with the contrast increased a bit.', '2003-01-14 21:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(191173, 10784, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a great sunset although the window frame and (to a lesser degree) the powerpoles do detract from the image - my eye is drawn from the sunset to the thick black line.  Couldn''t you have shot closer to the window, or even through the open window?</td>', 'It''s a great sunset although the window frame and (to a lesser degree) the powerpoles do detract from the image - my eye is drawn from the sunset to the thick black line.  Couldn''t you have shot closer to the window, or even through the open window?', '2003-01-14 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(191174, 10815, 527, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice but I find this scene fairly ordinary. I like the deer but I am distracted by darkness of the group of trees on the left. They interfere with the openess that would have appealed to me. It is also off balance with the deer on the same side. Maybe if you would have moved quickly to left to frame the deer on the right side and a smaller bit of the dark trees on the left to frame the scenery in the background. 5</td>', 'The colors are nice but I find this scene fairly ordinary. I like the deer but I am distracted by darkness of the group of trees on the left. They interfere with the openess that would have appealed to me. It is also off balance with the deer on the same side. Maybe if you would have moved quickly to left to frame the deer on the right side and a smaller bit of the dark trees on the left to frame the scenery in the background. 5', '2003-01-14 21:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(191175, 11000, 5250, '<td valign="top">A nice looking flower, though it could be sharper as it is the central piece of your image. A tighter cropping would have been more effective i think. jgillard5</td>', 'A nice looking flower, though it could be sharper as it is the central piece of your image. A tighter cropping would have been more effective i think. jgillard5', '2003-01-14 21:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(191177, 10898, 4162, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition here, great balance. feel that the focus is a bit soft, I think that if everything was a bit sharper there would be more impact.</td>', 'Lovely composition here, great balance. feel that the focus is a bit soft, I think that if everything was a bit sharper there would be more impact.', '2003-01-14 21:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(191179, 10762, 5250, '<td valign="top">The reason that I gave this a lower score is because it is hard to make out what we are looking at. Some colour alteration via a photo editing program would have resulted in a much higher score. For suggestions just send me a message, and I can show you what I mean. jgillard4</td>', 'The reason that I gave this a lower score is because it is hard to make out what we are looking at. Some colour alteration via a photo editing program would have resulted in a much higher score. For suggestions just send me a message, and I can show you what I mean. jgillard4', '2003-01-14 21:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(191183, 10746, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great photo - I like the colours.  I might have tried a slightly wider shot (depending on what was out there) to put both "brown mountains" into the shot a little more, but it''s great otherwise.</td>', 'Great photo - I like the colours.  I might have tried a slightly wider shot (depending on what was out there) to put both "brown mountains" into the shot a little more, but it''s great otherwise.', '2003-01-14 21:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(191184, 10792, 2999, '<td valign="top">Nice Form.</td>', 'Nice Form.', '2003-01-14 21:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191185, 10756, 4615, '<td valign="top">this is great, only its so small I can''t tell what it is.</td>', 'this is great, only its so small I can''t tell what it is.', '2003-01-14 21:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(191187, 10959, 5250, '<td valign="top">This shot is not really a landscape shot. You will probably hear this alot. I think that if you included the shore as well as the water reflections, you would have gotten a much better score. Also, The image is a little busy. There is no real focus in it to draw the attention of the viewer. jgillard4</td>', 'This shot is not really a landscape shot. You will probably hear this alot. I think that if you included the shore as well as the water reflections, you would have gotten a much better score. Also, The image is a little busy. There is no real focus in it to draw the attention of the viewer. jgillard4', '2003-01-14 21:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(191188, 10816, 527, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful and a nice choice of aspect ratio. I probably would have increased the brightness in the mid tones to help reveal more of the details in that range. The lower part of the mountain, for instance. I would love to see this photo at full resolution. The color and shape of the building on the right adds a lot.  7</td>', 'This is very beautiful and a nice choice of aspect ratio. I probably would have increased the brightness in the mid tones to help reveal more of the details in that range. The lower part of the mountain, for instance. I would love to see this photo at full resolution. The color and shape of the building on the right adds a lot.  7', '2003-01-14 21:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(191189, 10770, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think you have a little too much beach in the foreground - I would have aimed to have the pier slightly lower in the photo, although I guess the title of your photo explains that to some degree.  Interesting sunset.</td>', 'I think you have a little too much beach in the foreground - I would have aimed to have the pier slightly lower in the photo, although I guess the title of your photo explains that to some degree.  Interesting sunset.', '2003-01-14 21:20:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(191192, 11020, 1647, '<td valign="top">The trees in the foreground seem a little out of focus, or perhaps a tiny bit of camera shake.</td>', 'The trees in the foreground seem a little out of focus, or perhaps a tiny bit of camera shake.', '2003-01-14 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191197, 10835, 527, '<td valign="top">I know this mountain range very well. I''ve taken numerous photos of it. The colors, shapes and contrast in their simplicity make this a stunning shot. A great combination of abstract and landscape. It may be slightly oversharpened but not too bad. It is very lovely.  9</td>', 'I know this mountain range very well. I''ve taken numerous photos of it. The colors, shapes and contrast in their simplicity make this a stunning shot. A great combination of abstract and landscape. It may be slightly oversharpened but not too bad. It is very lovely.  9', '2003-01-14 21:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(191199, 10895, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely tree and I like the photo, although I might have considered including more of the hill (depending on what it looked like.  Having the tree on the left third line is very good - I might have aimed for the top third line as well.  Colours, focus and border are all nice, well done.</td>', 'It''s a lovely tree and I like the photo, although I might have considered including more of the hill (depending on what it looked like.  Having the tree on the left third line is very good - I might have aimed for the top third line as well.  Colours, focus and border are all nice, well done.', '2003-01-14 21:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(191200, 11040, 1647, '<td valign="top">A little blurry, but otherwise a nice photo.</td>', 'A little blurry, but otherwise a nice photo.', '2003-01-14 21:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(191203, 10914, 527, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition. The values and colors are very good and it is technically very clean and sharp.  8</td>', 'This is a very nice composition. The values and colors are very good and it is technically very clean and sharp.  8', '2003-01-14 21:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(191204, 10948, 4967, '<td valign="top">This looks unnatural and more like a painting then a photograph.  I really don''t care for whatever you did, I''m guessing in photoshop or a similar program.  This would have been a really cool photo just in black and white, not sure why you choose to do such dramatifc stuff with the coloring.  Just having the piece of the stteple is kind of bothersome, but I love your framing of this shot.</td>', 'This looks unnatural and more like a painting then a photograph.  I really don''t care for whatever you did, I''m guessing in photoshop or a similar program.  This would have been a really cool photo just in black and white, not sure why you choose to do such dramatifc stuff with the coloring.  Just having the piece of the stteple is kind of bothersome, but I love your framing of this shot.', '2003-01-14 21:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(191208, 10768, 527, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo. However I don''t like where the horizon line is. I would I preferred to see it either higher to see more of the grass which I think would work better here or lower to show more of the sky if the clowds were more interesting. <br/>6</td>', 'This is a nice photo. However I don''t like where the horizon line is. I would I preferred to see it either higher to see more of the grass which I think would work better here or lower to show more of the sky if the clowds were more interesting. 6', '2003-01-14 21:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191210, 10874, 4967, '<td valign="top">My favorite for the week.  This is AWESOME!  I love the warm colors here and your composition is truly phenomenal.  I also like the fact this is totally different then all the other entries.  Great job, you deserve a place in the top 3!  Good luck!  :-)</td>', 'My favorite for the week.  This is AWESOME!  I love the warm colors here and your composition is truly phenomenal.  I also like the fact this is totally different then all the other entries.  Great job, you deserve a place in the top 3!  Good luck!  :-)', '2003-01-14 21:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(191213, 10962, 527, '<td valign="top">like this photo quite a bit but it seems a little busy around the buildings. I wonder if there was another view that showed more of the buildings but still had the same kind of beautiful reflections.  8</td>', 'like this photo quite a bit but it seems a little busy around the buildings. I wonder if there was another view that showed more of the buildings but still had the same kind of beautiful reflections.  8', '2003-01-14 21:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(191214, 10791, 4585, '<td valign="top">Oh this is such a wonderful image.  I would have eliminated the sign post.  It is a bit distracting.  Good luck!</td>', 'Oh this is such a wonderful image.  I would have eliminated the sign post.  It is a bit distracting.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 21:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(191217, 10905, 4585, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  Nicely done with the lighting!  Excellent balance to the image as well.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love this image.  Nicely done with the lighting!  Excellent balance to the image as well.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 21:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(191220, 10745, 527, '<td valign="top">This photo just shouts black and white or sepia to me. That way the focus would be on the shapes and textures of the land rather than the colors. I also don''t care for the square format. It just doesn''t work for me.  6</td>', 'This photo just shouts black and white or sepia to me. That way the focus would be on the shapes and textures of the land rather than the colors. I also don''t care for the square format. It just doesn''t work for me.  6', '2003-01-14 21:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(191223, 11028, 4585, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones!  Good subject matter.  The focus though is a little soft.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent tones!  Good subject matter.  The focus though is a little soft.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 21:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(191224, 10808, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love the feeling of depth - it does really enhance the ''stability'' of the land as your title implies.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love the feeling of depth - it does really enhance the ''stability'' of the land as your title implies.', '2003-01-14 21:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(191227, 10822, 4615, '<td valign="top">A good photo of A building, but its not even a cityscape.</td>', 'A good photo of A building, but its not even a cityscape.', '2003-01-14 21:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(191228, 10998, 4585, '<td valign="top">I love the lines in this image and the lighting is wonderful.  But that truck!...a little distracting.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love the lines in this image and the lighting is wonderful.  But that truck!...a little distracting.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 21:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(191230, 10879, 4585, '<td valign="top">I love the patterns here and the line that leads you to the back of the image.  It looks a tiny bit overexposed!  Good luck!</td>', 'I love the patterns here and the line that leads you to the back of the image.  It looks a tiny bit overexposed!  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 21:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(191232, 10851, 4585, '<td valign="top">This is an exquisite image!  The tones on the windmill are deadon and the lines are excellent as well.  Best of all in this low light invitation, the image is well focused.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is an exquisite image!  The tones on the windmill are deadon and the lines are excellent as well.  Best of all in this low light invitation, the image is well focused.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 21:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(191233, 10895, 5475, '<td valign="top">I was just telling my wife last week that I\''ve been looking for a really cool, solitary tree that I can photograph on the crest of a hill. This is definitely a cool tree.  I like the patches of green grass, and the sky is nice.  I find the bush a little distracting, but you can\''t do anything about that with the editing rules.  I\''d clone it out, though, for printing or other purposes.  The only other thing I would have tried would be to get  a lower vantage point.  I would have liked to see the base of the tree at the crest of the hill, rather than having more \''land\'' behind the tree trunk.  If I had access to this place, I would go back and photograph it often...   lots of different skys, sunsets, sunrises, rain, snow, meteor storms, etc!!  I like this a lot and I give it an 8!  I hope it does well in the challenge!  Good luck, <br/>JD Anderson<br/>One other think...  I''m not sure I like the white border... actually, i''m pretty sure that I don''t.  You really don''t have any white tones in the image to draw out with the white border.  I may have gone all black, but this is a very minor detail.</td>', 'I was just telling my wife last week that I\''ve been looking for a really cool, solitary tree that I can photograph on the crest of a hill. This is definitely a cool tree.  I like the patches of green grass, and the sky is nice.  I find the bush a little distracting, but you can\''t do anything about that with the editing rules.  I\''d clone it out, though, for printing or other purposes.  The only other thing I would have tried would be to get  a lower vantage point.  I would have liked to see the base of the tree at the crest of the hill, rather than having more \''land\'' behind the tree trunk.  If I had access to this place, I would go back and photograph it often...   lots of different skys, sunsets, sunrises, rain, snow, meteor storms, etc!!  I like this a lot and I give it an 8!  I hope it does well in the challenge!  Good luck, JD AndersonOne other think...  I''m not sure I like the white border... actually, i''m pretty sure that I don''t.  You really don''t have any white tones in the image to draw out with the white border.  I may have gone all black, but this is a very minor detail.', '2003-01-14 21:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(191234, 10859, 4585, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!  Well balanced...well lit....the lines are wonderful!...the horizon seems a bit tilted from right to left but that may very well have been the natural state of the ground.  Anyhow, good luck!</td>', 'Magnificent!  Well balanced...well lit....the lines are wonderful!...the horizon seems a bit tilted from right to left but that may very well have been the natural state of the ground.  Anyhow, good luck!', '2003-01-14 21:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(191237, 10959, 4811, '<td valign="top">Love the abstract quality of broken relections in water. Perhaps a little busier than ideal...How moody it would be to have the 4-5 main tree trunks and just pure sky blue around them. Nice crop. It does not fit a landscape definition in the traditional sense but definately a creative spin on the term.</td>', 'Love the abstract quality of broken relections in water. Perhaps a little busier than ideal...How moody it would be to have the 4-5 main tree trunks and just pure sky blue around them. Nice crop. It does not fit a landscape definition in the traditional sense but definately a creative spin on the term.', '2003-01-14 21:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(191239, 10712, 4811, '<td valign="top">I sense some image manipulation here, but whatever the case, the flare from the sun makes the image unevenly lit on the left side. Other than the flare, a good fit for the challenge and a nicely composed shot.</td>', 'I sense some image manipulation here, but whatever the case, the flare from the sun makes the image unevenly lit on the left side. Other than the flare, a good fit for the challenge and a nicely composed shot.', '2003-01-14 22:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(191241, 10831, 1143, '<td valign="top">Strong image. Something bothers me about the tree though, and I can''t really explain why. Maybe it is just too big and dark while I would rather see something smaller to really accentuate the strength and majesty of the backdrop.</td>', 'Strong image. Something bothers me about the tree though, and I can''t really explain why. Maybe it is just too big and dark while I would rather see something smaller to really accentuate the strength and majesty of the backdrop.', '2003-01-14 22:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(191242, 10897, 1143, '<td valign="top">Hey. That looks a lot like East TN (my nome). I really like the bottom half of the photo. You did a good job of keeping color and shape in the foreground with such low lighting. There''s just too much sky for me, and it makes the whole thing seem bottom heavy. Maybe if you could have captured more light and color in the sky ...</td>', 'Hey. That looks a lot like East TN (my nome). I really like the bottom half of the photo. You did a good job of keeping color and shape in the foreground with such low lighting. There''s just too much sky for me, and it makes the whole thing seem bottom heavy. Maybe if you could have captured more light and color in the sky ...', '2003-01-14 22:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(191243, 10902, 1143, '<td valign="top">Tough lighting with the bright, sun-lit areas and the shadowed foreground. I like the natural framing created by the rock but would prefer a different angle that would show more of the water and rocks in the foreground and less of the washed out sky.</td>', 'Tough lighting with the bright, sun-lit areas and the shadowed foreground. I like the natural framing created by the rock but would prefer a different angle that would show more of the water and rocks in the foreground and less of the washed out sky.', '2003-01-14 22:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191244, 10932, 1143, '<td valign="top">I know that it is tough to take good winter shots without snow, but the black and white here doesn''t really help. I like the placement of the fall in the shot, but there''s too much empty water space in the foreground. The lighting isn''t bad, and I do like the diagonal of the rocks leading to the fall.</td>', 'I know that it is tough to take good winter shots without snow, but the black and white here doesn''t really help. I like the placement of the fall in the shot, but there''s too much empty water space in the foreground. The lighting isn''t bad, and I do like the diagonal of the rocks leading to the fall.', '2003-01-14 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(191245, 10733, 1143, '<td valign="top">The snow in the immediate foreground is way too white and distracting. I would have tried a little higher perspective because the sky and tower are really quite interesting. I do like the addition of the snow-covered rock though.</td>', 'The snow in the immediate foreground is way too white and distracting. I would have tried a little higher perspective because the sky and tower are really quite interesting. I do like the addition of the snow-covered rock though.', '2003-01-14 22:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(191246, 10736, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset but seems a tad overexposed maybe. It could stand some darker colors in the sky and more of a silhouette effect on the boats. The green in the bottom corner is too much of a contrast with the rest of the shot and probably should have been eliminated somehow.</td>', 'Nice sunset but seems a tad overexposed maybe. It could stand some darker colors in the sky and more of a silhouette effect on the boats. The green in the bottom corner is too much of a contrast with the rest of the shot and probably should have been eliminated somehow.', '2003-01-14 22:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(191247, 10869, 1143, '<td valign="top">In a way, this is a busy shot. There''s a lot of vegetation and light vs. dark areas. I''m left searching around within the frame for something to focus on. I do like the branch in the top corner, but that side of the shot is so dark that it''s hard to really appreciate.</td>', 'In a way, this is a busy shot. There''s a lot of vegetation and light vs. dark areas. I''m left searching around within the frame for something to focus on. I do like the branch in the top corner, but that side of the shot is so dark that it''s hard to really appreciate.', '2003-01-14 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(191248, 10913, 1143, '<td valign="top">It is a bit noisy  :o)  I think you have a nice opportunity here. The figure should be isolated more (it looks like there is maybe another person beyond the first). Maybe using a little lower perspective wouldn''t cut the person in half and would help them stand out more (placing them against the sky). The sky also seems a little overexposed. Would it have been possible to expose it a little less? There seems to still be some detail in the person (not yet a true silhouette) so maybe you could have captured more color in the sky.</td>', 'It is a bit noisy  :o)  I think you have a nice opportunity here. The figure should be isolated more (it looks like there is maybe another person beyond the first). Maybe using a little lower perspective wouldn''t cut the person in half and would help them stand out more (placing them against the sky). The sky also seems a little overexposed. Would it have been possible to expose it a little less? There seems to still be some detail in the person (not yet a true silhouette) so maybe you could have captured more color in the sky.', '2003-01-14 22:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191249, 10768, 1143, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of The Grapes of Wrath. The horizon is almost too centered, but I do like that you chose to put the buildings off to the side. Nice exposure although I''m not sure there''s enough contrast to make me want this in B&amp;W rather than color.</td>', 'Reminds me of The Grapes of Wrath. The horizon is almost too centered, but I do like that you chose to put the buildings off to the side. Nice exposure although I''m not sure there''s enough contrast to make me want this in B&W rather than color.', '2003-01-14 22:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(191250, 10988, 1143, '<td valign="top">Kentucky? Those black fences are all over in KY. Did you have a car or something to stand on? I think a higher perspective would have helped here. The fences are too close to the bottom of the frame, and I would like to see that building with the red roof better.</td>', 'Kentucky? Those black fences are all over in KY. Did you have a car or something to stand on? I think a higher perspective would have helped here. The fences are too close to the bottom of the frame, and I would like to see that building with the red roof better.', '2003-01-14 22:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(191253, 10958, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very nice muted, pastel colors for a beach scene. I do like that you tried to include something in the foreground although the blurred blades along the very bottom aren''t needed. I''m not really sure how to improve this. It needs a little more interest for me.</td>', 'Very nice muted, pastel colors for a beach scene. I do like that you tried to include something in the foreground although the blurred blades along the very bottom aren''t needed. I''m not really sure how to improve this. It needs a little more interest for me.', '2003-01-14 22:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(191255, 11028, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the sky a lot. The fall is a little too centered maybe. I''m not sure what other perspectives you could have used, but there''s a little too much of the tree on the left considering how dark the shadows in it are. There may be some way to shoot this and include a person to emphasize the height of the fall.</td>', 'I like the sky a lot. The fall is a little too centered maybe. I''m not sure what other perspectives you could have used, but there''s a little too much of the tree on the left considering how dark the shadows in it are. There may be some way to shoot this and include a person to emphasize the height of the fall.', '2003-01-14 22:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(191256, 10994, 1143, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast between natural beauty and man. Lovely colors. Could stand a tad more exposure or light.</td>', 'Interesting contrast between natural beauty and man. Lovely colors. Could stand a tad more exposure or light.', '2003-01-14 22:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(191257, 10975, 4585, '<td valign="top">A "macro"landscape image....this is soooo well done.  Excellent tones and colors.  This is my top image.  Good luck!</td>', 'A "macro"landscape image....this is soooo well done.  Excellent tones and colors.  This is my top image.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 22:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(191259, 10893, 4585, '<td valign="top">This is really good.  Excellent tones!  Great placement and framing of the couple.  A little bit grainy though!...Good luck!</td>', 'This is really good.  Excellent tones!  Great placement and framing of the couple.  A little bit grainy though!...Good luck!', '2003-01-14 22:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(191261, 10910, 1143, '<td valign="top">This looks like a cool place. I''d like to see more of the repeating roof lines in the bottom of the shot and a little less sky.</td>', 'This looks like a cool place. I''d like to see more of the repeating roof lines in the bottom of the shot and a little less sky.', '2003-01-14 22:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(191262, 10701, 5475, '<td valign="top">You have some vivid colors in the sunset/sunrise, whcih are nice.  I like the way they contrast with the blues remaining in the sky.  The foreground is bugging me a little.  Maybe too much.  I would have cropped higher on the bottom.  Is the blurriness in the trees due to wind?  Not much you can do about that.  The sky is the main interest here for me.<br/>JD</td>', 'You have some vivid colors in the sunset/sunrise, whcih are nice.  I like the way they contrast with the blues remaining in the sky.  The foreground is bugging me a little.  Maybe too much.  I would have cropped higher on the bottom.  Is the blurriness in the trees due to wind?  Not much you can do about that.  The sky is the main interest here for me.JD', '2003-01-14 22:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(191264, 10699, 5250, '<td valign="top">I do not really think that this picture fits the challenge. Technically, it is sharp. The sky could be a bit more saturated colour wise. Maybe if you cropped out the top 1/2 of the photo, it would look a bit better. jgillard4</td>', 'I do not really think that this picture fits the challenge. Technically, it is sharp. The sky could be a bit more saturated colour wise. Maybe if you cropped out the top 1/2 of the photo, it would look a bit better. jgillard4', '2003-01-14 22:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(191265, 10849, 1143, '<td valign="top">Love the softness of this shot and the warmth. The sun is just smack in the middle of the shot which bothers me. Also, the horizon is too centered.</td>', 'Love the softness of this shot and the warmth. The sun is just smack in the middle of the shot which bothers me. Also, the horizon is too centered.', '2003-01-14 22:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(191266, 10753, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this picture very much. The foreground building works very well against the sloping bridge, the towers and the arch. The city on the right gives the picture picture closure as the bridge leads you right to it. Unfortunately, you seem to have overboard with the USM as your picture is full of sharpening artifacts. Sorry, can''t give you full marks for it.</td>', 'I like the composition of this picture very much. The foreground building works very well against the sloping bridge, the towers and the arch. The city on the right gives the picture picture closure as the bridge leads you right to it. Unfortunately, you seem to have overboard with the USM as your picture is full of sharpening artifacts. Sorry, can''t give you full marks for it.', '2003-01-14 22:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(191267, 10801, 1143, '<td valign="top">If you''re gonna stick that sign in there then I think you shouldn''t have cropped up so high so that it''s just floating. The mountains are really cool. I think maybe you could have used a perspective from more to the right that would show the ridge better and the mountains in the distance.</td>', 'If you''re gonna stick that sign in there then I think you shouldn''t have cropped up so high so that it''s just floating. The mountains are really cool. I think maybe you could have used a perspective from more to the right that would show the ridge better and the mountains in the distance.', '2003-01-14 22:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191268, 10959, 5044, '<td valign="top">This picture is awesome, absolutely awesome, but.....I''m not sure it really meets the challenge.</td>', 'This picture is awesome, absolutely awesome, but.....I''m not sure it really meets the challenge.', '2003-01-14 22:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(191269, 11044, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the rocks in the still water - they look great.  Your composition / framing is very good.  The whole picture has a feeling of serenity to it - well done</td>', 'I love the rocks in the still water - they look great.  Your composition / framing is very good.  The whole picture has a feeling of serenity to it - well done', '2003-01-14 22:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191271, 10981, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I really like the hills and the inclusion of the green in the foreground is great. A little less light, giving more definitiion to the hills, would be nice.</td>', 'Very pretty. I really like the hills and the inclusion of the green in the foreground is great. A little less light, giving more definitiion to the hills, would be nice.', '2003-01-14 22:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191272, 10943, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting contrast, especially with the background being hazy.  Focus and lighting of the tree is very good and I think you have made your point.  Well done.</td>', 'It''s an interesting contrast, especially with the background being hazy.  Focus and lighting of the tree is very good and I think you have made your point.  Well done.', '2003-01-14 22:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(191275, 11007, 1143, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting. It''s such a dramatic, strong image of (what I consider) rather boring subjects. They ARE very nice houses but ... I wouldn''t mind living there anyway.</td>', 'Love the lighting. It''s such a dramatic, strong image of (what I consider) rather boring subjects. They ARE very nice houses but ... I wouldn''t mind living there anyway.', '2003-01-14 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(191277, 10885, 5044, '<td valign="top">My first impression of this picture was that it was a finalist, for sure, but...the more I look at it, the more it hurts my eyes to try to look at all the details. Given the B&amp;W, it makes it hard to see where one thing stops and another starts. It is a very busy picture, so perhaps the colour version might have helped to define the different foliage in the background. Then again, maybe it would just add to the confusion. The river, foreground and destination are great. The foliage makes my eyes bug out. I still give you a 7. I would love to see the original colour pic. Also, I would love to go there. where is this?</td>', 'My first impression of this picture was that it was a finalist, for sure, but...the more I look at it, the more it hurts my eyes to try to look at all the details. Given the B&W, it makes it hard to see where one thing stops and another starts. It is a very busy picture, so perhaps the colour version might have helped to define the different foliage in the background. Then again, maybe it would just add to the confusion. The river, foreground and destination are great. The foliage makes my eyes bug out. I still give you a 7. I would love to see the original colour pic. Also, I would love to go there. where is this?', '2003-01-14 22:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(191278, 10958, 5826, '<td valign="top">Beautifuly shot.  well done.  It is almost like 2 photographs in one. 10 all the way.</td>', 'Beautifuly shot.  well done.  It is almost like 2 photographs in one. 10 all the way.', '2003-01-14 22:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(191279, 10792, 5826, '<td valign="top">Awesome, I can''t say any more than that. 10</td>', 'Awesome, I can''t say any more than that. 10', '2003-01-14 22:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(191281, 11020, 5044, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this picture. Nice use of thirds. Too bad the foreground item is the bush and tree. I find they take away from this picture. IMO, I would have just blured the low yellow grass.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this picture. Nice use of thirds. Too bad the foreground item is the bush and tree. I find they take away from this picture. IMO, I would have just blured the low yellow grass.', '2003-01-14 22:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(191284, 11007, 5391, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous.  I love what the infrared has created with this scene.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous.  I love what the infrared has created with this scene.', '2003-01-14 22:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(191287, 11037, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Nice composition.</td>', 'Great shot, Nice composition.', '2003-01-14 22:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(191288, 10948, 5044, '<td valign="top">What did you do to this, and why?</td>', 'What did you do to this, and why?', '2003-01-14 22:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(191289, 10838, 4585, '<td valign="top">One word for this image...Stunning!  One score for this image....10  This is a top 3 finisher!  Good luck!</td>', 'One word for this image...Stunning!  One score for this image....10  This is a top 3 finisher!  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 22:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(191293, 10871, 4585, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit soft on the focus and the contrasts are a bit harsh...excellent subject though.  Good luck!</td>', 'This image is a bit soft on the focus and the contrasts are a bit harsh...excellent subject though.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 22:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(191294, 10770, 4585, '<td valign="top">The horizon is a bit slanted but oh wow!...great colors and excellent lighting.  Good luck!</td>', 'The horizon is a bit slanted but oh wow!...great colors and excellent lighting.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 22:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(191296, 10922, 5250, '<td valign="top">The sky has a bit of noise in it which could be removed by using a program such as neatimage. The contrast in your image needs improving. It is too hard to make out the trees against the landscape. Composition seems good to me though. I think this photo would be much more dramatic in colour. jgillard5</td>', 'The sky has a bit of noise in it which could be removed by using a program such as neatimage. The contrast in your image needs improving. It is too hard to make out the trees against the landscape. Composition seems good to me though. I think this photo would be much more dramatic in colour. jgillard5', '2003-01-14 22:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191297, 10754, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think the shot would have been a little bit better without the shadow (wouldn''t it be nice to be able to sit around for days waiting for the perfect moment to take a photo).  Other than that, your photo has nice focus, and a nice composition.  I particularly like the rocks in the foreground.  The tree disappearing out the top of the photo is a bit of a distraction, but nothing major.  Well done</td>', 'I think the shot would have been a little bit better without the shadow (wouldn''t it be nice to be able to sit around for days waiting for the perfect moment to take a photo).  Other than that, your photo has nice focus, and a nice composition.  I particularly like the rocks in the foreground.  The tree disappearing out the top of the photo is a bit of a distraction, but nothing major.  Well done', '2003-01-14 22:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(191298, 10996, 4585, '<td valign="top">Excellent alternating colors...white, brown, white and blue.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent alternating colors...white, brown, white and blue.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 22:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(191299, 10795, 5250, '<td valign="top">The effect used is neat, but I do not think that this photo delivers what you would like to the viewer. What is the point of the cd? Is it to show off that you know how to reflect light? ;) Just the image that you have reflected would of resulted in my giving you a higher score. jgillard4</td>', 'The effect used is neat, but I do not think that this photo delivers what you would like to the viewer. What is the point of the cd? Is it to show off that you know how to reflect light? ;) Just the image that you have reflected would of resulted in my giving you a higher score. jgillard4', '2003-01-14 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(191300, 10736, 4585, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.  However, the grass/trees at the bottom of the image detract from the wonderful seascape and boats.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.  However, the grass/trees at the bottom of the image detract from the wonderful seascape and boats.  Good luck!', '2003-01-14 22:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(191301, 10810, 5250, '<td valign="top">The post in the centre of the image is really distracting. It is almost the focal point of the picture, which I am pretty sure was not your intention. Taking a different angle for this shot would be much better. Just forget the boat, and shoot across the water. The boat in this instance does not really add to the picture. You chose a nice colour cast for this image though. jgillard5</td>', 'The post in the centre of the image is really distracting. It is almost the focal point of the picture, which I am pretty sure was not your intention. Taking a different angle for this shot would be much better. Just forget the boat, and shoot across the water. The boat in this instance does not really add to the picture. You chose a nice colour cast for this image though. jgillard5', '2003-01-14 22:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(191302, 10873, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice panaroma.  The border also works well with the white buildings.  Colours are nice and simple and it shows the urban sprawl well.</td>', 'Nice panaroma.  The border also works well with the white buildings.  Colours are nice and simple and it shows the urban sprawl well.', '2003-01-14 22:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191303, 10841, 5250, '<td valign="top">Those are some nice mussels attached to the rudder ;) But, I scored you low based on the fact that this is not a landscape shot IMO. Technically it is sound, and I like the composition. Colours are vibrant as well. jgillard4</td>', 'Those are some nice mussels attached to the rudder ;) But, I scored you low based on the fact that this is not a landscape shot IMO. Technically it is sound, and I like the composition. Colours are vibrant as well. jgillard4', '2003-01-14 22:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(191305, 10892, 5250, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of a pinecone. I think if the cone was at the left of the frame it would be better. A nice use of dof as well. Colours are sharp, and the cone is in focus. I scored you lower though, as IMO it does not meet the challenge. jgillard4</td>', 'This is a nice shot of a pinecone. I think if the cone was at the left of the frame it would be better. A nice use of dof as well. Colours are sharp, and the cone is in focus. I scored you lower though, as IMO it does not meet the challenge. jgillard4', '2003-01-14 22:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(191307, 10929, 5250, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Excellent shot. My favourite of the challenge. The colours are breathtaking. Everthing is in focus, and I love the composition. jgillard10</td>', 'Stunning. Excellent shot. My favourite of the challenge. The colours are breathtaking. Everthing is in focus, and I love the composition. jgillard10', '2003-01-14 22:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(191308, 10754, 5250, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. The colours could be a bit more vibrant, but what u have chosen still works well. jgillard9</td>', 'I love the composition. The colours could be a bit more vibrant, but what u have chosen still works well. jgillard9', '2003-01-14 22:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(191309, 10699, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting composition - probably not something I would have been brave enough to try.  It does make a real lonliness statement about the tree though - it''s so small and alone in the scheme of things.  Focus is pretty good (just a tiny bit blurry in the branches - but possibly unavoidable).  Well done</td>', 'That''s an interesting composition - probably not something I would have been brave enough to try.  It does make a real lonliness statement about the tree though - it''s so small and alone in the scheme of things.  Focus is pretty good (just a tiny bit blurry in the branches - but possibly unavoidable).  Well done', '2003-01-14 22:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(191310, 11044, 5250, '<td valign="top">The water looks great for fishing! I love the reflection of the sky in the water by the shore. The greens of the campsite encompased by trees sets a great scene. jgillard9</td>', 'The water looks great for fishing! I love the reflection of the sky in the water by the shore. The greens of the campsite encompased by trees sets a great scene. jgillard9', '2003-01-14 22:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(191311, 10904, 5250, '<td valign="top">What a stunning view. jgillard9</td>', 'What a stunning view. jgillard9', '2003-01-14 22:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(191312, 10801, 1647, '<td valign="top">A great postcode like photo.  The falling over signpost has an almost comical quality to it - which I like a lot.  I think black and white was a good choice for this photo (I think a lot of people overuse b&amp;w).  Well done.</td>', 'A great postcode like photo.  The falling over signpost has an almost comical quality to it - which I like a lot.  I think black and white was a good choice for this photo (I think a lot of people overuse b&w).  Well done.', '2003-01-14 22:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(191313, 10838, 5250, '<td valign="top">This photo has a great use of colour. I think the horizon could be up a bit higher in the frame to accentuate the water which has a most gorgeous tone to it. Mountains are nice and crisp. jgillard9</td>', 'This photo has a great use of colour. I think the horizon could be up a bit higher in the frame to accentuate the water which has a most gorgeous tone to it. Mountains are nice and crisp. jgillard9', '2003-01-14 22:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(191314, 10933, 1647, '<td valign="top">Looking at those buildings I''d say it became cityscape a long time ago (100 years or more), but I still like the photo.  It has an interesting mix of building types and colours and is nicely framed by the two trees.  Good work</td>', 'Looking at those buildings I''d say it became cityscape a long time ago (100 years or more), but I still like the photo.  It has an interesting mix of building types and colours and is nicely framed by the two trees.  Good work', '2003-01-14 22:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(191318, 10745, 1647, '<td valign="top">A lovely classic landscape shot.  The rocks in the foreground provide interest, whilst the mountains provide a sense of vastness.  Technically very good - lovely colour, focus and depth of field.  My only negative would be the squareness of this photo - it''s not bad but I think I''d prefer a wider shot (depending on what was out each side).  Well done though - one of the best and very true to the challenge title.</td>', 'A lovely classic landscape shot.  The rocks in the foreground provide interest, whilst the mountains provide a sense of vastness.  Technically very good - lovely colour, focus and depth of field.  My only negative would be the squareness of this photo - it''s not bad but I think I''d prefer a wider shot (depending on what was out each side).  Well done though - one of the best and very true to the challenge title.', '2003-01-14 22:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(191320, 10893, 772, '<td valign="top">This is simply phenomenal... The composition and exposure is perfect... the silhouetted people really make this image pop.  THAT is what i consider a ''single'' element of a landscape photo that gives the eye a great place to come to rest... excellent work - tied for best of show for me with one other image :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is simply phenomenal... The composition and exposure is perfect... the silhouetted people really make this image pop.  THAT is what i consider a ''single'' element of a landscape photo that gives the eye a great place to come to rest... excellent work - tied for best of show for me with one other image :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-14 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191322, 10940, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - good framing (if anything a little more of the rightmost tree could be included) and the red house looks great.  Focus is great, sky is nice and border is ok (just within what I would consider too big).  The shadow on the snow in the foreground is a little gloomy and distracting.  Very good photo though.</td>', 'Nice photo - good framing (if anything a little more of the rightmost tree could be included) and the red house looks great.  Focus is great, sky is nice and border is ok (just within what I would consider too big).  The shadow on the snow in the foreground is a little gloomy and distracting.  Very good photo though.', '2003-01-14 23:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(191326, 10942, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo.  B&amp;W really works, as does the border.  The sky is great, as is the entire composition.  Nothing negative to say about this actually.  My only suggestion would be to remove the powerline (if that''s not too much trouble for a free challenge photo) - but given that''s my best suggestion you have done very well.  Great job.</td>', 'Wonderful photo.  B&W really works, as does the border.  The sky is great, as is the entire composition.  Nothing negative to say about this actually.  My only suggestion would be to remove the powerline (if that''s not too much trouble for a free challenge photo) - but given that''s my best suggestion you have done very well.  Great job.', '2003-01-14 23:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(191328, 10990, 4805, '<td valign="top">Just stunning...love the black and white. I''m sure you agonised over the choice of it over colour. The depth is fantastic. The composition is also excellent. Very subtle tones in the ground. Well done.</td>', 'Just stunning...love the black and white. I''m sure you agonised over the choice of it over colour. The depth is fantastic. The composition is also excellent. Very subtle tones in the ground. Well done.', '2003-01-14 23:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(191330, 10702, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very simple and beautiful. Composition great. The large DOF works well, from the blades of grass to the trees. Nice.</td>', 'Very simple and beautiful. Composition great. The large DOF works well, from the blades of grass to the trees. Nice.', '2003-01-14 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(191332, 10786, 2295, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus and  really does not meet the challenge.  4 waltoml.</td>', 'Seems out of focus and  really does not meet the challenge.  4 waltoml.', '2003-01-14 23:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(191334, 10874, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very pretty reflection.  I really like the colors.  7 waltoml.</td>', 'Very pretty reflection.  I really like the colors.  7 waltoml.', '2003-01-14 23:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(191335, 10914, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I really like the sky.  The tree is a bit dark, but doesn''t really take away that much from the pict.  9 waltoml.</td>', 'Very nice.  I really like the sky.  The tree is a bit dark, but doesn''t really take away that much from the pict.  9 waltoml.', '2003-01-14 23:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(191336, 10699, 2295, '<td valign="top">Not much "landscape" here.  Focus looks OK.  Lighting is OK.  5 waltoml.<br/></td>', 'Not much "landscape" here.  Focus looks OK.  Lighting is OK.  5 waltoml.', '2003-01-14 23:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(191339, 10822, 5333, '<td valign="top">That is Petronas Towers for your infomation!!</td>', 'That is Petronas Towers for your infomation!!', '2003-01-14 23:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(191344, 10725, 3080, '<td valign="top">The framing with the wall is very nice.  I like that a lot.  The view is kind of dulled by the snow actually.  The sky is the problem, I think.  Weather can really affect a photo.  I think that the sky is too white and washed out for my personal preference.  I like the little trees in the forground.  Focus is nice.  Angle and framing/cropping are excelent. Great location.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The framing with the wall is very nice.  I like that a lot.  The view is kind of dulled by the snow actually.  The sky is the problem, I think.  Weather can really affect a photo.  I think that the sky is too white and washed out for my personal preference.  I like the little trees in the forground.  Focus is nice.  Angle and framing/cropping are excelent. Great location.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 23:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(191345, 10942, 3080, '<td valign="top">Dual meaning.  I like this a lot, and I think my only complaint is the white side of the building.  It really doesn''t fit with the photo.  seems out of place.  I realize you can''t control something like that.  But after the challenge, you could try dimming it with an editer or something.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you chose, and the border works very nicely as well.  is this IR?  I''m not real familiar with it, but from what I''ve seen, it has this kind of effect.  Lovely location for a shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Dual meaning.  I like this a lot, and I think my only complaint is the white side of the building.  It really doesn''t fit with the photo.  seems out of place.  I realize you can''t control something like that.  But after the challenge, you could try dimming it with an editer or something.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you chose, and the border works very nicely as well.  is this IR?  I''m not real familiar with it, but from what I''ve seen, it has this kind of effect.  Lovely location for a shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 23:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191346, 10990, 2792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, would have loved to have seen what it looked like in color though.  Also might have liked a little less sky.  Very good none the less.  7  =-)</td>', 'Beautiful shot, would have loved to have seen what it looked like in color though.  Also might have liked a little less sky.  Very good none the less.  7  =-)', '2003-01-14 23:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191348, 10975, 2792, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Beautiful colors!  One of my favorites for the week.  9  =-)</td>', 'Excellent!  Beautiful colors!  One of my favorites for the week.  9  =-)', '2003-01-14 23:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(191351, 11019, 2792, '<td valign="top">A little too much blue.  Sorry!  =(</td>', 'A little too much blue.  Sorry!  =(', '2003-01-14 23:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(191353, 11018, 2792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!  Nice, earthy tones.  Good job!  =-)  7</td>', 'Beautiful colors!  Nice, earthy tones.  Good job!  =-)  7', '2003-01-14 23:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(191355, 10728, 5044, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Nice shadows.</td>', 'Beautiful, Nice shadows.', '2003-01-14 23:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(191356, 10966, 5903, '<td valign="top">Great contrast in this picture gives it enormous depth...10<br/></td>', 'Great contrast in this picture gives it enormous depth...10', '2003-01-14 23:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(191359, 10746, 2792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place!!  But the top part of the landscape appears purplish and a bit noisy, but I can''t tell if that is part of the landscape or not, so I won''t mark ya down.  7</td>', 'Beautiful place!!  But the top part of the landscape appears purplish and a bit noisy, but I can''t tell if that is part of the landscape or not, so I won''t mark ya down.  7', '2003-01-14 23:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(191360, 10874, 5044, '<td valign="top">The outline of the tree on the ice is superb. The colours are great. I would have liked to see a little more sharpness to this image, though.</td>', 'The outline of the tree on the ice is superb. The colours are great. I would have liked to see a little more sharpness to this image, though.', '2003-01-14 23:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(191361, 10853, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is hurt by the small size.  The picture can be up to 640 pixels on one side and the file can be up to 150k.  You used 280 pixels on your largest side and a file size of 39k.  This may be a great shot, but there just isn''t enough of it here to tell.</td>', 'This is hurt by the small size.  The picture can be up to 640 pixels on one side and the file can be up to 150k.  You used 280 pixels on your largest side and a file size of 39k.  This may be a great shot, but there just isn''t enough of it here to tell.', '2003-01-14 23:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(191366, 10893, 2337, '<td valign="top">Everything a landscape should be!  Wonderful!  Did you hang out there a few minutes and see what colors the sky turned after it sunk a little lower?  Looks like you are about an hour early of the ''official'' sunset.  Congratulations...  Awesome shot!</td>', 'Everything a landscape should be!  Wonderful!  Did you hang out there a few minutes and see what colors the sky turned after it sunk a little lower?  Looks like you are about an hour early of the ''official'' sunset.  Congratulations...  Awesome shot!', '2003-01-14 23:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(191370, 10704, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Strong diagonals from the boats.  The horizon of the bridge looks a little slanted, but not so much as to overly distract.</td>', 'Very nice... Strong diagonals from the boats.  The horizon of the bridge looks a little slanted, but not so much as to overly distract.', '2003-01-15 00:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(191374, 10770, 2337, '<td valign="top">Excellent color!  The horizon might be just a tad slanted (or that could be an illusion), but not so badly that it hurts this wonderful shot!</td>', 'Excellent color!  The horizon might be just a tad slanted (or that could be an illusion), but not so badly that it hurts this wonderful shot!', '2003-01-15 00:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191375, 10968, 5964, '<td valign="top">There was something about this photo that I just love. I guess it has to be the tree formation and how you included part of the barren frozen lake. The framing is great...is that a shanty out there?. The weeds/grass  in the foreground add a lot too. Thanks for an enjoyable picture.8.</td>', 'There was something about this photo that I just love. I guess it has to be the tree formation and how you included part of the barren frozen lake. The framing is great...is that a shanty out there?. The weeds/grass  in the foreground add a lot too. Thanks for an enjoyable picture.8.', '2003-01-15 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(191376, 10712, 5044, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, but the colours seems off, especially the sky. The sun''s glare on the left side unfoirtunately washes out the colours on that side. The colours on the right side are very rich and deep. Beautiful. I guess maybe next time don''t shoot into (or so close to) the sun. Saturation is also maybe a little too much.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, but the colours seems off, especially the sky. The sun''s glare on the left side unfoirtunately washes out the colours on that side. The colours on the right side are very rich and deep. Beautiful. I guess maybe next time don''t shoot into (or so close to) the sun. Saturation is also maybe a little too much.', '2003-01-15 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(191377, 10840, 1647, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo.  The colour and contrast make for an interesting shot.  My only criticism would be the left edge framing.  Looking at the gap between the right edge and the tree, and the gap between the bush and the horse, I would have tried to replicate that gap on the left edge.  I guess that''s a personal taste thing though.  Focus is quite good.  Well done</td>', 'A lovely photo.  The colour and contrast make for an interesting shot.  My only criticism would be the left edge framing.  Looking at the gap between the right edge and the tree, and the gap between the bush and the horse, I would have tried to replicate that gap on the left edge.  I guess that''s a personal taste thing though.  Focus is quite good.  Well done', '2003-01-15 00:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(191378, 10996, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Good use of layers.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Good use of layers.', '2003-01-15 00:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(191380, 10811, 2337, '<td valign="top">Great composition!  Love the strong diagonal line!  Colors look a little flat to me, but not extremely so.</td>', 'Great composition!  Love the strong diagonal line!  Colors look a little flat to me, but not extremely so.', '2003-01-15 00:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191382, 10832, 1647, '<td valign="top">Witty title and pretty good exposure.  The framing and composition work well (tall buildings on each edge and some interest in the centre and foreground.  Did you have a filter to get the star effect around the lights or is your camera lens naturally gifted - they look very good.  Well done.</td>', 'Witty title and pretty good exposure.  The framing and composition work well (tall buildings on each edge and some interest in the centre and foreground.  Did you have a filter to get the star effect around the lights or is your camera lens naturally gifted - they look very good.  Well done.', '2003-01-15 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(191383, 10816, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great photo but lacks sharpness, definition.</td>', 'Great photo but lacks sharpness, definition.', '2003-01-15 00:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(191386, 10912, 2337, '<td valign="top">I hope you''re not getting comments telling you this isn''t a landscape.  If you are, don''t believe it... Not only is it a landscape, it''s a dang good one!</td>', 'I hope you''re not getting comments telling you this isn''t a landscape.  If you are, don''t believe it... Not only is it a landscape, it''s a dang good one!', '2003-01-15 00:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(191388, 10942, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.  The lit side of the house is a little distracting at first, but it greaw on me after looking for a while.</td>', 'Very nice effect.  The lit side of the house is a little distracting at first, but it greaw on me after looking for a while.', '2003-01-15 00:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191389, 10905, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  The range of colours is great, the silohuette of the tree is wonderful.  It''s a very interesting picture, and technically well executed.  The border sits well, colours are natural yet interesting, focus is good, composition is very good.  Well done - one of the best.</td>', 'I love this photo.  The range of colours is great, the silohuette of the tree is wonderful.  It''s a very interesting picture, and technically well executed.  The border sits well, colours are natural yet interesting, focus is good, composition is very good.  Well done - one of the best.', '2003-01-15 00:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(191391, 10712, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great title and wild colours.  It works very well with your chosen subject.  Good work</td>', 'Great title and wild colours.  It works very well with your chosen subject.  Good work', '2003-01-15 00:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(191393, 10971, 5964, '<td valign="top">Good shot. That perspective actually makes the fence look interesting. The white is almost too white and hard to look at but I guess that comes with the territory. Snow is hard to look at outside too. Overall great shot for an overcast snowy day.8.</td>', 'Good shot. That perspective actually makes the fence look interesting. The white is almost too white and hard to look at but I guess that comes with the territory. Snow is hard to look at outside too. Overall great shot for an overcast snowy day.8.', '2003-01-15 00:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191396, 10885, 1647, '<td valign="top">I find the black and white a little too harsh - especially when the title mentions "nature" - I expected some natural greens and blues.  It looks a little like an old photo and has lovely composition but I think colour would have gotten a higher vote from me - I don''t see a need for b&amp;w for this photo.</td>', 'I find the black and white a little too harsh - especially when the title mentions "nature" - I expected some natural greens and blues.  It looks a little like an old photo and has lovely composition but I think colour would have gotten a higher vote from me - I don''t see a need for b&w for this photo.', '2003-01-15 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(191397, 10971, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the way the fence snakes away through the photo - lovely composition.  The horizon is also at a nice height, and focus is good.  You should take the same photo in six months time, I think they''d make a lovely comparison.  Good work.</td>', 'I like the way the fence snakes away through the photo - lovely composition.  The horizon is also at a nice height, and focus is good.  You should take the same photo in six months time, I think they''d make a lovely comparison.  Good work.', '2003-01-15 00:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(191398, 10838, 5964, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, this is my #1 pick for this week. I love the reflection on the thin ice. The beauty of the scene is just breathtaking even down to the cloud formation. 10</td>', 'Wonderful shot, this is my #1 pick for this week. I love the reflection on the thin ice. The beauty of the scene is just breathtaking even down to the cloud formation. 10', '2003-01-15 00:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(191400, 10852, 5964, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the moon, I just love the detail you were able to pick up! You must have some setup to get such a close view. Perfect phase of the moon to take a pic too. Framing was real good and I even liked the border in this case. 9.</td>', 'Great shot of the moon, I just love the detail you were able to pick up! You must have some setup to get such a close view. Perfect phase of the moon to take a pic too. Framing was real good and I even liked the border in this case. 9.', '2003-01-15 00:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(191401, 10902, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is a very neat point of view. I liked the framing a lot and the shot is just awesome.To me this is still landscape, great job! 9.</td>', 'This is a very neat point of view. I liked the framing a lot and the shot is just awesome.To me this is still landscape, great job! 9.', '2003-01-15 00:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
