(191415, 10947, 5964, '<td valign="top">This shot sure shows something different, but I like that. I dont like black and white much, but it adds a lot to this shot. The rock formation in the foreground really adds to the shot. The only part I would change if at all possible would be to get rid of the tiny bit of rock on the lower right corner, but it does nothing detrimental to the effect. 8.</td>', 'This shot sure shows something different, but I like that. I dont like black and white much, but it adds a lot to this shot. The rock formation in the foreground really adds to the shot. The only part I would change if at all possible would be to get rid of the tiny bit of rock on the lower right corner, but it does nothing detrimental to the effect. 8.', '2003-01-15 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191416, 10855, 5925, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, the black and white completely make this picture.  It has  just wonderful contrasts!  I love it.</td>', 'Oh wow, the black and white completely make this picture.  It has  just wonderful contrasts!  I love it.', '2003-01-15 00:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(191417, 10912, 3724, '<td valign="top">I was attracted by the thumb nail  - this is a riot of colour &amp; juxtaposed shape.....your cityscape of this timessquare scene is a reminder for me of New Yorks vast untamed visual qualities....</td>', 'I was attracted by the thumb nail  - this is a riot of colour & juxtaposed shape.....your cityscape of this timessquare scene is a reminder for me of New Yorks vast untamed visual qualities....', '2003-01-15 01:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(191419, 10728, 5964, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the dawn breaking, it really adds a lot to the snow along with the shadows. I would be interested in seeing more of the trees though I think. They are kind of just cut off, especially the pine tree. Great shot. 8</td>', 'Nice capture of the dawn breaking, it really adds a lot to the snow along with the shadows. I would be interested in seeing more of the trees though I think. They are kind of just cut off, especially the pine tree. Great shot. 8', '2003-01-15 01:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(191420, 10811, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like this,  it is different. I am already sick of trees. Though I know it is not a classical landscape I give it a 8. The color differential along with the with the sunset make for a colorful and interesting shot.</td>', 'I like this,  it is different. I am already sick of trees. Though I know it is not a classical landscape I give it a 8. The color differential along with the with the sunset make for a colorful and interesting shot.', '2003-01-15 01:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
