(191431, 10768, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot, not scenic mind you but thought provoking. The B&amp;W adds a lot to this feeling. My only suggestion and just my personal preference would be to crop out a bit of weeds on the lower part of the picture. When I look at the picture sometimes the first thing I see is the weeds and not the barn.8.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot, not scenic mind you but thought provoking. The B&W adds a lot to this feeling. My only suggestion and just my personal preference would be to crop out a bit of weeds on the lower part of the picture. When I look at the picture sometimes the first thing I see is the weeds and not the barn.8.', '2003-01-15 01:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
