(191433, 10717, 5925, '<td valign="top">I love the bright red bench in the foreground, really brings something to the picture.</td>', 'I love the bright red bench in the foreground, really brings something to the picture.', '2003-01-15 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(191434, 10774, 3724, '<td valign="top">good colour...... i especially like the black &amp; brown of the tree trunks against the snow........  you have a good eye.......  the design of the composition is well done ....  i detect a softness in the contrast and sharpness of the picture which i like, as it adds to the ambiant feeling of this scene.</td>', 'good colour...... i especially like the black & brown of the tree trunks against the snow........  you have a good eye.......  the design of the composition is well done ....  i detect a softness in the contrast and sharpness of the picture which i like, as it adds to the ambiant feeling of this scene.', '2003-01-15 01:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(191435, 10792, 5822, '<td valign="top">Like this picture alot, but wish the tree on the left in the foreground wasn''t there, which I feel disturbs the balance of the picture. Still will give a high rating.</td>', 'Like this picture alot, but wish the tree on the left in the foreground wasn''t there, which I feel disturbs the balance of the picture. Still will give a high rating.', '2003-01-15 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(191437, 10855, 5964, '<td valign="top">Black and white really works for this shot, it really makes the tree pop. Is that really desert or snow? Those clouds look so menacing they engulf the horizon. I really think this shot is great and the tree is what really makes it. Without the tree it is just clouds and land, with the tree it is art. 8.</td>', 'Black and white really works for this shot, it really makes the tree pop. Is that really desert or snow? Those clouds look so menacing they engulf the horizon. I really think this shot is great and the tree is what really makes it. Without the tree it is just clouds and land, with the tree it is art. 8.', '2003-01-15 01:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191438, 10759, 1143, '<td valign="top">Tough competition on this challenge AND it isn''t the best season for landscape shots around here. I think you found a decent location but maybe not the perfect composition. I like the blue in the sky. I''m sure you know about the silly rule of thirds and I think that it would help if you had something in one of those intersections. There isn''t really a focal point for me. The bank and river lines go back into the shot and the point where they converge - far down river - would be a good point to place in one of the intersections. You''d have to change your location/perspective though. Basically, you have all these nice lines created by the trees, but they are all just leading out of the frame instead of leading you TO something. I don''t see any obvious technical problems though. That''s good. Once you have the technical aspects down, you can focus more on the creative and compositional side of photography.</td>', 'Tough competition on this challenge AND it isn''t the best season for landscape shots around here. I think you found a decent location but maybe not the perfect composition. I like the blue in the sky. I''m sure you know about the silly rule of thirds and I think that it would help if you had something in one of those intersections. There isn''t really a focal point for me. The bank and river lines go back into the shot and the point where they converge - far down river - would be a good point to place in one of the intersections. You''d have to change your location/perspective though. Basically, you have all these nice lines created by the trees, but they are all just leading out of the frame instead of leading you TO something. I don''t see any obvious technical problems though. That''s good. Once you have the technical aspects down, you can focus more on the creative and compositional side of photography.', '2003-01-15 01:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(191440, 10712, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like it. Love the title too! The sun washed out the left side of the the picture a bit too much, and you could probably crop a bit of that out. But other than that cool shot.7.</td>', 'I like it. Love the title too! The sun washed out the left side of the the picture a bit too much, and you could probably crop a bit of that out. But other than that cool shot.7.', '2003-01-15 01:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(191441, 10977, 2352, '<td valign="top">A bit fuzzy in focus and low in interest level to the right of the barn.  The focus is good in the front and a great place to start the center of attention.  Feel good for getting out there and doing it!</td>', 'A bit fuzzy in focus and low in interest level to the right of the barn.  The focus is good in the front and a great place to start the center of attention.  Feel good for getting out there and doing it!', '2003-01-15 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(191442, 10929, 5964, '<td valign="top">Very nice scenic view, must have been a pretty hazy day! I struggle on this shot for a few reasons, the shadow on the ground which could be cropped with no lasting impact to the effect and that my attention is drawn between the landscape and the building on the outcropping. Either would be fine in my opinion, but both is a little much to my eyes. Playing around with the crop on either side would accomplish this. I hope you understand what I am getting at, the shot is still really good.7.</td>', 'Very nice scenic view, must have been a pretty hazy day! I struggle on this shot for a few reasons, the shadow on the ground which could be cropped with no lasting impact to the effect and that my attention is drawn between the landscape and the building on the outcropping. Either would be fine in my opinion, but both is a little much to my eyes. Playing around with the crop on either side would accomplish this. I hope you understand what I am getting at, the shot is still really good.7.', '2003-01-15 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(191444, 10983, 3273, '<td valign="top">The foreground colours are excellent but the colours in the distance, particularly the tower and sky look a little washed out.</td>', 'The foreground colours are excellent but the colours in the distance, particularly the tower and sky look a little washed out.', '2003-01-15 02:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(191446, 10942, 1829, '<td valign="top">Your photo is an excellent example of sepia colour IMO.  I love how you have captured the ''age'' of this.  I also love the sky how it is not all one colour and it almost gives a sense of eerieness, which is usually felt at a grave yard.  Well done and GL in this weeks challenge. 10 :)</td>', 'Your photo is an excellent example of sepia colour IMO.  I love how you have captured the ''age'' of this.  I also love the sky how it is not all one colour and it almost gives a sense of eerieness, which is usually felt at a grave yard.  Well done and GL in this weeks challenge. 10 :)', '2003-01-15 02:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(191447, 10981, 1829, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.  I would like to know where this was taken.  I love the way you have captured colour and haze all in the one photo.  Also, I love the sweeping hills, reminds me of that movie/song ''The sound of music''.  Excellent job.  GL.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.  I would like to know where this was taken.  I love the way you have captured colour and haze all in the one photo.  Also, I love the sweeping hills, reminds me of that movie/song ''The sound of music''.  Excellent job.  GL.', '2003-01-15 02:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(191448, 11033, 1829, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture of scenery.  I love that big ole'' hill in the image as well.  Also the train tracks and bridge adds interest.  Excellent composition and use of B&amp;W.  Looks like a winner to me.  10 :)</td>', 'A beautiful capture of scenery.  I love that big ole'' hill in the image as well.  Also the train tracks and bridge adds interest.  Excellent composition and use of B&W.  Looks like a winner to me.  10 :)', '2003-01-15 02:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
