(191590, 10969, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this, with the farm buildings somewhat dwarfed by the landscape, but I don''t think you did it enough. If it was possible I would have liked to see more landscape to the left. You also need to straighten up the silo, as it appears to be leaning.</td>', 'I like the feel of this, with the farm buildings somewhat dwarfed by the landscape, but I don''t think you did it enough. If it was possible I would have liked to see more landscape to the left. You also need to straighten up the silo, as it appears to be leaning.', '2003-01-15 06:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
