(191603, 10792, 5340, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2003-01-15 06:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(191605, 10821, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, definition suffers a little from overcropping</td>', 'Nice scene, definition suffers a little from overcropping', '2003-01-15 06:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(191606, 10942, 4388, '<td valign="top">great composition. i like the way the gravestones go all the way to the building. all of the verticles in the image accentuate each other. nice shot.</td>', 'great composition. i like the way the gravestones go all the way to the building. all of the verticles in the image accentuate each other. nice shot.', '2003-01-15 06:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(191607, 10863, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really love how the tree stands out from the hill.  Subtle, but still very obvious.  The sun peeking out really adds the color that this shot needs.  i like the pinkish/orange tint to the shot.  The angle and framing/cropping is excelent.  I like the way the hill in the front sets an angle.  Focus and clarity are great.  That tree is just awesome.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really love how the tree stands out from the hill.  Subtle, but still very obvious.  The sun peeking out really adds the color that this shot needs.  i like the pinkish/orange tint to the shot.  The angle and framing/cropping is excelent.  I like the way the hill in the front sets an angle.  Focus and clarity are great.  That tree is just awesome.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 06:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(191608, 10833, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice composition, good framing. i like the way you put the sun in the center making so the light radiates from the center and draws your eyes to the island of trees.</td>', 'nice composition, good framing. i like the way you put the sun in the center making so the light radiates from the center and draws your eyes to the island of trees.', '2003-01-15 06:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191609, 11028, 4388, '<td valign="top">great shot and composition. i like the way the waterfall disappears behind the rocks.</td>', 'great shot and composition. i like the way the waterfall disappears behind the rocks.', '2003-01-15 06:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(191610, 10818, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal of the rock in the bottom left.  The water is very nice, and I bet the water is coooold.Focus and clarity are good.  I think it''s neat to see the cracks in the rock.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  You placed the diagonal very nicely within the photo.  My only nitpick is the water in the bottom right.  It seems almost like it''s starting to get washed out.  maybe a little lighting issue in that area.  Otherwise, lighting is nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the diagonal of the rock in the bottom left.  The water is very nice, and I bet the water is coooold.Focus and clarity are good.  I think it''s neat to see the cracks in the rock.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  You placed the diagonal very nicely within the photo.  My only nitpick is the water in the bottom right.  It seems almost like it''s starting to get washed out.  maybe a little lighting issue in that area.  Otherwise, lighting is nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 06:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(191611, 10831, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice composition with the tree and rocks in the foreground giving the image more substance. great background too! awesome view.</td>', 'nice composition with the tree and rocks in the foreground giving the image more substance. great background too! awesome view.', '2003-01-15 07:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(191612, 10851, 5340, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2003-01-15 07:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191615, 10801, 4388, '<td valign="top">great composition. i like the way the sign is leaning and where it is pointing. it really completes the image.</td>', 'great composition. i like the way the sign is leaning and where it is pointing. it really completes the image.', '2003-01-15 07:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(191616, 10746, 5340, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2003-01-15 07:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(191617, 10753, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not too fond of the pink tint, but the shot looks very nicely done.  Focus and clarity are great.  The detail is amazing in the bridge.  Looks like you did a great job leveling the photo.  Placement of the bridge within the photo is nice, and lighting seems good. No hot spots or distracting shadows.  That pole intruding from the bottom near the right corner is kind of out of place, but sometimes we take what we can get.  Very nice view. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not too fond of the pink tint, but the shot looks very nicely done.  Focus and clarity are great.  The detail is amazing in the bridge.  Looks like you did a great job leveling the photo.  Placement of the bridge within the photo is nice, and lighting seems good. No hot spots or distracting shadows.  That pole intruding from the bottom near the right corner is kind of out of place, but sometimes we take what we can get.  Very nice view. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191618, 10941, 4388, '<td valign="top">excellent capture of a beautiful scene. great color.</td>', 'excellent capture of a beautiful scene. great color.', '2003-01-15 07:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(191619, 10941, 5340, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.</td>', 'Nice landscape.', '2003-01-15 07:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(191620, 10755, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice choice of subjects and great color.</td>', 'nice choice of subjects and great color.', '2003-01-15 07:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(191621, 10838, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the way the blue water gets darker at the bottom of the image. it adds depth and contrast to it. great shot.</td>', 'i like the way the blue water gets darker at the bottom of the image. it adds depth and contrast to it. great shot.', '2003-01-15 07:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(191622, 10914, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s not the prettiest tree in the world, but it works.  I like the one in the distance better, but the larger one creates some balance.  Colors are beautiful.  Great job capturing the snow.  Snow is hard for me. Always turns out blue.  Cute little moon, but it almost looks like something on the photo, lint or something.  I know it''s a moon though.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, it''s not the prettiest tree in the world, but it works.  I like the one in the distance better, but the larger one creates some balance.  Colors are beautiful.  Great job capturing the snow.  Snow is hard for me. Always turns out blue.  Cute little moon, but it almost looks like something on the photo, lint or something.  I know it''s a moon though.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(191623, 10873, 4388, '<td valign="top">great use of repetition and cropping.</td>', 'great use of repetition and cropping.', '2003-01-15 07:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(191624, 10855, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the simplicity of this image. i also like the clouds in the background rising from the edge of the land. great composition. the border is a little overdone.</td>', 'i like the simplicity of this image. i also like the clouds in the background rising from the edge of the land. great composition. the border is a little overdone.', '2003-01-15 07:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(191625, 10737, 4388, '<td valign="top">great moon shot. i like the way you framed it.</td>', 'great moon shot. i like the way you framed it.', '2003-01-15 07:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(191626, 10714, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice composition with the trees standing as a gateway to the unknown.</td>', 'nice composition with the trees standing as a gateway to the unknown.', '2003-01-15 07:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(191627, 10835, 5340, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.</td>', 'Very beautiful.', '2003-01-15 07:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(191628, 10945, 3080, '<td valign="top">You have a very strong horizontal line and you put it right in the middle of the photo.  I don''t think that works well in this case.  I understand why you did it though, to get the ducks and the trees in the photo.  If you took this from a lower angle, closer to the ground, tilted up slightly, you may have been able to lower the ''horizon'' line a bit.  A couple more small things.  If you wanted the ''horizon'' level, it needs a slight left rotation.  If not, it''s totally not a big deal.   Also, winter was an aweful time for this challenge, cause of lack of color.  I wonder if a saturation level adjustment might help to add a bit of color without turning the ducks green. lol.  I love how you caught the one duck just as he splashed into the water.  It''s a lovely view.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You have a very strong horizontal line and you put it right in the middle of the photo.  I don''t think that works well in this case.  I understand why you did it though, to get the ducks and the trees in the photo.  If you took this from a lower angle, closer to the ground, tilted up slightly, you may have been able to lower the ''horizon'' line a bit.  A couple more small things.  If you wanted the ''horizon'' level, it needs a slight left rotation.  If not, it''s totally not a big deal.   Also, winter was an aweful time for this challenge, cause of lack of color.  I wonder if a saturation level adjustment might help to add a bit of color without turning the ducks green. lol.  I love how you caught the one duck just as he splashed into the water.  It''s a lovely view.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(191629, 10876, 4388, '<td valign="top">great composition and color. i like the tree on the left but it''s cut off a little too much or not enough. the trunk of the tree causes a bit of an imbalance in the image.</td>', 'great composition and color. i like the tree on the left but it''s cut off a little too much or not enough. the trunk of the tree causes a bit of an imbalance in the image.', '2003-01-15 07:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(191630, 10810, 5340, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I don´t like the magenta tone.</td>', 'Nice shot. I don´t like the magenta tone.', '2003-01-15 07:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191631, 10867, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  nice focus and clarity.  The sky is beautiful.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  The little patch of trees to the right adds just enough variation to keep it interesting.    Color is absolutely wonderful.  Both the sky and the ground.  It''s great how you got the green patch of grass there in the front, and how there are a few green patches out in the field.  Placement of the horizon within the photo is very nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty.  nice focus and clarity.  The sky is beautiful.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  The little patch of trees to the right adds just enough variation to keep it interesting.    Color is absolutely wonderful.  Both the sky and the ground.  It''s great how you got the green patch of grass there in the front, and how there are a few green patches out in the field.  Placement of the horizon within the photo is very nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(191633, 10965, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what''s up with this little weed(?).  It looks kind of odd, like a filter was used or something.  I do have to say that the photo would be bland without it, so it''s a good thing.  I like how the sun comes through it.  The blue is nice, and focus seems ok as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what''s up with this little weed(?).  It looks kind of odd, like a filter was used or something.  I do have to say that the photo would be bland without it, so it''s a good thing.  I like how the sun comes through it.  The blue is nice, and focus seems ok as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(191634, 10966, 5340, '<td valign="top">Marvelous!</td>', 'Marvelous!', '2003-01-15 07:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(191635, 10872, 3882, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in this one.  I like the angle of the hill.</td>', 'Nice colors in this one.  I like the angle of the hill.', '2003-01-15 07:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(191636, 11042, 3585, '<td valign="top">The barn in the backgroung has a lot of potential as an interesting foreground for a landscape composition. Trees and wires one sees everywhere. The dry winter ground vegetation also has charms that this dull uniform sky has''nt. good choice of location but not very well exploited. this is a scene viewed many times, include something unique in it to captivate your audiance</td>', 'The barn in the backgroung has a lot of potential as an interesting foreground for a landscape composition. Trees and wires one sees everywhere. The dry winter ground vegetation also has charms that this dull uniform sky has''nt. good choice of location but not very well exploited. this is a scene viewed many times, include something unique in it to captivate your audiance', '2003-01-15 07:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(191637, 10874, 3882, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool.  I love the colors and the reflection is pretty. 8</td>', 'This is pretty cool.  I love the colors and the reflection is pretty. 8', '2003-01-15 07:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(191638, 10943, 3080, '<td valign="top">What catches my eye about this photo is the foggy, polution like haze over the background, and the tree in the front is still hanging on, not in a haze.  Kind of says that there might be hope yet that we wont totally be smothered in polution some day.  Focus and clarity are great.  I like where you have placed your ''horizon'' line within the photo.  Angle and framing/cropping are nice.  The tree is perfect over to the right edge.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What catches my eye about this photo is the foggy, polution like haze over the background, and the tree in the front is still hanging on, not in a haze.  Kind of says that there might be hope yet that we wont totally be smothered in polution some day.  Focus and clarity are great.  I like where you have placed your ''horizon'' line within the photo.  Angle and framing/cropping are nice.  The tree is perfect over to the right edge.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191639, 10755, 3882, '<td valign="top">The lighthouse offers a nice constrast of colour here.</td>', 'The lighthouse offers a nice constrast of colour here.', '2003-01-15 07:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(191640, 10968, 3882, '<td valign="top">This shot would have been improved, in MHO, with a wider angle of view and more color in it.</td>', 'This shot would have been improved, in MHO, with a wider angle of view and more color in it.', '2003-01-15 07:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(191641, 10712, 2363, '<td valign="top">Hay, that''s extremely bright!</td>', 'Hay, that''s extremely bright!', '2003-01-15 07:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191642, 10939, 3080, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Going out there to have a picnic?  Looks like a picnic table.  The color is very nice.  You did an excelent job keeping the snow white in the photo, and not getting blown out spots that are too bright.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  The path leads us into the photo.  Good focus and clarity.  Lighting conditions seem to have been very good for the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'LOL.  Going out there to have a picnic?  Looks like a picnic table.  The color is very nice.  You did an excelent job keeping the snow white in the photo, and not getting blown out spots that are too bright.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  The path leads us into the photo.  Good focus and clarity.  Lighting conditions seem to have been very good for the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(191643, 10762, 3882, '<td valign="top">Brrr!  Just looking at this makes me cold!</td>', 'Brrr!  Just looking at this makes me cold!', '2003-01-15 07:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(191644, 10953, 3882, '<td valign="top">Nice waterfall.  Deeper colors would have been better.  More saturation perhaps??</td>', 'Nice waterfall.  Deeper colors would have been better.  More saturation perhaps??', '2003-01-15 07:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191645, 10881, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice and charming  location but none of the interesting subjects actually stand out in this picture (the cow, the rock(?), the tree or the barn). having one of these graphically featured would save the image.</td>', 'Nice and charming  location but none of the interesting subjects actually stand out in this picture (the cow, the rock(?), the tree or the barn). having one of these graphically featured would save the image.', '2003-01-15 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(191646, 10854, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of a sad little park.  Is that a cat?  I''m looking at the water, thinking it looks overrun by gunk, but it looks like it might just be the little white flowers off the tree that have fallen into the water?  The color is good, but the sky is a little too white.  Looks kind of dulled by lighting conditions?  Focus and clarity seems just fine to me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of a sad little park.  Is that a cat?  I''m looking at the water, thinking it looks overrun by gunk, but it looks like it might just be the little white flowers off the tree that have fallen into the water?  The color is good, but the sky is a little too white.  Looks kind of dulled by lighting conditions?  Focus and clarity seems just fine to me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(191647, 10779, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing a whole lot of this white sky.  Were weather conditions prety bad everywhere?  Looks like kind of an overcast day.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this.  The fence to the bottom right is great.  View is nice.  Wish there were some horses in Casey jones'' ranch, but we can''t have everything huh?  Something that catches my eye in this shot and really holds my attention is the cross that is formed just to the right of dead center.  It looks like a pole in the forground, and part of the field in the background.  It forms a cross though, kind of like a target, my eyes are drawn there.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m seeing a whole lot of this white sky.  Were weather conditions prety bad everywhere?  Looks like kind of an overcast day.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this.  The fence to the bottom right is great.  View is nice.  Wish there were some horses in Casey jones'' ranch, but we can''t have everything huh?  Something that catches my eye in this shot and really holds my attention is the cross that is formed just to the right of dead center.  It looks like a pole in the forground, and part of the field in the background.  It forms a cross though, kind of like a target, my eyes are drawn there.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(191648, 10716, 3080, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of our trip to Beaver Island.  Not really much to see in this shot, but we get the point.  The dark diagonal of the grass is nice and I like how you have placed it within the frame.  It looks like a little person out there in the background, to the left, but it''s hard to really tell through the fog.  It''s pretty.  I''d like to see what it looks like when it''s not foggy too.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Reminds me of our trip to Beaver Island.  Not really much to see in this shot, but we get the point.  The dark diagonal of the grass is nice and I like how you have placed it within the frame.  It looks like a little person out there in the background, to the left, but it''s hard to really tell through the fog.  It''s pretty.  I''d like to see what it looks like when it''s not foggy too.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(191650, 10702, 3080, '<td valign="top">This shot just jumps out of the thumbnails!!  Wow, what color.  Focus and clarity are great.  Look at every single blade of grass.  I''d love to be in an area that still had grass!! Everything''s snow here.  I think those 2 trees are excelent.  They are placed well within the photo, and this is as simple as it gets.  simple, yet very captivating.  Way to get the sky so empty, not even a plane flying by.  how did this look as a vertical crop?  Great negative space.  Lighting conditions are perfect!  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This shot just jumps out of the thumbnails!!  Wow, what color.  Focus and clarity are great.  Look at every single blade of grass.  I''d love to be in an area that still had grass!! Everything''s snow here.  I think those 2 trees are excelent.  They are placed well within the photo, and this is as simple as it gets.  simple, yet very captivating.  Way to get the sky so empty, not even a plane flying by.  how did this look as a vertical crop?  Great negative space.  Lighting conditions are perfect!  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(191651, 10874, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have nothing to complain about, so I wont even try.  Stunning image.  Beautiful color, excelent angle and framing/cropping.  I love the strong diatonal of the reflection.  The focus and clarity are great!  I love how the water is so still.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  10 from me. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I have nothing to complain about, so I wont even try.  Stunning image.  Beautiful color, excelent angle and framing/cropping.  I love the strong diatonal of the reflection.  The focus and clarity are great!  I love how the water is so still.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  10 from me. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191652, 11023, 3585, '<td valign="top">Lots of space here. I would request a little more land and a little less sky for the balance. 9</td>', 'Lots of space here. I would request a little more land and a little less sky for the balance. 9', '2003-01-15 07:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191653, 11044, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice texture with the rocks.  The photo looks a little tilted.  If you have photoshop try rotating the image a bit.  I''d be interested in seeing this same photo at other times of the day.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice texture with the rocks.  The photo looks a little tilted.  If you have photoshop try rotating the image a bit.  I''d be interested in seeing this same photo at other times of the day.  Good luck.', '2003-01-15 07:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191654, 11032, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your silo is leaning a slight bit to the left.  It was noticable in the thumbnail, not so noticable in the large version, so it''s not a big deal at all, but it''s an observation.  I was looking through the thumbnails for a photo that jumped out at me.  I liked the dark sky in this shot, with the bright silo in the front.  Lighting conditions are perfect in my opinion.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, I like the silo off to the left.  Focs and clarity are good as well.  Nice find! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your silo is leaning a slight bit to the left.  It was noticable in the thumbnail, not so noticable in the large version, so it''s not a big deal at all, but it''s an observation.  I was looking through the thumbnails for a photo that jumped out at me.  I liked the dark sky in this shot, with the bright silo in the front.  Lighting conditions are perfect in my opinion.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, I like the silo off to the left.  Focs and clarity are good as well.  Nice find! Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 07:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(191655, 10786, 2363, '<td valign="top">It''s quite difficult to tell what you are looking at here. I think it''s the upper branches of some trees and some bushes behind them? I think you''d have got a better effect if you''d photographed the branches from below so they were sillhouetted against the sky.</td>', 'It''s quite difficult to tell what you are looking at here. I think it''s the upper branches of some trees and some bushes behind them? I think you''d have got a better effect if you''d photographed the branches from below so they were sillhouetted against the sky.', '2003-01-15 07:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(191656, 10874, 2363, '<td valign="top">A really beautiful photo. One of my two 10s.</td>', 'A really beautiful photo. One of my two 10s.', '2003-01-15 07:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(191659, 10879, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think you choose a great location.  I really like the fact that my eyes are drawn down into the center of the picture.  It gives a since of great depth.  Good work and good luck.  I would like to see how this looks in B&amp;W too.</td>', 'I think you choose a great location.  I really like the fact that my eyes are drawn down into the center of the picture.  It gives a since of great depth.  Good work and good luck.  I would like to see how this looks in B&W too.', '2003-01-15 07:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
