(191736, 11004, 4517, '<td valign="top">Odd colour sky, but i think i like it. The fence is a bit distracting but that could be just me as i hate fences in the foreground. Overall nice. 8 :-)</td>', 'Odd colour sky, but i think i like it. The fence is a bit distracting but that could be just me as i hate fences in the foreground. Overall nice. 8 :-)', '2003-01-15 10:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(191738, 10918, 4015, '<td valign="top">Good crisp black and white.  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Good crisp black and white.  Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 10:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(191739, 10929, 2011, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  Can you imagine living there. Your own little mountain. What a view.</td>', 'Amazing.  Can you imagine living there. Your own little mountain. What a view.', '2003-01-15 10:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191740, 10874, 4015, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture.  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Really nice picture.  Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 10:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(191742, 10784, 4517, '<td valign="top">Wicked looking sky. I take it thats a window frame. Shame you couldn`t get outside to take a shot. Still worth an 8.</td>', 'Wicked looking sky. I take it thats a window frame. Shame you couldn`t get outside to take a shot. Still worth an 8.', '2003-01-15 10:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(191744, 10951, 4015, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 10:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191758, 11028, 4015, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Well taken photo.  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Very nice.  Well taken photo.  Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 10:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(191762, 11007, 4852, '<td valign="top">This is so cool . The infrared makes this setting look like a model village. I am however drawn to the left a bit too much. You can see how the lines and darker clouds do that. Wouldnt mind living in one of these shacks too.</td>', 'This is so cool . The infrared makes this setting look like a model village. I am however drawn to the left a bit too much. You can see how the lines and darker clouds do that. Wouldnt mind living in one of these shacks too.', '2003-01-15 10:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(191767, 11033, 4852, '<td valign="top">The lines in this are near perfect, giving very strong emphasis on the center horizontal third.</td>', 'The lines in this are near perfect, giving very strong emphasis on the center horizontal third.', '2003-01-15 10:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(191768, 10953, 4015, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 10:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(191770, 10891, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice, colourfull scene. 7</td>', 'Nice, colourfull scene. 7', '2003-01-15 10:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(191771, 10966, 4852, '<td valign="top">Man , I would love to see this in person. It looks perfecly arranged like a bouquet of flowers. . the only drawback is the lower left corner, otherwise , excellant shot   9</td>', 'Man , I would love to see this in person. It looks perfecly arranged like a bouquet of flowers. . the only drawback is the lower left corner, otherwise , excellant shot   9', '2003-01-15 10:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(191775, 10728, 4852, '<td valign="top">great winter scene. 8</td>', 'great winter scene. 8', '2003-01-15 10:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191777, 10710, 4015, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 10:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(191778, 10867, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice sky but not the most interesting foreground but there`s probaly not alot you could have done it. Overall 6.</td>', 'Nice sky but not the most interesting foreground but there`s probaly not alot you could have done it. Overall 6.', '2003-01-15 10:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(191779, 10892, 4517, '<td valign="top">You wont fool anybody into believing this is a landscape by the title.<br/>Does not meet the challenge at all. You score 1for the border. (If it had fit the challenge i would have scored 4 because it`s out of focus).Sorry.</td>', 'You wont fool anybody into believing this is a landscape by the title.Does not meet the challenge at all. You score 1for the border. (If it had fit the challenge i would have scored 4 because it`s out of focus).Sorry.', '2003-01-15 10:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(191780, 10928, 4852, '<td valign="top">If you pull back and look at the thumbnail you can see where the brush or leaves in the lower left throw off the balance of this shot. Imagine though if evrything in this were symetrical , wow . that would be cool. I tried this too with mixed results, nature doesnt always give  us a perfect canvas . But it is out there.</td>', 'If you pull back and look at the thumbnail you can see where the brush or leaves in the lower left throw off the balance of this shot. Imagine though if evrything in this were symetrical , wow . that would be cool. I tried this too with mixed results, nature doesnt always give  us a perfect canvas . But it is out there.', '2003-01-15 10:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(191781, 10762, 4517, '<td valign="top">looks like sand dunes to me. And contrast is rather poor.</td>', 'looks like sand dunes to me. And contrast is rather poor.', '2003-01-15 10:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(191782, 10888, 4015, '<td valign="top">Very very nice.  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Very very nice.  Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 10:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(191784, 10904, 4852, '<td valign="top">I wanna go , I wanna go..... Of all the places in the world I want to see , New Zealand is the top of the list. A filter to take out the haze would make this perfect.  Great shots like this dont ease my desire to come there.</td>', 'I wanna go , I wanna go..... Of all the places in the world I want to see , New Zealand is the top of the list. A filter to take out the haze would make this perfect.  Great shots like this dont ease my desire to come there.', '2003-01-15 11:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(191785, 10885, 4015, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene.  I would have liked to have seen this in color, but thats just me. Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Very nice scene.  I would have liked to have seen this in color, but thats just me. Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 11:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(191786, 10957, 4852, '<td valign="top">Cool tree shot, a little to tight in the cropping. Focus and or resolution a little too soft.</td>', 'Cool tree shot, a little to tight in the cropping. Focus and or resolution a little too soft.', '2003-01-15 11:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(191787, 10975, 772, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots this week.  I love your effective use of a shallow depth of field to use the lanscape to accent your subject... great photo :) - 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots this week.  I love your effective use of a shallow depth of field to use the lanscape to accent your subject... great photo :) - 10 - setzler', '2003-01-15 11:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(191789, 11026, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph... I really love the color contrast you have provided here.  I think that all landscapes need some specific element of interest for the eye to come to rest on and you have done that very well.  Without that old structure in your image, it would be rather boring overall... great shot = 10 - setzler</td>', 'Excellent photograph... I really love the color contrast you have provided here.  I think that all landscapes need some specific element of interest for the eye to come to rest on and you have done that very well.  Without that old structure in your image, it would be rather boring overall... great shot = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-15 11:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(191792, 10746, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot and beautiful exposure to go along with it!  The color and detail in this particular landsape is most excellent... great work! = 10 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful shot and beautiful exposure to go along with it!  The color and detail in this particular landsape is most excellent... great work! = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-15 11:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(191793, 10978, 4852, '<td valign="top">Center Mt Ranier(?)  in the picture and this would greatly improve this shot.  Wadda ya mean yould have to stand on a ladder. Hey, ya go to great lenghts to get the great shots.                                    Like I''d know.</td>', 'Center Mt Ranier(?)  in the picture and this would greatly improve this shot.  Wadda ya mean yould have to stand on a ladder. Hey, ya go to great lenghts to get the great shots.                                    Like I''d know.', '2003-01-15 11:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(191794, 10855, 4852, '<td valign="top">This is printable art for sure,dude.</td>', 'This is printable art for sure,dude.', '2003-01-15 11:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(191795, 10791, 4852, '<td valign="top">ya, what you said...... This looks just like the area where I live in Montana. Cool landscape, hey , can you tip that sign over its spoiling the view.</td>', 'ya, what you said...... This looks just like the area where I live in Montana. Cool landscape, hey , can you tip that sign over its spoiling the view.', '2003-01-15 11:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(191796, 10737, 4852, '<td valign="top">Hey , is that my big pimpled butt???  not sure , but  a sharper image would clarify that. (Yes I know its the  moon)</td>', 'Hey , is that my big pimpled butt???  not sure , but  a sharper image would clarify that. (Yes I know its the  moon)', '2003-01-15 11:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(191797, 11007, 2792, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Love the infrared!!!  IMO, the home in the middle looks like some spooky old mansion from a horror movie.  =D  7</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Love the infrared!!!  IMO, the home in the middle looks like some spooky old mansion from a horror movie.  =D  7', '2003-01-15 11:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(191801, 10874, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the best looking photos of the week.  The only thing I would have done differently is crop some off the top of the picture.  I don''t think all of the space is necessary.  Good Work though and good luck.</td>', 'I think this is one of the best looking photos of the week.  The only thing I would have done differently is crop some off the top of the picture.  I don''t think all of the space is necessary.  Good Work though and good luck.', '2003-01-15 11:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(191802, 10765, 4015, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Well taken photo.  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'Very nice.  Well taken photo.  Good luck in the challange.', '2003-01-15 11:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(191804, 10992, 3724, '<td valign="top">Your picture makes me dizzy standing on this narrow ledge at dusk.... I enjoy this picture.  Your title indicates you are revisiting a scene and location that you are familiar with.....  that is interesting to me.</td>', 'Your picture makes me dizzy standing on this narrow ledge at dusk.... I enjoy this picture.  Your title indicates you are revisiting a scene and location that you are familiar with.....  that is interesting to me.', '2003-01-15 11:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191805, 10756, 3599, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not the only one to say that its unfortunate that this one is too small.  It looks like a great picture.  The sky looks absolutly amazing.  I can''t tell what''s else is going on with the picture.  Sorry.</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not the only one to say that its unfortunate that this one is too small.  It looks like a great picture.  The sky looks absolutly amazing.  I can''t tell what''s else is going on with the picture.  Sorry.', '2003-01-15 11:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(191807, 11007, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully executed infrared... great shot :)  The only possible improvement that I could see here would have been to lower the horizon so it''s not in the center of the frame... removing some of the foreground to include more sky would have done this nicely... at any rate, this is a 10... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a beautifully executed infrared... great shot :)  The only possible improvement that I could see here would have been to lower the horizon so it''s not in the center of the frame... removing some of the foreground to include more sky would have done this nicely... at any rate, this is a 10... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-01-15 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(191808, 10735, 3599, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand your title but this isn''t Digital Title Challenge.  Plus most people don''t understand mine either.  Anyways, I like this picture.  It''s too bad that it wasn''t sunny.  That would make this place look more inviting and warm to me.  I like the framing of this.  I''m sure you might be getting this isn''t  a landscape photo.  Just ignore them.  Nice photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand your title but this isn''t Digital Title Challenge.  Plus most people don''t understand mine either.  Anyways, I like this picture.  It''s too bad that it wasn''t sunny.  That would make this place look more inviting and warm to me.  I like the framing of this.  I''m sure you might be getting this isn''t  a landscape photo.  Just ignore them.  Nice photo.  Good luck.', '2003-01-15 11:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(191811, 10881, 3599, '<td valign="top">I take it this was taken close to sunset?  The sky in this photo is very nice.  Perhaps if you took the photo a little earlier there may have been more light on the subject.  It is a little too dark and to me the trees in the back have lost some detail due to that.  I would interested in seeing this one at a different time of day.</td>', 'I take it this was taken close to sunset?  The sky in this photo is very nice.  Perhaps if you took the photo a little earlier there may have been more light on the subject.  It is a little too dark and to me the trees in the back have lost some detail due to that.  I would interested in seeing this one at a different time of day.', '2003-01-15 11:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191812, 11038, 4536, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and framing here, seems a bit soft. I think the people under the bridge distract a bit.</td>', 'Love the colors and framing here, seems a bit soft. I think the people under the bridge distract a bit.', '2003-01-15 11:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(191814, 11018, 3599, '<td valign="top">The title fits the picture and I must say you are lucky to have such a view.  I love the contrast between the sky and land with the border of dark hills and mountains seperating them.  Great work and good luck.</td>', 'The title fits the picture and I must say you are lucky to have such a view.  I love the contrast between the sky and land with the border of dark hills and mountains seperating them.  Great work and good luck.', '2003-01-15 11:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(191816, 10948, 2792, '<td valign="top">Very cool, very unique submittion for the Landscape challenge.</td>', 'Very cool, very unique submittion for the Landscape challenge.', '2003-01-15 11:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(191818, 10978, 3447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  What is the name of the mountain?</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  What is the name of the mountain?', '2003-01-15 11:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(191819, 11007, 4015, '<td valign="top">Very very nice.  Well taken photo.  I love it.</td>', 'Very very nice.  Well taken photo.  I love it.', '2003-01-15 11:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(191823, 10827, 3447, '<td valign="top">Great timing.  Good color balance and composition.</td>', 'Great timing.  Good color balance and composition.', '2003-01-15 11:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(191826, 10996, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great picture but the border is a bit chunky 9</td>', 'Great picture but the border is a bit chunky 9', '2003-01-15 11:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(191827, 10772, 4182, '<td valign="top">cause your friend took the time out to get all girly on me I will try to remember the more succinct words i used when i first commented on this image.<br/>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>good contrast in the sky, shame the horizon is dead center though.<br/>the mass of scrub ground in the foreground ruins this shot for me by no having anything to offer. It seems like you wanted the cactus to be main subject, so get closer give it a funky perspective making it look huge or something, everything in the middle just comes across to me like one of those psyciatrists blotch drawings.<br/>so it is those things (i think the black and white was a good choice) that go to make this image boring .. FOR ME .. my opinion, thats all, if you like it, then that is great as it''s like they say no one likes great artists works until their dead, and theres not much great about that.<br/>I explained to your friend why my response was so short. I had spent all day voting on images, and commenting on most all of them. I then started getting the same ones again, for no reason, yours was the third repeat i got, and so i got frustrated sorry, but i just summed it up quick.</td>', 'cause your friend took the time out to get all girly on me I will try to remember the more succinct words i used when i first commented on this image.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------good contrast in the sky, shame the horizon is dead center though.the mass of scrub ground in the foreground ruins this shot for me by no having anything to offer. It seems like you wanted the cactus to be main subject, so get closer give it a funky perspective making it look huge or something, everything in the middle just comes across to me like one of those psyciatrists blotch drawings.so it is those things (i think the black and white was a good choice) that go to make this image boring .. FOR ME .. my opinion, thats all, if you like it, then that is great as it''s like they say no one likes great artists works until their dead, and theres not much great about that.I explained to your friend why my response was so short. I had spent all day voting on images, and commenting on most all of them. I then started getting the same ones again, for no reason, yours was the third repeat i got, and so i got frustrated sorry, but i just summed it up quick.', '2003-01-15 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(191829, 10712, 205, '<td valign="top">colors are a bit too unrealistic for me.</td>', 'colors are a bit too unrealistic for me.', '2003-01-15 11:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(191830, 10877, 1041, '<td valign="top">doesn''t really fit my interpretation of landscape (i''d like to see more nature than buildings, doesn''t have to be exclusively nature), but i can see where you are going with this so i won''t deduct too many points.  i like the colors, especially the three yellow cabs on the left together.  overall, i think the picture could be just a tad sharper though.</td>', 'doesn''t really fit my interpretation of landscape (i''d like to see more nature than buildings, doesn''t have to be exclusively nature), but i can see where you are going with this so i won''t deduct too many points.  i like the colors, especially the three yellow cabs on the left together.  overall, i think the picture could be just a tad sharper though.', '2003-01-15 11:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(191832, 10936, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i love the color of the water, and the people in various actions (jumping kid, etc.) on the beach.  the bay has a nice curve to it that leads the eye through the photo nicely.  to me, the least interesting part is the sky (except maybe for that little blue bit at the top).  even though you''d then loose the blue bit, i think i would consider cropping this more into a panorama format, crop quite a bit of the sky off and maybe just a little bit off the bottom, too, to enhance the panorama format more.</td>', 'challenge met.  i love the color of the water, and the people in various actions (jumping kid, etc.) on the beach.  the bay has a nice curve to it that leads the eye through the photo nicely.  to me, the least interesting part is the sky (except maybe for that little blue bit at the top).  even though you''d then loose the blue bit, i think i would consider cropping this more into a panorama format, crop quite a bit of the sky off and maybe just a little bit off the bottom, too, to enhance the panorama format more.', '2003-01-15 11:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(191833, 10905, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met wonderfully.  i like the hints of color in the sky from the sunrise, and the fog over the land gives everything a somewhat mystical feel.  the composition is really nice, too, with the tree in the front clearly being the main subject and framing the tree in the bottom left and the landscape.  the black frame also works well.  nothing i would change.  high marks :)</td>', 'challenge met wonderfully.  i like the hints of color in the sky from the sunrise, and the fog over the land gives everything a somewhat mystical feel.  the composition is really nice, too, with the tree in the front clearly being the main subject and framing the tree in the bottom left and the landscape.  the black frame also works well.  nothing i would change.  high marks :)', '2003-01-15 12:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(191836, 10832, 1041, '<td valign="top">not quite what i was looking for in the landscape challenge (my interpretation is more along the lines of more nature than buildings) but i can see where you are going with this so i won''t deduct much for it.  for a cityscape photo, i think yours is very well done. it''s sharp throughout and the taller buildings at the left and right frame the photo nicely.  i especially like the starburst on the one light in the middle.  did you use a filter or simply a very small aperture?  the rame also works really nice.  good work!  :)</td>', 'not quite what i was looking for in the landscape challenge (my interpretation is more along the lines of more nature than buildings) but i can see where you are going with this so i won''t deduct much for it.  for a cityscape photo, i think yours is very well done. it''s sharp throughout and the taller buildings at the left and right frame the photo nicely.  i especially like the starburst on the one light in the middle.  did you use a filter or simply a very small aperture?  the rame also works really nice.  good work!  :)', '2003-01-15 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(191838, 10745, 3447, '<td valign="top">With enough pixels you might try cropping approximately 40% off the bottom.  This would give you a more classic landscape photograph.</td>', 'With enough pixels you might try cropping approximately 40% off the bottom.  This would give you a more classic landscape photograph.', '2003-01-15 12:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(191841, 11036, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i like how the "river" curves through the photo, the trees behind it almost draw a line and all this meets up at the big green tree where the river is no longer visible.  makes it very easy on the eye to wander around the shot and then find a place to rest.  i think you also did well eliminating much of the sky since it''s pretty bland.  good job :)</td>', 'challenge met.  i like how the "river" curves through the photo, the trees behind it almost draw a line and all this meets up at the big green tree where the river is no longer visible.  makes it very easy on the eye to wander around the shot and then find a place to rest.  i think you also did well eliminating much of the sky since it''s pretty bland.  good job :)', '2003-01-15 12:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(191842, 10846, 3447, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cold winter afternoon.  Try cropping foreground a bit, and hit color saturation button if your program allows.</td>', 'Looks like a cold winter afternoon.  Try cropping foreground a bit, and hit color saturation button if your program allows.', '2003-01-15 12:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(191844, 10869, 1041, '<td valign="top">hehe, i think you''d get a kick out of seeing me a sec ago.  i kept moving my head in front of the monitor, trying to peer into the shadows on the left.  i think they are just a bit too dark for my liking.  i do like the rest of the shot, and it definitely meets the challenge.  i like how the river curves through the photo and that, despite it being winter, there''s still some green in the shot.  although i have to admit that i maybe wouldn''t have noticed that the river is frozen if it wasn''t in your title.  lastly, does the image need a tiny bit of rotating clockwise?  it seems to me that the water isn''t quite level, although i''m not 100% sure.</td>', 'hehe, i think you''d get a kick out of seeing me a sec ago.  i kept moving my head in front of the monitor, trying to peer into the shadows on the left.  i think they are just a bit too dark for my liking.  i do like the rest of the shot, and it definitely meets the challenge.  i like how the river curves through the photo and that, despite it being winter, there''s still some green in the shot.  although i have to admit that i maybe wouldn''t have noticed that the river is frozen if it wasn''t in your title.  lastly, does the image need a tiny bit of rotating clockwise?  it seems to me that the water isn''t quite level, although i''m not 100% sure.', '2003-01-15 12:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(191845, 10851, 3447, '<td valign="top">Try cropping bottom to elimanate plants at lower right.  Nice that fence leads the eye to the windmill.</td>', 'Try cropping bottom to elimanate plants at lower right.  Nice that fence leads the eye to the windmill.', '2003-01-15 12:11:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(191846, 10859, 4536, '<td valign="top">Cool night shot. The horizon is tilted and there seems to be a bit too much space up top, I would crop in a inch or two. Maybe crop a bit off the bottom to get rid of the distracting white paper looking thing.</td>', 'Cool night shot. The horizon is tilted and there seems to be a bit too much space up top, I would crop in a inch or two. Maybe crop a bit off the bottom to get rid of the distracting white paper looking thing.', '2003-01-15 12:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(191847, 10778, 5753, '<td valign="top">Are these the magical kind?  Great shot, but too little landscape I''m afraid. 5</td>', 'Are these the magical kind?  Great shot, but too little landscape I''m afraid. 5', '2003-01-15 12:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(191849, 11042, 4536, '<td valign="top">I can see what attracted you to take this shot, but was totally disappointed when the power lines started to come into view, they are usually a big no no when shooting landscapes. I liked the pastel look to the photo and the old building.</td>', 'I can see what attracted you to take this shot, but was totally disappointed when the power lines started to come into view, they are usually a big no no when shooting landscapes. I liked the pastel look to the photo and the old building.', '2003-01-15 12:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(191850, 10937, 3724, '<td valign="top">You have choosen a very good vantage point from which to take this picture.  I have been on lanes like this, and have several views like it in my area.     I believe your lower camera placement is the key to the success of this picture.  I enjoy this shot.</td>', 'You have choosen a very good vantage point from which to take this picture.  I have been on lanes like this, and have several views like it in my area.     I believe your lower camera placement is the key to the success of this picture.  I enjoy this shot.', '2003-01-15 12:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(191852, 10792, 3447, '<td valign="top">Good crisp capture of the decorative ironwork on this very nice bridge.</td>', 'Good crisp capture of the decorative ironwork on this very nice bridge.', '2003-01-15 12:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(191853, 10882, 5753, '<td valign="top">Small picture gives poor resolution.  Great composition, but hides what the surrounding "landscape" has to offer.  Would have been great to catch the "light" of the lighthouse, wouldn''t it?</td>', 'Small picture gives poor resolution.  Great composition, but hides what the surrounding "landscape" has to offer.  Would have been great to catch the "light" of the lighthouse, wouldn''t it?', '2003-01-15 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(191855, 10912, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very busy scene, hard to compose with so many elements, but pulled off rather well. There are lots of places to keep your eye moving, perhaps it would be nice with a main center of interest, some place for your eye to stop. Using a longer shutter speed and blurring the vehicles a bit could add to the scene... Not technically a landscape in the traditional sense, but I don''t mind giving creative leeway...</td>', 'Very busy scene, hard to compose with so many elements, but pulled off rather well. There are lots of places to keep your eye moving, perhaps it would be nice with a main center of interest, some place for your eye to stop. Using a longer shutter speed and blurring the vehicles a bit could add to the scene... Not technically a landscape in the traditional sense, but I don''t mind giving creative leeway...', '2003-01-15 12:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(191856, 10731, 5753, '<td valign="top">Great compo, but a little dark...</td>', 'Great compo, but a little dark...', '2003-01-15 12:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
