(191920, 10971, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it how the fence leads my eye trough the photo. Nice composition &amp; crop. Good exposure given all that snow.</td>', 'I like it how the fence leads my eye trough the photo. Nice composition & crop. Good exposure given all that snow.', '2003-01-15 13:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
