(191925, 10893, 3032, '<td valign="top">The human element and the golden touch of the sun on the grass in the foreground, combined with the yellow and purplegrey of the clouds and the reflection in the water makes this a classic beauty. I don''t know if they posed for this, but it is a good one. :)<br/>I don''t think that the white of the border was the right choice, but I don''t look at frames anyway so that doesn''t affect the score.<br/></td>', 'The human element and the golden touch of the sun on the grass in the foreground, combined with the yellow and purplegrey of the clouds and the reflection in the water makes this a classic beauty. I don''t know if they posed for this, but it is a good one. :)I don''t think that the white of the border was the right choice, but I don''t look at frames anyway so that doesn''t affect the score.', '2003-01-15 13:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(191926, 10794, 3447, '<td valign="top">You chose your front yard very well.  The rainbow is a bonus.  Nice afternoon light.</td>', 'You chose your front yard very well.  The rainbow is a bonus.  Nice afternoon light.', '2003-01-15 13:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(191929, 10788, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky with silky smooth water and a great reflection on the rock. Wow.<br/>Nice horizon, I think that I like it with and without the boat.<br/>Was this the result of toning or did you use a filter or is this just a great place for a photograper to be at the right time of day?<br/>Colors blow me away!</td>', 'Wonderful sky with silky smooth water and a great reflection on the rock. Wow.Nice horizon, I think that I like it with and without the boat.Was this the result of toning or did you use a filter or is this just a great place for a photograper to be at the right time of day?Colors blow me away!', '2003-01-15 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(191930, 10784, 3447, '<td valign="top">Magnificent sunset.  Wish the vertical obstruction could have been left out.</td>', 'Magnificent sunset.  Wish the vertical obstruction could have been left out.', '2003-01-15 13:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(191931, 10770, 3032, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the beach/water is beatiful and the lines in the foreground lead you right into it. The construction at the right adds another interesting element. It tells me something about the place, it creates perspective, a reference for size and the poles create a nice texture.<br/>The bright spot in the middle  is less attractive, but still a great photo.</td>', 'The reflection on the beach/water is beatiful and the lines in the foreground lead you right into it. The construction at the right adds another interesting element. It tells me something about the place, it creates perspective, a reference for size and the poles create a nice texture.The bright spot in the middle  is less attractive, but still a great photo.', '2003-01-15 13:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191932, 11025, 3447, '<td valign="top">If this is the view from your dwelling place you can be very happy with it.  Good early morning photograph.</td>', 'If this is the view from your dwelling place you can be very happy with it.  Good early morning photograph.', '2003-01-15 13:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(191933, 10737, 3447, '<td valign="top">OK, it''s a landscape.  Remarkably sharp photograph of the moon.</td>', 'OK, it''s a landscape.  Remarkably sharp photograph of the moon.', '2003-01-15 13:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(191934, 10981, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mixture of colors, curves, tones.<br/>The people that live there live in a beautiful landscape.<br/> <br/>The curve in the foreground is a nice frame for what comes beyond it and is a reference for the depth of this. The fence is the only minor distraction.<br/></td>', 'Wonderful mixture of colors, curves, tones.The people that live there live in a beautiful landscape. The curve in the foreground is a nice frame for what comes beyond it and is a reference for the depth of this. The fence is the only minor distraction.', '2003-01-15 13:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(191935, 10852, 2792, '<td valign="top">AMAZING!!!</td>', 'AMAZING!!!', '2003-01-15 13:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(191936, 10975, 3447, '<td valign="top">Would be rewarding to see those handsome barns more clearly.  Sharp focus on thorns.</td>', 'Would be rewarding to see those handsome barns more clearly.  Sharp focus on thorns.', '2003-01-15 13:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(191937, 11007, 3032, '<td valign="top">I never liked infrared photography, but this is really nice. Very sharp, almost unreal. It makes me think of the scenery of my old model-railway. :)</td>', 'I never liked infrared photography, but this is really nice. Very sharp, almost unreal. It makes me think of the scenery of my old model-railway. :)', '2003-01-15 13:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(191939, 10905, 3032, '<td valign="top">I love the compostion of this and the light is wonderful. Beatiful scene, well captured. I guess it must have been some work, seems like a remote place and light like that is something you only get at sunrise and at sunset. :)<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'I love the compostion of this and the light is wonderful. Beatiful scene, well captured. I guess it must have been some work, seems like a remote place and light like that is something you only get at sunrise and at sunset. :) Well done!', '2003-01-15 13:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(191941, 10929, 3080, '<td valign="top">I bet this is extra impressive in summer and fall.  It''s a very lovely view. I''m glad that the house isn''t in the fog too.  I think it''s good how the cliff is in shadow, it kind of creates a balance with the white fog.  The fog mutes the colors, but I like it that way.  Lovely angle and framing/cropping.  I think I have seen photos of this before, but there seemed to be extra brush or something in the forgroud.  Anyway, nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I bet this is extra impressive in summer and fall.  It''s a very lovely view. I''m glad that the house isn''t in the fog too.  I think it''s good how the cliff is in shadow, it kind of creates a balance with the white fog.  The fog mutes the colors, but I like it that way.  Lovely angle and framing/cropping.  I think I have seen photos of this before, but there seemed to be extra brush or something in the forgroud.  Anyway, nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 13:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(191942, 10769, 3032, '<td valign="top">Classic city silhouette. Nice.</td>', 'Classic city silhouette. Nice.', '2003-01-15 13:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(191943, 11038, 3080, '<td valign="top">That is such a beautiful bridge that I wish we could see more of it.  Understand why you didn''t though.  Suposed to be landscape, not bridge.  So that was a good choice.  I''m drawn to the red coat(?). Seems like my brain wants to know exactly what it is.  Suspect it''s a person, but want to know for sure, you know?  I think the colors are good.  As good as they can be in winter anyway.  Focus seems good, and the angle and framing/cropping is ok.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That is such a beautiful bridge that I wish we could see more of it.  Understand why you didn''t though.  Suposed to be landscape, not bridge.  So that was a good choice.  I''m drawn to the red coat(?). Seems like my brain wants to know exactly what it is.  Suspect it''s a person, but want to know for sure, you know?  I think the colors are good.  As good as they can be in winter anyway.  Focus seems good, and the angle and framing/cropping is ok.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-15 13:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(191944, 10725, 3447, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph a lot.  Reminds me of our time living in France.  Interestingly composed, with good colors.</td>', 'I like this photograph a lot.  Reminds me of our time living in France.  Interestingly composed, with good colors.', '2003-01-15 13:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
