(192052, 10898, 4536, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the inclusion of the tree and the lights. The horizon is tilted a bit. I am wondering if a different angle, stepping a little to your right would have improved the composition to see more of the lights, off center the tree and not include a lot of wasted space on the right. Still a good photo.</td>', 'Very nice, love the inclusion of the tree and the lights. The horizon is tilted a bit. I am wondering if a different angle, stepping a little to your right would have improved the composition to see more of the lights, off center the tree and not include a lot of wasted space on the right. Still a good photo.', '2003-01-15 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
