(192131, 10755, 4514, '<td valign="top">And just off to the right you have a scenic view of Dubois park.  Intresting thing here is this lighthouse was owned by Johnson and Johnson.  This is a wonderful inlet.  The beaches are wonderful there.  Miss it alot but will be moving back to Stuart any day now.  You took this from the bridge on US1.  I think they have a fish walk under the bridge.  Might have provided for a better picture.  Nice shot.<br/> <br/>TurboTech</td>', 'And just off to the right you have a scenic view of Dubois park.  Intresting thing here is this lighthouse was owned by Johnson and Johnson.  This is a wonderful inlet.  The beaches are wonderful there.  Miss it alot but will be moving back to Stuart any day now.  You took this from the bridge on US1.  I think they have a fish walk under the bridge.  Might have provided for a better picture.  Nice shot. TurboTech', '2003-01-15 17:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
