(192178, 10863, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very good composition witht the three in the lower left and the sun in the middle right corner. Beautiful subject, wonderful colors.</td>', 'Very good composition witht the three in the lower left and the sun in the middle right corner. Beautiful subject, wonderful colors.', '2003-01-15 17:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(192179, 11026, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great colour and interesting tank.9</td>', 'Great colour and interesting tank.9', '2003-01-15 17:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(192180, 10874, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice composistion. Creative and good job on the light.<br/>Would have cropped the upper 1/5th part of tough.</td>', 'Nice composistion. Creative and good job on the light.Would have cropped the upper 1/5th part of tough.', '2003-01-15 17:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(192181, 10814, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the compostion, but probably because of the time of year the rest of the frame lacks really interesting bits. Good exposure.</td>', 'I like the compostion, but probably because of the time of year the rest of the frame lacks really interesting bits. Good exposure.', '2003-01-15 17:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(192183, 10908, 5158, '<td valign="top">I really like your picture: I have the feeling I look at a special moment when the clouds that are below just open up for a short time, revealing the mountain. What I like too is that on the left the mountain is iluminated by some warm light in the otherwise cold, icy landscape. The thin line of the frame could have a better color though. Still one of the best landscapes of this very good challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'I really like your picture: I have the feeling I look at a special moment when the clouds that are below just open up for a short time, revealing the mountain. What I like too is that on the left the mountain is iluminated by some warm light in the otherwise cold, icy landscape. The thin line of the frame could have a better color though. Still one of the best landscapes of this very good challenge. Good luck!', '2003-01-15 17:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(192184, 10827, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice how all the lines work in this image. Good job on the still very bright sun, beautiful sky an interesting reflection.</td>', 'Nice how all the lines work in this image. Good job on the still very bright sun, beautiful sky an interesting reflection.', '2003-01-15 17:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(192186, 10769, 5158, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call cityscape: the view is awesome. The buildings are arranged like the trees of a small forest or it looks like a small hill. Cropping is a little tight, but I guess that the effect mentioned above would otherwise be disturbed by bulidings on the left or right. I have a little problem with the color though. Too brown/orange to me. This is probably the result of the sunset, but because it''s not obvious to the viewer, it feels somewhat un-natural. Still a great cityscape and the best example that cityscapes fit the challenge.</td>', 'Now that''s what I call cityscape: the view is awesome. The buildings are arranged like the trees of a small forest or it looks like a small hill. Cropping is a little tight, but I guess that the effect mentioned above would otherwise be disturbed by bulidings on the left or right. I have a little problem with the color though. Too brown/orange to me. This is probably the result of the sunset, but because it''s not obvious to the viewer, it feels somewhat un-natural. Still a great cityscape and the best example that cityscapes fit the challenge.', '2003-01-15 18:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(192189, 10884, 1664, '<td valign="top">I like this great outdoor shot.</td>', 'I like this great outdoor shot.', '2003-01-15 18:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(192190, 11024, 5158, '<td valign="top">the picture has some very interesting parts: the mountain range in the back, the mountain at the right with the low clouds and the nicely structured clouds of the sky. However the woods in the front (also the treetop to the left) attract the viewers eyes first and because they are not so interesting, the viewer has to search for what he should look at. Also it could be darker. Then some nice orange colors of the sky would get visible  (I have a laptop on which I simply tilt the screen to see how brightness variation alter the apperence of an image).</td>', 'the picture has some very interesting parts: the mountain range in the back, the mountain at the right with the low clouds and the nicely structured clouds of the sky. However the woods in the front (also the treetop to the left) attract the viewers eyes first and because they are not so interesting, the viewer has to search for what he should look at. Also it could be darker. Then some nice orange colors of the sky would get visible  (I have a laptop on which I simply tilt the screen to see how brightness variation alter the apperence of an image).', '2003-01-15 18:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(192191, 10837, 1664, '<td valign="top">Great  shot.</td>', 'Great  shot.', '2003-01-15 18:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(192192, 11028, 1664, '<td valign="top">It could have been  divided into upper and lower halves and make two good pictures.</td>', 'It could have been  divided into upper and lower halves and make two good pictures.', '2003-01-15 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192193, 10958, 1664, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2003-01-15 18:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(192194, 11020, 5158, '<td valign="top">The mountain with the clouds are realy great and are an eye catcher. However, they are too bright to be able to see any details and the various things in front of them (bush, tree, the powerline and the hills) attract the viewers attention, although they shouldn''t. It''s a little soft too. Still a great piece of nature you captured.</td>', 'The mountain with the clouds are realy great and are an eye catcher. However, they are too bright to be able to see any details and the various things in front of them (bush, tree, the powerline and the hills) attract the viewers attention, although they shouldn''t. It''s a little soft too. Still a great piece of nature you captured.', '2003-01-15 18:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(192195, 10856, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like pictures taken into the sun (I submitted one of this type too), especially in winter. The peace of land you have chosen is also very good: the empty, frosty field, the leaf-less trees in the back. However, it''s too overexposed and the lens flare is not interesting enough to not beeing cropped away. You might have moved closer to the trees, so that the sun passes through them.</td>', 'I like pictures taken into the sun (I submitted one of this type too), especially in winter. The peace of land you have chosen is also very good: the empty, frosty field, the leaf-less trees in the back. However, it''s too overexposed and the lens flare is not interesting enough to not beeing cropped away. You might have moved closer to the trees, so that the sun passes through them.', '2003-01-15 18:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(192200, 10811, 5158, '<td valign="top">Now this is a great picture regarding the subject (haven''t seen boots alligned that was before), the color (boats and sky) and the angle of view (you might have cropped it tighter on the right though). However, the picture comes short in my opinion regarding the challenge topic: therefor you were too close to the boats and the open-feeling is missing.</td>', 'Now this is a great picture regarding the subject (haven''t seen boots alligned that was before), the color (boats and sky) and the angle of view (you might have cropped it tighter on the right though). However, the picture comes short in my opinion regarding the challenge topic: therefor you were too close to the boats and the open-feeling is missing.', '2003-01-15 18:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(192201, 10786, 5158, '<td valign="top">While the picture for sure shows a peace of nature, it would better fit to the texture challenge. When I look at the picture my eyes tend to follow the branches in all direction. That''s somehow nice (although it makes it hard to look at for a longer time)! Color choice is good, could be less blurry, but my major concern is that it does not fit the challenge topic in my opinion.</td>', 'While the picture for sure shows a peace of nature, it would better fit to the texture challenge. When I look at the picture my eyes tend to follow the branches in all direction. That''s somehow nice (although it makes it hard to look at for a longer time)! Color choice is good, could be less blurry, but my major concern is that it does not fit the challenge topic in my opinion.', '2003-01-15 18:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(192202, 10753, 5158, '<td valign="top">The brige is great and the angle you have chosen is also great. The house in the front dsturbes a little, it catches the viewers attention although it shouldn''t. Choise of color and technicaly alos good.<br/>However, to make me rate it higher, it should better fit the challenge: it''s too close to the bridge, which dominates the picture. Too me landscape pictures have to give the feeling of space, openess and details (like the bridge) have to stand back. But that''s just me.</td>', 'The brige is great and the angle you have chosen is also great. The house in the front dsturbes a little, it catches the viewers attention although it shouldn''t. Choise of color and technicaly alos good.However, to make me rate it higher, it should better fit the challenge: it''s too close to the bridge, which dominates the picture. Too me landscape pictures have to give the feeling of space, openess and details (like the bridge) have to stand back. But that''s just me.', '2003-01-15 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(192203, 10966, 4411, '<td valign="top">OMG. That is absolutely beautiful. Probably the first shot (and there have been many good ones) that has made me sit back gawping at the sheer beauty. The layered effect is great. The only complaint I could possibly have is that the lower left corner is a bit plain. Brilliant. Well done.</td>', 'OMG. That is absolutely beautiful. Probably the first shot (and there have been many good ones) that has made me sit back gawping at the sheer beauty. The layered effect is great. The only complaint I could possibly have is that the lower left corner is a bit plain. Brilliant. Well done.', '2003-01-15 18:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(192204, 11007, 1005, '<td valign="top">OMG!  This is incredible!  (Are you sure this isn''t film?  I am joking, but the clarity and detail have the quality of film work, so I am not accusing you of cheating, just terribly great photography!)  The dramatic sky is great, but it''s those houses that really stand out (or should I say mansions!).  The field in fron doesn''t do anything for me, but I think I see why it''s there, to add to the feeling of distance, right?  No matter, I''m scoring this as a 10 due to it''s extreme drama!  10 Swash</td>', 'OMG!  This is incredible!  (Are you sure this isn''t film?  I am joking, but the clarity and detail have the quality of film work, so I am not accusing you of cheating, just terribly great photography!)  The dramatic sky is great, but it''s those houses that really stand out (or should I say mansions!).  The field in fron doesn''t do anything for me, but I think I see why it''s there, to add to the feeling of distance, right?  No matter, I''m scoring this as a 10 due to it''s extreme drama!  10 Swash', '2003-01-15 18:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192205, 10855, 5158, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a keeper and for the livingrooms wall! I like what I see although I have no detailed idea what I look at and were exactly it is. But it does not matter!<br/>The cloud (water, fog, dust?) in the back is just awesome, the piece of dark sky frames it and gives structure. The structure of the sand (beach, water?!)  is just in the right way: in the front it gives an interesting texture and in the back it gives the basis on which the more important clouds settle. And the branch in the front is wonderfull: it catches the eye but does not take over. For me a winner, lets see what the other think. Good luck.</td>', 'Now that''s a keeper and for the livingrooms wall! I like what I see although I have no detailed idea what I look at and were exactly it is. But it does not matter!The cloud (water, fog, dust?) in the back is just awesome, the piece of dark sky frames it and gives structure. The structure of the sand (beach, water?!)  is just in the right way: in the front it gives an interesting texture and in the back it gives the basis on which the more important clouds settle. And the branch in the front is wonderfull: it catches the eye but does not take over. For me a winner, lets see what the other think. Good luck.', '2003-01-15 18:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(192206, 10948, 4852, '<td valign="top">This is awesome, near perfect.Has a Maxfield Parish look to it.  I give it my first and only    10</td>', 'This is awesome, near perfect.Has a Maxfield Parish look to it.  I give it my first and only    10', '2003-01-15 18:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(192207, 10827, 5158, '<td valign="top">You are a lucky guy/girl to have been at that place at that particular moment. And we are lucky that you share this moment with us. As a cloud-, mountain-, sea- and shot-against-the-sun lover this picture has it all (the sun might be a little too bright though). Colors are great and natural, it''s sharp and well composed.<br/>One of the very best submissions in this challenge. Good luck to you.</td>', 'You are a lucky guy/girl to have been at that place at that particular moment. And we are lucky that you share this moment with us. As a cloud-, mountain-, sea- and shot-against-the-sun lover this picture has it all (the sun might be a little too bright though). Colors are great and natural, it''s sharp and well composed.One of the very best submissions in this challenge. Good luck to you.', '2003-01-15 18:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(192208, 10746, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You are either very lucky to live in Hawaii (envy!!) or have great timing for a vacation (still envy!!!).  Great shot, love the clouds hanging on the mountain top.  Very dramatic scene.  The blue ocean and red land outcropping just add to the variety of color in the very beautiful, colorful shot.  Great detail!!!  10 Swash</td>', 'Wow!  You are either very lucky to live in Hawaii (envy!!) or have great timing for a vacation (still envy!!!).  Great shot, love the clouds hanging on the mountain top.  Very dramatic scene.  The blue ocean and red land outcropping just add to the variety of color in the very beautiful, colorful shot.  Great detail!!!  10 Swash', '2003-01-15 19:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(192214, 10864, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!  Did you use any special effects/filters?  I really like the color in this shot.  Is that a town down in the valley?  The hot spots on the right middle are a little distracting, but it wouldn''t have turned out as stunning w/o them (I think).  How about a 9?  Swash</td>', 'This is wonderful!  Did you use any special effects/filters?  I really like the color in this shot.  Is that a town down in the valley?  The hot spots on the right middle are a little distracting, but it wouldn''t have turned out as stunning w/o them (I think).  How about a 9?  Swash', '2003-01-15 19:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(192216, 11026, 888, '<td valign="top">very nice contrasting colours</td>', 'very nice contrasting colours', '2003-01-15 19:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192221, 10815, 4536, '<td valign="top">Is that a baby deer in the grass? I like this, wish the sky weren''t so blown out, maybe crop it out.</td>', 'Is that a baby deer in the grass? I like this, wish the sky weren''t so blown out, maybe crop it out.', '2003-01-15 19:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(192223, 10869, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but I gotta ask about the title:  frozen?  It looks pretty warm, were you referring to it as in frozen in time?  No matter, it''s a fine picture, nice colors, I like the branch hanging in the foreground.  Sun on the river might have made this a tad more appealing, IMHO.  (stronger reflections on the water, mostly)  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice pic, but I gotta ask about the title:  frozen?  It looks pretty warm, were you referring to it as in frozen in time?  No matter, it''s a fine picture, nice colors, I like the branch hanging in the foreground.  Sun on the river might have made this a tad more appealing, IMHO.  (stronger reflections on the water, mostly)  7 Swash', '2003-01-15 19:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192224, 10903, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the grass in the foreground, nice touch.  The roof top takes a tiny bit of the wilderness feel away, but on the unavoidable side.  Was a wider view possible?  (just an idea)  7 Swash  (I should joke with you about using a haze filter to remove the haze..... I hope you know I am joking!)</td>', 'I like the grass in the foreground, nice touch.  The roof top takes a tiny bit of the wilderness feel away, but on the unavoidable side.  Was a wider view possible?  (just an idea)  7 Swash  (I should joke with you about using a haze filter to remove the haze..... I hope you know I am joking!)', '2003-01-15 19:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(192226, 10832, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely city-scape shot, very well executed.  I won''t take away points for this not being a mountainous yada yada yada, but others might....The flag in the upper right corner is a nice touch.  7 Swash</td>', 'It''s a lovely city-scape shot, very well executed.  I won''t take away points for this not being a mountainous yada yada yada, but others might....The flag in the upper right corner is a nice touch.  7 Swash', '2003-01-15 19:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192229, 10975, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. I love foreground stuff and these prickly guys are wonderful, but by focussing on them, IMO you make this a picture of them, with the background being just that.  (takes away from the landscape idea a bit)  I love this shot, so I''m going to "ding" you two points, that''s all.  8 Swash</td>', 'O.K. I love foreground stuff and these prickly guys are wonderful, but by focussing on them, IMO you make this a picture of them, with the background being just that.  (takes away from the landscape idea a bit)  I love this shot, so I''m going to "ding" you two points, that''s all.  8 Swash', '2003-01-15 19:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192233, 10788, 1005, '<td valign="top">Glorious shot, nice inclusion of the ferry!  Is this near Magnolia?  I just can''t quite place it.  Damn nice, don''t tell anyone this was in Washington!  Remember, it rains here EVERY day!  (Don''t change our story!)  10 Swash</td>', 'Glorious shot, nice inclusion of the ferry!  Is this near Magnolia?  I just can''t quite place it.  Damn nice, don''t tell anyone this was in Washington!  Remember, it rains here EVERY day!  (Don''t change our story!)  10 Swash', '2003-01-15 19:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(192237, 10929, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Reminds me of the Columbia River Gorge area.  The building on top of the near outcropping looks very cool.  Did you use a haze filter?  If not, it might have helped, but I haven''t had great luck in that area.  Easy 9!  Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  Reminds me of the Columbia River Gorge area.  The building on top of the near outcropping looks very cool.  Did you use a haze filter?  If not, it might have helped, but I haven''t had great luck in that area.  Easy 9!  Swash', '2003-01-15 19:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(192239, 10815, 4585, '<td valign="top">This would have been so difficult for me to get the right exposure...but you made it look easy.  Great composition!  Good luck!</td>', 'This would have been so difficult for me to get the right exposure...but you made it look easy.  Great composition!  Good luck!', '2003-01-15 19:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(192241, 10995, 5508, '<td valign="top">That thing in the water is a bit distracting. Great shaot though. 8</td>', 'That thing in the water is a bit distracting. Great shaot though. 8', '2003-01-15 19:54:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(192242, 10847, 5508, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what that thing on the ground is but its a beautiful shot. 8</td>', 'I don''t know what that thing on the ground is but its a beautiful shot. 8', '2003-01-15 19:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(192244, 10862, 4585, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!  IMHO...I would have cropped a bit of the sky out and tighted up the right side to exclude the yellow road markings.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful image!  IMHO...I would have cropped a bit of the sky out and tighted up the right side to exclude the yellow road markings.  Good luck!', '2003-01-15 19:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192245, 10778, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very bizarre fungus!  Neat macro, it does simulate a landscape, but the wall/window in the background with the water droplets gives it away.  Very brave to submit for this challenge, I''m glad you did, but don''t let a low score get you too down.  I''m going with 7 as a good simulated landscape.  O.K?  Swash</td>', 'Very bizarre fungus!  Neat macro, it does simulate a landscape, but the wall/window in the background with the water droplets gives it away.  Very brave to submit for this challenge, I''m glad you did, but don''t let a low score get you too down.  I''m going with 7 as a good simulated landscape.  O.K?  Swash', '2003-01-15 19:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(192246, 10827, 5508, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Interesting what''s happening with the water. Alska seems nice.</td>', 'Very nice. Interesting what''s happening with the water. Alska seems nice.', '2003-01-15 19:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(192247, 10808, 5508, '<td valign="top">The is a very unique and interesting shot. Love the focusing.</td>', 'The is a very unique and interesting shot. Love the focusing.', '2003-01-15 19:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(192249, 10981, 5508, '<td valign="top">where is this? Your lucky.</td>', 'where is this? Your lucky.', '2003-01-15 19:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192250, 10710, 4585, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this a bit higher than lower...IMHO.  Excellent lines leading to the top of the image...not to mention the beauty of the subject.  Good luck!</td>', 'I would have cropped this a bit higher than lower...IMHO.  Excellent lines leading to the top of the image...not to mention the beauty of the subject.  Good luck!', '2003-01-15 19:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(192251, 10893, 5508, '<td valign="top">Strangers in the night.........8</td>', 'Strangers in the night.........8', '2003-01-15 19:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(192252, 10814, 5508, '<td valign="top">I wish that big shadow was''nt there. Good shot though.</td>', 'I wish that big shadow was''nt there. Good shot though.', '2003-01-15 20:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(192253, 11033, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, nasty clear cut in the background.  Was there a possibility to take this from the other side of the tracks?  W/O the clear cut, this is really nice, with it, a couple notches less..... 7 Swash</td>', 'Very nice picture, nasty clear cut in the background.  Was there a possibility to take this from the other side of the tracks?  W/O the clear cut, this is really nice, with it, a couple notches less..... 7 Swash', '2003-01-15 20:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(192254, 10852, 5508, '<td valign="top">Great moon shot. Focusing is awsome.</td>', 'Great moon shot. Focusing is awsome.', '2003-01-15 20:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(192255, 10895, 5508, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice. Good job.', '2003-01-15 20:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(192256, 11017, 5508, '<td valign="top">Grainy. Everything else is great.</td>', 'Grainy. Everything else is great.', '2003-01-15 20:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(192257, 10978, 5508, '<td valign="top">to bad the mountain was''nt higher in the picture......damn.</td>', 'to bad the mountain was''nt higher in the picture......damn.', '2003-01-15 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(192258, 10835, 1005, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous picture!  (Personal note:  this is the second great Washington shot with NO clouds!  You''re attracting people!! Remember, it rains here EVERY day!!!)  I got nothing bad to say about this, just great shot.  9 Swash<br/>oh yes, I really like how the sun rays came out in this one, very nice touch!</td>', 'Gorgeous picture!  (Personal note:  this is the second great Washington shot with NO clouds!  You''re attracting people!! Remember, it rains here EVERY day!!!)  I got nothing bad to say about this, just great shot.  9 Swashoh yes, I really like how the sun rays came out in this one, very nice touch!', '2003-01-15 20:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192259, 10904, 5508, '<td valign="top">I can see Gandalf now......</td>', 'I can see Gandalf now......', '2003-01-15 20:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192261, 10827, 3751, '<td valign="top">I really like it, the only thing that got me wondering is the line bethween the land and the water, it looks fake, the clouds reflection doesn''t look natural.(9)</td>', 'I really like it, the only thing that got me wondering is the line bethween the land and the water, it looks fake, the clouds reflection doesn''t look natural.(9)', '2003-01-15 20:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(192262, 10940, 4585, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors!  The simplicity of this image makes it great!  Good luck!<br/></td>', 'Wonderful colors!  The simplicity of this image makes it great!  Good luck!', '2003-01-15 20:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(192265, 10948, 1005, '<td valign="top">Bizarre coloration, but cool!  The clouds came out a little grainy and the tree in the foreground looks to be over sharpened, but the overall effect is just a little too cool to berate it too much.  (Special filter?)  Very, very cool!  9 Swash (I just had to take away a point for the above issues, sorry)</td>', 'Bizarre coloration, but cool!  The clouds came out a little grainy and the tree in the foreground looks to be over sharpened, but the overall effect is just a little too cool to berate it too much.  (Special filter?)  Very, very cool!  9 Swash (I just had to take away a point for the above issues, sorry)', '2003-01-15 20:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(192266, 10994, 5508, '<td valign="top">Interesting......well done.</td>', 'Interesting......well done.', '2003-01-15 20:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192267, 11040, 3751, '<td valign="top">it may have been better if you had taken it in the early morning or late afternoon. (give more life to it)</td>', 'it may have been better if you had taken it in the early morning or late afternoon. (give more life to it)', '2003-01-15 20:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(192268, 10892, 5508, '<td valign="top">Good macro work.</td>', 'Good macro work.', '2003-01-15 20:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(192269, 10821, 5508, '<td valign="top">That''s a beautiful sun. What is that in the back......... a pyramid?</td>', 'That''s a beautiful sun. What is that in the back......... a pyramid?', '2003-01-15 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(192270, 10849, 5508, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Is you lens softened?</td>', 'Very nice. Is you lens softened?', '2003-01-15 20:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(192271, 11043, 1647, '<td valign="top">The colours of the sky against the silohuette works very well.  Focus and composition is very good - quite a nice photo, worthy of printing.  Well done.  As a suggestion, you could try cropping the right edge to include the power pole, although I would try to keep a landscape perspective to the image.</td>', 'The colours of the sky against the silohuette works very well.  Focus and composition is very good - quite a nice photo, worthy of printing.  Well done.  As a suggestion, you could try cropping the right edge to include the power pole, although I would try to keep a landscape perspective to the image.', '2003-01-15 20:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(192272, 10731, 5508, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious....I wish there was a tad bit more light.</td>', 'Very mysterious....I wish there was a tad bit more light.', '2003-01-15 20:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(192274, 10795, 3751, '<td valign="top">very good idea, but not for this challenge</td>', 'very good idea, but not for this challenge', '2003-01-15 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(192275, 10794, 1647, '<td valign="top">The subject is quite nice, and the rainbow adds a nice effect.  I''d love to see this landscape on a clear day - I''m jealous.</td>', 'The subject is quite nice, and the rainbow adds a nice effect.  I''d love to see this landscape on a clear day - I''m jealous.', '2003-01-15 20:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192276, 10898, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped this just to the right of the tree to eliminate most of that black space.  The rest of it is gorgeous.</td>', 'I''d have cropped this just to the right of the tree to eliminate most of that black space.  The rest of it is gorgeous.', '2003-01-15 20:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(192277, 10864, 3575, '<td valign="top">It''s on fire! I assume but I might be wrong, you used a filter to get the orange effect. The only thing that is a problem is the blown-out hightlights but it''s a really well composed image.</td>', 'It''s on fire! I assume but I might be wrong, you used a filter to get the orange effect. The only thing that is a problem is the blown-out hightlights but it''s a really well composed image.', '2003-01-15 20:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(192278, 10830, 3575, '<td valign="top">Yep, people need a place to hang their hats. Nice exposure and colors.</td>', 'Yep, people need a place to hang their hats. Nice exposure and colors.', '2003-01-15 20:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(192279, 10812, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The fog in the background really adds distance.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The fog in the background really adds distance.', '2003-01-15 20:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(192280, 10769, 3575, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look real clear to me, it looks hazy:). Excellent composition. I really like the way you made this a panorama. Good work</td>', 'It doesn''t look real clear to me, it looks hazy:). Excellent composition. I really like the way you made this a panorama. Good work', '2003-01-15 20:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192281, 10794, 4585, '<td valign="top">Excellent image!...should have gotten the pot of gold at the end of the rainbow too...;).  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent image!...should have gotten the pot of gold at the end of the rainbow too...;).  Good luck!', '2003-01-15 20:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192282, 10821, 3575, '<td valign="top">However did you get that sun! Fabulous. Then it''s either a volcano or a pyramid and then a power plant? I bet this is a great shot full size. Very nice panorama.</td>', 'However did you get that sun! Fabulous. Then it''s either a volcano or a pyramid and then a power plant? I bet this is a great shot full size. Very nice panorama.', '2003-01-15 20:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192283, 10739, 3575, '<td valign="top">That looks like my hill! I''ll take a picture of mine and send it to you when I find out who you are. Good composition and fresh idea.</td>', 'That looks like my hill! I''ll take a picture of mine and send it to you when I find out who you are. Good composition and fresh idea.', '2003-01-15 20:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(192284, 10737, 3575, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!</td>', 'Awesome!!', '2003-01-15 20:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192286, 11017, 3575, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, this is breathtaking. I''m speachless so here''s a 10!</td>', 'Oh my gosh, this is breathtaking. I''m speachless so here''s a 10!', '2003-01-15 20:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192287, 10929, 2158, '<td valign="top">Pity you couldn''t get there at a time of day when there was sun on the back of the mountain on the right too.  Easier said than done though!</td>', 'Pity you couldn''t get there at a time of day when there was sun on the back of the mountain on the right too.  Easier said than done though!', '2003-01-15 20:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(192288, 10993, 3575, '<td valign="top">Great color on those little objects. I think this is another one that will be great to see full-size because it looks like the clarity is there, just not so good at the 640 max.</td>', 'Great color on those little objects. I think this is another one that will be great to see full-size because it looks like the clarity is there, just not so good at the 640 max.', '2003-01-15 20:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(192289, 10764, 3575, '<td valign="top">Lovely winter scene. I can''t tell if it''s morning or evening but the light is very pretty (not the lamp but the sunlight)</td>', 'Lovely winter scene. I can''t tell if it''s morning or evening but the light is very pretty (not the lamp but the sunlight)', '2003-01-15 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(192291, 10793, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Composition and the lighting is great. I love the saturation of the colors and the curves, the curves are wonderful. Only thing that would have made this better would have been pristeen snow -- but you take what you can get, right? Nice work.</td>', 'Wonderful Composition and the lighting is great. I love the saturation of the colors and the curves, the curves are wonderful. Only thing that would have made this better would have been pristeen snow -- but you take what you can get, right? Nice work.', '2003-01-15 20:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(192292, 10801, 5892, '<td valign="top">Its an interesting picture, but for some reason doesn''t really grab my attention.</td>', 'Its an interesting picture, but for some reason doesn''t really grab my attention.', '2003-01-15 20:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(192294, 10893, 2158, '<td valign="top">That couple really make this picture.</td>', 'That couple really make this picture.', '2003-01-15 20:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192295, 10788, 5892, '<td valign="top">Stunning! Everything looks so smooth, and the strip of orange in the sky that you managed to capture is perfect. What a beautiful night.</td>', 'Stunning! Everything looks so smooth, and the strip of orange in the sky that you managed to capture is perfect. What a beautiful night.', '2003-01-15 20:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(192296, 10884, 3575, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful contrast of wamth and chilly cold. This is a beautifully composed image. It gives me the creeps a little becaus I know you must have walked out on those slick rocks to take this photo. A real pleasure to see. Love it.</td>', 'What a wonderful contrast of wamth and chilly cold. This is a beautifully composed image. It gives me the creeps a little becaus I know you must have walked out on those slick rocks to take this photo. A real pleasure to see. Love it.', '2003-01-15 20:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(192297, 10830, 5892, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation - I like the crop.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation - I like the crop.', '2003-01-15 20:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(192298, 10724, 3575, '<td valign="top">Well composed. I like the sky and the sunset pink on the distant hill, that''s very nice. I wish it was a little lighter in the forground.</td>', 'Well composed. I like the sky and the sunset pink on the distant hill, that''s very nice. I wish it was a little lighter in the forground.', '2003-01-15 20:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(192299, 10971, 3575, '<td valign="top">Gorgeousl winter scene. I love the white trees, are those birch or aspens maybe? The killer image in this photo for me is the curve of the fence - absolutely perfect! Very, very nice.</td>', 'Gorgeousl winter scene. I love the white trees, are those birch or aspens maybe? The killer image in this photo for me is the curve of the fence - absolutely perfect! Very, very nice.', '2003-01-15 20:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(192300, 10731, 5892, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful, unique and stunning photo. Great job</td>', 'This is a wonderful, unique and stunning photo. Great job', '2003-01-15 20:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(192301, 10791, 5892, '<td valign="top">I like the depth - I feel as though I could walk for miles into your picture</td>', 'I like the depth - I feel as though I could walk for miles into your picture', '2003-01-15 20:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(192302, 10701, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a sunset! I can''t believe those bright colors. I think cropping a lot of the dark foreground would improve the composition.</td>', 'Wow, what a sunset! I can''t believe those bright colors. I think cropping a lot of the dark foreground would improve the composition.', '2003-01-15 20:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(192303, 10864, 5892, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out what the light is - is the forest on fire?</td>', 'I can''t figure out what the light is - is the forest on fire?', '2003-01-15 20:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(192304, 10778, 3575, '<td valign="top">OK, I wonder how many people on this site even know what Psychedelic means? Excellent DOF. What is the background? a window?</td>', 'OK, I wonder how many people on this site even know what Psychedelic means? Excellent DOF. What is the background? a window?', '2003-01-15 20:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(192305, 11041, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. I like the sepia tone. Maybe a little more contrast but I like it, rocks and misty water.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. I like the sepia tone. Maybe a little more contrast but I like it, rocks and misty water.', '2003-01-15 20:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(192306, 10996, 3575, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful postcard! Excellent composition.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful postcard! Excellent composition.', '2003-01-15 20:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(192307, 10835, 3575, '<td valign="top">OK, who was out there and didn''t take me along?!  The rays of the sun are wonderful, I''ve not seen that before, I bet your opportunity didn''t last long. I love the rocks and water and the curving in and out of each other, very dramatic and beautiful.</td>', 'OK, who was out there and didn''t take me along?!  The rays of the sun are wonderful, I''ve not seen that before, I bet your opportunity didn''t last long. I love the rocks and water and the curving in and out of each other, very dramatic and beautiful.', '2003-01-15 20:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(192308, 10768, 3575, '<td valign="top">Love it. Good contrast, the composition is really well done but it appears the horizon is slanted a little, it could be an optical illusion though.</td>', 'Love it. Good contrast, the composition is really well done but it appears the horizon is slanted a little, it could be an optical illusion though.', '2003-01-15 20:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(192312, 10862, 3751, '<td valign="top">It looks like a painting</td>', 'It looks like a painting', '2003-01-15 21:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(192315, 10893, 2920, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent picture.  I missed the people initially as they blended in with the grass,  this was because my eye was drawn to the background.  However, once I became aware of them, their presence adds much to the scene, both in terms of the composition and also cementing the wonderfull idyllic mood.  I would love to know if they appear there by chance or if you positioned them deliberately.  On the strength of the rest of the picture I''ll assume the latter and add and extra point.</td>', 'This is an excellent picture.  I missed the people initially as they blended in with the grass,  this was because my eye was drawn to the background.  However, once I became aware of them, their presence adds much to the scene, both in terms of the composition and also cementing the wonderfull idyllic mood.  I would love to know if they appear there by chance or if you positioned them deliberately.  On the strength of the rest of the picture I''ll assume the latter and add and extra point.', '2003-01-15 21:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192317, 10853, 2158, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a bit bigger.  It could have looked really good.</td>', 'I wish this were a bit bigger.  It could have looked really good.', '2003-01-15 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(192319, 10998, 5892, '<td valign="top">good clarity, the light is beautiful</td>', 'good clarity, the light is beautiful', '2003-01-15 21:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(192321, 10799, 2920, '<td valign="top">I think this is a superb picture, full of mood, which is helped by the wonderfull colouration.  I particularly like the way the top of the picture fades out into the border.  However, at the same time, I feel the border is a bit of a distraction because of it''s uneven proportions.  This is particularly noticeable at the bottom corners.  I think if you had kept the proportions even all around it would have added even more to the charm of the image.  Even so - an excellent shot.</td>', 'I think this is a superb picture, full of mood, which is helped by the wonderfull colouration.  I particularly like the way the top of the picture fades out into the border.  However, at the same time, I feel the border is a bit of a distraction because of it''s uneven proportions.  This is particularly noticeable at the bottom corners.  I think if you had kept the proportions even all around it would have added even more to the charm of the image.  Even so - an excellent shot.', '2003-01-15 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(192324, 10840, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice landscape shot... I think the only area for improvement in this one would be to crop out just a little bit of the foreground possibly.  Empty sky is generally more appealing in a landscape than empty foreground.  I really like the horse rider in this shot.. that makes this scene work nicely :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice landscape shot... I think the only area for improvement in this one would be to crop out just a little bit of the foreground possibly.  Empty sky is generally more appealing in a landscape than empty foreground.  I really like the horse rider in this shot.. that makes this scene work nicely :) - setzler', '2003-01-15 21:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192335, 11010, 4585, '<td valign="top">I guess you might have heard this before, but I would have cropped a lot of that sky out of this image because the image is simply stunning!...Good luck!</td>', 'I guess you might have heard this before, but I would have cropped a lot of that sky out of this image because the image is simply stunning!...Good luck!', '2003-01-15 21:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(192339, 10912, 6250, '<td valign="top">I LOVE NY MORE THAN EVER!</td>', 'I LOVE NY MORE THAN EVER!', '2003-01-15 21:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(192341, 10932, 5904, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2003-01-15 21:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(192342, 11037, 5904, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the clouds/mist!</td>', 'Great capture of the clouds/mist!', '2003-01-15 21:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192343, 10754, 5904, '<td valign="top">Could have been better if you waited until the sunlight filled the canyon.</td>', 'Could have been better if you waited until the sunlight filled the canyon.', '2003-01-15 21:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(192344, 10856, 5904, '<td valign="top">Lens Flare distracts from the beauty of the shot.</td>', 'Lens Flare distracts from the beauty of the shot.', '2003-01-15 21:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(192345, 10966, 5904, '<td valign="top">The sharp snow line on the far river bank distracts the attention from the whole shot.</td>', 'The sharp snow line on the far river bank distracts the attention from the whole shot.', '2003-01-15 21:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(192346, 10970, 5904, '<td valign="top">Lens flare is too distracting.</td>', 'Lens flare is too distracting.', '2003-01-15 22:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(192347, 10911, 5904, '<td valign="top">could use a little sharper focus.</td>', 'could use a little sharper focus.', '2003-01-15 22:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(192348, 10902, 5904, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot!</td>', 'beautiful shot!', '2003-01-15 22:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192352, 10995, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well done. Nice colors. Sharp.</td>', 'Well done. Nice colors. Sharp.', '2003-01-15 22:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(192361, 10940, 2352, '<td valign="top">I love the blue sky behind the trees!  The shadows in front are somewhat distracting for me and I wonder what it would look like just white.  Other then that a very enjoyable shot to view with a crisp focus and nice contrast.</td>', 'I love the blue sky behind the trees!  The shadows in front are somewhat distracting for me and I wonder what it would look like just white.  Other then that a very enjoyable shot to view with a crisp focus and nice contrast.', '2003-01-15 22:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(192363, 11011, 2352, '<td valign="top">The bird is very dramatic as the focal point here with fabulous colors against the background!  The lower section of the shot doesn`t do much for it, although ties in the colors well.  Perhaps a crop from just the bottom of the post up would be interesting to help eliminiate the shadow.</td>', 'The bird is very dramatic as the focal point here with fabulous colors against the background!  The lower section of the shot doesn`t do much for it, although ties in the colors well.  Perhaps a crop from just the bottom of the post up would be interesting to help eliminiate the shadow.', '2003-01-15 23:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(192365, 10874, 4793, '<td valign="top">This a beautiful shot, only one suggestion, try cropping a bit off the top. Good luck.</td>', 'This a beautiful shot, only one suggestion, try cropping a bit off the top. Good luck.', '2003-01-15 23:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(192367, 11018, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and how the road leads off in to the distance.  The mountains/hills in the distance look a little out of focus to me, could be the distance? But overall really nice shot.7</td>', 'I like this shot and how the road leads off in to the distance.  The mountains/hills in the distance look a little out of focus to me, could be the distance? But overall really nice shot.7', '2003-01-15 23:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(192370, 11028, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, comp. is great, crisp clear shot, one that you get your emotions all wrapped up in. I like your border.</td>', 'Beautiful, comp. is great, crisp clear shot, one that you get your emotions all wrapped up in. I like your border.', '2003-01-15 23:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(192374, 10847, 2352, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  Excellent black and white!  Nice composition, focus, and contrast.  The line of trees takes the eye to the rear - Congratulations!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  Excellent black and white!  Nice composition, focus, and contrast.  The line of trees takes the eye to the rear - Congratulations!', '2003-01-15 23:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(192375, 11026, 5964, '<td valign="top">I never knew that an old rusted piece of metal could looks so interesting! The metal really stands out from the lush green of the back ground. I don''t know if I would call this a traditional landscape, but it works for me. The distance seems to be a bit too bright/out of focus, but htat could be your intention. 7.</td>', 'I never knew that an old rusted piece of metal could looks so interesting! The metal really stands out from the lush green of the back ground. I don''t know if I would call this a traditional landscape, but it works for me. The distance seems to be a bit too bright/out of focus, but htat could be your intention. 7.', '2003-01-15 23:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(192379, 10830, 4793, '<td valign="top">Sad, but true your title can be said of so many once beautiful landscapes that are now covered with buildings and as your photo shows the trees have been cleared away.</td>', 'Sad, but true your title can be said of so many once beautiful landscapes that are now covered with buildings and as your photo shows the trees have been cleared away.', '2003-01-15 23:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(192380, 10909, 2352, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a better shot taken at a different time of day.  The light is too strong up front.  Nice composition and subject though!</td>', 'I think this would be a better shot taken at a different time of day.  The light is too strong up front.  Nice composition and subject though!', '2003-01-15 23:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(192381, 10788, 5964, '<td valign="top">What beautiful colors, I like how you captured the waterfall in the shot. Very crisp shot the focus was still good all the eay to the city in the background. There is almost too much sky in this shot, but I understand to show the color gradient. 8.</td>', 'What beautiful colors, I like how you captured the waterfall in the shot. Very crisp shot the focus was still good all the eay to the city in the background. There is almost too much sky in this shot, but I understand to show the color gradient. 8.', '2003-01-15 23:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(192383, 10922, 811, '<td valign="top">I htink the black and white gives this picture a feeling of desolation and loneliness.  Is that what you were after?  Also, it seems that the focus is a bit off, it just seems kinda soft.  Maybe if there was an object or road in the foreground to focus on, it wouldn''t be so noticeable.</td>', 'I htink the black and white gives this picture a feeling of desolation and loneliness.  Is that what you were after?  Also, it seems that the focus is a bit off, it just seems kinda soft.  Maybe if there was an object or road in the foreground to focus on, it wouldn''t be so noticeable.', '2003-01-15 23:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(192384, 10984, 4615, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, i would chop off the half-tree on the left.</td>', 'Nice scene, i would chop off the half-tree on the left.', '2003-01-15 23:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(192385, 10917, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern shot.  A little too dark on the right.  And the light thingy in the upper right is a bit distracting.  The composition might have been better with the transition point maybe at the 1/3 right osition instead of in the middle.  But OK, I sound like I''m ripping it when in fact I like it a lot.  So good job!  8 md</td>', 'Nice pattern shot.  A little too dark on the right.  And the light thingy in the upper right is a bit distracting.  The composition might have been better with the transition point maybe at the 1/3 right osition instead of in the middle.  But OK, I sound like I''m ripping it when in fact I like it a lot.  So good job!  8 md', '2003-01-15 23:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192386, 10975, 933, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Great clarity on the thorny things. Composition seems a bit off - maybe if the thorns were more to the right that might balance out the barns or something.  Very nice shot. 8 md</td>', 'Great colors.  Great clarity on the thorny things. Composition seems a bit off - maybe if the thorns were more to the right that might balance out the barns or something.  Very nice shot. 8 md', '2003-01-15 23:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(192387, 10945, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and colors</td>', 'Very nice composition and colors', '2003-01-15 23:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(192388, 10941, 933, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, lighting and clarity in this image.  I am looking forward to finding out where this was taken.  My only neg would be the tree in the lower right,  Kind of pokes out from nowhere, only just half there.  I\''d would have preferred not seeing it at all, or instead maybe having it brought into the frame some more.  Otherwise, excllent job!  addendum -  I liked this so much I had to bump it from a 9 to a 10.  md</td>', 'Wonderful colors, lighting and clarity in this image.  I am looking forward to finding out where this was taken.  My only neg would be the tree in the lower right,  Kind of pokes out from nowhere, only just half there.  I\''d would have preferred not seeing it at all, or instead maybe having it brought into the frame some more.  Otherwise, excllent job!  addendum -  I liked this so much I had to bump it from a 9 to a 10.  md', '2003-01-15 23:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(192389, 10876, 811, '<td valign="top">Good placement of the objects (trees, barn, etc) in the frame.  Also, I like how the green trees and red barn contrast.  I think there needs to be just a touch more space in the foreground if possible.  It kinda feels like the barn is sitting on the bottom of the frame, and it seems off balanced to me.</td>', 'Good placement of the objects (trees, barn, etc) in the frame.  Also, I like how the green trees and red barn contrast.  I think there needs to be just a touch more space in the foreground if possible.  It kinda feels like the barn is sitting on the bottom of the frame, and it seems off balanced to me.', '2003-01-15 23:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(192390, 10832, 5964, '<td valign="top">Great cityscape! The exposure may have been a touch too long the smoke rising from the building almost makes it look there are ghosts amid the tops of the building. The prominent focus in this shot is the slightly off centered well lit up building. I would have probably moved this up a bit ans over to the left a little more. Overall great capture.7.</td>', 'Great cityscape! The exposure may have been a touch too long the smoke rising from the building almost makes it look there are ghosts amid the tops of the building. The prominent focus in this shot is the slightly off centered well lit up building. I would have probably moved this up a bit ans over to the left a little more. Overall great capture.7.', '2003-01-15 23:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(192391, 10814, 933, '<td valign="top">Good colors and composition.  A little too much shadow in the foreground.  Well done.  8  md</td>', 'Good colors and composition.  A little too much shadow in the foreground.  Well done.  8  md', '2003-01-15 23:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(192392, 10852, 933, '<td valign="top">These are not easy shots to capture.  Some might question whether this is a landscape or not, but personally I think it fits just fine. Only knock is that it''s a bit blown out in the lower left. All in all an excellent photo though.  9  md</td>', 'These are not easy shots to capture.  Some might question whether this is a landscape or not, but personally I think it fits just fine. Only knock is that it''s a bit blown out in the lower left. All in all an excellent photo though.  9  md', '2003-01-15 23:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(192393, 11018, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and good capture of the textures.  I like how the road leads from the bottom of the frame, giving an "entry" point.  Maybe if it was framed so that the road curved into the  picture instead of out of it, it may be more effective, at least to me.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and good capture of the textures.  I like how the road leads from the bottom of the frame, giving an "entry" point.  Maybe if it was framed so that the road curved into the  picture instead of out of it, it may be more effective, at least to me.', '2003-01-15 23:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(192394, 10827, 933, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity and color. Good composition. Nice work.  8  md</td>', 'Excellent clarity and color. Good composition. Nice work.  8  md', '2003-01-15 23:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192395, 10962, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2003-01-15 23:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(192396, 10840, 933, '<td valign="top">Composition seems a bit off.  The two trees seem to compete for attention. The rider is way to far off to the left.  better luck next challenge.  md</td>', 'Composition seems a bit off.  The two trees seem to compete for attention. The rider is way to far off to the left.  better luck next challenge.  md', '2003-01-15 23:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(192398, 10854, 933, '<td valign="top">The house behind the trees is too distracting.  And the cat is also a distraction, as it is too small to really be a focal point.   better luck next challenge.  md</td>', 'The house behind the trees is too distracting.  And the cat is also a distraction, as it is too small to really be a focal point.   better luck next challenge.  md', '2003-01-15 23:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(192403, 10958, 2352, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot!  The colors and shapes in the sand with the colors of the windblown weeds  is outstanding!  Sharp focus along with excellent detail in the water with a hint of focal point and perfect light direction.  The clouds are in excellent position with a color that just complements the whole concept.   Congratulations and good luck!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot!  The colors and shapes in the sand with the colors of the windblown weeds  is outstanding!  Sharp focus along with excellent detail in the water with a hint of focal point and perfect light direction.  The clouds are in excellent position with a color that just complements the whole concept.   Congratulations and good luck!', '2003-01-15 23:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(192405, 10914, 933, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I''m a sucker for earth, snow and blue sky in a photo. Too bad the moon was not a bit lower - it kind of throws off the balance of the photo.  Still, a very nice shot.  8  md</td>', 'Great colors.  I''m a sucker for earth, snow and blue sky in a photo. Too bad the moon was not a bit lower - it kind of throws off the balance of the photo.  Still, a very nice shot.  8  md', '2003-01-15 23:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192407, 10925, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent black and white... the curvature of the sidewalk really makes this image work nicely.  That provides the ''single'' element of attention that I belive is required to make a nice landscape photo... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an excellent black and white... the curvature of the sidewalk really makes this image work nicely.  That provides the ''single'' element of attention that I belive is required to make a nice landscape photo... great work :) - setzler', '2003-01-15 23:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(192408, 10874, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo.. I really like the warm color tones and how they contrast with the theme of the cold ice... great shot :)  - setzler</td>', 'This is a lovely photo.. I really like the warm color tones and how they contrast with the theme of the cold ice... great shot :)  - setzler', '2003-01-15 23:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(192409, 10849, 811, '<td valign="top">The  colors on this are awesome.  having the sun on the vertical middle, and the horizon on the horizontal middle make the picture a little static for me.  Did moving it up/down, left or right change it any?  The plus to this composition, though, is that it is very soothing and stable.</td>', 'The  colors on this are awesome.  having the sun on the vertical middle, and the horizon on the horizontal middle make the picture a little static for me.  Did moving it up/down, left or right change it any?  The plus to this composition, though, is that it is very soothing and stable.', '2003-01-15 23:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(192410, 10830, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like the title. That is what we I ran into everywhere I saw a good shot....houses. This is a good idea, though I may have taken it in a slightly different angle. Let the road lead your focus off to the development of houses, right now it looks flat not a lot of depth. 7.</td>', 'I like the title. That is what we I ran into everywhere I saw a good shot....houses. This is a good idea, though I may have taken it in a slightly different angle. Let the road lead your focus off to the development of houses, right now it looks flat not a lot of depth. 7.', '2003-01-15 23:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192411, 10897, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition,  I think, but the picture is a bit dark in the foreground for my.  I either like complete silhouettes (like the tree on teh right), or being able to distinguish the details.  I love how you have captured the fog/mist on teh lower left, just wish I could see more of it.  Overall, an excellent shot, and it reminds me of home!</td>', 'Great composition,  I think, but the picture is a bit dark in the foreground for my.  I either like complete silhouettes (like the tree on teh right), or being able to distinguish the details.  I love how you have captured the fog/mist on teh lower left, just wish I could see more of it.  Overall, an excellent shot, and it reminds me of home!', '2003-01-15 23:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(192412, 10876, 5964, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I don''t really consider this a classic landscape, but the shot is great.  The barn draws the most attention and I don''t pay any attention to the rest of the landscape. Good placement of the trees relative to the barn, overall great shot.7.</td>', 'Great shot, I don''t really consider this a classic landscape, but the shot is great.  The barn draws the most attention and I don''t pay any attention to the rest of the landscape. Good placement of the trees relative to the barn, overall great shot.7.', '2003-01-15 23:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(192413, 10784, 4514, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Colors.  It is a shame that this photo is very busy.<br/></td>', 'Wonderful Colors.  It is a shame that this photo is very busy.', '2003-01-16 00:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(192415, 10856, 4514, '<td valign="top">Wow now that big lightbuld in the sky is huge.<br/></td>', 'Wow now that big lightbuld in the sky is huge.', '2003-01-16 00:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192416, 10859, 4514, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  Good lines.  Lots of noise from the lights and the extended shutter speed.</td>', 'Not bad.  Good lines.  Lots of noise from the lights and the extended shutter speed.', '2003-01-16 00:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(192417, 10874, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is definetly not your typical landscape, but it is amazingly eye catching. It would have really helped if you would have caught more of the trees in the reflection to give it a landscape feel. But for the creativity and execution I''ll give a 7</td>', 'This is definetly not your typical landscape, but it is amazingly eye catching. It would have really helped if you would have caught more of the trees in the reflection to give it a landscape feel. But for the creativity and execution I''ll give a 7', '2003-01-16 00:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(192418, 10847, 5044, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. The mood is great, the composition is excellent. I like how you framed the background with the foreground branches. I also like how you managed to get a "full colour" B&amp;W picture. Nice. The object on the ground on the bottom left is a mystery to me as to what it is. I find it adds to the mood of the pic. Almost looks like a canoe that has sunk into the snow. A 10 in my Book. My prediction: In the top 3.</td>', 'I really like this picture. The mood is great, the composition is excellent. I like how you framed the background with the foreground branches. I also like how you managed to get a "full colour" B&W picture. Nice. The object on the ground on the bottom left is a mystery to me as to what it is. I find it adds to the mood of the pic. Almost looks like a canoe that has sunk into the snow. A 10 in my Book. My prediction: In the top 3.', '2003-01-16 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192419, 10838, 5044, '<td valign="top">What can I say. This is one of the most awesome amateur pictures I have ever seen. I stared at my screen for ten minutes before my wife came and picked my jaw up off the floor. <br/>Composition is great. Usually I would apply the rule of thirds and not put the horizon in the center, but given the reflection this works perfectly. Colours are splendid. Sharpness is excellent. Where is this? Alaska? Iceland? If I could, I would give this an 11 (10 will have to be sufficient). My prediction for #1.</td>', 'What can I say. This is one of the most awesome amateur pictures I have ever seen. I stared at my screen for ten minutes before my wife came and picked my jaw up off the floor. Composition is great. Usually I would apply the rule of thirds and not put the horizon in the center, but given the reflection this works perfectly. Colours are splendid. Sharpness is excellent. Where is this? Alaska? Iceland? If I could, I would give this an 11 (10 will have to be sufficient). My prediction for #1.', '2003-01-16 00:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192420, 11038, 4514, '<td valign="top">The Bridge was a wonderful subject.  The tree really does hurt the shot.</td>', 'The Bridge was a wonderful subject.  The tree really does hurt the shot.', '2003-01-16 00:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(192421, 10851, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but I feel the lines could have been composed a little better.  Nice colors.</td>', 'This is a nice shot but I feel the lines could have been composed a little better.  Nice colors.', '2003-01-16 00:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(192422, 10716, 4514, '<td valign="top">I think it is a tad too dark.  Slower shutter speed would have worked a little better.<br/></td>', 'I think it is a tad too dark.  Slower shutter speed would have worked a little better.', '2003-01-16 00:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(192423, 10963, 4514, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  A Mogul Course for skiing.</td>', 'Hmmm.  A Mogul Course for skiing.', '2003-01-16 00:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(192424, 10929, 5044, '<td valign="top">A wonderful picture. Too bad it was so hazy. Maybe could have stood to have a little increase in the saturation, to punch up the colours a little. 9</td>', 'A wonderful picture. Too bad it was so hazy. Maybe could have stood to have a little increase in the saturation, to punch up the colours a little. 9', '2003-01-16 00:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(192426, 10990, 5044, '<td valign="top">Normally, I would say too much sky, but the cloud is so imposing this way, I feel sorry for the poor little mountain underneath it. Excellent shot. 9</td>', 'Normally, I would say too much sky, but the cloud is so imposing this way, I feel sorry for the poor little mountain underneath it. Excellent shot. 9', '2003-01-16 00:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192427, 10770, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great colours, composition and sharpness. A 9 in my book.</td>', 'Great colours, composition and sharpness. A 9 in my book.', '2003-01-16 00:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(192428, 11036, 5964, '<td valign="top">The stream really adds a lot to this shot, for at once you can tell the stream was much bigger but now just a trickle. I like how the stream takes your attention towards the backdrop of the shot. 7.</td>', 'The stream really adds a lot to this shot, for at once you can tell the stream was much bigger but now just a trickle. I like how the stream takes your attention towards the backdrop of the shot. 7.', '2003-01-16 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(192431, 11006, 5318, '<td valign="top">Hey ,this is a beautiful  LANDSCAPE picture, Ilove the clarity, and the colors. It definity stands out from the rest.  Good eye!!!!      You\''ll do well.</td>', 'Hey ,this is a beautiful  LANDSCAPE picture, Ilove the clarity, and the colors. It definity stands out from the rest.  Good eye!!!!      You\''ll do well.', '2003-01-16 00:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192432, 11007, 674, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrasts.  Postcard perfect.</td>', 'Lovely contrasts.  Postcard perfect.', '2003-01-16 00:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(192433, 10895, 4811, '<td valign="top">Strong composition, even stronger if the lower bush is not present, in my opinion. Tried looking at this in B&amp;W, and I must say it makes a stunning black and white image, especially if you "burn in" a bit of the sky, and clone out the bush. (making it DPC illegal) Hope I gave you some things to try in your image editing program! :)</td>', 'Strong composition, even stronger if the lower bush is not present, in my opinion. Tried looking at this in B&W, and I must say it makes a stunning black and white image, especially if you "burn in" a bit of the sky, and clone out the bush. (making it DPC illegal) Hope I gave you some things to try in your image editing program! :)', '2003-01-16 00:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(192434, 10922, 4811, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus slightly, but if this is an infrared image, which is my guess at the moment, then I know firsthand how tricky it is getting things in your image sharp. Infrared has a different focusing point than the one given by your camera, not sure if that''s the case here. Focusing aside, excellent sky, very dramatic landscape elements!</td>', 'Looks out of focus slightly, but if this is an infrared image, which is my guess at the moment, then I know firsthand how tricky it is getting things in your image sharp. Infrared has a different focusing point than the one given by your camera, not sure if that''s the case here. Focusing aside, excellent sky, very dramatic landscape elements!', '2003-01-16 01:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(192436, 10812, 5964, '<td valign="top">Very neat perspective. It sure is a hazy day hard time seeing the hills in the backdrop. I really like how you caught hte road at an angle like that, catches your eyes and leads them back. I may have cropped up a bit and got rid of that brush on the lower right hand corner, a little less distracting. 7.</td>', 'Very neat perspective. It sure is a hazy day hard time seeing the hills in the backdrop. I really like how you caught hte road at an angle like that, catches your eyes and leads them back. I may have cropped up a bit and got rid of that brush on the lower right hand corner, a little less distracting. 7.', '2003-01-16 01:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(192444, 10932, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Focus seems a tad soft in the middle - was there mist? I think I would prefer to see this beautiful scene in color.</td>', 'Nice composition. Focus seems a tad soft in the middle - was there mist? I think I would prefer to see this beautiful scene in color.', '2003-01-16 01:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(192446, 10969, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors. You''ve probably heard this already, but horizon (front of barn) looks tilted. Pretty scene.</td>', 'Nice rich colors. You''ve probably heard this already, but horizon (front of barn) looks tilted. Pretty scene.', '2003-01-16 01:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(192447, 10958, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and interesting composition. I like the waving grasses in the foreground. Looks cold there.....</td>', 'Good DOF and interesting composition. I like the waving grasses in the foreground. Looks cold there.....', '2003-01-16 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(192449, 10965, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition, and nice capture of the light behind the foreground vegetation (looks like Queen Anne''s Lace to me?). Captivating.</td>', 'Very interesting composition, and nice capture of the light behind the foreground vegetation (looks like Queen Anne''s Lace to me?). Captivating.', '2003-01-16 01:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(192451, 10951, 3419, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t consider this to be a landscape - there''s no land in this photo. It is a nice capture though - you''ve done well with the sun behind the tree in terms of exposure. I''d clone out the wires at the bottom when the challenge voting is done.</td>', 'I wouldn''t consider this to be a landscape - there''s no land in this photo. It is a nice capture though - you''ve done well with the sun behind the tree in terms of exposure. I''d clone out the wires at the bottom when the challenge voting is done.', '2003-01-16 01:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(192452, 10855, 3419, '<td valign="top">Stark mood captured very well. The vegetation in the foreground and the clouds really add interest. B&amp;W is good choice for this.</td>', 'Stark mood captured very well. The vegetation in the foreground and the clouds really add interest. B&W is good choice for this.', '2003-01-16 01:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(192453, 10712, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but the colors are very saturated. Gives photo more of a "painting" feeling. Good eye for catching this scene.</td>', 'Nice photo, but the colors are very saturated. Gives photo more of a "painting" feeling. Good eye for catching this scene.', '2003-01-16 01:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(192455, 11034, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''ve always liked strong diagonal lines and this is a good example of one.  The grey (power? phone?) box on the right side really hurts the image overall for me.  Maybe a closer crop could have eliminated it?</td>', 'I''ve always liked strong diagonal lines and this is a good example of one.  The grey (power? phone?) box on the right side really hurts the image overall for me.  Maybe a closer crop could have eliminated it?', '2003-01-16 01:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(192458, 10909, 3599, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the lens flare too much but the upper left hand corner is over exposed.  Taking the photo earlier would have helped eliminate the flare and possibly overexposed sky.  The composition is very nice so I think this same photo at a different time during the day would have made this one even better.</td>', 'I don''t mind the lens flare too much but the upper left hand corner is over exposed.  Taking the photo earlier would have helped eliminate the flare and possibly overexposed sky.  The composition is very nice so I think this same photo at a different time during the day would have made this one even better.', '2003-01-16 02:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192461, 10885, 3599, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the old Tarzan movies I used to watch when I was a kid.  I think this a great photo.  I''m curious to see what this looks like in color.  Good work and good luck.</td>', 'This reminds me of the old Tarzan movies I used to watch when I was a kid.  I think this a great photo.  I''m curious to see what this looks like in color.  Good work and good luck.', '2003-01-16 02:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(192469, 11020, 3540, '<td valign="top">THe color of the mountains is super.  The mountains in general are captured very well.  I''m not real fond of the foreground, especially since it isn''t in focus.  Overall I think its a pretty good photo still - Inspzil</td>', 'THe color of the mountains is super.  The mountains in general are captured very well.  I''m not real fond of the foreground, especially since it isn''t in focus.  Overall I think its a pretty good photo still - Inspzil', '2003-01-16 04:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(192472, 10998, 2261, '<td valign="top">dark isnt it!</td>', 'dark isnt it!', '2003-01-16 04:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(192475, 10912, 3585, '<td valign="top">Glitterscape! Great composition and colors, practically unreal.</td>', 'Glitterscape! Great composition and colors, practically unreal.', '2003-01-16 05:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(192476, 10712, 3585, '<td valign="top">If that one could be re-shot my advice would be: get closer to some of these and have more fun composing with these shapes in different sizes and keep just enough sky only to mark the horizon. 7</td>', 'If that one could be re-shot my advice would be: get closer to some of these and have more fun composing with these shapes in different sizes and keep just enough sky only to mark the horizon. 7', '2003-01-16 05:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(192478, 10773, 3540, '<td valign="top">Well framed.  Looks nice and warm there. - Inspzil</td>', 'Well framed.  Looks nice and warm there. - Inspzil', '2003-01-16 05:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(192480, 10944, 5158, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderfull scene, which lives from it''s stepwise buildup: the beach in the front, the ocean, the houses behind it and then the wonderfull hills and mountains.<br/>Also that everything is alligned and oriented to the the left side is great. You might have moved closer to the colored sunshades though, making them an surface on which the rest of the scene (ocean, houses, mountain) are rested. Would have been a better choice as the white tent in the front. Sharpness and colors are great. I hope you were able to swim a little. Good luck with this.</td>', 'This is a wonderfull scene, which lives from it''s stepwise buildup: the beach in the front, the ocean, the houses behind it and then the wonderfull hills and mountains.Also that everything is alligned and oriented to the the left side is great. You might have moved closer to the colored sunshades though, making them an surface on which the rest of the scene (ocean, houses, mountain) are rested. Would have been a better choice as the white tent in the front. Sharpness and colors are great. I hope you were able to swim a little. Good luck with this.', '2003-01-16 05:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(192481, 10772, 5158, '<td valign="top">The cactus and the sky are great (the sky is a little overexposed though) and using B&amp;W was a good choice. You might have cropped the dark lower section stronger though. It''s hard to see anything in there and it''s not necessary, but it captures the viewer''s eyes when it tries to find something without success. Still one of the many good pictures of this great challenge.</td>', 'The cactus and the sky are great (the sky is a little overexposed though) and using B&W was a good choice. You might have cropped the dark lower section stronger though. It''s hard to see anything in there and it''s not necessary, but it captures the viewer''s eyes when it tries to find something without success. Still one of the many good pictures of this great challenge.', '2003-01-16 05:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(192482, 10822, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this picture: placing the reflection of the two towers behind some palms is wonderful. Color and sharpness are good, maybe a little brighter in the dark regions. What disturb me though are the tree branch on the upper left side and the lamppost on the very right. They frame the picture and thus it losses the open space, something very important to landscape in my opinion. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the idea of this picture: placing the reflection of the two towers behind some palms is wonderful. Color and sharpness are good, maybe a little brighter in the dark regions. What disturb me though are the tree branch on the upper left side and the lamppost on the very right. They frame the picture and thus it losses the open space, something very important to landscape in my opinion. Good luck.', '2003-01-16 05:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(192483, 10733, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of the picture: the tower looks great and the sky has just enough structure to make a statement (cold and grey day) because it''s not overexposed. What disturbes me is the snow covered stone on the left: my eyes are attracted by it, although it turn''s out that it is not important. Would have liked it to see more of the trees surrounding the tower.</td>', 'I like the mood of the picture: the tower looks great and the sky has just enough structure to make a statement (cold and grey day) because it''s not overexposed. What disturbes me is the snow covered stone on the left: my eyes are attracted by it, although it turn''s out that it is not important. Would have liked it to see more of the trees surrounding the tower.', '2003-01-16 05:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(192484, 10773, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the sky (could be a little darker though to show the blue parts better) the tight cropping at the bottoom and top and of course the center topic of your picture, the tree. It might have been nice if there would have been more room to the left and right to strengthen the feeling of space though. Still very good and a 8 from me.</td>', 'I like the texture of the sky (could be a little darker though to show the blue parts better) the tight cropping at the bottoom and top and of course the center topic of your picture, the tree. It might have been nice if there would have been more room to the left and right to strengthen the feeling of space though. Still very good and a 8 from me.', '2003-01-16 05:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(192485, 10747, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sun is a little hot, but nice besides that. - Inspzil</td>', 'The sun is a little hot, but nice besides that. - Inspzil', '2003-01-16 05:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(192487, 10712, 5158, '<td valign="top">The composition is wonderfull and you have choosen a great topic. In my opinion it could have been improved by choosing a darker and deeper blue for the sky, but maybe this was not possible. Together with the yellow it looks a little artificial to me. Also the bright spot from the sun in the upper left corner does not add something in my opinion. Still a great picture for its topic and a 8 from me.</td>', 'The composition is wonderfull and you have choosen a great topic. In my opinion it could have been improved by choosing a darker and deeper blue for the sky, but maybe this was not possible. Together with the yellow it looks a little artificial to me. Also the bright spot from the sun in the upper left corner does not add something in my opinion. Still a great picture for its topic and a 8 from me.', '2003-01-16 05:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(192488, 10714, 5158, '<td valign="top">while I first rated your submission not so high, on the second look it apears to me as beeing very good. When I rushed through the pictures I didn''t notice the nice texture of the road and how it''s bended. Also the asymmetric framing by the trees on the left and the bush on the right is good: the small bush gives way to allow the viewer to get a view to the hill behind the fog. This hill could have been more visible if you would have increased the contrast though or reduce the brightness. Still very good and fitting to the challenge topic.</td>', 'while I first rated your submission not so high, on the second look it apears to me as beeing very good. When I rushed through the pictures I didn''t notice the nice texture of the road and how it''s bended. Also the asymmetric framing by the trees on the left and the bush on the right is good: the small bush gives way to allow the viewer to get a view to the hill behind the fog. This hill could have been more visible if you would have increased the contrast though or reduce the brightness. Still very good and fitting to the challenge topic.', '2003-01-16 06:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192489, 10877, 5158, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that I do not like this picture very much. While I don''t mind submitting a view to a city in this landscape challenge (there are very good cityscapes in this challenge) I like to see a wide view to a scene with only a few different details. This picture has too many details, it would better fit to a challenge like traffic or so. My eyes can not find rest anywere.<br/>Could be sharper and less noisy too.<br/>What I like are the cars: the look like toy cars to me.</td>', 'I have to admit that I do not like this picture very much. While I don''t mind submitting a view to a city in this landscape challenge (there are very good cityscapes in this challenge) I like to see a wide view to a scene with only a few different details. This picture has too many details, it would better fit to a challenge like traffic or so. My eyes can not find rest anywere.Could be sharper and less noisy too.What I like are the cars: the look like toy cars to me.', '2003-01-16 06:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192490, 10944, 4517, '<td valign="top">Oh yes roll on summer.Great pic 9</td>', 'Oh yes roll on summer.Great pic 9', '2003-01-16 06:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192491, 10748, 5158, '<td valign="top">Why is it so small? The clouds are great with nice features I would like to see in more details. Also the color is great. You might have cropped the bottom portion a little more: the black area is not adding anything and thus unnecessary.</td>', 'Why is it so small? The clouds are great with nice features I would like to see in more details. Also the color is great. You might have cropped the bottom portion a little more: the black area is not adding anything and thus unnecessary.', '2003-01-16 06:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(192499, 10746, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the way the fog is sitting on top of the mountain like a marshmellow</td>', 'I like the way the fog is sitting on top of the mountain like a marshmellow', '2003-01-16 07:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192500, 10838, 5728, '<td valign="top">I had to look closely at the reflections on the water because I thought there was actually ice on the water itself. It sure is deceiving!</td>', 'I had to look closely at the reflections on the water because I thought there was actually ice on the water itself. It sure is deceiving!', '2003-01-16 07:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(192501, 10922, 5728, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this photo in color. I bet that sky has a deep blue to it, right? I like the clouds, they seem to be floating pieces of cotton wool.</td>', 'I would love to see this photo in color. I bet that sky has a deep blue to it, right? I like the clouds, they seem to be floating pieces of cotton wool.', '2003-01-16 07:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192502, 10892, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, although I am not sure it fits into the landscape category.</td>', 'Nice photo, although I am not sure it fits into the landscape category.', '2003-01-16 07:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(192504, 10821, 5728, '<td valign="top">That sun looks great in the background, so unusually big. Nice capture.</td>', 'That sun looks great in the background, so unusually big. Nice capture.', '2003-01-16 07:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(192506, 10992, 5728, '<td valign="top">I am trying to guess where this cityscape could be, but I just can''t place it. Nice firey sky there, however I think there is a tad too much magenta in this photo.</td>', 'I am trying to guess where this cityscape could be, but I just can''t place it. Nice firey sky there, however I think there is a tad too much magenta in this photo.', '2003-01-16 08:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(192507, 10733, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the way the snow is trying to eat up that rock on the left, like a blanket of powder just devouring it away. Nice placement of the tower between the two rocks, (I guess that is also a rock on the right).<br/> <br/>Does this photo meet the category requirements? Is it a landscape? I guess yes and no really. I like it.</td>', 'I like the way the snow is trying to eat up that rock on the left, like a blanket of powder just devouring it away. Nice placement of the tower between the two rocks, (I guess that is also a rock on the right). Does this photo meet the category requirements? Is it a landscape? I guess yes and no really. I like it.', '2003-01-16 08:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(192508, 10711, 3724, '<td valign="top">I like your unusual colour......  it has a nostolgic feel to it.   Almost like a old hand tinted photograph.  The crops in the valley (looks like corn) and the tower on Martin hill draw me in to this interesting composition.  The foreground before the corn, (at the bottom of the pic) acts like a little fence or barrier, and to me could have been restrained to provide a tighter view of the scene.</td>', 'I like your unusual colour......  it has a nostolgic feel to it.   Almost like a old hand tinted photograph.  The crops in the valley (looks like corn) and the tower on Martin hill draw me in to this interesting composition.  The foreground before the corn, (at the bottom of the pic) acts like a little fence or barrier, and to me could have been restrained to provide a tighter view of the scene.', '2003-01-16 08:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192509, 10981, 5728, '<td valign="top">The hill in front seems to distract a little from the landscape in the background. Nice rolly hills in the background, shame they are enveloped in a light haze.</td>', 'The hill in front seems to distract a little from the landscape in the background. Nice rolly hills in the background, shame they are enveloped in a light haze.', '2003-01-16 08:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192510, 10702, 5728, '<td valign="top">That grass looks lusciously green! Nice shot.</td>', 'That grass looks lusciously green! Nice shot.', '2003-01-16 08:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(192511, 10963, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. Are there rocks under that snow or is it just dirt? Sure gives it an unuusal effect. Good.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. Are there rocks under that snow or is it just dirt? Sure gives it an unuusal effect. Good.', '2003-01-16 08:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192512, 10879, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a swamp in my life, but this is just how I imagine it to be. Nice shot! Do you have aligators there?</td>', 'I''ve never seen a swamp in my life, but this is just how I imagine it to be. Nice shot! Do you have aligators there?', '2003-01-16 08:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(192513, 10892, 3882, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, nice layout.  Good job on the focusing too.  A little more abstract to the concept of "landscape" for my taste, but a good photo. 7</td>', 'Nice colours, nice layout.  Good job on the focusing too.  A little more abstract to the concept of "landscape" for my taste, but a good photo. 7', '2003-01-16 08:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(192514, 10912, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow you sure fit a lot of life into this photo. I bet it is New York, right?</td>', 'Wow you sure fit a lot of life into this photo. I bet it is New York, right?', '2003-01-16 08:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192515, 10798, 3882, '<td valign="top">This would have been a super photo with more color - more green in the trees and more blue in the sky.</td>', 'This would have been a super photo with more color - more green in the trees and more blue in the sky.', '2003-01-16 08:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(192516, 10756, 3882, '<td valign="top">A nice shot - a little too small though to see detaild, would have been more striking if it were larger.</td>', 'A nice shot - a little too small though to see detaild, would have been more striking if it were larger.', '2003-01-16 08:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(192517, 10898, 3882, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colour.  The horizon appears tilted to me though . . .</td>', 'Nice composition and colour.  The horizon appears tilted to me though . . .', '2003-01-16 08:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(192518, 10712, 3882, '<td valign="top">Nice colour, but the sun flare does not add to the photo.  There also appears to be too much grain.  Perhaps a lower ISO would have been better and positioning it a little more to the right to get the sun out of the frame.</td>', 'Nice colour, but the sun flare does not add to the photo.  There also appears to be too much grain.  Perhaps a lower ISO would have been better and positioning it a little more to the right to get the sun out of the frame.', '2003-01-16 08:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192519, 10984, 3882, '<td valign="top">Good shot, nice lines in the photo  and the red roof keeps your eye in.</td>', 'Good shot, nice lines in the photo  and the red roof keeps your eye in.', '2003-01-16 08:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(192520, 10951, 3882, '<td valign="top">Oooh.  I really like this one.  Super job!</td>', 'Oooh.  I really like this one.  Super job!', '2003-01-16 08:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(192521, 10772, 3882, '<td valign="top">While this is an interesting landscape photo, it need more punch, either colour or a stronger contrast between black and white</td>', 'While this is an interesting landscape photo, it need more punch, either colour or a stronger contrast between black and white', '2003-01-16 08:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(192522, 10818, 3724, '<td valign="top">i voted and wrote on this once already.....   i had it up for quite a while and must have been timed out or something......   i like the pic a lot.  i like the contrast of the calm pool of water at the top and the action of the little falls in the lower portion.  it is a unique place....  i love the rocky natural dam.   I feel a tighter composition would have been achieved if you had cropped near the top eliminating the green bank, but leave the reflection of the trees as your top edge......  this is a very good picture and an inviting place.</td>', 'i voted and wrote on this once already.....   i had it up for quite a while and must have been timed out or something......   i like the pic a lot.  i like the contrast of the calm pool of water at the top and the action of the little falls in the lower portion.  it is a unique place....  i love the rocky natural dam.   I feel a tighter composition would have been achieved if you had cropped near the top eliminating the green bank, but leave the reflection of the trees as your top edge......  this is a very good picture and an inviting place.', '2003-01-16 08:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(192525, 10701, 674, '<td valign="top">Absolutely magnificent!!!  Brilliant pic, well done!!</td>', 'Absolutely magnificent!!!  Brilliant pic, well done!!', '2003-01-16 09:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(192526, 10823, 674, '<td valign="top">WOW!! Lovely!!</td>', 'WOW!! Lovely!!', '2003-01-16 09:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192529, 10769, 3112, '<td valign="top">A golden photo of my favorite city., and no matter what, this IS a landscape...</td>', 'A golden photo of my favorite city., and no matter what, this IS a landscape...', '2003-01-16 09:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192531, 10936, 4510, '<td valign="top">I think if the rule of thirds had been applied to this shot it may have given it more impact. Colour and focus are excellent.</td>', 'I think if the rule of thirds had been applied to this shot it may have given it more impact. Colour and focus are excellent.', '2003-01-16 09:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(192535, 11024, 4510, '<td valign="top">The very tips of the trees in the foreground are a bit distracting. Otherwise great shot. I like that it''s hard to see where the horizon ends and the sky begins.</td>', 'The very tips of the trees in the foreground are a bit distracting. Otherwise great shot. I like that it''s hard to see where the horizon ends and the sky begins.', '2003-01-16 09:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(192536, 10748, 4510, '<td valign="top">IMO this is just too small to give an accurate assessment.</td>', 'IMO this is just too small to give an accurate assessment.', '2003-01-16 09:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(192539, 10871, 4510, '<td valign="top">IMO too much in the foreground, the trees break up what looks to be a nice landscape.</td>', 'IMO too much in the foreground, the trees break up what looks to be a nice landscape.', '2003-01-16 09:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(192542, 10864, 4510, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen anything like it, great work.</td>', 'I''ve never seen anything like it, great work.', '2003-01-16 09:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192543, 10799, 3724, '<td valign="top">I am hoping this picture is not made from a reciepe.......  Outstanding presentation.........      beautiful home/farm that matches the drug store print frame perfectly........ your creative processing is flawless and displays an intutive knowledge of recent foto history.......      truly "refreshing"  picture</td>', 'I am hoping this picture is not made from a reciepe.......  Outstanding presentation.........      beautiful home/farm that matches the drug store print frame perfectly........ your creative processing is flawless and displays an intutive knowledge of recent foto history.......      truly "refreshing"  picture', '2003-01-16 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192554, 10784, 4430, '<td valign="top">not a traditional landscrape, absolutely gorgeous sky, looks like it is on fire.  Don''t you wish you could saw down some telelphone poles?  My main beef is the window frame in front being so prominent and distracting, plus needs to be rotated slightly.</td>', 'not a traditional landscrape, absolutely gorgeous sky, looks like it is on fire.  Don''t you wish you could saw down some telelphone poles?  My main beef is the window frame in front being so prominent and distracting, plus needs to be rotated slightly.', '2003-01-16 10:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192556, 10966, 4430, '<td valign="top">I would hang this on my wall.  Although I may cut out the bank in the foreground, just that little triangle, it leaves less river but to me more appealling.</td>', 'I would hang this on my wall.  Although I may cut out the bank in the foreground, just that little triangle, it leaves less river but to me more appealling.', '2003-01-16 10:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(192557, 11023, 4510, '<td valign="top">One of the few true landscape shots this challenge, great work!</td>', 'One of the few true landscape shots this challenge, great work!', '2003-01-16 10:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192559, 10904, 4510, '<td valign="top">A little bit too much grass in the foreground IMO, still a good shot.</td>', 'A little bit too much grass in the foreground IMO, still a good shot.', '2003-01-16 10:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192561, 10976, 326, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2003-01-16 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(192562, 10971, 326, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!', '2003-01-16 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(192563, 11033, 326, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!', '2003-01-16 10:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(192564, 10942, 4493, '<td valign="top">Upon further looking at this photo I see much more than I originally did. This is an excellent shot with a very emotional feel to it. The headstones in the forground tell the story of a part of history. The one on its side shows how easily we forget. The strength of the tree shows how we overcome the loss of loved ones, and the building in the back takes us back home. Your conversion to b/w is well done. My only negative is the left side of the building is washed out. I know that in order to have enough light for the darker surroundings you prolly metered for it, resulting in a brighter building. Excellent work!</td>', 'Upon further looking at this photo I see much more than I originally did. This is an excellent shot with a very emotional feel to it. The headstones in the forground tell the story of a part of history. The one on its side shows how easily we forget. The strength of the tree shows how we overcome the loss of loved ones, and the building in the back takes us back home. Your conversion to b/w is well done. My only negative is the left side of the building is washed out. I know that in order to have enough light for the darker surroundings you prolly metered for it, resulting in a brighter building. Excellent work!', '2003-01-16 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(192565, 10942, 326, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2003-01-16 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(192568, 10912, 326, '<td valign="top">Wow! You sure packed a lot into this photo! I really like it!</td>', 'Wow! You sure packed a lot into this photo! I really like it!', '2003-01-16 11:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(192569, 10788, 5514, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, colors and saturation are great.  I would have zoomed and framed a little differently but that''s just my opinion.  Great Work!!</td>', 'Wonderful image, colors and saturation are great.  I would have zoomed and framed a little differently but that''s just my opinion.  Great Work!!', '2003-01-16 11:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192570, 10895, 326, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2003-01-16 11:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(192571, 11017, 5514, '<td valign="top">This is a Awesome Image- I love it,  long enough exposure to get all the details perfect!!  Keep up the Wonderful Work!!</td>', 'This is a Awesome Image- I love it,  long enough exposure to get all the details perfect!!  Keep up the Wonderful Work!!', '2003-01-16 11:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(192572, 10811, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as a landscape.  I do like the perspective of this pic.  You could''ve used a few less clouds though so that the colors of the boats was stronger.  Too bad we can''t dictate the weather.  I''m sure it''d improve most of my shots - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t see this as a landscape.  I do like the perspective of this pic.  You could''ve used a few less clouds though so that the colors of the boats was stronger.  Too bad we can''t dictate the weather.  I''m sure it''d improve most of my shots - Inspzil', '2003-01-16 11:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192573, 10742, 326, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2003-01-16 11:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192577, 10863, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky.  I like the tree silhouette.  Very nice pic all the way around but I especially like the warm colors of the sunset - Inspzil</td>', 'Awesome sky.  I like the tree silhouette.  Very nice pic all the way around but I especially like the warm colors of the sunset - Inspzil', '2003-01-16 11:18:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(192579, 10932, 326, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! Great job.</td>', 'This is fantastic! Great job.', '2003-01-16 11:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(192583, 10884, 326, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot!</td>', 'wonderful shot!', '2003-01-16 11:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(192586, 10990, 326, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is great!</td>', 'Wow! This is great!', '2003-01-16 11:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192587, 10984, 5514, '<td valign="top">Love this! Great Depth of Field, wonderful colors. Could use a little level adjustment in order to bring out some the foreground details.</td>', 'Love this! Great Depth of Field, wonderful colors. Could use a little level adjustment in order to bring out some the foreground details.', '2003-01-16 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(192592, 10821, 4400, '<td valign="top">Þetta er nokkuð góð mynd</td>', 'Þetta er nokkuð góð mynd', '2003-01-16 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192601, 10881, 1005, '<td valign="top">There''s quite a bit about this I like and a little that I don''t.  The feathery clouds and sky, very nice.  I like the tree that seems to be the centerpiece of this shot, but the lower parts are a bit lost in it''s background.  The cows in the corner, very cool, which makes the red bard connected into this, so it gets a cool too.  The telephone pole, well, they''re everywhere, what can you do.  Finally the ground, the far snow is really neat, too bad the sun had melted the area in the foreground making it look mottled, but I''m not asking you to take a snow blower to the scene, that''s silly.  It''s just the best I could do to descibe why I am as wishy washy about this shot as I am.  I like it and I don''t.....If you would have gone closer to the tree for a nice tree branches shot, it wouldn''t be as much of a landscape.  I really do like the cows in the corner.  Color seems really nice, lighting...well that goes partly back to the trees in the background.   7 Swash<br/>??? Confused ???? Please send me a note, we can "talk".</td>', 'There''s quite a bit about this I like and a little that I don''t.  The feathery clouds and sky, very nice.  I like the tree that seems to be the centerpiece of this shot, but the lower parts are a bit lost in it''s background.  The cows in the corner, very cool, which makes the red bard connected into this, so it gets a cool too.  The telephone pole, well, they''re everywhere, what can you do.  Finally the ground, the far snow is really neat, too bad the sun had melted the area in the foreground making it look mottled, but I''m not asking you to take a snow blower to the scene, that''s silly.  It''s just the best I could do to descibe why I am as wishy washy about this shot as I am.  I like it and I don''t.....If you would have gone closer to the tree for a nice tree branches shot, it wouldn''t be as much of a landscape.  I really do like the cows in the corner.  Color seems really nice, lighting...well that goes partly back to the trees in the background.   7 Swash??? Confused ???? Please send me a note, we can "talk".', '2003-01-16 12:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(192603, 10919, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like the trees in the left corner, with the slope of the hill, it seems very interesting to me.  Usually, I like close foreground stuff (most often coming from the bottom of the frame), but for some reason I just don''t like those branches just hanging on the left edge of the photo.  I see the clouds and yes a bit stormy, but IMO not contrasty/dark enough to be really threatening (see title).   I think I could have lived with the hill being fully sillhouetted (just a thought).  7 Swash</td>', 'I really like the trees in the left corner, with the slope of the hill, it seems very interesting to me.  Usually, I like close foreground stuff (most often coming from the bottom of the frame), but for some reason I just don''t like those branches just hanging on the left edge of the photo.  I see the clouds and yes a bit stormy, but IMO not contrasty/dark enough to be really threatening (see title).   I think I could have lived with the hill being fully sillhouetted (just a thought).  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 12:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(192604, 10753, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Technically this is more of an architecture shot, but I''ve not dinged any of the other city scapes either, so I won''t this one.  (Who am I to say you could or couldn''t get out to the backcountry...no wheels, not able, whatever)  Sepia always makes me think of OLD and that bridge looks very old, but the towers behind it don''t (mix doesn''t feel good).  Focus and lighting seem very good.   Contrast is well done, too.  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot!  Technically this is more of an architecture shot, but I''ve not dinged any of the other city scapes either, so I won''t this one.  (Who am I to say you could or couldn''t get out to the backcountry...no wheels, not able, whatever)  Sepia always makes me think of OLD and that bridge looks very old, but the towers behind it don''t (mix doesn''t feel good).  Focus and lighting seem very good.   Contrast is well done, too.  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 12:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(192605, 10992, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky.  The colors of this sunset are wonderful, nice clouds, too.  I sort of question the inclusion on your building, but your title ties in to make it seem more valid.  I question city-scapes as landscapes, but who knows, you (and the others) might not be able to leave the city (for one of several reasons I can think of), so I''m not "dinging" any scores for that reason, but I do question it. <br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Lovely sky.  The colors of this sunset are wonderful, nice clouds, too.  I sort of question the inclusion on your building, but your title ties in to make it seem more valid.  I question city-scapes as landscapes, but who knows, you (and the others) might not be able to leave the city (for one of several reasons I can think of), so I''m not "dinging" any scores for that reason, but I do question it. 7 Swash', '2003-01-16 12:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(192607, 10846, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, neat clouds, but a little low for general interest.  It''s your home, I don''t mean to offend, but it doesn''t draw me in.  I also like the watering hole, maybe if that were a larger part of the photo?  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, neat clouds, but a little low for general interest.  It''s your home, I don''t mean to offend, but it doesn''t draw me in.  I also like the watering hole, maybe if that were a larger part of the photo?  6 Swash', '2003-01-16 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(192610, 10909, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty stream and valley.  I am assuming that''s low clouds/haze and that you wanted in the photo.  (Bet you''re getting "use a haze filter" comments!)   But did you really want the two sun flares?  (If not, try shading the front of the lens from above, might help some, or a different angle shot).  7 Swash</td>', 'Pretty stream and valley.  I am assuming that''s low clouds/haze and that you wanted in the photo.  (Bet you''re getting "use a haze filter" comments!)   But did you really want the two sun flares?  (If not, try shading the front of the lens from above, might help some, or a different angle shot).  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 12:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(192612, 10777, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2003-01-16 12:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(192613, 11020, 4514, '<td valign="top">THe colors in the background are better then in the forground.  Something does appear to be missing. <br/></td>', 'THe colors in the background are better then in the forground.  Something does appear to be missing. ', '2003-01-16 12:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192614, 11035, 1005, '<td valign="top">Referring to the title, I see a few patches of blue sky, but no  sun rays.  It''s a bit hazy, but could be clouds in the way.  Combo shot - landscape/city scape.  In a way, I like this thought, sort of human encrochment (sp).  The dull-ness (caused by clouds/haze/pollution) takes away some of the drama I think this shot could portray.  7 Swash</td>', 'Referring to the title, I see a few patches of blue sky, but no  sun rays.  It''s a bit hazy, but could be clouds in the way.  Combo shot - landscape/city scape.  In a way, I like this thought, sort of human encrochment (sp).  The dull-ness (caused by clouds/haze/pollution) takes away some of the drama I think this shot could portray.  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 13:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(192615, 10784, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset!  Very nice!  (sorry, but ugly telephone poles/wires)  I really like the red mountains in the background.  Suggestion - re-crop just below the dark sillhouette line (removes the street lights, etc.)  and move around, stand in a truck bed (get above/away from the poles/wires).  7 Swash</td>', 'Pretty sunset!  Very nice!  (sorry, but ugly telephone poles/wires)  I really like the red mountains in the background.  Suggestion - re-crop just below the dark sillhouette line (removes the street lights, etc.)  and move around, stand in a truck bed (get above/away from the poles/wires).  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 13:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(192616, 10944, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Nice combination of landscape, city scape and people.  I just realized that the beach extends across the whole picture is is full up crowded the entire length!  Wow, that''s alot of people on the beach!  Nice puffy clouds!  Good color.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very pretty.  Nice combination of landscape, city scape and people.  I just realized that the beach extends across the whole picture is is full up crowded the entire length!  Wow, that''s alot of people on the beach!  Nice puffy clouds!  Good color.  8 Swash', '2003-01-16 13:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(192617, 10833, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ohh my!  This is really nice!  Nice concept, good eye to spot it.  I think it would have been more effective w/o the woods on the left, but I''m not asking you to cut down a forest!  I really like the sun shining through the trees and their shadows!  Very nice!  Strong 8.  Swash</td>', 'Ohh my!  This is really nice!  Nice concept, good eye to spot it.  I think it would have been more effective w/o the woods on the left, but I''m not asking you to cut down a forest!  I really like the sun shining through the trees and their shadows!  Very nice!  Strong 8.  Swash', '2003-01-16 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(192618, 10904, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.</td>', 'Very Nice.', '2003-01-16 13:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(192619, 10863, 1005, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this has many elements that I really enjoy!  Colorful sunset, neat sillhouette of a twisted tree.  As I ponder this shot, it seems to me this would be a very hard shot to "get just right".  I think you did about as good as possible with this lighting and subject matter.  I want the tree to "stand out", well it does (I always want more!).  This one is tough to score!  7 Swash</td>', 'Oh my, this has many elements that I really enjoy!  Colorful sunset, neat sillhouette of a twisted tree.  As I ponder this shot, it seems to me this would be a very hard shot to "get just right".  I think you did about as good as possible with this lighting and subject matter.  I want the tree to "stand out", well it does (I always want more!).  This one is tough to score!  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 13:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(192620, 10953, 5212, '<td valign="top">I would change nothing about this photo, except maybe a slight increase in gamma.   beautiful, 8</td>', 'I would change nothing about this photo, except maybe a slight increase in gamma.   beautiful, 8', '2003-01-16 13:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(192621, 11010, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, this has some very cool (personal favorite) elements!  Rainbow, frozen stuff (in the foreground no less!), water (lots of water) and a pretty sky.  What''s not to like?  9 Swash</td>', 'Wow, this has some very cool (personal favorite) elements!  Rainbow, frozen stuff (in the foreground no less!), water (lots of water) and a pretty sky.  What''s not to like?  9 Swash', '2003-01-16 13:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192622, 10995, 5212, '<td valign="top">I love the angle of the lighting in this photo, really brings out the colors in the rocks.  Maybe a little more dof might have clarified the background a bit, but I really like the beauty of the rocks, so maybe that was intentional.</td>', 'I love the angle of the lighting in this photo, really brings out the colors in the rocks.  Maybe a little more dof might have clarified the background a bit, but I really like the beauty of the rocks, so maybe that was intentional.', '2003-01-16 13:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(192623, 10969, 5212, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this to be rotated to the left some.  Nice shot, anyway,.</td>', 'I would have liked this to be rotated to the left some.  Nice shot, anyway,.', '2003-01-16 13:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(192624, 10882, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, really like the foreground grasses!  This is a pretty small view, hard to tell on quality issues like focus.  I need more, please.  Score 6 for now.  Swash</td>', 'Neat shot, really like the foreground grasses!  This is a pretty small view, hard to tell on quality issues like focus.  I need more, please.  Score 6 for now.  Swash', '2003-01-16 13:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(192625, 10963, 1005, '<td valign="top">Bumpy!  I like it!  I''d have been O.K. with just the bumps (no fence or far distance), you might have fooled some into thinking these were snow topped mountains (need to leave out the grass, too!)  7 Swash</td>', 'Bumpy!  I like it!  I''d have been O.K. with just the bumps (no fence or far distance), you might have fooled some into thinking these were snow topped mountains (need to leave out the grass, too!)  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 13:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(192626, 10897, 5212, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, wish the artifacts in the sky could have been lessened a bit especially where the light and dark areas of the sky meet.  Maybe a tad increase in gamma to bring out the foreground and detail a bit.  Love the composition and the scenery couldn''t have been prettier.  Good capture!  8</td>', 'Beautiful shot, wish the artifacts in the sky could have been lessened a bit especially where the light and dark areas of the sky meet.  Maybe a tad increase in gamma to bring out the foreground and detail a bit.  Love the composition and the scenery couldn''t have been prettier.  Good capture!  8', '2003-01-16 13:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192627, 11024, 5212, '<td valign="top">Like the color layers and depth.  I would have liked to see some of the sky cropped out for a panoramic effect, if I was to be picky about it.  Although using the rule of thirds, I guess it is ''correct''.  The top of the sky just seems to distract me from the mountain, though.</td>', 'Like the color layers and depth.  I would have liked to see some of the sky cropped out for a panoramic effect, if I was to be picky about it.  Although using the rule of thirds, I guess it is ''correct''.  The top of the sky just seems to distract me from the mountain, though.', '2003-01-16 13:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(192629, 10895, 5212, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the composition and the shadow under the tree, and the mood the colors on the ground and in the sky convey strength, which to me this tree looks worn but still strong on this hill!  Good luck, 9</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the composition and the shadow under the tree, and the mood the colors on the ground and in the sky convey strength, which to me this tree looks worn but still strong on this hill!  Good luck, 9', '2003-01-16 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(192630, 10748, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot, but it''s sooo small!  It''s hard to make out enough detail to address quality issues.  Nice colors, maybe a bit too much foreground.  Show me more, maybe I can squeeze another point for you.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very pretty shot, but it''s sooo small!  It''s hard to make out enough detail to address quality issues.  Nice colors, maybe a bit too much foreground.  Show me more, maybe I can squeeze another point for you.  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 13:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(192631, 10756, 5212, '<td valign="top">This could have been a winner, if I could see those objects (children) in the lower left part.   I love the contrast of light and colors and the composition.</td>', 'This could have been a winner, if I could see those objects (children) in the lower left part.   I love the contrast of light and colors and the composition.', '2003-01-16 13:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(192632, 10733, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute play on words (on purpose, right?) title.  Nice opposing subjects.  Too bad the sky was so grey, to help out with the contrast.  Very soft looking snow.  <br/>Easy 8 Swash!</td>', 'Cute play on words (on purpose, right?) title.  Nice opposing subjects.  Too bad the sky was so grey, to help out with the contrast.  Very soft looking snow.  Easy 8 Swash!', '2003-01-16 13:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(192634, 10894, 5212, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the pole is leaning, but I think I would have liked this better rotated a bit, and with the car and buildings out of the photo, even though they lend some depth.  The complimentary colors are nice.</td>', 'I don''t know if the pole is leaning, but I think I would have liked this better rotated a bit, and with the car and buildings out of the photo, even though they lend some depth.  The complimentary colors are nice.', '2003-01-16 13:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(192635, 10914, 5212, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and contrast, wish the sky had less  noise.  It would have been nice to have been able to capture the top of the tree, too for my taste.</td>', 'Love the colors and contrast, wish the sky had less  noise.  It would have been nice to have been able to capture the top of the tree, too for my taste.', '2003-01-16 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(192636, 10870, 5212, '<td valign="top">I  wish this had a bit more of a focal point in it.  Maybe if you had moved right and highlighted that nice evergreen?  It''s a bit busy for me, although I still find it pleasing.</td>', 'I  wish this had a bit more of a focal point in it.  Maybe if you had moved right and highlighted that nice evergreen?  It''s a bit busy for me, although I still find it pleasing.', '2003-01-16 13:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(192637, 10965, 5212, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this rotated right a tad.  The lighting on the snow is pretty and the contrast between the sky and the neutral colors is nice to me.</td>', 'I would have liked this rotated right a tad.  The lighting on the snow is pretty and the contrast between the sky and the neutral colors is nice to me.', '2003-01-16 13:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(192638, 10747, 5212, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this rotated a bit right..  Beautiful colors, reflections, contrast, and sunset.  8</td>', 'I would have liked this rotated a bit right..  Beautiful colors, reflections, contrast, and sunset.  8', '2003-01-16 13:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(192639, 10710, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the curves in teh creek, the bush in the left to frame the shot, adn the contrast in the complimentary colors and the light and dark in the photo.  Might have liked it lightened up a bit or an increase in mid and high levels, if it didn''t get blown out.  8</td>', 'Great shot, love the curves in teh creek, the bush in the left to frame the shot, adn the contrast in the complimentary colors and the light and dark in the photo.  Might have liked it lightened up a bit or an increase in mid and high levels, if it didn''t get blown out.  8', '2003-01-16 13:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(192640, 10854, 5212, '<td valign="top">The white buds seem a little blown out in exposure.  Too bad there were buildings in the background.  Like the reflection and the blossoms floating and the kitty for interest and perspective.</td>', 'The white buds seem a little blown out in exposure.  Too bad there were buildings in the background.  Like the reflection and the blossoms floating and the kitty for interest and perspective.', '2003-01-16 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(192641, 10901, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, composition and use of contrast.</td>', 'Nice focus, composition and use of contrast.', '2003-01-16 13:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192642, 10702, 5212, '<td valign="top">Like the sharp focus in the grass, use of thirds.</td>', 'Like the sharp focus in the grass, use of thirds.', '2003-01-16 13:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(192643, 10850, 5964, '<td valign="top">That is a beautiful shot, I really liked the level where you placed the trees,  There doesn''t seem to be too much sky due top the 2 tall trees. The only thing I don''t like about the shot is the sun is tooooo bright I have a hard time looking at the picture on my monitor.7.</td>', 'That is a beautiful shot, I really liked the level where you placed the trees,  There doesn''t seem to be too much sky due top the 2 tall trees. The only thing I don''t like about the shot is the sun is tooooo bright I have a hard time looking at the picture on my monitor.7.', '2003-01-16 13:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(192644, 10862, 5212, '<td valign="top">The sky helps make this scene look colder, like the curves and straight lines accentuated by the inclusion of the roads, and the depth of field.  Like the fence shadows, too on the snow.  It all looks a bit dark to me, though.</td>', 'The sky helps make this scene look colder, like the curves and straight lines accentuated by the inclusion of the roads, and the depth of field.  Like the fence shadows, too on the snow.  It all looks a bit dark to me, though.', '2003-01-16 13:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(192645, 10753, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but would have liked to see more "land objects" in a landscape.</td>', 'Nice photo, but would have liked to see more "land objects" in a landscape.', '2003-01-16 13:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(192646, 10837, 472, '<td valign="top">i would have suggested crouching down lower to try to get that tree on the left up into the sky for more drama and separation from the bg.</td>', 'i would have suggested crouching down lower to try to get that tree on the left up into the sky for more drama and separation from the bg.', '2003-01-16 13:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192647, 10906, 5212, '<td valign="top">Wow, it looks like those buildings on the edges are leaning!!  Very nice use of composition, contrast and complimentary colors, though.  Wish those spots in the upper and lower  right could have been a bit less bold.</td>', 'Wow, it looks like those buildings on the edges are leaning!!  Very nice use of composition, contrast and complimentary colors, though.  Wish those spots in the upper and lower  right could have been a bit less bold.', '2003-01-16 13:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(192648, 10742, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a tranquil scene!  I like it except for the branch in the right foreground.  Not that you could have helped it....</td>', 'What a tranquil scene!  I like it except for the branch in the right foreground.  Not that you could have helped it....', '2003-01-16 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192649, 11020, 472, '<td valign="top">good classic type shot.  2 nits: a little bit soft on the focus.. you might have focused on the distance, rendering the foreground blurry, and the other thing is that tree is centered in the frame.  would have been better a bit more to the left.</td>', 'good classic type shot.  2 nits: a little bit soft on the focus.. you might have focused on the distance, rendering the foreground blurry, and the other thing is that tree is centered in the frame.  would have been better a bit more to the left.', '2003-01-16 13:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(192650, 11011, 5212, '<td valign="top">The hawk certainly adds interest and I like the contast of the rocks to the weedy areas.</td>', 'The hawk certainly adds interest and I like the contast of the rocks to the weedy areas.', '2003-01-16 13:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(192651, 10852, 1379, '<td valign="top">Such detail!  Your photo blows my mind.  I think your choice of border really enhances this already stunning photo.  Incredible.</td>', 'Such detail!  Your photo blows my mind.  I think your choice of border really enhances this already stunning photo.  Incredible.', '2003-01-16 13:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(192652, 10798, 5964, '<td valign="top">I really like the dynamics of this shot, where the horizon was placed &amp; where the prominent outcropping is.Some may think that there is too much sky/empty space, but i really like it in this case. It looks kind of funny with just one little cloud in the sky though.7.</td>', 'I really like the dynamics of this shot, where the horizon was placed & where the prominent outcropping is.Some may think that there is too much sky/empty space, but i really like it in this case. It looks kind of funny with just one little cloud in the sky though.7.', '2003-01-16 13:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192653, 10799, 472, '<td valign="top">stunning.  the old timey feel is great.  the composition and sharpness are also great.</td>', 'stunning.  the old timey feel is great.  the composition and sharpness are also great.', '2003-01-16 13:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192655, 10859, 472, '<td valign="top">focus more on our foreground to reduce blur.  fg blur is more distracting than bg most of the time.</td>', 'focus more on our foreground to reduce blur.  fg blur is more distracting than bg most of the time.', '2003-01-16 13:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(192657, 10751, 5212, '<td valign="top">Wish this could have been lightened up a bit without ruining the sky.  It also looks like it might have used a little rotation to the left.  I love the lighting on the homes on the bluff, the waves and the sky.  Maybe a little bit of gamma increase??  It''s a very pretty photo, anyway.</td>', 'Wish this could have been lightened up a bit without ruining the sky.  It also looks like it might have used a little rotation to the left.  I love the lighting on the homes on the bluff, the waves and the sky.  Maybe a little bit of gamma increase??  It''s a very pretty photo, anyway.', '2003-01-16 13:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(192658, 11020, 1379, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking....  I would have like to see less of the tree in the foreground, though, although it does lend itself to emphasizing the distance of the mountains.  What a lovely scene!</td>', 'Breathtaking....  I would have like to see less of the tree in the foreground, though, although it does lend itself to emphasizing the distance of the mountains.  What a lovely scene!', '2003-01-16 13:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(192659, 10816, 472, '<td valign="top">looks great.  with some really good sharpness this would be a winner.  tripod or unsharp mask?</td>', 'looks great.  with some really good sharpness this would be a winner.  tripod or unsharp mask?', '2003-01-16 13:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
