(192662, 10919, 472, '<td valign="top">interesting image. has focus issues.</td>', 'interesting image. has focus issues.', '2003-01-16 13:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(192663, 10862, 472, '<td valign="top">good detail. feels a little centered and close to the barn for me.</td>', 'good detail. feels a little centered and close to the barn for me.', '2003-01-16 13:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192664, 10811, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat photo, but (sorry) slightly off the challenge idea.  Nice sunset in the background.  I think the mast coming out of the line of boats seems like an unfortunate placement (it just looks wrong to have mast coming out of a dingy''s nose).  A strange idea:  get closer to a boat and get the sunset reflection in it''s side... maybe too strange.  Sorry, 5 Swash</td>', 'Neat photo, but (sorry) slightly off the challenge idea.  Nice sunset in the background.  I think the mast coming out of the line of boats seems like an unfortunate placement (it just looks wrong to have mast coming out of a dingy''s nose).  A strange idea:  get closer to a boat and get the sunset reflection in it''s side... maybe too strange.  Sorry, 5 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(192665, 10798, 472, '<td valign="top">lovely.  there''s just a few sharpness issues here.  and i wonder why you lost the rich color of the vegetation?  nice feel to this one.</td>', 'lovely.  there''s just a few sharpness issues here.  and i wonder why you lost the rich color of the vegetation?  nice feel to this one.', '2003-01-16 14:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(192666, 10984, 472, '<td valign="top">this is very very pretty. could be a hair sharper. people are prolly knocking it for not being a ''landscape'' but it works for me :)</td>', 'this is very very pretty. could be a hair sharper. people are prolly knocking it for not being a ''landscape'' but it works for me :)', '2003-01-16 14:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(192667, 10906, 472, '<td valign="top">wonderful. it is like a postcard.</td>', 'wonderful. it is like a postcard.', '2003-01-16 14:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192668, 11018, 472, '<td valign="top">i''d like to see the horizon higher (top 3rd of frame) and more foreground.  or consequently, if the sky was amazing, put horizon at bottom 3rd.</td>', 'i''d like to see the horizon higher (top 3rd of frame) and more foreground.  or consequently, if the sky was amazing, put horizon at bottom 3rd.', '2003-01-16 14:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(192669, 10854, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Looks like I see two kitties, right?  (the one I think is there is very close in color to it''s background, hard to see it)  The stuff on the pond''s surface obscures the neat reflection (I know you can''t do anything about that, but it does).  The tree blooming in the background is nice, but further back is a building that I could have lived without.  Good color, details seem less than crisp.  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot.  Looks like I see two kitties, right?  (the one I think is there is very close in color to it''s background, hard to see it)  The stuff on the pond''s surface obscures the neat reflection (I know you can''t do anything about that, but it does).  The tree blooming in the background is nice, but further back is a building that I could have lived without.  Good color, details seem less than crisp.  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192670, 10929, 472, '<td valign="top">oh my, this is the best one i''ve seen so far.  everything is present in this picture, except possible, a time of day where the light is more dramatic.</td>', 'oh my, this is the best one i''ve seen so far.  everything is present in this picture, except possible, a time of day where the light is more dramatic.', '2003-01-16 14:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(192671, 10917, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful abstract.  hang this one on your wall.</td>', 'beautiful abstract.  hang this one on your wall.', '2003-01-16 14:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192672, 11028, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Sharp photo with lots of great color.  Good amount of blue sky.  Did the falls disappear below the rock in front -  or - could you have shot over that rock?  I''d like to see more of the waterfall.  Still, all in all, this is very nice.  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  Sharp photo with lots of great color.  Good amount of blue sky.  Did the falls disappear below the rock in front -  or - could you have shot over that rock?  I''d like to see more of the waterfall.  Still, all in all, this is very nice.  9 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(192673, 10908, 472, '<td valign="top">incredible image. the foreground mist and clouds really add.</td>', 'incredible image. the foreground mist and clouds really add.', '2003-01-16 14:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(192674, 10901, 472, '<td valign="top">an incredible natural formation. great sharpness.  would have liked to see more fo the surrounding environment but then you might have lost the detail of the icicles.</td>', 'an incredible natural formation. great sharpness.  would have liked to see more fo the surrounding environment but then you might have lost the detail of the icicles.', '2003-01-16 14:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(192675, 10821, 472, '<td valign="top">wow!  a stunning composition.  Egypt? my wife was there last week.  the only thing that''s lacking for me is image sharpness here.  was this handheld?</td>', 'wow!  a stunning composition.  Egypt? my wife was there last week.  the only thing that''s lacking for me is image sharpness here.  was this handheld?', '2003-01-16 14:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(192676, 10919, 1379, '<td valign="top">This is a really moody, desolate shot, that is really quite stirring.   It actually took me a moment to realize that it''s b/w.  I initially thought it was just a really gloomy, gray scene!</td>', 'This is a really moody, desolate shot, that is really quite stirring.   It actually took me a moment to realize that it''s b/w.  I initially thought it was just a really gloomy, gray scene!', '2003-01-16 14:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
