(192679, 10993, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  A tad hazy in the distance, but I like the idea.  Suggestion:  could you saturate the greens and blues more (to fake out the haze).  8 Swash</td>', 'Very nice shot!  A tad hazy in the distance, but I like the idea.  Suggestion:  could you saturate the greens and blues more (to fake out the haze).  8 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
