(192683, 10818, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!   I like the contrast between the rushing water and the calm of the reflecting pool above it.  (Hint:  natural shots seem more natural w/o man made items in them, no score effect)  8 Swash</td>', 'Very nice!   I like the contrast between the rushing water and the calm of the reflecting pool above it.  (Hint:  natural shots seem more natural w/o man made items in them, no score effect)  8 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
