(192690, 10822, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, nice reflection.  It''s more city scape/architecture than landscape, but that''s splitting hairs, who knows, maybe you can''t get "out" of the city.  Colors seem dim (crank up the saturation! esp. the green and blue)  7 Swash</td>', 'Interesting view, nice reflection.  It''s more city scape/architecture than landscape, but that''s splitting hairs, who knows, maybe you can''t get "out" of the city.  Colors seem dim (crank up the saturation! esp. the green and blue)  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(192691, 10835, 5212, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the composition, lighting and reflections as well as the dark landscape against the flaming sky.  The only thing I would change about this shot is a bit less grain in the sky.  9</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the composition, lighting and reflections as well as the dark landscape against the flaming sky.  The only thing I would change about this shot is a bit less grain in the sky.  9', '2003-01-16 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
