(192696, 10794, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice rainbow!  I really like the far background and to me, the haziness just makes it seem more distant, but the foreground just isn''t my cup o tea.    (Maybe try cropping just above the line of the field?)  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice rainbow!  I really like the far background and to me, the haziness just makes it seem more distant, but the foreground just isn''t my cup o tea.    (Maybe try cropping just above the line of the field?)  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(192697, 11006, 1379, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Your border really enhances this, I think, although it''s a bit dark.  The snow on the mountains is really lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Your border really enhances this, I think, although it''s a bit dark.  The snow on the mountains is really lovely.', '2003-01-16 14:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(192701, 10893, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The couple and pampus grass on the left is a nice touch, nicely sillhouetted (well, almost sillhouetted!)  Too bad about the sun flare just below them, but it''s not horribly noticable.  Nice yellows and grays.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  The couple and pampus grass on the left is a nice touch, nicely sillhouetted (well, almost sillhouetted!)  Too bad about the sun flare just below them, but it''s not horribly noticable.  Nice yellows and grays.  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(192703, 10976, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, good contrasts in the foreground, but I really love the moss hanging down from the trees (though barely visible in this shot).  Sorry, but what did this look like in color?  Much of the farther details just aren''t very visible.  7 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot, good contrasts in the foreground, but I really love the moss hanging down from the trees (though barely visible in this shot).  Sorry, but what did this look like in color?  Much of the farther details just aren''t very visible.  7 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(192704, 10716, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice foggy sand dunes.  I like the grass in the foreground.  Not alot of drama or interest.  The heavy fog dims the color, too.  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice foggy sand dunes.  I like the grass in the foreground.  Not alot of drama or interest.  The heavy fog dims the color, too.  6 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(192705, 10714, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, as if the road just disappears.  Is this black and white?  Sorry to ask, but the blue-ish (almost purple)  tint makes me wonder......7 Swash</td>', 'I like your idea, as if the road just disappears.  Is this black and white?  Sorry to ask, but the blue-ish (almost purple)  tint makes me wonder......7 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(192707, 10704, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  (the nearer boats seem to have water in them, did you bale them out?)  Neat old bridge.  I like the branches hanging on the right, too.  How does one access the boats parked under the bridge?  8 Swash</td>', 'Very nice.  (the nearer boats seem to have water in them, did you bale them out?)  Neat old bridge.  I like the branches hanging on the right, too.  How does one access the boats parked under the bridge?  8 Swash', '2003-01-16 14:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(192745, 10855, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is totally awesome.  I love the way you added some depth to it with the plant in the foreground, and this picture makes me think of an Ansel Adams.  Awesome!  Also this photo would not have been as cool without the texture at the bottom of the page in the (sand?)  Very well done!  One of my 10''s for the week.  Congrats and good luck!</td>', 'This is totally awesome.  I love the way you added some depth to it with the plant in the foreground, and this picture makes me think of an Ansel Adams.  Awesome!  Also this photo would not have been as cool without the texture at the bottom of the page in the (sand?)  Very well done!  One of my 10''s for the week.  Congrats and good luck!', '2003-01-16 15:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192746, 10838, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely gorgeous!  I love how the reflection is centered so they both come out of the middle and I love your use of blue border and then white as well, it really adds to the photo.  Amazing how blue the water is compared to the sky, thats really neat!  Did you use a polarizing filter on this.  Excellent job on your exposure, that can be really tough with the white.  -10-  Good luck!</td>', 'This is absolutely gorgeous!  I love how the reflection is centered so they both come out of the middle and I love your use of blue border and then white as well, it really adds to the photo.  Amazing how blue the water is compared to the sky, thats really neat!  Did you use a polarizing filter on this.  Excellent job on your exposure, that can be really tough with the white.  -10-  Good luck!', '2003-01-16 15:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192748, 10910, 3575, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to find out where this photo was taken!</td>', 'I can''t wait to find out where this photo was taken!', '2003-01-16 15:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192752, 10862, 4967, '<td valign="top">When I saw the thumbnail of this I thought, wow cool, it looks like a painting... then when I made it bigger I still thought it looked pretty neat, but I also saw a few minor problems with it that really bother me.  For one, I think the angle you took this at kind of gave it a tilted look.  Also I''m not sure the horizon is completely straight... Turning this in photoshop or a similar program might have helped with that.  I don''t mind the fact that you have the roadsign or the road in there... they add the modern look... but maybe you should have worked to keep from shooting the telephone pole coming out of the right side of the barn or house... that is fairly disturbing to me.  Otherwise this is a really cool photo, and I gave it a 7.  Good luck!</td>', 'When I saw the thumbnail of this I thought, wow cool, it looks like a painting... then when I made it bigger I still thought it looked pretty neat, but I also saw a few minor problems with it that really bother me.  For one, I think the angle you took this at kind of gave it a tilted look.  Also I''m not sure the horizon is completely straight... Turning this in photoshop or a similar program might have helped with that.  I don''t mind the fact that you have the roadsign or the road in there... they add the modern look... but maybe you should have worked to keep from shooting the telephone pole coming out of the right side of the barn or house... that is fairly disturbing to me.  Otherwise this is a really cool photo, and I gave it a 7.  Good luck!', '2003-01-16 15:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192758, 10831, 3575, '<td valign="top">I like how you included the tree and the rocks in your landscape shot. It adds dimension and interest.</td>', 'I like how you included the tree and the rocks in your landscape shot. It adds dimension and interest.', '2003-01-16 15:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192764, 10917, 1906, '<td valign="top">this is a realy cool shot. great use of lines and light.</td>', 'this is a realy cool shot. great use of lines and light.', '2003-01-16 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(192765, 10746, 3575, '<td valign="top">What colors! It''s odd  that the sky is so white and the water so blue. A wonderful scene.</td>', 'What colors! It''s odd  that the sky is so white and the water so blue. A wonderful scene.', '2003-01-16 15:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(192766, 10980, 1019, '<td valign="top">Lovely grainy gritty feel and good contrasts in the layers of trees</td>', 'Lovely grainy gritty feel and good contrasts in the layers of trees', '2003-01-16 15:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(192769, 10948, 3575, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous! I love the light. The light in the foreground tree is incredible. The sky is a little grainy so I give you a 9</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous! I love the light. The light in the foreground tree is incredible. The sky is a little grainy so I give you a 9', '2003-01-16 15:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(192770, 11010, 3575, '<td valign="top">You made me cry! 10!</td>', 'You made me cry! 10!', '2003-01-16 16:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(192776, 10788, 3575, '<td valign="top">I can\''t believe the amazing photographs I\''m seeing this time. I\''m humbled. First of all, the colors are surreal and even more so with the long exposure on the tide. -10</td>', 'I can\''t believe the amazing photographs I\''m seeing this time. I\''m humbled. First of all, the colors are surreal and even more so with the long exposure on the tide. -10', '2003-01-16 16:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(192778, 10702, 3575, '<td valign="top">This is amazing! The colors and the hard edge between the grass and the sky makes it look manufactured but of course, it isn''t. I love the two little trees just sitting on the edge. Wonderful find, wonderful photo.</td>', 'This is amazing! The colors and the hard edge between the grass and the sky makes it look manufactured but of course, it isn''t. I love the two little trees just sitting on the edge. Wonderful find, wonderful photo.', '2003-01-16 16:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(192779, 10725, 6263, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but there is a rose color cast over the whole pic which I think should have been corrected (yes, I have a fully calibrated monitor).</td>', 'I like the composition but there is a rose color cast over the whole pic which I think should have been corrected (yes, I have a fully calibrated monitor).', '2003-01-16 16:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(192780, 10714, 6263, '<td valign="top">I like the composition... too bad the most noticeable horizon appears almost half-way but at least you composed around the tree.  The rise in the road is a nice touch.</td>', 'I like the composition... too bad the most noticeable horizon appears almost half-way but at least you composed around the tree.  The rise in the road is a nice touch.', '2003-01-16 16:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(192782, 10852, 6263, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the lunar landscape, good sharpening, I would have framed it differently - too stark with the B&amp;W frame.  Just my tastes...</td>', 'Excellent capture of the lunar landscape, good sharpening, I would have framed it differently - too stark with the B&W frame.  Just my tastes...', '2003-01-16 16:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
