(192789, 10821, 6263, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the two domes - one natural, one manmade.  Pic could have been sharpened more.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the two domes - one natural, one manmade.  Pic could have been sharpened more.', '2003-01-16 16:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
