(192794, 10977, 6263, '<td valign="top">Yes, I like this.  Living in the great white north of Canada, I know this type of landscape.  You''ve done well with the focus on the tree in the foreground, but enough of the old barn in focus to get a feeling of depth.  I can feel the cold wind in this picture.</td>', 'Yes, I like this.  Living in the great white north of Canada, I know this type of landscape.  You''ve done well with the focus on the tree in the foreground, but enough of the old barn in focus to get a feeling of depth.  I can feel the cold wind in this picture.', '2003-01-16 16:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
