(192796, 10930, 6263, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I''m not crazy about the lake horizon being at the 50/50 point, other than that, a good shot.</td>', 'I really like this.  I''m not crazy about the lake horizon being at the 50/50 point, other than that, a good shot.', '2003-01-16 16:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
