(192986, 10764, 1135, '<td valign="top">I would suggest that you us the available 640 pixels to make your photo bigger, this photo is only 518 pixels wide. Nice composition. Good Job.</td>', 'I would suggest that you us the available 640 pixels to make your photo bigger, this photo is only 518 pixels wide. Nice composition. Good Job.', '2003-01-16 20:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(192988, 10746, 1135, '<td valign="top">Hey, I''ve been there. One of the most beautiful spots on the earth. Do you live in Hawaii or were you lucky enough to be there the week of the challenge? Nice shot!</td>', 'Hey, I''ve been there. One of the most beautiful spots on the earth. Do you live in Hawaii or were you lucky enough to be there the week of the challenge? Nice shot!', '2003-01-16 20:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(192991, 11007, 4162, '<td valign="top">What a strong Picture, I love IR and you have done a great job with it!</td>', 'What a strong Picture, I love IR and you have done a great job with it!', '2003-01-16 20:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(192995, 10831, 2352, '<td valign="top">Ewww NICE!  I love the sharp focus and color of the tree with the beautiful mountain colors.  The rocks in front create a beautiful base for the shot and bring the eyes forward, as the snow takes the eyes to the back.  A technically superior shot!  Congratulations.</td>', 'Ewww NICE!  I love the sharp focus and color of the tree with the beautiful mountain colors.  The rocks in front create a beautiful base for the shot and bring the eyes forward, as the snow takes the eyes to the back.  A technically superior shot!  Congratulations.', '2003-01-16 21:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(192997, 11006, 3447, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph of that scenic landscape.  The unrelieved heavy black border does not help.  Suggest first a narrow snowwhite borderline, then pick up the dark earthtone from the foothills as a wider border.  JEM</td>', 'Excellent photograph of that scenic landscape.  The unrelieved heavy black border does not help.  Suggest first a narrow snowwhite borderline, then pick up the dark earthtone from the foothills as a wider border.  JEM', '2003-01-16 21:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(192999, 10882, 5898, '<td valign="top">Great point of view,  composition, depth of field...If you would have pushed your ASA/ISO to it''s max, then you could have shot at a faster speed which would have stopped the moving of the grass, and you still would have been able to use  your F22/F26 aperture setting to have the depth of field you wanted. Excellent eye, good luck, JG</td>', 'Great point of view,  composition, depth of field...If you would have pushed your ASA/ISO to it''s max, then you could have shot at a faster speed which would have stopped the moving of the grass, and you still would have been able to use  your F22/F26 aperture setting to have the depth of field you wanted. Excellent eye, good luck, JG', '2003-01-16 21:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193000, 10902, 3447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Nice composition.', '2003-01-16 21:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193001, 10941, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful, lovely picture.</td>', 'This is so beautiful, lovely picture.', '2003-01-16 21:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(193002, 10814, 2352, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderfil shot!  the shadow in front is a partner to the mountain shadows.  The light against the tree and just behind it is perfect.  Nice crop and crisp focus!  Congratulation on an excellent shot!</td>', 'This is a wonderfil shot!  the shadow in front is a partner to the mountain shadows.  The light against the tree and just behind it is perfect.  Nice crop and crisp focus!  Congratulation on an excellent shot!', '2003-01-16 21:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(193003, 10903, 2823, '<td valign="top">calming...</td>', 'calming...', '2003-01-16 21:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193006, 10788, 2352, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!  I wish it had something to focus on as the main subject though.  The light in front does not really bring out the colors of the rocks and water.  Perhaps just a hint of flash would have helped bring something out in front.</td>', 'Beautiful colors!  I wish it had something to focus on as the main subject though.  The light in front does not really bring out the colors of the rocks and water.  Perhaps just a hint of flash would have helped bring something out in front.', '2003-01-16 21:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(193007, 10711, 4162, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, looks like it could be in France.  I think that the building is too central, maybe a bit more to the left would have been good.</td>', 'Beautiful colours, looks like it could be in France.  I think that the building is too central, maybe a bit more to the left would have been good.', '2003-01-16 21:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(193009, 11026, 3447, '<td valign="top">Richard?  Was this a tank to feed a water trough for cattle?</td>', 'Richard?  Was this a tank to feed a water trough for cattle?', '2003-01-16 21:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(193010, 10946, 5898, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you could have gotten closer to your subject, but much of the foreground is very distracting to the beauty of this picture. There is also several things on the right which are distracting as well. The lighting could also have been better. I''m sure you were trying to capture the sunset with the masts as your point of interest which is very eye catching and a beautiful sight. Good luck.</td>', 'I don''t know if you could have gotten closer to your subject, but much of the foreground is very distracting to the beauty of this picture. There is also several things on the right which are distracting as well. The lighting could also have been better. I''m sure you were trying to capture the sunset with the masts as your point of interest which is very eye catching and a beautiful sight. Good luck.', '2003-01-16 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(193011, 10912, 4049, '<td valign="top">Wow, great colors and light! Looks so exciting, I want to go to NYC.</td>', 'Wow, great colors and light! Looks so exciting, I want to go to NYC.', '2003-01-16 21:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193012, 10962, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love the almost watercolour feel to this (no pun intended!)  Lovely colours here.  Good Luck! Very original, how did you get this effect?</td>', 'I love the almost watercolour feel to this (no pun intended!)  Lovely colours here.  Good Luck! Very original, how did you get this effect?', '2003-01-16 21:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(193013, 10770, 4338, '<td valign="top">great colors...awesome pic</td>', 'great colors...awesome pic', '2003-01-16 21:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
