(193016, 10948, 4338, '<td valign="top">looks like too much unsharp mask was used...the edges of the tree in the foreground take away from the pic. nice job on framing and composition.</td>', 'looks like too much unsharp mask was used...the edges of the tree in the foreground take away from the pic. nice job on framing and composition.', '2003-01-16 21:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193017, 10999, 5898, '<td valign="top">This is not the most striking of all the pictures but it is one of my favorites because I appreciate the photographer who shoots in light that is not perfect. Great composition! It''s  starts with the tree, then your eye drops to the muddy tracks, which leads to the hilly background which takes you back to the tree. All this surrounds the fog making it a great picture. I hope everyone appreciates it as much as I did.</td>', 'This is not the most striking of all the pictures but it is one of my favorites because I appreciate the photographer who shoots in light that is not perfect. Great composition! It''s  starts with the tree, then your eye drops to the muddy tracks, which leads to the hilly background which takes you back to the tree. All this surrounds the fog making it a great picture. I hope everyone appreciates it as much as I did.', '2003-01-16 21:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193019, 11019, 5898, '<td valign="top">With the right light, even artificial that ice could have really dazzled the viewer. Good luck,JG</td>', 'With the right light, even artificial that ice could have really dazzled the viewer. Good luck,JG', '2003-01-16 21:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193024, 10953, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Did you try a slower shutter speed? I used 1/5 of a second on this photo:<br/>www.pbase.com/rcrawford/waterfall<br/>I think it worked well. Give it a try. Good Job.</td>', 'Nice shot. Did you try a slower shutter speed? I used 1/5 of a second on this photo:www.pbase.com/rcrawford/waterfallI think it worked well. Give it a try. Good Job.', '2003-01-16 21:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
