(193035, 10907, 5898, '<td valign="top">Less sky and more foreground, try the same shot and this time lay down on the ground and see what you''d get...I think you''ll like the shot...Good luck</td>', 'Less sky and more foreground, try the same shot and this time lay down on the ground and see what you''d get...I think you''ll like the shot...Good luck', '2003-01-16 21:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(193036, 11000, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting effect (coloured flower, black and white background) although it doesn''t seem to fit the landscape challenge very well.</td>', 'It''s an interesting effect (coloured flower, black and white background) although it doesn''t seem to fit the landscape challenge very well.', '2003-01-16 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(193038, 10854, 1647, '<td valign="top">The house roof in the background for some reason grabs my attention and makes me think this is a backyard.  Also, because it''s such a close shot it looks more like a wide shot of the cat rather than a landscape.  On the plus side, colours and exposure are pretty good, especially for what looks like an average day in terms of weather.</td>', 'The house roof in the background for some reason grabs my attention and makes me think this is a backyard.  Also, because it''s such a close shot it looks more like a wide shot of the cat rather than a landscape.  On the plus side, colours and exposure are pretty good, especially for what looks like an average day in terms of weather.', '2003-01-16 21:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193039, 10882, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately there isn''t a lot of colour in this photo.  It also seems quite small - was there a reason for not making it larger?  I might have considered holding the camera a little higher and showing the grass heading towards the lighthouse, to show it towering about the flat ground.</td>', 'Unfortunately there isn''t a lot of colour in this photo.  It also seems quite small - was there a reason for not making it larger?  I might have considered holding the camera a little higher and showing the grass heading towards the lighthouse, to show it towering about the flat ground.', '2003-01-16 21:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193040, 11044, 5898, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast in textures of the water and stones. The composition is very good, and the dark rich colors of the trees on the left makes for a very striking picture. The sky does nothing for the picture, and distracts from the overall image. Still, you have have a very good eye for the natural beauty of your surroundings. Good luck.</td>', 'I love the contrast in textures of the water and stones. The composition is very good, and the dark rich colors of the trees on the left makes for a very striking picture. The sky does nothing for the picture, and distracts from the overall image. Still, you have have a very good eye for the natural beauty of your surroundings. Good luck.', '2003-01-16 21:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(193041, 10716, 1647, '<td valign="top">Is it deliberately untitled?  Perhaps you could have called it "vanishing landscape" or something?  Unfortunately I have little else to comment on - there is a lot of grey and not much going on.</td>', 'Is it deliberately untitled?  Perhaps you could have called it "vanishing landscape" or something?  Unfortunately I have little else to comment on - there is a lot of grey and not much going on.', '2003-01-16 22:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193042, 10983, 5898, '<td valign="top">Nice framing with the trees and good use of the available light to catch the reflection. Nice rich colors in the scenery, a shame there is not the same richness in the tower. Good luck JG</td>', 'Nice framing with the trees and good use of the available light to catch the reflection. Nice rich colors in the scenery, a shame there is not the same richness in the tower. Good luck JG', '2003-01-16 22:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193048, 10888, 5898, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the close-up of the tree and the rich colors with just a splatter of brighter colors at the base. Good composition and lighting. Good Luck</td>', 'Very nice, I like the close-up of the tree and the rich colors with just a splatter of brighter colors at the base. Good composition and lighting. Good Luck', '2003-01-16 22:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193054, 10978, 5898, '<td valign="top">Jealousy rears it''s ugly head, a "1". Just kidding. Great view and just enough light on the branches in the lower half of the picture to seperate it from another ho-hum beautiful landscape shot</td>', 'Jealousy rears it''s ugly head, a "1". Just kidding. Great view and just enough light on the branches in the lower half of the picture to seperate it from another ho-hum beautiful landscape shot', '2003-01-16 22:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193058, 10966, 5898, '<td valign="top">Another picture to add to my favorites, I especially love the dark background that contrasts so dramatically with the delicate foreground. Beautiful!</td>', 'Another picture to add to my favorites, I especially love the dark background that contrasts so dramatically with the delicate foreground. Beautiful!', '2003-01-16 22:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
