(193116, 10746, 1019, '<td valign="top">Very dr5amatic--well exposed</td>', 'Very dr5amatic--well exposed', '2003-01-16 23:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(193117, 10941, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That is really really amazing.  Beautiful landscape.  I love everything about this really.  Angle and framing/cropping, focus and clarity, lighting.  Everything.  It''s wonderfully divided.  The sky is beautiful too.  Great color.  Nothing I would like to see differently.  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'Wow.  That is really really amazing.  Beautiful landscape.  I love everything about this really.  Angle and framing/cropping, focus and clarity, lighting.  Everything.  It''s wonderfully divided.  The sky is beautiful too.  Great color.  Nothing I would like to see differently.  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2003-01-16 23:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(193121, 10855, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic image! Curious to see where this photo was taken. Did you shoot in infrared to get such a dark sky? composition, contrast and frame are excellent. Well done!</td>', 'Very dramatic image! Curious to see where this photo was taken. Did you shoot in infrared to get such a dark sky? composition, contrast and frame are excellent. Well done!', '2003-01-17 00:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193122, 10701, 4811, '<td valign="top">You managed to catch a very dramatic sunset - don''t think I''ve ever seen one so yellow. Photo just needs something in the foreground, or some landscape element that''s visible, to improve the photo. It would be nice to see whats being silhoutted in the picture by exposing more of the bottom half of the photo (using a gradual ND filter?, would be nice but not everyone has one of those)</td>', 'You managed to catch a very dramatic sunset - don''t think I''ve ever seen one so yellow. Photo just needs something in the foreground, or some landscape element that''s visible, to improve the photo. It would be nice to see whats being silhoutted in the picture by exposing more of the bottom half of the photo (using a gradual ND filter?, would be nice but not everyone has one of those)', '2003-01-17 00:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(193124, 10725, 4811, '<td valign="top">The trees add a nice touch of symmetry to the photo, and the stone frame adds to the composition nicely. Absence of color in the middle photo seems to contrast well with the earthen tones of the stone frame. This locale must still provide a good photo oppurtunuty during other seasons as well!</td>', 'The trees add a nice touch of symmetry to the photo, and the stone frame adds to the composition nicely. Absence of color in the middle photo seems to contrast well with the earthen tones of the stone frame. This locale must still provide a good photo oppurtunuty during other seasons as well!', '2003-01-17 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(193125, 10756, 4811, '<td valign="top">This looks to be a fantastic photo but unfortunately is a little to small. Wonderful sky!! Sky seems unevenly dark in the left corner, I think I remember reading that by adjusting the polarizer angle (assuming you had a polarizer on for this effect :), you can render the sky all nice and deep blue but also evenly lit...its just of a matter of hitting the right angle. tree, jumpers and horizon all conform to the rule of thirds, making a pleasing arrangement...</td>', 'This looks to be a fantastic photo but unfortunately is a little to small. Wonderful sky!! Sky seems unevenly dark in the left corner, I think I remember reading that by adjusting the polarizer angle (assuming you had a polarizer on for this effect :), you can render the sky all nice and deep blue but also evenly lit...its just of a matter of hitting the right angle. tree, jumpers and horizon all conform to the rule of thirds, making a pleasing arrangement...', '2003-01-17 00:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193131, 10994, 811, '<td valign="top">One of the very few photographs that I have seen where power lines actually ADD to the shot.  The towers anchor it on the right, and the lines lead the eyes to the right.  Nicely done, and great colors, too.</td>', 'One of the very few photographs that I have seen where power lines actually ADD to the shot.  The towers anchor it on the right, and the lines lead the eyes to the right.  Nicely done, and great colors, too.', '2003-01-17 00:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(193133, 10981, 3419, '<td valign="top">A pretty scene, but bright sunlight washes out the hills in the background. Would prefer more contrast there. What strikes me most is the shortage of trees.</td>', 'A pretty scene, but bright sunlight washes out the hills in the background. Would prefer more contrast there. What strikes me most is the shortage of trees.', '2003-01-17 00:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193134, 10978, 3419, '<td valign="top">Like looking out a window. Nice depth of focus, but would different lighting (time of day) would provide more contrast on the mountain in the background?</td>', 'Like looking out a window. Nice depth of focus, but would different lighting (time of day) would provide more contrast on the mountain in the background?', '2003-01-17 00:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193136, 10870, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice texture/detail on the trees. The snow looks a little over-exposed (it takes a lot of practice to capture correctly). I like the suggestion of a little path into the brush, just off center to the left.</td>', 'Nice texture/detail on the trees. The snow looks a little over-exposed (it takes a lot of practice to capture correctly). I like the suggestion of a little path into the brush, just off center to the left.', '2003-01-17 00:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(193137, 10832, 3419, '<td valign="top">Cities look their best when photographed at night. This is a very pretty shot - colors and focus are very nice. Some day I will get around to trying my hand at this.</td>', 'Cities look their best when photographed at night. This is a very pretty shot - colors and focus are very nice. Some day I will get around to trying my hand at this.', '2003-01-17 00:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(193138, 10809, 1863, '<td valign="top">What a lovely photograph, reminds me terribly of London. This must be the most snow it''s had in years. I enjoy the way the trees seem to pull you to the back of the picture with the way they hang over the path you chose. I think it''s a bit crooked.. maybe if you''d had cropped out the first seat? I''m not sure how I would improve on this photo. -Annida</td>', 'What a lovely photograph, reminds me terribly of London. This must be the most snow it''s had in years. I enjoy the way the trees seem to pull you to the back of the picture with the way they hang over the path you chose. I think it''s a bit crooked.. maybe if you''d had cropped out the first seat? I''m not sure how I would improve on this photo. -Annida', '2003-01-17 00:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193139, 10799, 1863, '<td valign="top">A bit bright on the eyes at the top middle/right, and it''s a tiny bit small. It would have looked perhaps a bit better if you had removed the half of the building on the right and made the photo a bit bigger. -Annida</td>', 'A bit bright on the eyes at the top middle/right, and it''s a tiny bit small. It would have looked perhaps a bit better if you had removed the half of the building on the right and made the photo a bit bigger. -Annida', '2003-01-17 00:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193140, 10746, 1863, '<td valign="top">Truly Amazing. Make it longer next time! Maybe from a bit further away, but have a 10 anyway! -Annida</td>', 'Truly Amazing. Make it longer next time! Maybe from a bit further away, but have a 10 anyway! -Annida', '2003-01-17 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(193142, 10711, 3419, '<td valign="top">The gold colors in this are very striking. I like the diagonal line effect of the field in the foreground. I would have cropped some of the sky.</td>', 'The gold colors in this are very striking. I like the diagonal line effect of the field in the foreground. I would have cropped some of the sky.', '2003-01-17 00:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(193144, 10957, 1863, '<td valign="top">Amazing tree, I think this photo would have been sliglty better if you were at a higher angle, and looking down on the tree.. probably impossible which is a shame :) I give you an 8! -Annida</td>', 'Amazing tree, I think this photo would have been sliglty better if you were at a higher angle, and looking down on the tree.. probably impossible which is a shame :) I give you an 8! -Annida', '2003-01-17 00:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193145, 10747, 1863, '<td valign="top">Perhaps one of the most stunning skies in the whole challenge. Have a 10 !! -Annida</td>', 'Perhaps one of the most stunning skies in the whole challenge. Have a 10 !! -Annida', '2003-01-17 00:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193146, 10940, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and peaceful looking. Nice capture of snow detail and shadows. I can''t help feel that this place looks familiar. I know one similar to this in Gravenhurst.</td>', 'Very pretty and peaceful looking. Nice capture of snow detail and shadows. I can''t help feel that this place looks familiar. I know one similar to this in Gravenhurst.', '2003-01-17 00:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193147, 11010, 1863, '<td valign="top">So much blue! It''s definitely a beautiful photo, and the sky is superb. 8! -Annida</td>', 'So much blue! It''s definitely a beautiful photo, and the sky is superb. 8! -Annida', '2003-01-17 00:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(193148, 10893, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very very pretty. The waving grasses and parent/child on the left are a nice touch. Beautiful sunset.</td>', 'Very very pretty. The waving grasses and parent/child on the left are a nice touch. Beautiful sunset.', '2003-01-17 00:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(193149, 10853, 1863, '<td valign="top">It''s such a shame the picture is so small, I''m sure everybody else is writing the same thing! I love your sky, and the composition of the picture, so have an 8! -Annida</td>', 'It''s such a shame the picture is so small, I''m sure everybody else is writing the same thing! I love your sky, and the composition of the picture, so have an 8! -Annida', '2003-01-17 00:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193150, 10835, 1863, '<td valign="top">I love how the rays are pointing up from the mountain in the background. Such a serene and tranquil view! 9! -Annida</td>', 'I love how the rays are pointing up from the mountain in the background. Such a serene and tranquil view! 9! -Annida', '2003-01-17 00:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(193151, 10841, 3419, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t call this a landscape. Barring that, composition is different, but I would like to see more focus on the barnacles in the foreground (they''re blurry).</td>', 'I wouldn''t call this a landscape. Barring that, composition is different, but I would like to see more focus on the barnacles in the foreground (they''re blurry).', '2003-01-17 01:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(193153, 10956, 3419, '<td valign="top">The scene is very pretty, and composition is very nice. However, bright sunlight gives harsh feeling (glares). What would this be like at sunrise or sunset?</td>', 'The scene is very pretty, and composition is very nice. However, bright sunlight gives harsh feeling (glares). What would this be like at sunrise or sunset?', '2003-01-17 01:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(193154, 10788, 1863, '<td valign="top">I just love the colours in this! 10! -Annida</td>', 'I just love the colours in this! 10! -Annida', '2003-01-17 01:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193157, 10770, 811, '<td valign="top">My only suggestion would be to crop some of the bottom of it so that it was more narrow.  This would eliminate some of the foreground.  I think this picture would be effective if the structure on the right were in the middle horizontally, and  water between the sky and reflection cut the picture in half -- "breaking" the thirds rule.<br/>Still, an awesome shot!!!!</td>', 'My only suggestion would be to crop some of the bottom of it so that it was more narrow.  This would eliminate some of the foreground.  I think this picture would be effective if the structure on the right were in the middle horizontally, and  water between the sky and reflection cut the picture in half -- "breaking" the thirds rule.Still, an awesome shot!!!!', '2003-01-17 01:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(193158, 10905, 933, '<td valign="top">A very nicely composed photo. Great clarity on the branches.  Nice background and sunset too.  I cant offer any suggestions for improvement, but at the same time this doesn''t really jump out at me either. All in all though a very good photo.  8  md</td>', 'A very nicely composed photo. Great clarity on the branches.  Nice background and sunset too.  I cant offer any suggestions for improvement, but at the same time this doesn''t really jump out at me either. All in all though a very good photo.  8  md', '2003-01-17 01:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193159, 10801, 933, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.  Nice composition, though I''d be curious to see it in color.  8 md</td>', 'Very cool photo.  Nice composition, though I''d be curious to see it in color.  8 md', '2003-01-17 01:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(193160, 10850, 3273, '<td valign="top">Very moody shot and the border actually improves the shot rather than detracting from it.</td>', 'Very moody shot and the border actually improves the shot rather than detracting from it.', '2003-01-17 01:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193162, 10929, 3273, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That certainly is a good viewpoint.  If I had to pick one flaw it would be that the area on the right of frame is in shadow, maybe you have tried this again at a different time of day.  Congratulations on a very striking photograph.</td>', 'Wow.  That certainly is a good viewpoint.  If I had to pick one flaw it would be that the area on the right of frame is in shadow, maybe you have tried this again at a different time of day.  Congratulations on a very striking photograph.', '2003-01-17 01:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193163, 11025, 3273, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you''ve captured the detail in the foreground rather than just concentrating on a silhouetted horizon.  The horizon is slightly off horizontal though.</td>', 'I like the fact that you''ve captured the detail in the foreground rather than just concentrating on a silhouetted horizon.  The horizon is slightly off horizontal though.', '2003-01-17 01:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(193176, 10969, 221, '<td valign="top">God this photo sucks, it looks like you took it from a moving car. I mean look at the colors, gross. :)</td>', 'God this photo sucks, it looks like you took it from a moving car. I mean look at the colors, gross. :)', '2003-01-17 03:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193178, 10901, 3540, '<td valign="top">That is one cool picture.  I can''t say I''ve ever seen a frozin waterfall.  Now I have.  Well captured.  It''s very picturesque.  I think this acually could stand to be panned back a little.  It would make the falls a trite smaller, but open up room to show some other vegetation or something of color.  Good luck and thanks for sharing this - Inspzil</td>', 'That is one cool picture.  I can''t say I''ve ever seen a frozin waterfall.  Now I have.  Well captured.  It''s very picturesque.  I think this acually could stand to be panned back a little.  It would make the falls a trite smaller, but open up room to show some other vegetation or something of color.  Good luck and thanks for sharing this - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 04:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193179, 10739, 3540, '<td valign="top">Ever use a polarizer?  It will keep the sky from going stark white.  It keeps the colors from getting out of control when there is more than an adequate light source, in this case, the sun.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Ever use a polarizer?  It will keep the sky from going stark white.  It keeps the colors from getting out of control when there is more than an adequate light source, in this case, the sun.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 04:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193180, 10746, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome landscape!!  The only thing about it I don''t like is that the sky is colorless.   Ever try a polarizer?   It would help a lot to preserve the color of the sky.  Good luck and nice pic - Inspzil</td>', 'Awesome landscape!!  The only thing about it I don''t like is that the sky is colorless.   Ever try a polarizer?   It would help a lot to preserve the color of the sky.  Good luck and nice pic - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 04:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193181, 10918, 3540, '<td valign="top">Not sure how fitting the title is for the pic, but the pic is pretty good.   Very busy though.  It is not a picture with a clear cut focal point.  Then again, this pic might not need it.  I would prefer to see something colorful as the focal point to break up the trees a little. - Inspzil</td>', 'Not sure how fitting the title is for the pic, but the pic is pretty good.   Very busy though.  It is not a picture with a clear cut focal point.  Then again, this pic might not need it.  I would prefer to see something colorful as the focal point to break up the trees a little. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(193182, 10830, 1863, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this picture, there''s just no motion in it. Perhaps if you had taken the picture in more of a motion, like following the road, to give the eye direction? I really like the background more, and the foreground less. -Annida</td>', 'I like the idea of this picture, there''s just no motion in it. Perhaps if you had taken the picture in more of a motion, like following the road, to give the eye direction? I really like the background more, and the foreground less. -Annida', '2003-01-17 05:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(193184, 10812, 3540, '<td valign="top">The scene below is nice.  The sky part though is a little too colorless. The greens stand out well.   - Inspzil</td>', 'The scene below is nice.  The sky part though is a little too colorless. The greens stand out well.   - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193185, 10951, 1863, '<td valign="top">I think this is an absolutely beautiful picture, I love the outline of the tree in the sky.. what I don''t like is that there is no background of what is behind the tree, but I can imagine it''s a house, judging from the telephone wires(?) behind it. I still think this is a beautiful picture though. -Annida</td>', 'I think this is an absolutely beautiful picture, I love the outline of the tree in the sky.. what I don''t like is that there is no background of what is behind the tree, but I can imagine it''s a house, judging from the telephone wires(?) behind it. I still think this is a beautiful picture though. -Annida', '2003-01-17 05:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(193186, 11019, 3540, '<td valign="top">What do they call melted frost?  I think I like this pic better than the title.  I like how the glob glows.  Nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'What do they call melted frost?  I think I like this pic better than the title.  I like how the glob glows.  Nice job - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193187, 11018, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the colors.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the colors.', '2003-01-17 05:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193189, 10879, 3280, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a vist to Looosiana!   Good job. I love the path down the middle.</td>', 'Reminds me of a vist to Looosiana!   Good job. I love the path down the middle.', '2003-01-17 05:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(193190, 10917, 1863, '<td valign="top">An original idea :) Good to see that. I enjoy the lighting in this photograph, good work :) -Annida</td>', 'An original idea :) Good to see that. I enjoy the lighting in this photograph, good work :) -Annida', '2003-01-17 05:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193191, 10772, 3280, '<td valign="top">Prettty nice.  Seems a bit dark and might have worked better if your horizon line wasn''t dead in the middle.</td>', 'Prettty nice.  Seems a bit dark and might have worked better if your horizon line wasn''t dead in the middle.', '2003-01-17 05:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193192, 10856, 1863, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve heard this a million times, but the sun is so distracting in this picture.. maybe if you had waited until it was behind the trees to get a better sillhouette of them? I''m not sure :) Nice idea though :) -Annida</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve heard this a million times, but the sun is so distracting in this picture.. maybe if you had waited until it was behind the trees to get a better sillhouette of them? I''m not sure :) Nice idea though :) -Annida', '2003-01-17 05:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193193, 10852, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very clear and sharp. I assume this was with a telescope. Do you have some sort of adapter or does it just fit your camera?</td>', 'Very clear and sharp. I assume this was with a telescope. Do you have some sort of adapter or does it just fit your camera?', '2003-01-17 05:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(193194, 11038, 1863, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful bridge, and such a huge tree in the way! Maybe if you walked about 30 steps to the right and taken the picture again, the composition would be more uniform. It''s a lovely park. I wish I lived near it :) -Annida</td>', 'Such a beautiful bridge, and such a huge tree in the way! Maybe if you walked about 30 steps to the right and taken the picture again, the composition would be more uniform. It''s a lovely park. I wish I lived near it :) -Annida', '2003-01-17 05:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(193195, 11042, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like the coloration a lot.  I wonder if this wouldn''t have worked better as a portrait style shot, cropped just right of the tree. Nice job.</td>', 'I like the coloration a lot.  I wonder if this wouldn''t have worked better as a portrait style shot, cropped just right of the tree. Nice job.', '2003-01-17 05:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(193196, 10946, 3540, '<td valign="top">This pic is underexposed quite a bit.  It looks like it might have been a good picture a little more in the daytime.  - Inspzil</td>', 'This pic is underexposed quite a bit.  It looks like it might have been a good picture a little more in the daytime.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193197, 10939, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really nice job of lighting and color. Doesn''t look like a great time for a picnic though.</td>', 'Really nice job of lighting and color. Doesn''t look like a great time for a picnic though.', '2003-01-17 05:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193198, 10905, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful. I am assuming that you used selective cropping and couldn''t show the entire tree because of the surroundings.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Really beautiful. I am assuming that you used selective cropping and couldn''t show the entire tree because of the surroundings.  One of my favorites.', '2003-01-17 05:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193199, 10902, 3280, '<td valign="top">Boy wouldn''t this have been nice with a sailboat or something out there.  Nice color and focus.</td>', 'Boy wouldn''t this have been nice with a sailboat or something out there.  Nice color and focus.', '2003-01-17 05:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(193200, 10879, 3540, '<td valign="top">It looks like a graveyard with the stumps sticking up out of the ground/water.  Kind of an eerie graveyard at that. - Inspzil</td>', 'It looks like a graveyard with the stumps sticking up out of the ground/water.  Kind of an eerie graveyard at that. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(193201, 10873, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, seems just a bit soft on focus. Probably could have used a bit more than the 110kb of the 150 allowed to sharpen it some.</td>', 'Neat shot, seems just a bit soft on focus. Probably could have used a bit more than the 110kb of the 150 allowed to sharpen it some.', '2003-01-17 05:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193202, 10814, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice job on the lighting.  I like how everything is in shadow except your tree. Composition is good too. An excellent example of how you can make a really nice shot of a pretty average subject.</td>', 'Very nice job on the lighting.  I like how everything is in shadow except your tree. Composition is good too. An excellent example of how you can make a really nice shot of a pretty average subject.', '2003-01-17 05:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(193203, 10977, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good title and shot.  Seems a bit blown out though.</td>', 'Good title and shot.  Seems a bit blown out though.', '2003-01-17 05:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(193204, 10977, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good mood set on this one.  Barn is a little too centered for my taste.  Good shot though - Inspzil</td>', 'Good mood set on this one.  Barn is a little too centered for my taste.  Good shot though - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(193206, 10910, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wow, neat shot, I can\''t wait to find where this is! I really like the fact that you used the portrait shot for this.</td>', 'Wow, neat shot, I can\''t wait to find where this is! I really like the fact that you used the portrait shot for this.', '2003-01-17 05:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(193207, 11010, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is awesome, one of my favorites.  Only thing I MIGHT change would be to crop just a bit of the sky out to bring the horizon line up off of center.</td>', 'This is awesome, one of my favorites.  Only thing I MIGHT change would be to crop just a bit of the sky out to bring the horizon line up off of center.', '2003-01-17 05:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(193208, 10908, 3280, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. It looks like you are right on top of the mountain. The clouds are great!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. It looks like you are right on top of the mountain. The clouds are great!', '2003-01-17 05:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(193209, 10746, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is so cool. The colors are great.  The clouds give it wow factor but are a bit of distraction too as I am led there first.</td>', 'This is so cool. The colors are great.  The clouds give it wow factor but are a bit of distraction too as I am led there first.', '2003-01-17 05:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193210, 10754, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the rocks in the foreground.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the rocks in the foreground.', '2003-01-17 05:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(193211, 10988, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiul tree from a tree lover!  The red roof on the barn makes this shot. The colors are great.  Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiul tree from a tree lover!  The red roof on the barn makes this shot. The colors are great.  Nice job.', '2003-01-17 05:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(193212, 10975, 3280, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I didn''t think I liked your DOF, but the more I looked the better I liked it. The colors and lighting are awesome and I like it a lot!  You are taking a chance in the challenge, I hope you score well.</td>', 'At first glance, I didn''t think I liked your DOF, but the more I looked the better I liked it. The colors and lighting are awesome and I like it a lot!  You are taking a chance in the challenge, I hope you score well.', '2003-01-17 05:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
