(193214, 11011, 3280, '<td valign="top">Super shot of a tough subject.  I''m not sure how much it meets the challenge but if I got this close to the hawk or eagle, I woulld have submitted it too!</td>', 'Super shot of a tough subject.  I''m not sure how much it meets the challenge but if I got this close to the hawk or eagle, I woulld have submitted it too!', '2003-01-17 05:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193215, 10751, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is just a little underexposed.  Not much sun for a sunset.  The framing is good and I like the perspective - Inspzil</td>', 'This is just a little underexposed.  Not much sun for a sunset.  The framing is good and I like the perspective - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(193216, 10728, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the sunlight.  I just feel as if I am missing the top of the pine tree though.</td>', 'Nice job with the sunlight.  I just feel as if I am missing the top of the pine tree though.', '2003-01-17 05:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193217, 10994, 3280, '<td valign="top">Who would have thought that electric towers could look so graceful.  Very nice job. I like the color and composition.</td>', 'Who would have thought that electric towers could look so graceful.  Very nice job. I like the color and composition.', '2003-01-17 05:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193218, 11025, 3280, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, the clouds really cooperated nicely for you!</td>', 'Cool shot, the clouds really cooperated nicely for you!', '2003-01-17 05:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(193219, 10969, 3540, '<td valign="top">Well framed.  I don''t like the sky so white but judging by the haze up the side of the mountain/hill, it doesn''t look like there was much to be done about it.  Cool old barn and silo though - Inspzil</td>', 'Well framed.  I don''t like the sky so white but judging by the haze up the side of the mountain/hill, it doesn''t look like there was much to be done about it.  Cool old barn and silo though - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(193220, 10911, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of not going with color here. It looks like something from an old book. Good job.</td>', 'Nice choice of not going with color here. It looks like something from an old book. Good job.', '2003-01-17 05:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(193221, 10786, 3280, '<td valign="top">Not sure this is a landscape. A bit too soft on focus as well. Aptly named.</td>', 'Not sure this is a landscape. A bit too soft on focus as well. Aptly named.', '2003-01-17 05:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(193222, 10931, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good job on light. It looks cold to me!</td>', 'Good job on light. It looks cold to me!', '2003-01-17 05:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(193223, 10747, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice job on the reflection. Focus is good as well. Nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice job on the reflection. Focus is good as well. Nice shot.', '2003-01-17 05:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193224, 10725, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job of framing.  We had our first real snow in twenty years yesterday! Good color on your stone wall.</td>', 'Nice job of framing.  We had our first real snow in twenty years yesterday! Good color on your stone wall.', '2003-01-17 05:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193225, 10995, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture needs a nice colorful subject.  It would make for a most beautiful background, but it needs something badly. - Inspzil</td>', 'This picture needs a nice colorful subject.  It would make for a most beautiful background, but it needs something badly. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 05:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(193226, 10859, 3280, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this the better I like it.  It seems a bit grainy though. A little bigger file size and maybe Neat Image would have helped. Great shot though.</td>', 'The more I look at this the better I like it.  It seems a bit grainy though. A little bigger file size and maybe Neat Image would have helped. Great shot though.', '2003-01-17 05:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193227, 10822, 3280, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the shot would have looked like from on top the towers instead of the bottom for the challenge!</td>', 'I wonder what the shot would have looked like from on top the towers instead of the bottom for the challenge!', '2003-01-17 05:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(193229, 10962, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the reflection. The sky in the water is actually bluer than the actual!</td>', 'Nice job on the reflection. The sky in the water is actually bluer than the actual!', '2003-01-17 05:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193230, 10799, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice composition but it seems too small and too yellow.</td>', 'Pretty nice composition but it seems too small and too yellow.', '2003-01-17 05:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193231, 10971, 1829, '<td valign="top">A truly beautiful landscape.  The eyecatching fence really grabbed my attention.  I love the composition and clarity.  Excellent capture.  GL</td>', 'A truly beautiful landscape.  The eyecatching fence really grabbed my attention.  I love the composition and clarity.  Excellent capture.  GL', '2003-01-17 05:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193232, 10827, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is gorgeous. The clouds are really super here. It doesn''t even look that cold!  Super shot.</td>', 'Wow, this is gorgeous. The clouds are really super here. It doesn''t even look that cold!  Super shot.', '2003-01-17 05:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193233, 10832, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and great title!</td>', 'Nice shot and great title!', '2003-01-17 05:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(193234, 10827, 1829, '<td valign="top">Wow what a fantastic capture.  I love the cloud formation and the colour of the sun reflecting off the water.  Excellent job.  GL</td>', 'Wow what a fantastic capture.  I love the cloud formation and the colour of the sun reflecting off the water.  Excellent job.  GL', '2003-01-17 05:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(193235, 10875, 3280, '<td valign="top">A little too grainy, you need to get your file size up to the 150 allowed.</td>', 'A little too grainy, you need to get your file size up to the 150 allowed.', '2003-01-17 05:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(193236, 10745, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Who would have thought you make a dried out old field look so nice. Good eye.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Who would have thought you make a dried out old field look so nice. Good eye.', '2003-01-17 05:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(193237, 11026, 1829, '<td valign="top">The greenery caught my eye in your photograph.  It is truely beautiful.  I like the water tower? here as well it add interest to the photo.  Well done - GL.</td>', 'The greenery caught my eye in your photograph.  It is truely beautiful.  I like the water tower? here as well it add interest to the photo.  Well done - GL.', '2003-01-17 05:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(193238, 10958, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great job on the lighting.  Beautiful shot, I like the foreground.</td>', 'Great job on the lighting.  Beautiful shot, I like the foreground.', '2003-01-17 05:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(193239, 10983, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and composition.  I just have a bit of a problem that your main focal point is so faded out.</td>', 'Nice framing and composition.  I just have a bit of a problem that your main focal point is so faded out.', '2003-01-17 05:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193240, 10984, 3280, '<td valign="top">Colors are super. I would like the horse to be a bit brighter but that would have probably thrown your sky off more.  Tough call.</td>', 'Colors are super. I would like the horse to be a bit brighter but that would have probably thrown your sky off more.  Tough call.', '2003-01-17 06:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(193241, 10978, 3280, '<td valign="top">I hope you had to pay extra for that view!!  Really nice shot and great framing.</td>', 'I hope you had to pay extra for that view!!  Really nice shot and great framing.', '2003-01-17 06:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193242, 10853, 3280, '<td valign="top">A little too small to really see the detail.</td>', 'A little too small to really see the detail.', '2003-01-17 06:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193243, 10739, 3280, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I love the road. Seems a bit bright on the contrast though. The colors seem just a bit washed out.</td>', 'Cool shot, I love the road. Seems a bit bright on the contrast though. The colors seem just a bit washed out.', '2003-01-17 06:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193244, 11026, 3280, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors.  I like the compositon as well.  Good job.</td>', 'Fantastic colors.  I like the compositon as well.  Good job.', '2003-01-17 06:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193245, 10810, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, I''m just drawn to that big pole in the middle though.   It is so dark compared to everything else in the shot.</td>', 'Pretty nice, I''m just drawn to that big pole in the middle though.   It is so dark compared to everything else in the shot.', '2003-01-17 06:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(193246, 10704, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice compositon. I wish the bridge wans''t leaning right though.</td>', 'Nice compositon. I wish the bridge wans''t leaning right though.', '2003-01-17 06:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193248, 10940, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice color and focus.  I think you could have cropped out some of the foreground though.</td>', 'Nice color and focus.  I think you could have cropped out some of the foreground though.', '2003-01-17 06:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(193249, 10701, 3280, '<td valign="top">A little too light on the focus. Colors are great.  Take advantage of more of the 150 file size.</td>', 'A little too light on the focus. Colors are great.  Take advantage of more of the 150 file size.', '2003-01-17 06:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193250, 11033, 3280, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I really like the focus on the bridge. Good job.</td>', 'Cool shot, I really like the focus on the bridge. Good job.', '2003-01-17 06:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193251, 11004, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good job, the composition and focus are great.  The sky looks unatural in color though. Is that the way it was?</td>', 'Good job, the composition and focus are great.  The sky looks unatural in color though. Is that the way it was?', '2003-01-17 06:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193252, 11000, 3280, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the focus and perhaps a bit of a stretch on the challenge.</td>', 'A little soft on the focus and perhaps a bit of a stretch on the challenge.', '2003-01-17 06:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(193253, 10823, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful vista. Using a bit more of the 150kb file size allowed may have sharpened this some.</td>', 'Beautiful vista. Using a bit more of the 150kb file size allowed may have sharpened this some.', '2003-01-17 06:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(193254, 10919, 3280, '<td valign="top">You need a bit more contrast in your clouds to meet your title.</td>', 'You need a bit more contrast in your clouds to meet your title.', '2003-01-17 06:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(193255, 10948, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful shot but it seems too unatural.  The moss in the foreground looks oversharpened because of the color. I would like to see the original out of the camera.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful shot but it seems too unatural.  The moss in the foreground looks oversharpened because of the color. I would like to see the original out of the camera.', '2003-01-17 06:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193256, 10699, 3280, '<td valign="top">I feel like I would like to see a bit more of the tree in this shot.</td>', 'I feel like I would like to see a bit more of the tree in this shot.', '2003-01-17 06:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(193257, 10996, 3280, '<td valign="top">I think that using more of the 150 kb file size would have really sharpened this shot up.  You used only 11kb!  A bit bigger would have been nice as well.  It is a pretty shot but it is hard to tell.</td>', 'I think that using more of the 150 kb file size would have really sharpened this shot up.  You used only 11kb!  A bit bigger would have been nice as well.  It is a pretty shot but it is hard to tell.', '2003-01-17 06:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(193258, 11036, 3280, '<td valign="top">It certainly looks like a drought!  I like the feel of the way the water swings back to the right. Good job with color.</td>', 'It certainly looks like a drought!  I like the feel of the way the water swings back to the right. Good job with color.', '2003-01-17 06:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193259, 10798, 3280, '<td valign="top">I know you have no control, but that one little cloud is such a distraction.  It looks almost like an error on the film. (Of course there is no such thing as film these days!!)</td>', 'I know you have no control, but that one little cloud is such a distraction.  It looks almost like an error on the film. (Of course there is no such thing as film these days!!)', '2003-01-17 06:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193260, 10891, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, almost too bright.  I think this shot would have benefited alot by using more of the 150 kb file size allowed. You only used half of it and it would have sharpened this up a lot.</td>', 'Pretty colors, almost too bright.  I think this shot would have benefited alot by using more of the 150 kb file size allowed. You only used half of it and it would have sharpened this up a lot.', '2003-01-17 06:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193261, 10741, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice and tranquil.  The tree to the left seems a bit oversharpened but it may just be the light. Nice color.</td>', 'Very nice and tranquil.  The tree to the left seems a bit oversharpened but it may just be the light. Nice color.', '2003-01-17 06:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193262, 10808, 1863, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours in this. A bit narrow on the photo though :( I give you an 8! -Annida</td>', 'Beautiful colours in this. A bit narrow on the photo though :( I give you an 8! -Annida', '2003-01-17 06:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193263, 10712, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like the title and the colors are great.  The haze or smoke in the left middle is really distracting though.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the title and the colors are great.  The haze or smoke in the left middle is really distracting though.  Nice shot.', '2003-01-17 06:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(193264, 10906, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, color and focus look really good.</td>', 'Very nice, color and focus look really good.', '2003-01-17 06:25:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(193265, 10981, 1863, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines in this photo, it really draws you into the little tree area in the middle, and then out again. I don''t think I would change much at all. Congratulations. - 9 - Annida</td>', 'Beautiful lines in this photo, it really draws you into the little tree area in the middle, and then out again. I don''t think I would change much at all. Congratulations. - 9 - Annida', '2003-01-17 06:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(193266, 10793, 3280, '<td valign="top">Man, it looks cold!  Good use of the foreground to set up the shot.</td>', 'Man, it looks cold!  Good use of the foreground to set up the shot.', '2003-01-17 06:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(193267, 10755, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really nice, colors are great. Seems like it could have been just a bit sharper though.</td>', 'Really nice, colors are great. Seems like it could have been just a bit sharper though.', '2003-01-17 06:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(193268, 10794, 3280, '<td valign="top">Lighting and rainbow are super.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Lighting and rainbow are super.  Nice shot.', '2003-01-17 06:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(193269, 10827, 1863, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. The composition is excellent. I wish you had taken the picture right before the sun had moved over the mountains in the background, cause then there wouldn''t be this huge glare on the water. It is rather distracting. 8 - Annida</td>', 'Lovely image. The composition is excellent. I wish you had taken the picture right before the sun had moved over the mountains in the background, cause then there wouldn''t be this huge glare on the water. It is rather distracting. 8 - Annida', '2003-01-17 06:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193272, 10942, 5475, '<td valign="top">So far, this is my only 10!  Your composition is really interesting.  The rows of headstones brings your eye to the building, and the tree on the right adds balance.  I like the wide range of tones from whites to blacks.  The left wall of the house is a little blown, but spot editing rules prevent a better fix, so I won''t count off for that.  There are some power lines running horizontally behind the house that I find a little distracting, but once again, you can''t do anything with that based on contest rules.  I would clone them out for printing, though.  Overall, a very nice image, well composed, nice balance of tones, good DOF.  Well done!<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'So far, this is my only 10!  Your composition is really interesting.  The rows of headstones brings your eye to the building, and the tree on the right adds balance.  I like the wide range of tones from whites to blacks.  The left wall of the house is a little blown, but spot editing rules prevent a better fix, so I won''t count off for that.  There are some power lines running horizontally behind the house that I find a little distracting, but once again, you can''t do anything with that based on contest rules.  I would clone them out for printing, though.  Overall, a very nice image, well composed, nice balance of tones, good DOF.  Well done!JD Anderson', '2003-01-17 06:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(193277, 10737, 2920, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s right to describe a moonscape as "atmospheric" but I think its a great shot and the composition/crop works really well.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s right to describe a moonscape as "atmospheric" but I think its a great shot and the composition/crop works really well.', '2003-01-17 07:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193281, 10904, 1863, '<td valign="top">What a stunning view! I wish I could see more of the lake (appends: Ocean :))area to the right, that would have made it absolutely perfect. 9! -Annida!</td>', 'What a stunning view! I wish I could see more of the lake (appends: Ocean :))area to the right, that would have made it absolutely perfect. 9! -Annida!', '2003-01-17 07:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(193283, 10809, 3540, '<td valign="top">The snow covered tree branches are great.  The red building is a nice shot of color for the pic.  I don''t really see this as too much of a landscape, but I do like the shot.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'The snow covered tree branches are great.  The red building is a nice shot of color for the pic.  I don''t really see this as too much of a landscape, but I do like the shot.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 07:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193284, 10835, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  I really like how warm the suns rays look coming over that rock.  I would have cropped the bottom off.  It doesn''t add anything to the pic.  It''s almost contrary to where the picture is going being so dark.  Good job! - Inspzil</td>', 'Great picture.  I really like how warm the suns rays look coming over that rock.  I would have cropped the bottom off.  It doesn''t add anything to the pic.  It''s almost contrary to where the picture is going being so dark.  Good job! - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 07:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(193285, 11037, 3540, '<td valign="top">For some reason, this look like a fake landscapre for a train set or something.  Cool picture!! - Inspzil</td>', 'For some reason, this look like a fake landscapre for a train set or something.  Cool picture!! - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 07:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(193286, 10945, 3540, '<td valign="top">The soft focus doesn''t work with this pic.  I like the scene, but a better day and a crisper picture would''ve been preferred.  Nice capture nonetheless - Inspzil</td>', 'The soft focus doesn''t work with this pic.  I like the scene, but a better day and a crisper picture would''ve been preferred.  Nice capture nonetheless - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 08:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193287, 10832, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the photo generally.  Makes me wish my star filter wasn''t on backorder.  I don''t like the little flares coming off the top of the buildings though. -Inspzil</td>', 'I like the photo generally.  Makes me wish my star filter wasn''t on backorder.  I don''t like the little flares coming off the top of the buildings though. -Inspzil', '2003-01-17 08:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(193290, 10932, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great shot, would have liked to see this in colour.</td>', 'Great shot, would have liked to see this in colour.', '2003-01-17 08:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193291, 10739, 4510, '<td valign="top">This shot looks over exposed IMO.</td>', 'This shot looks over exposed IMO.', '2003-01-17 08:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193293, 10838, 4510, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, great work, good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, great work, good luck.', '2003-01-17 09:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193305, 10736, 3540, '<td valign="top">Yellow sky is pretty neat.  I''m not sure I like the foliage in the foreground.  I look at it for perspective its ok.  But it isn''t really adding anything either.  I would''ve cropped some of the blue sky off.  Pretty nice pic all around. - Inspzil</td>', 'Yellow sky is pretty neat.  I''m not sure I like the foliage in the foreground.  I look at it for perspective its ok.  But it isn''t really adding anything either.  I would''ve cropped some of the blue sky off.  Pretty nice pic all around. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 09:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193306, 10919, 772, '<td valign="top">This landscape lacks a strong element to really catch the viewer''s eye.  The bare tree on the lower left of the frame could posibly have made a nice subject for this shot as well.. maybe focus a little closer on it for a strong black and white shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This landscape lacks a strong element to really catch the viewer''s eye.  The bare tree on the lower left of the frame could posibly have made a nice subject for this shot as well.. maybe focus a little closer on it for a strong black and white shot :) - setzler', '2003-01-17 09:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(193307, 10913, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting.  Nice sky.  Like the silhouette.  Highlight of this pic for me is the subject and his placement, which is excellent.  Nice photo - Inspzil</td>', 'Looks like a painting.  Nice sky.  Like the silhouette.  Highlight of this pic for me is the subject and his placement, which is excellent.  Nice photo - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 09:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193308, 11036, 3540, '<td valign="top">If you could''ve gotten the sky blue, it would be really great.  With the sky white, it''s still pretty darn good.  Nice pic. - Inspzil</td>', 'If you could''ve gotten the sky blue, it would be really great.  With the sky white, it''s still pretty darn good.  Nice pic. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(193309, 10882, 4510, '<td valign="top">IMO this is just too small to accurately assess properly.</td>', 'IMO this is just too small to accurately assess properly.', '2003-01-17 09:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193311, 10978, 6202, '<td valign="top">I love the framing effect of the trees.  Adds to the beauty.</td>', 'I love the framing effect of the trees.  Adds to the beauty.', '2003-01-17 09:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(193312, 10999, 3540, '<td valign="top">The fog is a great addition to this pic.  Nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'The fog is a great addition to this pic.  Nice job - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193313, 10827, 3540, '<td valign="top">The reflections of the clouds at the shoreline is outstanding.  Great shot! - Inspzil</td>', 'The reflections of the clouds at the shoreline is outstanding.  Great shot! - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 09:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(193314, 10792, 5276, '<td valign="top">I wish this were in color</td>', 'I wish this were in color', '2003-01-17 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(193315, 10704, 3540, '<td valign="top">More architecture than landscape IMO.  Interesting boats. - Inspzil</td>', 'More architecture than landscape IMO.  Interesting boats. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 09:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193317, 11011, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I like the bird.  Adds a little something extra to this pic.  Interesting pic in terms of the colors and elevations of layers and stuff. - Inspzil</td>', 'Great colors.  I like the bird.  Adds a little something extra to this pic.  Interesting pic in terms of the colors and elevations of layers and stuff. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 09:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(193318, 10917, 5629, '<td valign="top">Right side is a little too dark. If it was a little brighter, and kept the light/dark aspect that you were going for, it would have helped. I think this may be perfect in B&amp;W. Great lines!</td>', 'Right side is a little too dark. If it was a little brighter, and kept the light/dark aspect that you were going for, it would have helped. I think this may be perfect in B&W. Great lines!', '2003-01-17 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193319, 10884, 5276, '<td valign="top">I wish this wasn''t in shadow</td>', 'I wish this wasn''t in shadow', '2003-01-17 09:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(193320, 10895, 5629, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but feel it could be a little better. I like the fact that the hill drops off on the right, which give a sense of height and nothingness out that way. I think if you were a bit lower or somehow got the entire tree branches into the sky, it would be perfect. Also, I would have liked to see the bush gone and the grass green (2 things not in your control).</td>', 'I like this photo but feel it could be a little better. I like the fact that the hill drops off on the right, which give a sense of height and nothingness out that way. I think if you were a bit lower or somehow got the entire tree branches into the sky, it would be perfect. Also, I would have liked to see the bush gone and the grass green (2 things not in your control).', '2003-01-17 09:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(193322, 11041, 3540, '<td valign="top">There are not really a lot of instances where sepia works for me.  This one turned out pretty well.  The composition isn''t terribly exciting but it''s a pretty nice pic. - Inspzil</td>', 'There are not really a lot of instances where sepia works for me.  This one turned out pretty well.  The composition isn''t terribly exciting but it''s a pretty nice pic. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(193324, 10792, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is more of an architecture pic IMO.  Not a bad one either. - Inspzil</td>', 'This is more of an architecture pic IMO.  Not a bad one either. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(193325, 10712, 3540, '<td valign="top">The landscape itself looks pretty dull.  Add the round bales and you got yourself a pic!!  Nice colors.  Looks like the upper left side wanted to glare a bit - Inspzil</td>', 'The landscape itself looks pretty dull.  Add the round bales and you got yourself a pic!!  Nice colors.  Looks like the upper left side wanted to glare a bit - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(193326, 10874, 3540, '<td valign="top">The colors are awesome!!  Nice reflection.  I think you could''ve cropped off the top 1/4 of the pic and concentrated the viewers on this water. - Inspzil</td>', 'The colors are awesome!!  Nice reflection.  I think you could''ve cropped off the top 1/4 of the pic and concentrated the viewers on this water. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(193328, 10984, 3540, '<td valign="top">This pic is just too busy and there isn''t actually much for landscape at all.  The building is nice, but there''s too much fence.  I feel like I''m being watched too!  This pic isn''t doing it for me.  Good luck anyway - Inspzil</td>', 'This pic is just too busy and there isn''t actually much for landscape at all.  The building is nice, but there''s too much fence.  I feel like I''m being watched too!  This pic isn''t doing it for me.  Good luck anyway - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193329, 11005, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo has serious conflicts of interest.  On one hand you have snow, which is very difficult to shoot in due to exposure.  On the other hand everything else in the picture is dark, which in itself is difficult to shoot.  The lack of exposure really mutes any details of anything out of arms reach.  This is a difficult shot for anyone. - Inspzil</td>', 'This photo has serious conflicts of interest.  On one hand you have snow, which is very difficult to shoot in due to exposure.  On the other hand everything else in the picture is dark, which in itself is difficult to shoot.  The lack of exposure really mutes any details of anything out of arms reach.  This is a difficult shot for anyone. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(193330, 10754, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  I don''t like how some of the pic is in shadow and the other half is in sun.  Looks like a fantastic place to take pics.  Well taken pic though. - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice landscape.  I don''t like how some of the pic is in shadow and the other half is in sun.  Looks like a fantastic place to take pics.  Well taken pic though. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193331, 11026, 3540, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice.  If the clarity was there, you''d have a contender - Inspzil</td>', 'The colors are nice.  If the clarity was there, you''d have a contender - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(193332, 11025, 3540, '<td valign="top">The cityscape is just too dark.  It''s hard to get the exposure just right here.  A lot of it IMO is just taking the pic at the perfect time. - Inspzil</td>', 'The cityscape is just too dark.  It''s hard to get the exposure just right here.  A lot of it IMO is just taking the pic at the perfect time. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
