(193337, 10789, 3540, '<td valign="top">The colors of this photo are really bland and flat.  A better day would''ve helped a lot to bring colors out.  The roof that you took this from should''ve been cropped out IMO.  I think I''m interested in the buidings right in front of you more than anything else in the pic. - Inspzil</td>', 'The colors of this photo are really bland and flat.  A better day would''ve helped a lot to bring colors out.  The roof that you took this from should''ve been cropped out IMO.  I think I''m interested in the buidings right in front of you more than anything else in the pic. - Inspzil', '2003-01-17 10:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
