(193424, 10912, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is soooo cool!  The composition and the colors are great!  The only thing I would have done with this is a levels adjustment to increase your blacks (ie make your blacks darker) to give a better feel for night time.  That''s just me, though.  I hope you don''t get voted down for the cityscape vice landscape.  I see it as what''s on the land where you are, so it''s a landscape!  8</td>', 'This is soooo cool!  The composition and the colors are great!  The only thing I would have done with this is a levels adjustment to increase your blacks (ie make your blacks darker) to give a better feel for night time.  That''s just me, though.  I hope you don''t get voted down for the cityscape vice landscape.  I see it as what''s on the land where you are, so it''s a landscape!  8', '2003-01-17 12:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
