(193476, 10710, 3575, '<td valign="top">Brrrrr.  A lot of times I look at photos and try to put myself in the scene as the photographer. Am I on a bridge? Rock? The exposure is great, it brings out the nice color saturation.</td>', 'Brrrrr.  A lot of times I look at photos and try to put myself in the scene as the photographer. Am I on a bridge? Rock? The exposure is great, it brings out the nice color saturation.', '2003-01-17 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(193477, 10788, 888, '<td valign="top">wow, very sexy. (can a photo be sexy?) is that a cruise ship or a town in the distance?<br/></td>', 'wow, very sexy. (can a photo be sexy?) is that a cruise ship or a town in the distance?', '2003-01-17 13:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(193479, 10966, 3575, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. I love the blues.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. I love the blues.', '2003-01-17 13:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(193480, 10755, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love this. I love the turquise water and salmon colored lighthouse.</td>', 'I love this. I love the turquise water and salmon colored lighthouse.', '2003-01-17 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(193481, 10895, 3575, '<td valign="top">A beautiful oak tree in a beautiful scene. It''s interesting how the small branches on the tree are blue. Excellent composition.</td>', 'A beautiful oak tree in a beautiful scene. It''s interesting how the small branches on the tree are blue. Excellent composition.', '2003-01-17 13:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193483, 10712, 3575, '<td valign="top">Where does one find hay like this. I love the beautiful, golden sheen that comes from these rolled bales. Excellent lighting, color and compositon.</td>', 'Where does one find hay like this. I love the beautiful, golden sheen that comes from these rolled bales. Excellent lighting, color and compositon.', '2003-01-17 13:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(193484, 10847, 3575, '<td valign="top">Could this be more beautiful? I don''t think so. I love the color, or lack of.</td>', 'Could this be more beautiful? I don''t think so. I love the color, or lack of.', '2003-01-17 13:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(193485, 10971, 5100, '<td valign="top">Ok.. I have to change my vote, at this time your shot seems better than I originally thought :)</td>', 'Ok.. I have to change my vote, at this time your shot seems better than I originally thought :)', '2003-01-17 13:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193486, 10898, 3575, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective and beautiful scene. A little too much dark on the lower right but there''s not way you could have avoided that and still include the important elements. That bridge out in the distance is a real plus in this composition.</td>', 'Excellent perspective and beautiful scene. A little too much dark on the lower right but there''s not way you could have avoided that and still include the important elements. That bridge out in the distance is a real plus in this composition.', '2003-01-17 13:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(193487, 10833, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful play of lilght and shanddwos. The low sun really made this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful play of lilght and shanddwos. The low sun really made this shot.', '2003-01-17 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193488, 10823, 3575, '<td valign="top">An empty beach. Must be cold out there. Very nice.</td>', 'An empty beach. Must be cold out there. Very nice.', '2003-01-17 13:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(193489, 11025, 5100, '<td valign="top">Ok... I change my mind you deserve better :)</td>', 'Ok... I change my mind you deserve better :)', '2003-01-17 13:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(193490, 10956, 3575, '<td valign="top">Love the panorama. This is great, I get on the boardwalk on the right and walk all the way around and into the trees on the left. excellent composition.</td>', 'Love the panorama. This is great, I get on the boardwalk on the right and walk all the way around and into the trees on the left. excellent composition.', '2003-01-17 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193493, 10731, 3575, '<td valign="top">Vry dramatic. Wonderful composition</td>', 'Vry dramatic. Wonderful composition', '2003-01-17 13:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(193494, 10832, 5100, '<td valign="top">This is a nice cityscape, like it a lot</td>', 'This is a nice cityscape, like it a lot', '2003-01-17 13:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193498, 10840, 5100, '<td valign="top">IMHO the horse shouldn''t be there but this is one of the things I like the most of photography, you get to show whatever you want, after all, this is your shot! :)</td>', 'IMHO the horse shouldn''t be there but this is one of the things I like the most of photography, you get to show whatever you want, after all, this is your shot! :)', '2003-01-17 13:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(193508, 10852, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the square framing works well with this shot.  Excellent capture of the detail, and I like that the moon is in the bottom of the frame with the  "shadow" at the top.  I think that makes for a strong composition.</td>', 'I think the square framing works well with this shot.  Excellent capture of the detail, and I like that the moon is in the bottom of the frame with the  "shadow" at the top.  I think that makes for a strong composition.', '2003-01-17 13:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193513, 10994, 5100, '<td valign="top">Ok, I don''t like power lines on landscape pictures (with a certain exceptions) but yours are essential to this beautiful scene, I must change my vote..</td>', 'Ok, I don''t like power lines on landscape pictures (with a certain exceptions) but yours are essential to this beautiful scene, I must change my vote..', '2003-01-17 13:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193514, 10724, 4411, '<td valign="top">Starting from the bottom of the frame I really like this ... until I reach the houses. Sorry, but all those buildings are spoiling your photo. Could have done with less exposure to bring out more detail in the sky too.<br/>The bottom third has the beginnings of a really good shot, I like the way the path curves off out of view and the rocks &amp; grass border it very nicely. Just would be better without houses.</td>', 'Starting from the bottom of the frame I really like this ... until I reach the houses. Sorry, but all those buildings are spoiling your photo. Could have done with less exposure to bring out more detail in the sky too.The bottom third has the beginnings of a really good shot, I like the way the path curves off out of view and the rocks & grass border it very nicely. Just would be better without houses.', '2003-01-17 13:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193530, 10928, 2302, '<td valign="top">The blue border hurts this one - it would have been better to stick with solid black or get the blue more closely matched to the sky. Nice framing, good detail and lovely photo otherwise. = 6</td>', 'The blue border hurts this one - it would have been better to stick with solid black or get the blue more closely matched to the sky. Nice framing, good detail and lovely photo otherwise. = 6', '2003-01-17 14:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(193533, 10867, 2302, '<td valign="top">Two things I think that would have made this a better shot (in mho) one - get lower to the ground - perhaps even use the weeds in the lower right to help frame the shot and give the view a more dramatic angle. Or, move the camera up a bit to eliminate the "greener" grasses in the forground. These grasses pull my eye too much and I think the focus is more on the vastness in the rest of the picture. Eliminating the green grasses in the foreground would also help give more focus to the clouds referenced in the title.  = 5</td>', 'Two things I think that would have made this a better shot (in mho) one - get lower to the ground - perhaps even use the weeds in the lower right to help frame the shot and give the view a more dramatic angle. Or, move the camera up a bit to eliminate the "greener" grasses in the forground. These grasses pull my eye too much and I think the focus is more on the vastness in the rest of the picture. Eliminating the green grasses in the foreground would also help give more focus to the clouds referenced in the title.  = 5', '2003-01-17 14:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(193537, 10999, 4411, '<td valign="top">The mist really adds to the mood of this along with the muddy tracks. The tree adds an interesting bit of detail in that corner. The sky is a little overexposed, and I would prefer the tracks to vanish into infinity rather than off the frame, but overall this is a good shot.</td>', 'The mist really adds to the mood of this along with the muddy tracks. The tree adds an interesting bit of detail in that corner. The sky is a little overexposed, and I would prefer the tracks to vanish into infinity rather than off the frame, but overall this is a good shot.', '2003-01-17 14:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(193539, 10909, 4411, '<td valign="top">The sun is doing its best to spoil this shot, but I''m not sure if it ends up adding to it. The lens flare is not too distracting or ugly, and the rest of the shot is great. Nice work.</td>', 'The sun is doing its best to spoil this shot, but I''m not sure if it ends up adding to it. The lens flare is not too distracting or ugly, and the rest of the shot is great. Nice work.', '2003-01-17 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193540, 10827, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I especially like the cloud reflections on the very front of the water.  Really meets the challenge.  8 waltoml.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I especially like the cloud reflections on the very front of the water.  Really meets the challenge.  8 waltoml.', '2003-01-17 14:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(193541, 10811, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Focus and lighting look good.  7 waltoml.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Focus and lighting look good.  7 waltoml.', '2003-01-17 14:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193542, 10892, 2295, '<td valign="top">Great photo of a pine cone.  Doesn''t have too much to do with landscape though.  Focus and lighting look great.  7 waltoml.</td>', 'Great photo of a pine cone.  Doesn''t have too much to do with landscape though.  Focus and lighting look great.  7 waltoml.', '2003-01-17 14:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193543, 10904, 2295, '<td valign="top">Definitely landscape.  Nice photo.  Focus and lighting look good.  7 waltoml.</td>', 'Definitely landscape.  Nice photo.  Focus and lighting look good.  7 waltoml.', '2003-01-17 14:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(193544, 10913, 4411, '<td valign="top">The title fits well :-/<br/>I guess you''ve tried to brighten up what were very dark hills? Kudos for trying rather than just presenting a silhouette.<br/>It''s a good idea, and very difficult to pull off. The composition is good, but the noise &amp; blown out sky take away from it. Good try.</td>', 'The title fits well :-/I guess you''ve tried to brighten up what were very dark hills? Kudos for trying rather than just presenting a silhouette.It''s a good idea, and very difficult to pull off. The composition is good, but the noise & blown out sky take away from it. Good try.', '2003-01-17 14:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193545, 10824, 4805, '<td valign="top">A nice balance between the water and the trees...good exposure. did you try a vertical shot, with the falls at the bottow (duh) and more of the trees? That might have been more simple and effective...the more static foreground to the left could be left out. Nice shot.</td>', 'A nice balance between the water and the trees...good exposure. did you try a vertical shot, with the falls at the bottow (duh) and more of the trees? That might have been more simple and effective...the more static foreground to the left could be left out. Nice shot.', '2003-01-17 14:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(193547, 10881, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice omposition, though I think the lighting is a bit lacking in this one. There is a large portion in the trees where it''s just ''muddy'' looking. I think if you had emphasized the cow, tree and barn by taking the shot from a little to the right and a bit higher (to avoid the grass hiding the cow) it might have been more effective. Still, not bad.</td>', 'Nice omposition, though I think the lighting is a bit lacking in this one. There is a large portion in the trees where it''s just ''muddy'' looking. I think if you had emphasized the cow, tree and barn by taking the shot from a little to the right and a bit higher (to avoid the grass hiding the cow) it might have been more effective. Still, not bad.', '2003-01-17 14:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(193548, 10837, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice...and while including a foreground object is good practice, I''m not sure that the tree is adding a lot to the shot. It blends into the background too much for it to stand out, though the shadow is nice. I''d also have liked to see a little more sky and a little less foreground. Still, very clear and sharp. Good shot.</td>', 'Nice...and while including a foreground object is good practice, I''m not sure that the tree is adding a lot to the shot. It blends into the background too much for it to stand out, though the shadow is nice. I''d also have liked to see a little more sky and a little less foreground. Still, very clear and sharp. Good shot.', '2003-01-17 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(193549, 10962, 4805, '<td valign="top">Great idea...love the composition. The reflection is great. I can only say that a bit of sharpening would have nailed this shot. Well done.</td>', 'Great idea...love the composition. The reflection is great. I can only say that a bit of sharpening would have nailed this shot. Well done.', '2003-01-17 14:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(193550, 10951, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - good blues. The sun relative to the tree is great. I would have cropped the powerlines, and tried to get all of the tree branch into the shot on the right.</td>', 'Nice shot - good blues. The sun relative to the tree is great. I would have cropped the powerlines, and tried to get all of the tree branch into the shot on the right.', '2003-01-17 14:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(193551, 10808, 4805, '<td valign="top">I really like this one...great depth of focus and I love the colour. The balance and symmetry in the sand, ocean and sky is great. I can hear the ''out of focus'' comments from here! Good job.</td>', 'I really like this one...great depth of focus and I love the colour. The balance and symmetry in the sand, ocean and sky is great. I can hear the ''out of focus'' comments from here! Good job.', '2003-01-17 15:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(193553, 10840, 4805, '<td valign="top">Great shot...nice scene. I think that this might have been better, compositionally, if the horses were in a different spot. They seem to be stuck on the edge of the frame. It looks unbalanced with them in it. I might have also cropped some of the grass...there''s a whole lot of the same there.</td>', 'Great shot...nice scene. I think that this might have been better, compositionally, if the horses were in a different spot. They seem to be stuck on the edge of the frame. It looks unbalanced with them in it. I might have also cropped some of the grass...there''s a whole lot of the same there.', '2003-01-17 15:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193554, 10901, 4793, '<td valign="top">You did not have to worry about stopping the motion on this one, mother nature did it for you. Nice shot like your comp, overall nice shot.</td>', 'You did not have to worry about stopping the motion on this one, mother nature did it for you. Nice shot like your comp, overall nice shot.', '2003-01-17 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193555, 10814, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very nice...well balanced. A polarizing filter would have really popped the colour in the sky and provided a bit more contrast...I''m also not convinced that it''s the best place for the tree...covering the peak with the branches throws me off. I''d prefer to have the tree intersect a lower part of the horizon, such as off to the right. Still, very good.</td>', 'Very nice...well balanced. A polarizing filter would have really popped the colour in the sky and provided a bit more contrast...I''m also not convinced that it''s the best place for the tree...covering the peak with the branches throws me off. I''d prefer to have the tree intersect a lower part of the horizon, such as off to the right. Still, very good.', '2003-01-17 15:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(193556, 10958, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice, well balanced. Good colours. Perhaps it would hav ebeen better to frame it higher with more sky and slightly less foreground. Those clouds have a very nice shape and texture. The ground reminds me of a cinnamon bun...</td>', 'Nice, well balanced. Good colours. Perhaps it would hav ebeen better to frame it higher with more sky and slightly less foreground. Those clouds have a very nice shape and texture. The ground reminds me of a cinnamon bun...', '2003-01-17 15:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193558, 11026, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, well balanced. The composition is great. It might be slightly overexposed...the sky is blown out a touch and the background loses some detail as a resuly. still, nice shot.</td>', 'Nice colours, well balanced. The composition is great. It might be slightly overexposed...the sky is blown out a touch and the background loses some detail as a resuly. still, nice shot.', '2003-01-17 15:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(193559, 10975, 4805, '<td valign="top">Interesting...lovely colours.  The reddish brown matches very well with the red in the barn. I really like the DOF. Excellent composition, sharp and balanced exposure. Get the feeling this one won''t do as well due to the focus...but we''ll see. Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting...lovely colours.  The reddish brown matches very well with the red in the barn. I really like the DOF. Excellent composition, sharp and balanced exposure. Get the feeling this one won''t do as well due to the focus...but we''ll see. Good luck.', '2003-01-17 15:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193562, 11044, 4805, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...great idea, but the horizon really needs levelling. I feel like I''m sliding off the river, which clearly conflicts with the serenity.</td>', 'Hmmm...great idea, but the horizon really needs levelling. I feel like I''m sliding off the river, which clearly conflicts with the serenity.', '2003-01-17 15:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(193564, 10874, 4805, '<td valign="top">Great colour! Interesting shot, for sure. I like how the ice''s edge matches the tree line. Well done.</td>', 'Great colour! Interesting shot, for sure. I like how the ice''s edge matches the tree line. Well done.', '2003-01-17 15:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(193565, 10895, 4210, '<td valign="top">Love the composition!</td>', 'Love the composition!', '2003-01-17 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193581, 10728, 4411, '<td valign="top">Lovely. The texture on the untouched snow is great as are the shadows. An excellect winter scene.</td>', 'Lovely. The texture on the untouched snow is great as are the shadows. An excellect winter scene.', '2003-01-17 15:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193583, 10882, 4210, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve recieved alot of people saying it''s too small. But don''t worry. I think it looks good little.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve recieved alot of people saying it''s too small. But don''t worry. I think it looks good little.', '2003-01-17 15:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(193584, 10885, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, but IMO, a lot (mood) is lost by converting this to black and white.</td>', 'Very nice composition, but IMO, a lot (mood) is lost by converting this to black and white.', '2003-01-17 15:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193585, 10831, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, and pretty scene. The focus looks a little soft in the foreground - would prefer more crispness here.</td>', 'Very nice composition, and pretty scene. The focus looks a little soft in the foreground - would prefer more crispness here.', '2003-01-17 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(193586, 10741, 3419, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m standing there - focus is right on. A very pretty scene - I can feel the sun''s warmth.</td>', 'I feel like I''m standing there - focus is right on. A very pretty scene - I can feel the sun''s warmth.', '2003-01-17 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(193588, 10966, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture, but it seems to be a bit over-exposed, which contributing to the softness overall. Would prefer crisper detail. I like the diagonal lines created by the water and the tree tops.</td>', 'Very pretty picture, but it seems to be a bit over-exposed, which contributing to the softness overall. Would prefer crisper detail. I like the diagonal lines created by the water and the tree tops.', '2003-01-17 16:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193589, 11041, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice color, and nice composition. IMO, I think the photo could use some sharpening.</td>', 'Nice color, and nice composition. IMO, I think the photo could use some sharpening.', '2003-01-17 16:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(193592, 10725, 3419, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve used the window to frame the shot, though I can''t say I like the pinkness of the scene - caused by a pink filter? Focus seems a little soft around the edge of the window - would prefer more sharpness there.</td>', 'I like how you''ve used the window to frame the shot, though I can''t say I like the pinkness of the scene - caused by a pink filter? Focus seems a little soft around the edge of the window - would prefer more sharpness there.', '2003-01-17 16:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(193593, 10863, 3419, '<td valign="top">I love the colors. Composition is very nice too.</td>', 'I love the colors. Composition is very nice too.', '2003-01-17 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193602, 10840, 4815, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of wide open expanse by including lots of blue sky. A long time ago I was told that an odd number of visual elements seems to balance better than an even number. Thus three or one tree(s) might work better than two. The horses and riders do fit in with your theme. Although circumstances may have been out of your control I would personally rather have the folks riding into the picture towards the trees thus bringing the viewers attention back inside the frame. Just a suggestion. The foliage of the larger trees is very photogenic. Those alone say in a silhouette with a horse on a puffy cloudy day would be a magical moment. You have got the right elements here in the game. A few minor changes in composition, lighting (i.e. dramatic sidelighting or backlighting during sunset/sunrise ) would alter the image presentation ...should you wish to do so. Otherwise a reasonable photo with redeeming qualities. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the feeling of wide open expanse by including lots of blue sky. A long time ago I was told that an odd number of visual elements seems to balance better than an even number. Thus three or one tree(s) might work better than two. The horses and riders do fit in with your theme. Although circumstances may have been out of your control I would personally rather have the folks riding into the picture towards the trees thus bringing the viewers attention back inside the frame. Just a suggestion. The foliage of the larger trees is very photogenic. Those alone say in a silhouette with a horse on a puffy cloudy day would be a magical moment. You have got the right elements here in the game. A few minor changes in composition, lighting (i.e. dramatic sidelighting or backlighting during sunset/sunrise ) would alter the image presentation ...should you wish to do so. Otherwise a reasonable photo with redeeming qualities. Good luck.', '2003-01-17 16:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193603, 10978, 4815, '<td valign="top">A pleasnt image to behold. I love the encircling sweep of the branches around the frame. An elegant touch. The detail in the conifers is also appreciated. Often these photos are just foreground silhouettes. The idea of lots of sky to express freedom/openess,etc definetely comes across here. Although it may not have been possible I personally would have liked a little more mountain top plus a few more bolder clouds to glide across the heavens. A good nature shot overall.</td>', 'A pleasnt image to behold. I love the encircling sweep of the branches around the frame. An elegant touch. The detail in the conifers is also appreciated. Often these photos are just foreground silhouettes. The idea of lots of sky to express freedom/openess,etc definetely comes across here. Although it may not have been possible I personally would have liked a little more mountain top plus a few more bolder clouds to glide across the heavens. A good nature shot overall.', '2003-01-17 16:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193606, 10831, 4811, '<td valign="top">jpg quality seems less than it has to be. The file size needs to be maximum 150kb so you have some room to work with if this photo originates from a higher quality image. If not for the image quality, the backdrop is gorgeous, and quite an interesting contrast between a white and barren landscape to a foreground with vegetation. The two worlds seem so near to each other :)</td>', 'jpg quality seems less than it has to be. The file size needs to be maximum 150kb so you have some room to work with if this photo originates from a higher quality image. If not for the image quality, the backdrop is gorgeous, and quite an interesting contrast between a white and barren landscape to a foreground with vegetation. The two worlds seem so near to each other :)', '2003-01-17 17:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193617, 10794, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wish I was there.  Great capture.  I wish I could see a bit more the mountains in the distance.  However, the Rainbow makes the shot.  Jacko.</td>', 'Wish I was there.  Great capture.  I wish I could see a bit more the mountains in the distance.  However, the Rainbow makes the shot.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 18:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(193619, 10778, 2716, '<td valign="top">Looks like a seascape.  Is it?  Nice shot.  I like the depth of field.</td>', 'Looks like a seascape.  Is it?  Nice shot.  I like the depth of field.', '2003-01-17 18:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193620, 11041, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the blend of close and faraway subjects, however the colors seems off ... like a yellowed newspaper.  Still a nice angle.</td>', 'I like the blend of close and faraway subjects, however the colors seems off ... like a yellowed newspaper.  Still a nice angle.', '2003-01-17 18:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193621, 10914, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great colors and contrast.  I like the tiny little mood, too.  Good job.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Great colors and contrast.  I like the tiny little mood, too.  Good job.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-17 18:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(193623, 10741, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflexion.  I find the things growing out of the water disctracting, but I simply love the curves of the hills and the detail of the little trees.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice reflexion.  I find the things growing out of the water disctracting, but I simply love the curves of the hills and the detail of the little trees.  Good job.', '2003-01-17 18:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(193624, 10731, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love those foggy shots.  Very creepy looking.  Good job.  Jacko.</td>', 'Wow!  I love those foggy shots.  Very creepy looking.  Good job.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 18:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193625, 10746, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Looks like something out of Jurassic Park.</td>', 'Great shot.  Looks like something out of Jurassic Park.', '2003-01-17 18:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193626, 10941, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great contrast (snow/no snow).  Good eye.  Cute title.</td>', 'Great contrast (snow/no snow).  Good eye.  Cute title.', '2003-01-17 18:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(193627, 10971, 2716, '<td valign="top">The fence really makes this shot.  The colours are too dark, but it looks like a cloud covered sky.  Maybe show less sky when it is gray like that.  I still like the curves of the fence.  7</td>', 'The fence really makes this shot.  The colours are too dark, but it looks like a cloud covered sky.  Maybe show less sky when it is gray like that.  I still like the curves of the fence.  7', '2003-01-17 18:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193629, 11028, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m jealous!  Wish I was there.  The colours are great and I like the composition.  The only thing I''d change (not sure if possible) is to see the bottom of the fall ... I find the rock on the left bottom corner a bit distracting.  Jacko   9</td>', 'Wow, I''m jealous!  Wish I was there.  The colours are great and I like the composition.  The only thing I''d change (not sure if possible) is to see the bottom of the fall ... I find the rock on the left bottom corner a bit distracting.  Jacko   9', '2003-01-17 18:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(193630, 10943, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love the tree.  I don''t like the inclusion of the industrial plant.  Sure, they are in stark contrast, however I''d rather see something else in the background ... I find the tree is in the perfect placement.  Jacko.  7 because I still think it''s a nice composition.</td>', 'I love the tree.  I don''t like the inclusion of the industrial plant.  Sure, they are in stark contrast, however I''d rather see something else in the background ... I find the tree is in the perfect placement.  Jacko.  7 because I still think it''s a nice composition.', '2003-01-17 18:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(193631, 10762, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great curves.  Seems very interesting, however the whole shot lacks crispness.  Was this taken from a plane.  Looks like fog/haze.  Good eye.</td>', 'Great curves.  Seems very interesting, however the whole shot lacks crispness.  Was this taken from a plane.  Looks like fog/haze.  Good eye.', '2003-01-17 18:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(193632, 10892, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great Macro.  I''ll take away 2 because the title is a stretch.  Jacko  8</td>', 'Great Macro.  I''ll take away 2 because the title is a stretch.  Jacko  8', '2003-01-17 18:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193633, 10847, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice Symetry on the right.  I find the "thing" in the bottom right corner distracting.  Doesn''t seem to fit in the picture.   Still a wonderfull winter shot.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice Symetry on the right.  I find the "thing" in the bottom right corner distracting.  Doesn''t seem to fit in the picture.   Still a wonderfull winter shot.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 18:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(193634, 10875, 2716, '<td valign="top">This shot lacks a bit of brightness.  Tough because of the partially covered sky.</td>', 'This shot lacks a bit of brightness.  Tough because of the partially covered sky.', '2003-01-17 18:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(193635, 11010, 2716, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m officially jealous.  I haven''t been there in 20 years, but I long to go back.  Great shot because of the different interesting elements (all in focus): the rainbow, the sky, the falls, and the ice covered vegetation.  Good job.  ............. 10  :)</td>', 'OK, I''m officially jealous.  I haven''t been there in 20 years, but I long to go back.  Great shot because of the different interesting elements (all in focus): the rainbow, the sky, the falls, and the ice covered vegetation.  Good job.  ............. 10  :)', '2003-01-17 18:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193637, 10812, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  A tad too much haze for my tasted, but I like it all comes together - Mountains, trees and the fields.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Nice and simple.  A tad too much haze for my tasted, but I like it all comes together - Mountains, trees and the fields.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-17 18:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(193638, 10917, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice curves.  I like the contrast between the shadows and light.  Good Job.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice curves.  I like the contrast between the shadows and light.  Good Job.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 18:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(193639, 10947, 2716, '<td valign="top">This shot feels too dark.  Maybe could be brightened up with Photoshop.  Would have been a great shot on a sunny day with a blue sky.  Still a nice composition.  7</td>', 'This shot feels too dark.  Maybe could be brightened up with Photoshop.  Would have been a great shot on a sunny day with a blue sky.  Still a nice composition.  7', '2003-01-17 18:37:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(193641, 10716, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this shot, like at my cottage on a cold morning.   however I think I''d like to see less sky, looks a bit empty.  Good luck.  Jacko</td>', 'I like the feel of this shot, like at my cottage on a cold morning.   however I think I''d like to see less sky, looks a bit empty.  Good luck.  Jacko', '2003-01-17 18:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(193642, 10823, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wish I was there.  I think I''d like to see more of the vegetation and mountain and less sky and mountains.  Seems a bit too blue.  Still a wonderfull shot, ''cause it makes me dream.  Good luck. Jacko  8</td>', 'Wish I was there.  I think I''d like to see more of the vegetation and mountain and less sky and mountains.  Seems a bit too blue.  Still a wonderfull shot, ''cause it makes me dream.  Good luck. Jacko  8', '2003-01-17 18:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(193643, 10856, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love the angle you chose and the two elements: short grass and trees in the distance, however having the sun head on made the shot too bright and caused flar9ing (bottom).</td>', 'I love the angle you chose and the two elements: short grass and trees in the distance, however having the sun head on made the shot too bright and caused flar9ing (bottom).', '2003-01-17 18:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193644, 10993, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Too bad the day was so hazy, because a clearer shot of the hills would have helped out.    Can''t controle Mother Nature I guess :)</td>', 'Cute shot.  Too bad the day was so hazy, because a clearer shot of the hills would have helped out.    Can''t controle Mother Nature I guess :)', '2003-01-17 18:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193648, 10786, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the pink/black combination, but it really lacks a focal point and sharpness<br/></td>', 'I like the pink/black combination, but it really lacks a focal point and sharpness', '2003-01-17 18:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193650, 10893, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the colours.  Nice placement of the people.  Hopefully, DPCers aren''t voting you down because you included people.  Great postcard image.  Jacko.  absolute 10.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the colours.  Nice placement of the people.  Hopefully, DPCers aren''t voting you down because you included people.  Great postcard image.  Jacko.  absolute 10.', '2003-01-17 18:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(193651, 10928, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''m not too sure about the blue inner border.</td>', 'I''m not too sure about the blue inner border.', '2003-01-17 18:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193653, 10895, 6007, '<td valign="top">This would be a good picture for a calendar, greeting card, or something of the sort. I like it</td>', 'This would be a good picture for a calendar, greeting card, or something of the sort. I like it', '2003-01-17 18:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(193654, 10799, 6007, '<td valign="top">I like what the photo is of, however the yellow throws me off, looks like a solar eclipse</td>', 'I like what the photo is of, however the yellow throws me off, looks like a solar eclipse', '2003-01-17 18:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(193655, 10956, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good job.  I like the panoramic crop.</td>', 'Good job.  I like the panoramic crop.', '2003-01-17 18:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193656, 10958, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Looks like a cold day!  I like the curves in front and the clouds faraway.  Good job.  Jacko  8<br/></td>', 'Great shot.  Looks like a cold day!  I like the curves in front and the clouds faraway.  Good job.  Jacko  8', '2003-01-17 19:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(193657, 10922, 6007, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. The clouds make the picture look 3D. The picture almost talks to you..</td>', 'I really like this picture. The clouds make the picture look 3D. The picture almost talks to you..', '2003-01-17 19:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(193658, 10888, 6007, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this one. However the tree is not a good focal point, it si distracting, I would try this shot from a few different angles..</td>', 'I like the colors in this one. However the tree is not a good focal point, it si distracting, I would try this shot from a few different angles..', '2003-01-17 19:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(193659, 10725, 6007, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot. The snow looks so fresh and everything looks pristine and quiet. Good job..</td>', 'Very creative shot. The snow looks so fresh and everything looks pristine and quiet. Good job..', '2003-01-17 19:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(193660, 10814, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''m not too keen on that shadow across the bottom of the picture.  This might have worked better at a different time of day.  Even cropping half way between the bottom of the tree and the photo base works better for me.</td>', 'I''m not too keen on that shadow across the bottom of the picture.  This might have worked better at a different time of day.  Even cropping half way between the bottom of the tree and the photo base works better for me.', '2003-01-17 19:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193661, 10994, 6007, '<td valign="top">The sunset is beautiful, not too sure if I like the focal point. I maybe would have tried to catch a shot of the bottom black horizon and the tops of the few trees that you can see, up to where the sky got dark blue, for stronger contrast without the distraction of the towers..</td>', 'The sunset is beautiful, not too sure if I like the focal point. I maybe would have tried to catch a shot of the bottom black horizon and the tops of the few trees that you can see, up to where the sky got dark blue, for stronger contrast without the distraction of the towers..', '2003-01-17 19:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193662, 10898, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours.  Adding the street lamps makes for a very original shot.  I like it.  Jacko  9</td>', 'Wonderful colours.  Adding the street lamps makes for a very original shot.  I like it.  Jacko  9', '2003-01-17 19:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193663, 10959, 6007, '<td valign="top">I love to catch a pretty relection, they were always when the lake was like glass, this is very cool, love the textures and movement you get out of the reflections, good job...</td>', 'I love to catch a pretty relection, they were always when the lake was like glass, this is very cool, love the textures and movement you get out of the reflections, good job...', '2003-01-17 19:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(193664, 10922, 2716, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this shot in colour.  I suspect we could see more detail.  Everything seems to be lost in the Black and White.</td>', 'I''d like to see this shot in colour.  I suspect we could see more detail.  Everything seems to be lost in the Black and White.', '2003-01-17 19:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(193665, 10936, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the nice blues and the curve of the shore.</td>', 'I like the nice blues and the curve of the shore.', '2003-01-17 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(193666, 10801, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great shot, however I find the sign very distracting.  Maybe if I''d know what the sign says it wouldn''t be as bad.  Very nice tones and contrast.  Jacko.</td>', 'Great shot, however I find the sign very distracting.  Maybe if I''d know what the sign says it wouldn''t be as bad.  Very nice tones and contrast.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 19:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(193667, 10913, 6007, '<td valign="top">Overall I really like the picture, the strong contrasts are attractive to the eye, too bad you could not have catptured a sunset, or clearer skies.<br/>Good job =)</td>', 'Overall I really like the picture, the strong contrasts are attractive to the eye, too bad you could not have catptured a sunset, or clearer skies.Good job =)', '2003-01-17 19:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(193668, 10931, 6007, '<td valign="top">Way to catch movement in a picture, good job =)</td>', 'Way to catch movement in a picture, good job =)', '2003-01-17 19:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193669, 10745, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love the inclusion of the strong elements in front and in the distance.  Good eye.  Jacko.</td>', 'I love the inclusion of the strong elements in front and in the distance.  Good eye.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 19:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(193670, 11019, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s neat.  Did you use a garden hose or was this natural?  Great capture.</td>', 'Wow, that''s neat.  Did you use a garden hose or was this natural?  Great capture.', '2003-01-17 19:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193671, 10904, 6007, '<td valign="top">You have a 10 in my book. Beautiful picture. You are the first 10 I have given =)</td>', 'You have a 10 in my book. Beautiful picture. You are the first 10 I have given =)', '2003-01-17 19:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
