(193686, 10821, 6007, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the sun looks gigantic, the only thing I would have changed was made a different center point for the shot. Crop a portion of the building off, to bring more of your eye to the beautiful horizon..Good job=)</td>', 'Great shot, the sun looks gigantic, the only thing I would have changed was made a different center point for the shot. Crop a portion of the building off, to bring more of your eye to the beautiful horizon..Good job=)', '2003-01-17 19:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
