(193691, 10840, 6007, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, I would have cropped some of the grass out, other than that good job :)</td>', 'Very interesting, I would have cropped some of the grass out, other than that good job :)', '2003-01-17 19:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(193692, 10748, 6007, '<td valign="top">Looks a tad polorized, not a big enough a picture to be sure. Love the colors in the sky, but there is too much black empty space at the bottom of the picture, maybe crop a tad off, other than that it is a good shot...</td>', 'Looks a tad polorized, not a big enough a picture to be sure. Love the colors in the sky, but there is too much black empty space at the bottom of the picture, maybe crop a tad off, other than that it is a good shot...', '2003-01-17 19:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(193693, 10965, 6007, '<td valign="top">Too much light brought in to this picture. The color of the sky is breathtaking, not sure I would have added the focal point here, it is a bit distracting</td>', 'Too much light brought in to this picture. The color of the sky is breathtaking, not sure I would have added the focal point here, it is a bit distracting', '2003-01-17 19:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193700, 11031, 2158, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''d love to live somewhere like that.</td>', 'Wow, I''d love to live somewhere like that.', '2003-01-17 19:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193701, 10965, 3320, '<td valign="top">Just love it ... the light, the contrasts, the 3  zones from top to bottom that are not dead center, rule of thurd but with a nice 1-2-4 proportion that I like. Nice job .. very nice .. good luck for this week .. I hope you get a ribbon :-)<br/>9<br/>ionel</td>', 'Just love it ... the light, the contrasts, the 3  zones from top to bottom that are not dead center, rule of thurd but with a nice 1-2-4 proportion that I like. Nice job .. very nice .. good luck for this week .. I hope you get a ribbon :-)9ionel', '2003-01-17 19:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(193702, 10748, 3320, '<td valign="top">Sorry I do not like thumbmails as pictures.</td>', 'Sorry I do not like thumbmails as pictures.', '2003-01-17 19:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193709, 10756, 2158, '<td valign="top">This looks really good.  Wish you''d made it a bit bigger so I could judge it properly.</td>', 'This looks really good.  Wish you''d made it a bit bigger so I could judge it properly.', '2003-01-17 20:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193710, 10702, 3447, '<td valign="top">You have done a lot with a little.  Good composition.</td>', 'You have done a lot with a little.  Good composition.', '2003-01-17 20:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(193723, 10809, 2752, '<td valign="top">the contrast between the snow..black trees, and red building makes for a very dramatic composition...Only suggestion for me would be cropping out the grey building..it is a distraction for me...leaving the left tree in the photo  of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'the contrast between the snow..black trees, and red building makes for a very dramatic composition...Only suggestion for me would be cropping out the grey building..it is a distraction for me...leaving the left tree in the photo  of course.  Good luck.', '2003-01-17 21:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(193725, 10866, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great composition..good colors and the mood is cold.  Definately mid winter.</td>', 'Great composition..good colors and the mood is cold.  Definately mid winter.', '2003-01-17 21:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193730, 10942, 2716, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfull photo.  IR?  I like the different elements. Tree, building, tomb stones.  Good eye.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'What a wonderfull photo.  IR?  I like the different elements. Tree, building, tomb stones.  Good eye.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-17 21:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(193732, 10966, 2752, '<td valign="top">very well composed..nice play of lines and textures..beautiful transition of colors...white snow, blue stream, frost covered bushes and trees leading into the evergreens and misty background all equal a beautiful photo.  Well done.  One of my 10''s for the week.</td>', 'very well composed..nice play of lines and textures..beautiful transition of colors...white snow, blue stream, frost covered bushes and trees leading into the evergreens and misty background all equal a beautiful photo.  Well done.  One of my 10''s for the week.', '2003-01-17 21:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193733, 10784, 2716, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just love the sky when it looks like this.  Great catpure.  I really like the bright colours.</td>', 'Don''t you just love the sky when it looks like this.  Great catpure.  I really like the bright colours.', '2003-01-17 21:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(193734, 10853, 2716, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours you used for the sky.  Interesint composition with the tree standing out.  Unfortunate the picture is so small.  Jakco.</td>', 'Lovely colours you used for the sky.  Interesint composition with the tree standing out.  Unfortunate the picture is so small.  Jakco.', '2003-01-17 21:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193735, 10830, 2716, '<td valign="top">The picture looks too busy.  Would like to see less buildings, more nature.  However, I like your use of a panoramic crop.  Jacko.</td>', 'The picture looks too busy.  Would like to see less buildings, more nature.  However, I like your use of a panoramic crop.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 21:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(193736, 10831, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wonder, wonderful shot.  I really like the fact you added the tree.  adds a nice little kick.   Good job.  Jacko    9</td>', 'Wonder, wonderful shot.  I really like the fact you added the tree.  adds a nice little kick.   Good job.  Jacko    9', '2003-01-17 21:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(193737, 10907, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice view of the horizon, however there seems to be a lack of detail.  The bottom portionof the image might be too dark.</td>', 'Nice view of the horizon, however there seems to be a lack of detail.  The bottom portionof the image might be too dark.', '2003-01-17 21:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(193738, 10884, 2752, '<td valign="top">very powerful...well taken shot.  I like the coolness of the foreground and the power of the moving water in contrast to the "warm" nonmoving trees in the background.  Well done.</td>', 'very powerful...well taken shot.  I like the coolness of the foreground and the power of the moving water in contrast to the "warm" nonmoving trees in the background.  Well done.', '2003-01-17 21:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(193739, 10932, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the placementof the falls.  Good use of B&amp;W.  I assume the sky was overcast?  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the placementof the falls.  Good use of B&W.  I assume the sky was overcast?  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 21:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(193740, 11023, 5351, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo! I like the composition and colors.  high score :)</td>', 'Stunning photo! I like the composition and colors.  high score :)', '2003-01-17 21:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193741, 11044, 2716, '<td valign="top">The picture somehow seems tilted to the left.  Eveything seems to flow what way.  I like the title ... you really were able to show the peacefullness of nature.  Good work.  Jacko.</td>', 'The picture somehow seems tilted to the left.  Eveything seems to flow what way.  I like the title ... you really were able to show the peacefullness of nature.  Good work.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 21:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(193742, 10950, 2716, '<td valign="top">Beatifull colours.  I find the branch in the upper left a bit distracting.  I think a larger smaller aperture would have helped keep everything in focus.  The lack of focus in the background makes it look like the branch is the main subject.  I still think it''s a nice shot.  Good luck.  Jacko</td>', 'Beatifull colours.  I find the branch in the upper left a bit distracting.  I think a larger smaller aperture would have helped keep everything in focus.  The lack of focus in the background makes it look like the branch is the main subject.  I still think it''s a nice shot.  Good luck.  Jacko', '2003-01-17 21:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193743, 10874, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love the colour in the reflection, but I''m not crazy about the colour of the Ice.  I suppose you can''t have one withouth the other.  Nice effect.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'I love the colour in the reflection, but I''m not crazy about the colour of the Ice.  I suppose you can''t have one withouth the other.  Nice effect.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-17 21:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193744, 10995, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I like the curves and the focus on the rocks, as well as the elements in the distance.  Neat clouds too.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like it.  I like the curves and the focus on the rocks, as well as the elements in the distance.  Neat clouds too.  Good luck.', '2003-01-17 21:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(193745, 10881, 2716, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out what is obstructing our view of the wonderfull tree.  Is it just light from a sunset/sunrise?   I find the cow interesting but the barn distracting.  I''d really like to see more of the tree.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out what is obstructing our view of the wonderfull tree.  Is it just light from a sunset/sunrise?   I find the cow interesting but the barn distracting.  I''d really like to see more of the tree.', '2003-01-17 21:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(193746, 11036, 2716, '<td valign="top">You have captured the drought feeling of this photo.  I like the contrast between the trees an the grass.  Good job at minimizing the sky since it was overcast.  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'You have captured the drought feeling of this photo.  I like the contrast between the trees an the grass.  Good job at minimizing the sky since it was overcast.  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-01-17 21:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(193751, 10838, 1280, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely and well captured!</td>', 'Absolutely lovely and well captured!', '2003-01-17 22:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(193752, 10996, 4793, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty shot, very nice soft colors, but it would work much better if you had made the photo larger, the border would work better if it was not so bold.</td>', 'This is a pretty shot, very nice soft colors, but it would work much better if you had made the photo larger, the border would work better if it was not so bold.', '2003-01-17 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193754, 10847, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and lighting.  The only oddity is that I can''t figure out what the object is sticking out of the ground near the lower left.  Love everything else about this.</td>', 'Very nice composition and lighting.  The only oddity is that I can''t figure out what the object is sticking out of the ground near the lower left.  Love everything else about this.', '2003-01-17 22:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(193755, 10956, 4793, '<td valign="top">So peaceful. A beautiful photo, I like your lead in lines, on the bottom right the three posts grabs me and takes me in a nice curve across the lake, you used the rule of thirds well. Congrats on a nice shot.</td>', 'So peaceful. A beautiful photo, I like your lead in lines, on the bottom right the three posts grabs me and takes me in a nice curve across the lake, you used the rule of thirds well. Congrats on a nice shot.', '2003-01-17 22:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(193756, 10788, 472, '<td valign="top">my favorite pic of the challenge. i liked it when you posted it in the forum too :)</td>', 'my favorite pic of the challenge. i liked it when you posted it in the forum too :)', '2003-01-17 22:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193759, 10903, 4793, '<td valign="top">All the small weeds in the front of this shot are cluttering it up , if you have the oportunity to re-shoot this try it with perhaps just a bit of the palm tree that I see peeking in the top right, or just a couple of the weeds.  The foggy, misty look of this shot and the forms of the ridges are beautiful and you have given me a sense of the moisture in the air.</td>', 'All the small weeds in the front of this shot are cluttering it up , if you have the oportunity to re-shoot this try it with perhaps just a bit of the palm tree that I see peeking in the top right, or just a couple of the weeds.  The foggy, misty look of this shot and the forms of the ridges are beautiful and you have given me a sense of the moisture in the air.', '2003-01-17 22:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(193761, 10746, 4793, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2003-01-17 23:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193762, 10737, 3936, '<td valign="top">So barren, so cold, so lifeless.  I like the way the moon fades into the darkness at the bottom of the frame.  If you stare at the image, the darkness seems to almost creep up from the bottom.  Very nice job on the overall exposure.  8</td>', 'So barren, so cold, so lifeless.  I like the way the moon fades into the darkness at the bottom of the frame.  If you stare at the image, the darkness seems to almost creep up from the bottom.  Very nice job on the overall exposure.  8', '2003-01-17 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(193763, 10884, 5964, '<td valign="top">What beatiful landscape you found. I love the turmoil of the water, the rapids are really interesting. Was the sun behind a hill? I think it would have helped if either the whole shot was overcast in shadow, or all in the sunlight. Especially I would have wanted the rapids/river part of the shot to be lit because that is the focal point of the whole picture. I may also have included a bit less stream and a little more sky, put the horizon a little lower in the shot to give it a little more depth. 7.</td>', 'What beatiful landscape you found. I love the turmoil of the water, the rapids are really interesting. Was the sun behind a hill? I think it would have helped if either the whole shot was overcast in shadow, or all in the sunlight. Especially I would have wanted the rapids/river part of the shot to be lit because that is the focal point of the whole picture. I may also have included a bit less stream and a little more sky, put the horizon a little lower in the shot to give it a little more depth. 7.', '2003-01-17 23:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193764, 10754, 806, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the complete curve of the river. . i.e. framing too cropped on the right side. sky washed out for such a sunny day. Like the contrast of the dirt, water and trees.</td>', 'I would like to see the complete curve of the river. . i.e. framing too cropped on the right side. sky washed out for such a sunny day. Like the contrast of the dirt, water and trees.', '2003-01-17 23:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193765, 10837, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice snowscape without a lot of snow. Good color.</td>', 'Nice snowscape without a lot of snow. Good color.', '2003-01-17 23:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193766, 10913, 3280, '<td valign="top">It is a bit too noisey.  Perhaps because you only used 45 kb of the 150 kb file size allowed.  That and Neat Image would help!</td>', 'It is a bit too noisey.  Perhaps because you only used 45 kb of the 150 kb file size allowed.  That and Neat Image would help!', '2003-01-17 23:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(193767, 11032, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.  I like the lighting and compositon.  I just don''t know what that brown thing is at the bottom right of the Silo.</td>', 'Very cool photo.  I like the lighting and compositon.  I just don''t know what that brown thing is at the bottom right of the Silo.', '2003-01-17 23:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193768, 10815, 806, '<td valign="top">.. and there are more laying down in the field! nice! <br/>Sky is a bit washed out, and the colors muted.. Maybe some color correct?<br/></td>', '.. and there are more laying down in the field! nice! Sky is a bit washed out, and the colors muted.. Maybe some color correct?', '2003-01-17 23:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193769, 10716, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good shot but a little too misty in the background.</td>', 'Good shot but a little too misty in the background.', '2003-01-17 23:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193770, 10957, 3280, '<td valign="top">What an awesome tree.  I wish I could see a bit more of it though.</td>', 'What an awesome tree.  I wish I could see a bit more of it though.', '2003-01-17 23:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(193771, 10966, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  I like it. I''ll be glad to see how you did it.</td>', 'This is really cool.  I like it. I''ll be glad to see how you did it.', '2003-01-17 23:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(193772, 10809, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice framing job and color.  I wish that car wasn''t there though.</td>', 'Nice framing job and color.  I wish that car wasn''t there though.', '2003-01-17 23:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193773, 10735, 3280, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous, we have 8 inches of snow!  Very nice colors. and I like the rocks in front.</td>', 'I''m jealous, we have 8 inches of snow!  Very nice colors. and I like the rocks in front.', '2003-01-17 23:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(193774, 10741, 5964, '<td valign="top">Wow what a reflection in the pond, were you using a polarized filter? I can see so much detail under the water. The colors in this shot turned out great. There is something I cannot place about this shot when I look away and look back, I find myself concentrating on the foreground almost everytime. I think I might have cropped a bit more of the water, about a half an inch and included that half an inch in the sky. That big yellow trees draw my eye also I wonder ehat it would have looked like with the whole grove int he shot. Overall nicely done and great focus.8.</td>', 'Wow what a reflection in the pond, were you using a polarized filter? I can see so much detail under the water. The colors in this shot turned out great. There is something I cannot place about this shot when I look away and look back, I find myself concentrating on the foreground almost everytime. I think I might have cropped a bit more of the water, about a half an inch and included that half an inch in the sky. That big yellow trees draw my eye also I wonder ehat it would have looked like with the whole grove int he shot. Overall nicely done and great focus.8.', '2003-01-17 23:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(193775, 10841, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really nice color but I''m not positive that this qualifies for hte challenge.</td>', 'Really nice color but I''m not positive that this qualifies for hte challenge.', '2003-01-17 23:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(193776, 10945, 3280, '<td valign="top">Looks like they are having a blast.  Seems just a bit soft on focus.</td>', 'Looks like they are having a blast.  Seems just a bit soft on focus.', '2003-01-17 23:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193777, 10929, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an awesome view!  I really like the building on the point. The lighting works great too.  I wish it wasn''t quite so hazy but don''t think you have much control over that.</td>', 'Wow, what an awesome view!  I really like the building on the point. The lighting works great too.  I wish it wasn''t quite so hazy but don''t think you have much control over that.', '2003-01-17 23:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(193778, 10840, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, colors are great.  I know this seems petty but I thing the shot would benefit by having the horses walking into the shot insteaf of out of it.</td>', 'Nice shot, colors are great.  I know this seems petty but I thing the shot would benefit by having the horses walking into the shot insteaf of out of it.', '2003-01-17 23:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(193779, 10867, 806, '<td valign="top">Love the low angle used to take this shot, and my eye follows the lines of the field and mountain range to the horizon beyond. Great catch of clouds and time of day! fabulous! you got it!</td>', 'Love the low angle used to take this shot, and my eye follows the lines of the field and mountain range to the horizon beyond. Great catch of clouds and time of day! fabulous! you got it!', '2003-01-17 23:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193780, 10751, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, the clouds are awesome.  I wish it was just a bit brighter though.</td>', 'This is really nice, the clouds are awesome.  I wish it was just a bit brighter though.', '2003-01-17 23:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(193781, 10736, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job, the boats are great.  You may have been able to crop just a bit of the sky though.</td>', 'Nice job, the boats are great.  You may have been able to crop just a bit of the sky though.', '2003-01-17 23:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193782, 10770, 5964, '<td valign="top">I really like the dynamics of this shot, where the horizon is placed and where the reflective beach seems to fade away to black. The placement of the dock is great, just the plain sunset would have been pretty but not content, here there is a subject int he shot. It makes me think I would have loved to be out there staring off into the sunset and the waves. My only observation/question is what is that blurred object just below the dock. This really caught my attention becasue everything else int he shot is ion perfect focus.  Great capture.8.<br/></td>', 'I really like the dynamics of this shot, where the horizon is placed and where the reflective beach seems to fade away to black. The placement of the dock is great, just the plain sunset would have been pretty but not content, here there is a subject int he shot. It makes me think I would have loved to be out there staring off into the sunset and the waves. My only observation/question is what is that blurred object just below the dock. This really caught my attention becasue everything else int he shot is ion perfect focus.  Great capture.8.', '2003-01-18 00:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(193783, 10788, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I really like the color.  The motion of the water is super too.  One of my faves this week.  The way the color reflects of of the big rock on the left is unbelievable.</td>', 'This is a great shot, I really like the color.  The motion of the water is super too.  One of my faves this week.  The way the color reflects of of the big rock on the left is unbelievable.', '2003-01-18 00:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193784, 10959, 806, '<td valign="top">nice abstract!!</td>', 'nice abstract!!', '2003-01-18 00:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(193785, 10969, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the colors.  I wonder if having the barn just a bit to the right wouldn''t have improved this a touch.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the colors.  I wonder if having the barn just a bit to the right wouldn''t have improved this a touch.', '2003-01-18 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193786, 10778, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty interesting but I''m not sure exactly what I am looking at.</td>', 'Pretty interesting but I''m not sure exactly what I am looking at.', '2003-01-18 00:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193787, 10737, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is pretty close.  Were you on the shuttle or something?  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow, that is pretty close.  Were you on the shuttle or something?  Nice job.', '2003-01-18 00:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193788, 11044, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I really like the water and the title really describes it.</td>', 'Very nice, I really like the water and the title really describes it.', '2003-01-18 00:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
