(193808, 10835, 3900, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but I don''t think the border works with this pic since there are too many areas where it seems to become the photo, and then it becomes a border again.  Try another color or lose the border altogether.  This will stand alone just fine without one.</td>', 'Very nice, but I don''t think the border works with this pic since there are too many areas where it seems to become the photo, and then it becomes a border again.  Try another color or lose the border altogether.  This will stand alone just fine without one.', '2003-01-18 02:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(193809, 10905, 3900, '<td valign="top">I love the silhouette of the tree.  The only thing I don''t like is the branch sticking in from the other tree at the top right.  I know, mother nature can be so contrary sometimes.  Anyway, great shot overall.</td>', 'I love the silhouette of the tree.  The only thing I don''t like is the branch sticking in from the other tree at the top right.  I know, mother nature can be so contrary sometimes.  Anyway, great shot overall.', '2003-01-18 02:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(193810, 10835, 933, '<td valign="top">A very striking photo.  The composition on this is pretty good, though a little less sky might have benefitted the image. Adjusting the levels might have brought out some of the colors a little more as well.  but all in all a great photo.  8  md</td>', 'A very striking photo.  The composition on this is pretty good, though a little less sky might have benefitted the image. Adjusting the levels might have brought out some of the colors a little more as well.  but all in all a great photo.  8  md', '2003-01-18 02:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(193811, 10838, 933, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo.  Very crisp, beautiful colors, good composition.  Though I think I might have moved the horizon line down a bit to the 1/3 height level.  A little less of the water.  Congrats on a very nice image.  8  md</td>', 'A beautiful photo.  Very crisp, beautiful colors, good composition.  Though I think I might have moved the horizon line down a bit to the 1/3 height level.  A little less of the water.  Congrats on a very nice image.  8  md', '2003-01-18 02:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193812, 10788, 933, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. Kind of a mysical feel to it.  Nice colors and feel.  Good composition.  8 md</td>', 'Cool photo. Kind of a mysical feel to it.  Nice colors and feel.  Good composition.  8 md', '2003-01-18 02:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193813, 11023, 933, '<td valign="top">A nice image.  Though a little washed out - a little hazy that day it seems.  Maybe playing with the Levels in PS might have helped pop the colors a bit. The focus also seems a bit soft.  Good job.  8  md</td>', 'A nice image.  Though a little washed out - a little hazy that day it seems.  Maybe playing with the Levels in PS might have helped pop the colors a bit. The focus also seems a bit soft.  Good job.  8  md', '2003-01-18 02:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(193814, 10893, 933, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  The couple is a nice touch.  Good composition.  8  md</td>', 'Very nice photo.  The couple is a nice touch.  Good composition.  8  md', '2003-01-18 02:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193818, 11010, 5121, '<td valign="top">Superb composition with the icicles in the fore, and that rainbow has come out great. Lovely shot!</td>', 'Superb composition with the icicles in the fore, and that rainbow has come out great. Lovely shot!', '2003-01-18 05:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193819, 10818, 5121, '<td valign="top">Lovely golden reflections in the still water, cascading into a little waterfall at the bottom. Potentially two great pictures, but masterfully integrated as one.</td>', 'Lovely golden reflections in the still water, cascading into a little waterfall at the bottom. Potentially two great pictures, but masterfully integrated as one.', '2003-01-18 05:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193820, 11006, 5121, '<td valign="top">Superb panaramic image. I think the frame might be a bit heavy though?</td>', 'Superb panaramic image. I think the frame might be a bit heavy though?', '2003-01-18 05:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(193821, 10799, 5121, '<td valign="top">I like the way the picture burns into the border. Lovely Postcard. I''d love to see a picture with those trees a bit closer,. They''re fantastic.</td>', 'I like the way the picture burns into the border. Lovely Postcard. I''d love to see a picture with those trees a bit closer,. They''re fantastic.', '2003-01-18 05:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(193822, 11028, 5121, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich colours and composed well!</td>', 'Lovely rich colours and composed well!', '2003-01-18 05:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(193823, 10897, 5121, '<td valign="top">Any photographer that takes advantage of this type of weather phenomenon gets my respect. Early or late, this is the type of thing that''ll make a great picture. One thing: shame the foreground wasn''t a tad lighter.</td>', 'Any photographer that takes advantage of this type of weather phenomenon gets my respect. Early or late, this is the type of thing that''ll make a great picture. One thing: shame the foreground wasn''t a tad lighter.', '2003-01-18 05:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(193827, 10944, 5121, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this is what summers all about. Lovely colourful image! This would look great as a BW/colour mix. Take a look at my BW/colour mix album at www.picturetrail.com/freezethemoment to see what I did with a shot I took of a crowded harbour in Cornwall.</td>', 'Yeah, this is what summers all about. Lovely colourful image! This would look great as a BW/colour mix. Take a look at my BW/colour mix album at www.picturetrail.com/freezethemoment to see what I did with a shot I took of a crowded harbour in Cornwall.', '2003-01-18 07:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193828, 10773, 5121, '<td valign="top">Lovely tree. I could make an entire album of this image, taken at differing angles at different times of the day and seasons. Think about it...</td>', 'Lovely tree. I could make an entire album of this image, taken at differing angles at different times of the day and seasons. Think about it...', '2003-01-18 07:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193829, 10838, 5121, '<td valign="top">Lovely image with crisp whites (I''m shivering here!) and superb reflections. Nice border too!</td>', 'Lovely image with crisp whites (I''m shivering here!) and superb reflections. Nice border too!', '2003-01-18 07:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193830, 10914, 5121, '<td valign="top">Almost a silhouette but with some good highlights on the trunk and branches. Great shadows on the snow, lovely composition!</td>', 'Almost a silhouette but with some good highlights on the trunk and branches. Great shadows on the snow, lovely composition!', '2003-01-18 07:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(193831, 10851, 5121, '<td valign="top">This sunrise is near-as-dammit a carbon copy of the sunrise in my picture for this challenge. Lovely warm reflections on the windmill.  Say, if you want to see a windmill photo that''ll blow your socks off, take a look at my landscape album at www.picturetrail.com/freezethemoment.  Well done and good luck.</td>', 'This sunrise is near-as-dammit a carbon copy of the sunrise in my picture for this challenge. Lovely warm reflections on the windmill.  Say, if you want to see a windmill photo that''ll blow your socks off, take a look at my landscape album at www.picturetrail.com/freezethemoment.  Well done and good luck.', '2003-01-18 07:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(193832, 10911, 5121, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture and nicely composed!</td>', 'Lovely picture and nicely composed!', '2003-01-18 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(193833, 11023, 5121, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a lovely sight. I envy you. Well done!</td>', 'Wow, what a lovely sight. I envy you. Well done!', '2003-01-18 07:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193834, 10789, 2716, '<td valign="top">Houses as far as the eye can see:)  Isn''t that sad.  Since the sky is overcast, it would be better to show less sky, and more buildings.  Nice vantage point.  Jacko.</td>', 'Houses as far as the eye can see:)  Isn''t that sad.  Since the sky is overcast, it would be better to show less sky, and more buildings.  Nice vantage point.  Jacko.', '2003-01-18 07:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193835, 10905, 2716, '<td valign="top">Super duper silhouette!  My only gripe would be to more of the wonderfull tree.  Good job.</td>', 'Super duper silhouette!  My only gripe would be to more of the wonderfull tree.  Good job.', '2003-01-18 07:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(193836, 11043, 2716, '<td valign="top">OK my turn:  I''d like to see the horzion more horizontal.  <br/> <br/>That being said, I love the colour of the sky and the sihouettes.  Good luck.</td>', 'OK my turn:  I''d like to see the horzion more horizontal.   That being said, I love the colour of the sky and the sihouettes.  Good luck.', '2003-01-18 07:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(193838, 10773, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great choice of framing ... put the tree exactly where I\''d want ot see it.  Good job at minismising the foreground, with just enough of the fence to make it interesting.  9.  Would be spectacular if the sky was more bright blue (something to add on with Photoshop, and hang on your wall).  Good job.  Jacko.</td>', 'Great choice of framing ... put the tree exactly where I\''d want ot see it.  Good job at minismising the foreground, with just enough of the fence to make it interesting.  9.  Would be spectacular if the sky was more bright blue (something to add on with Photoshop, and hang on your wall).  Good job.  Jacko.', '2003-01-18 07:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(193839, 10701, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ecellent firy colours however th picture still seems a bit too dark.  I''d like to see a bit more detailin the silhouette.  Still a great effect.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ecellent firy colours however th picture still seems a bit too dark.  I''d like to see a bit more detailin the silhouette.  Still a great effect.  Good luck.', '2003-01-18 07:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(193840, 10968, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Missing a little something.  Did you try converting to Black and White (or is this B&amp;W)?</td>', 'Nice capture.  Missing a little something.  Did you try converting to Black and White (or is this B&W)?', '2003-01-18 07:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(193841, 10814, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The shadow (front of picture) takes away from the colours.  Maybe better during another time of day.  Lovely sky colour.  Like the contrast between mountains and fields.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The shadow (front of picture) takes away from the colours.  Maybe better during another time of day.  Lovely sky colour.  Like the contrast between mountains and fields.  Jacko.', '2003-01-18 07:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193843, 10981, 4615, '<td valign="top">A very elegant study of lines and curves.</td>', 'A very elegant study of lines and curves.', '2003-01-18 08:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(193844, 10882, 4615, '<td valign="top">too small.</td>', 'too small.', '2003-01-18 08:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(193845, 10874, 4615, '<td valign="top">the slab of ice at the top, makes the composition apppear top heavy.  The colors in the water are nice.</td>', 'the slab of ice at the top, makes the composition apppear top heavy.  The colors in the water are nice.', '2003-01-18 08:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(193846, 10811, 4615, '<td valign="top">Its a greta photo.  But its not a landscape, and the idea is for every to compete equal in the same genre.  Playing with the title is cute, but doesn''t change what it is.</td>', 'Its a greta photo.  But its not a landscape, and the idea is for every to compete equal in the same genre.  Playing with the title is cute, but doesn''t change what it is.', '2003-01-18 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193847, 10778, 4615, '<td valign="top">phallic!</td>', 'phallic!', '2003-01-18 09:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(193848, 10905, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lovely! The silhouette of the tree adds imensely to the overall image.</td>', 'Lovely! The silhouette of the tree adds imensely to the overall image.', '2003-01-18 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(193849, 10940, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I would have eliminated some of the foreground though.  Tilted the camera up to capture more sky and put the house in the lower third.  <br/>The coloring here is very nice. The red adds wonderful contrasting warmth to the cold winter scene.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I would have eliminated some of the foreground though.  Tilted the camera up to capture more sky and put the house in the lower third.  The coloring here is very nice. The red adds wonderful contrasting warmth to the cold winter scene.', '2003-01-18 09:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(193850, 10751, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice painterly quality, and the panoramic format works well.  The colors are nice.  I''d like to see a little more detail in the land and sea...just bit. Very nice anyway. :-) Beautiful coloring in the sky.</td>', 'Very nice painterly quality, and the panoramic format works well.  The colors are nice.  I''d like to see a little more detail in the land and sea...just bit. Very nice anyway. :-) Beautiful coloring in the sky.', '2003-01-18 09:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193851, 10929, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a viewpoint it is!!!  Just wonderful!  Unfortunately there isn''t enough detail in the shaded part and the highlighted part could use a filter to clarify a bit.  I still like it, but would score higher with those details fixed.  It is a very beautiful scene.</td>', 'Wow!  What a viewpoint it is!!!  Just wonderful!  Unfortunately there isn''t enough detail in the shaded part and the highlighted part could use a filter to clarify a bit.  I still like it, but would score higher with those details fixed.  It is a very beautiful scene.', '2003-01-18 09:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(193852, 10898, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, perfect tme of day, and well captured.</td>', 'Very pretty, perfect tme of day, and well captured.', '2003-01-18 09:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(193855, 10792, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like how you framed the bench under the bridge.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like how you framed the bench under the bridge.', '2003-01-18 09:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(193856, 10731, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and different.. I like it...moody.</td>', 'Very interesting and different.. I like it...moody.', '2003-01-18 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(193858, 10849, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors.  I''ve taken a lot of sunrise pics that have similar colors.  Not sure I like how centered everything is.  I think a little different framing would make this shot better.   A nice shot regardless. - Inspzil</td>', 'Awesome colors.  I''ve taken a lot of sunrise pics that have similar colors.  Not sure I like how centered everything is.  I think a little different framing would make this shot better.   A nice shot regardless. - Inspzil', '2003-01-18 09:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(193859, 10946, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the scene but it''s very dark.  I had just the opposite problem with a similar picture recently....too bright.</td>', 'I like the scene but it''s very dark.  I had just the opposite problem with a similar picture recently....too bright.', '2003-01-18 09:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(193860, 10904, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the grass in the foreground, but that''s just me.  The rest of the shot is absolutely picturesque.  Nice job! - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t like the grass in the foreground, but that''s just me.  The rest of the shot is absolutely picturesque.  Nice job! - Inspzil', '2003-01-18 10:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193861, 11043, 3540, '<td valign="top">The fact that the land part on this one is silhouetted plus the sun barely over the horizon makes this more of an sunset/sunrise pic than a landscape IMO.  Cropping this one would''ve done a world of good.  I''d have cut the pic off in front of the power pole on the lower right.  I''d have also cut the road out of the bottom of the pic and then seen where to go from there.  Might have to sacrifice a little sky or the tree on the left to get the proportions as you''d like them. - Inspzil</td>', 'The fact that the land part on this one is silhouetted plus the sun barely over the horizon makes this more of an sunset/sunrise pic than a landscape IMO.  Cropping this one would''ve done a world of good.  I''d have cut the pic off in front of the power pole on the lower right.  I''d have also cut the road out of the bottom of the pic and then seen where to go from there.  Might have to sacrifice a little sky or the tree on the left to get the proportions as you''d like them. - Inspzil', '2003-01-18 10:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(193862, 10847, 3540, '<td valign="top">very scenic.  Nice shot! - Inspzil</td>', 'very scenic.  Nice shot! - Inspzil', '2003-01-18 10:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(193878, 10975, 2011, '<td valign="top">This picture is a great example of DOF, moreso than landscape.  It has wonderful colors.  The thorns are perfectly sharp. 7 is best I can do for you though.</td>', 'This picture is a great example of DOF, moreso than landscape.  It has wonderful colors.  The thorns are perfectly sharp. 7 is best I can do for you though.', '2003-01-18 11:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193880, 11033, 2011, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Reminds me of Setz.......</td>', 'Great shot. Reminds me of Setz.......', '2003-01-18 11:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(193883, 10904, 2011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. You most have to go a long way to get to the pub.</td>', 'Beautiful. You most have to go a long way to get to the pub.', '2003-01-18 11:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193888, 10768, 2011, '<td valign="top">This works really well in black and white. Adds to the feeling of desolation .</td>', 'This works really well in black and white. Adds to the feeling of desolation .', '2003-01-18 11:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(193895, 10981, 2011, '<td valign="top">Can I come live with you?  This is what a landscape is supposed to be.  Beautiful land, beautiful shot. 10</td>', 'Can I come live with you?  This is what a landscape is supposed to be.  Beautiful land, beautiful shot. 10', '2003-01-18 11:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(193903, 10903, 4159, '<td valign="top">Range of greens is nice.  I like the grass; however, i think it should''ve been a little less.</td>', 'Range of greens is nice.  I like the grass; however, i think it should''ve been a little less.', '2003-01-18 13:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(193904, 10946, 4159, '<td valign="top">Something about the presentation here is not as effective as it could be.  Could''ve stood to be a bit brighter, especially on the "land" part.</td>', 'Something about the presentation here is not as effective as it could be.  Could''ve stood to be a bit brighter, especially on the "land" part.', '2003-01-18 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(193905, 11020, 4159, '<td valign="top">I think you might have been able to find a better crop that would place the tree in a different place than just off center; it''s really the focal point, and those beautiful mountains should have been.<br/></td>', 'I think you might have been able to find a better crop that would place the tree in a different place than just off center; it''s really the focal point, and those beautiful mountains should have been.', '2003-01-18 13:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(193907, 10995, 4159, '<td valign="top">Photographically, this is well done.  The picture doesn''t really capture my interest, though, and I''m not sure what to suggest to improve that.  Small detractors for me are that speck out a ways, and the way the rocks in the bottom right corner draw my focus.</td>', 'Photographically, this is well done.  The picture doesn''t really capture my interest, though, and I''m not sure what to suggest to improve that.  Small detractors for me are that speck out a ways, and the way the rocks in the bottom right corner draw my focus.', '2003-01-18 13:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(193908, 10875, 4159, '<td valign="top">I''m sure everyone has already said that the grain detracts here.  Additionally, the pins-and-needles feel of the brsh and the trees on the left really give the picture an unpleasant feel.</td>', 'I''m sure everyone has already said that the grain detracts here.  Additionally, the pins-and-needles feel of the brsh and the trees on the left really give the picture an unpleasant feel.', '2003-01-18 13:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193909, 10756, 1, '<td valign="top">Such stunning colors, but it''s so horribly small that I can''t make much out.  I would love to see a high resolution of this image.</td>', 'Such stunning colors, but it''s so horribly small that I can''t make much out.  I would love to see a high resolution of this image.', '2003-01-18 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(193911, 10799, 4159, '<td valign="top">The colors work really well here.  If possible, you should have submitted a larger size, though, as the loss of detail can hurt you.</td>', 'The colors work really well here.  If possible, you should have submitted a larger size, though, as the loss of detail can hurt you.', '2003-01-18 13:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(193912, 10936, 4159, '<td valign="top">I would''ve needed more brilliant colors or less human clutter for this picture to be effective.  The crop is good for what you have, though.</td>', 'I would''ve needed more brilliant colors or less human clutter for this picture to be effective.  The crop is good for what you have, though.', '2003-01-18 13:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(193913, 10911, 4159, '<td valign="top">The black and white is very successful here, gives the water a sheen of silver.  The quadrants all contrast, too, and that''s effective.  Good work.</td>', 'The black and white is very successful here, gives the water a sheen of silver.  The quadrants all contrast, too, and that''s effective.  Good work.', '2003-01-18 13:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(193914, 10918, 4159, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about this.  Without the black and white and high contrast, this really wouldn''t have appeared desolate to me.  I think, too, that you might have had more success with a lower angle.</td>', 'I''m not sure about this.  Without the black and white and high contrast, this really wouldn''t have appeared desolate to me.  I think, too, that you might have had more success with a lower angle.', '2003-01-18 13:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193915, 10821, 4159, '<td valign="top">Blurry.  But I like the trio idea, and I personally have no problem with buildings in a landscape.</td>', 'Blurry.  But I like the trio idea, and I personally have no problem with buildings in a landscape.', '2003-01-18 13:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193916, 10904, 4159, '<td valign="top">I can almost see Frodo and his gang running across one of those hills.  I think you might have tried this picture with less grass and more sky, but I do liike the composition outside of that.</td>', 'I can almost see Frodo and his gang running across one of those hills.  I think you might have tried this picture with less grass and more sky, but I do liike the composition outside of that.', '2003-01-18 13:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(193917, 10917, 4159, '<td valign="top">It''s a stretch, this is more of a texture to me.  But it''s  a very nice texture - light/shadow contrast is effective.</td>', 'It''s a stretch, this is more of a texture to me.  But it''s  a very nice texture - light/shadow contrast is effective.', '2003-01-18 13:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193918, 10907, 4159, '<td valign="top">That tall whatever-it-is is really distracting.  The picture itself is a bit dark, and there''s probably too much sky in it to work for me.</td>', 'That tall whatever-it-is is really distracting.  The picture itself is a bit dark, and there''s probably too much sky in it to work for me.', '2003-01-18 13:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193919, 11007, 4159, '<td valign="top">Looks drawn by hand, nice effect.  I think a tighter crop along the buildings, with a little less sky and a little less foreground, would have been more effective, though.</td>', 'Looks drawn by hand, nice effect.  I think a tighter crop along the buildings, with a little less sky and a little less foreground, would have been more effective, though.', '2003-01-18 13:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(193920, 10854, 4159, '<td valign="top">The building in the back detracts a good deal.  Have you considered a tighter crop without the left side, and black and white?</td>', 'The building in the back detracts a good deal.  Have you considered a tighter crop without the left side, and black and white?', '2003-01-18 13:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(193921, 11019, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice find. The color really gives the feel of cold.</td>', 'Nice find. The color really gives the feel of cold.', '2003-01-18 13:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(193922, 10945, 4159, '<td valign="top">Focus is a big problem here.</td>', 'Focus is a big problem here.', '2003-01-18 13:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193923, 10971, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice winter "feel" and like the way the split-rail fence leads my ey from the foreground, to the background.</td>', 'Very nice winter "feel" and like the way the split-rail fence leads my ey from the foreground, to the background.', '2003-01-18 15:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193924, 10812, 4159, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a good eye for where to put things in a picture; however, the image is a bit overexposed, and something gives the whole thing impression of colored pencil, which doesn''t really work here.</td>', 'You''ve got a good eye for where to put things in a picture; however, the image is a bit overexposed, and something gives the whole thing impression of colored pencil, which doesn''t really work here.', '2003-01-18 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(193925, 10825, 4159, '<td valign="top">The image is too dark for me; a little post-processing might have fixed this.</td>', 'The image is too dark for me; a little post-processing might have fixed this.', '2003-01-18 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(193926, 10824, 4159, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work for me; the arboreal chaos at the top and the speed of the water don''t combine to give me much of a sense of serenity.  I do like the reflections on the water at the bottom left, but this isn''t enough of a saving grace.</td>', 'This doesn''t work for me; the arboreal chaos at the top and the speed of the water don''t combine to give me much of a sense of serenity.  I do like the reflections on the water at the bottom left, but this isn''t enough of a saving grace.', '2003-01-18 15:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(193927, 10822, 4159, '<td valign="top">I know that we''re stretching the definition of landscape in this challenge, but this doesn''t qualify for me.  Setting that aside, I don''t find this to be effective in composition either; the tree in the upper left and the thing (pole?) in the upper right are very distracting.</td>', 'I know that we''re stretching the definition of landscape in this challenge, but this doesn''t qualify for me.  Setting that aside, I don''t find this to be effective in composition either; the tree in the upper left and the thing (pole?) in the upper right are very distracting.', '2003-01-18 15:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193928, 10736, 4159, '<td valign="top">The sky is really very nice here, but the water seems almost infested with all of those boats; they have an unpleasant effect on the overall composition.</td>', 'The sky is really very nice here, but the water seems almost infested with all of those boats; they have an unpleasant effect on the overall composition.', '2003-01-18 15:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(193929, 10912, 5383, '<td valign="top">Very busy photo. I like it.</td>', 'Very busy photo. I like it.', '2003-01-18 15:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(193930, 10946, 5383, '<td valign="top">Could have been great, but to dark.</td>', 'Could have been great, but to dark.', '2003-01-18 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(193931, 10862, 5383, '<td valign="top">Great composition</td>', 'Great composition', '2003-01-18 15:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(193932, 10754, 4159, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been more successful if you had come at a different time in the day; the shadow detracts a good deal.</td>', 'I think this would have been more successful if you had come at a different time in the day; the shadow detracts a good deal.', '2003-01-18 15:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193933, 11028, 4159, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this picture.  Parts of it seem a bit out of focus or of low definition, such as the upper left corner.  You might have brightened it a little, or saturated the sky a little more.  Good job, though.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this picture.  Parts of it seem a bit out of focus or of low definition, such as the upper left corner.  You might have brightened it a little, or saturated the sky a little more.  Good job, though.', '2003-01-18 15:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(193934, 10769, 4159, '<td valign="top">I think you probably had too much sky in this picture; a tighter crop might have been in order.</td>', 'I think you probably had too much sky in this picture; a tighter crop might have been in order.', '2003-01-18 15:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(193937, 10939, 4159, '<td valign="top">This might have been better if you had included only the right half of this picture; try out the crop, and see how it works.</td>', 'This might have been better if you had included only the right half of this picture; try out the crop, and see how it works.', '2003-01-18 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(193938, 10910, 4159, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here, and I''m extremely jealous of the view.  Nice picture.</td>', 'I really like the composition here, and I''m extremely jealous of the view.  Nice picture.', '2003-01-18 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(193939, 10975, 4159, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little too prominent.  Your landscape is completely blurred, and though I know you meant to do this, I don''t think the thorns are enough of an interesting focus for htis picture.</td>', 'Perhaps a little too prominent.  Your landscape is completely blurred, and though I know you meant to do this, I don''t think the thorns are enough of an interesting focus for htis picture.', '2003-01-18 15:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(193941, 10898, 5383, '<td valign="top">I like the way the low light level was used.</td>', 'I like the way the low light level was used.', '2003-01-18 15:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(193942, 10969, 5383, '<td valign="top">Nice setting.</td>', 'Nice setting.', '2003-01-18 15:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(193943, 10942, 5383, '<td valign="top">I get an eerie feeling and I think that''s what you were after here.</td>', 'I get an eerie feeling and I think that''s what you were after here.', '2003-01-18 15:54:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(193944, 10799, 5383, '<td valign="top">A building was chopped off. I like how the sun is trying to get through the clouds.<br/> <br/></td>', 'A building was chopped off. I like how the sun is trying to get through the clouds. ', '2003-01-18 15:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(193945, 10990, 5383, '<td valign="top">Awesome black and white.</td>', 'Awesome black and white.', '2003-01-18 15:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(193946, 10879, 6284, '<td valign="top">Very Interesting the way you are drawn into the photo</td>', 'Very Interesting the way you are drawn into the photo', '2003-01-18 15:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(193947, 10794, 5383, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. Pot of gold is right over there.</td>', 'Very beautiful. Pot of gold is right over there.', '2003-01-18 15:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193949, 11038, 5383, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus</td>', 'Slightly out of focus', '2003-01-18 15:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(193950, 10908, 5383, '<td valign="top">Clouds give you the feeling you''re in them.</td>', 'Clouds give you the feeling you''re in them.', '2003-01-18 15:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(193951, 10902, 6284, '<td valign="top">Impressive use of nature to frame the view</td>', 'Impressive use of nature to frame the view', '2003-01-18 16:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(193952, 10906, 5383, '<td valign="top">Very nice night shot.</td>', 'Very nice night shot.', '2003-01-18 16:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193953, 10712, 5383, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors</td>', 'Very nice colors', '2003-01-18 16:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(193957, 10832, 4430, '<td valign="top">I think that this could be quite beautiful but has some focus issues.  If you used a star filter I like the affect.</td>', 'I think that this could be quite beautiful but has some focus issues.  If you used a star filter I like the affect.', '2003-01-18 16:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193958, 11005, 4430, '<td valign="top">I think that the tree that got cut off could have been an interesting focal point.  Also this is really dark, hard to tell what I''m really looking at, besides the picnic table.  Nice job capturing the snow.</td>', 'I think that the tree that got cut off could have been an interesting focal point.  Also this is really dark, hard to tell what I''m really looking at, besides the picnic table.  Nice job capturing the snow.', '2003-01-18 16:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(193959, 10728, 4430, '<td valign="top">this is so peaceful and beautiful but I keep looking for the top of the picture.</td>', 'this is so peaceful and beautiful but I keep looking for the top of the picture.', '2003-01-18 16:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
