(194012, 10741, 1863, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful picture, the colours are lovely. To make it even better, I would have completely cropped out the water area, and just shown the land and the sky. Those are absolutely perfect :) - 7- Annida :)</td>', 'What a beautiful picture, the colours are lovely. To make it even better, I would have completely cropped out the water area, and just shown the land and the sky. Those are absolutely perfect :) - 7- Annida :)', '2003-01-18 18:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(194015, 10990, 4811, '<td valign="top">Though the sky is dramatic, I do find there is too much of it, and the most interesting parts of the sky are closer to the bottom. Since the most dramatic portions of your image are all in the lower 1/6th of the photo, I think having a panormic crop of just the mountain itself with some sky above it to be a better frame for the photo. Quite a good capture nonetheless!!</td>', 'Though the sky is dramatic, I do find there is too much of it, and the most interesting parts of the sky are closer to the bottom. Since the most dramatic portions of your image are all in the lower 1/6th of the photo, I think having a panormic crop of just the mountain itself with some sky above it to be a better frame for the photo. Quite a good capture nonetheless!!', '2003-01-18 18:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
