(194049, 10745, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice, I like being able to see a lot of things in a landscape. Forground and background here are very good! 9</td>', 'Really nice, I like being able to see a lot of things in a landscape. Forground and background here are very good! 9', '2003-01-18 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(194050, 10944, 2780, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling people might rate this down having so many people in it, but i like it. The background is great, with nice rolling hills and great rock formations, compared to the very angular buildings. Great shot. 9</td>', 'I get the feeling people might rate this down having so many people in it, but i like it. The background is great, with nice rolling hills and great rock formations, compared to the very angular buildings. Great shot. 9', '2003-01-18 19:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
