(194056, 11028, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- what a great spot!  I wish I lived near something like that! -10</td>', 'Wow -- what a great spot!  I wish I lived near something like that! -10', '2003-01-18 19:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(194061, 10990, 3532, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a better photograph in color.  The mass of gray cloud in the upper right quarter of the picture is too undifferentiated in tone to make an interesting black and white photo.</td>', 'I think this would have been a better photograph in color.  The mass of gray cloud in the upper right quarter of the picture is too undifferentiated in tone to make an interesting black and white photo.', '2003-01-18 20:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(194063, 10849, 3532, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  It might have been more interesting if the sun was a little less centered in the  compostion</td>', 'Good photo.  It might have been more interesting if the sun was a little less centered in the  compostion', '2003-01-18 20:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(194065, 10801, 3080, '<td valign="top">Did you chose black and white cause the sky was white and blank?  I''m seeing white sky in a lot of shots this week.  must be the weather.  Anyway, I like the choice for black and white, and I think that is makes the white sky not so bad.  It''s a lovely mountain.  Looks like a pyrimid.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose as well.  Having the sign in the front, although I have no idea what it says, is very nice.  GOod shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Did you chose black and white cause the sky was white and blank?  I''m seeing white sky in a lot of shots this week.  must be the weather.  Anyway, I like the choice for black and white, and I think that is makes the white sky not so bad.  It''s a lovely mountain.  Looks like a pyrimid.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose as well.  Having the sign in the front, although I have no idea what it says, is very nice.  GOod shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-18 21:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(194066, 10930, 3080, '<td valign="top">I know that the unlevel look is due to the curve of the shore line, but I think that a right rotation would still help this a bit.  It would level the tree line in the back, making it look more ''uniform'', if there is such a thing.  The color is very nice.  I like how the sky is just a bit lighter than the reflection of the sky. Focus and clarity are good.  The view would be much prettier in summer or fall, but some silly people chose this challenge in winter.  lol.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I know that the unlevel look is due to the curve of the shore line, but I think that a right rotation would still help this a bit.  It would level the tree line in the back, making it look more ''uniform'', if there is such a thing.  The color is very nice.  I like how the sky is just a bit lighter than the reflection of the sky. Focus and clarity are good.  The view would be much prettier in summer or fall, but some silly people chose this challenge in winter.  lol.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-18 21:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(194068, 11025, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really quite sure what to say here. The buildings are straight, but the ''horizon'' line is falling off the left side of the photo.  Is there a hill out there or something?  If you straightened up the horizon, your buildings would be tilting, so while I''m not really fond of the tilted horizon (or the LOOK like the horizon is tilted) I really can''t say to rotate to the right, cause then the buildings would be off.  The sunset is really pretty, and the silhouettes are nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not really quite sure what to say here. The buildings are straight, but the ''horizon'' line is falling off the left side of the photo.  Is there a hill out there or something?  If you straightened up the horizon, your buildings would be tilting, so while I''m not really fond of the tilted horizon (or the LOOK like the horizon is tilted) I really can''t say to rotate to the right, cause then the buildings would be off.  The sunset is really pretty, and the silhouettes are nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-18 21:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(194069, 10717, 4411, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, though there is little detail in the snow. The biggest mistake is that the bench is facing out of shot, rather than into it. Would have been better with less exposure and the bench on the right of the frame.</td>', 'A nice shot, though there is little detail in the snow. The biggest mistake is that the bench is facing out of shot, rather than into it. Would have been better with less exposure and the bench on the right of the frame.', '2003-01-18 21:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(194071, 10768, 3080, '<td valign="top">Would a very slight left rotation mess up the angle of the building?  If not, I''d like to see the horizon line leveled off a bit.  There is a horizontal line in the field, so it makes the tilt look worse than it really is, so I don''t really think it''s a big deal.  I love the use of black and white here.   Levels are nice.  Focus and clarity are also great.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Would a very slight left rotation mess up the angle of the building?  If not, I''d like to see the horizon line leveled off a bit.  There is a horizontal line in the field, so it makes the tilt look worse than it really is, so I don''t really think it''s a big deal.  I love the use of black and white here.   Levels are nice.  Focus and clarity are also great.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-18 21:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(194072, 10965, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wow, this took some work. I think it''s fantastic. I guess I would like to see the setup.</td>', 'Wow, this took some work. I think it''s fantastic. I guess I would like to see the setup.', '2003-01-18 21:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
