(194087, 10963, 4159, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s coming to life.  Interesting shot.  I wonder how it would have looked if you had tried it in black and white and then cropped it from the left side of the fence to just to the right of the twig sticking up in the bottom right?  I think the added framing would do a good deal.</td>', 'Looks like it''s coming to life.  Interesting shot.  I wonder how it would have looked if you had tried it in black and white and then cropped it from the left side of the fence to just to the right of the twig sticking up in the bottom right?  I think the added framing would do a good deal.', '2003-01-18 22:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(194088, 10902, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice place you''ve found here.  I think a higher angle, showing more of the other side, might have been more effective, maybe to where the waterline is fully halfway up the "portal."  Still, nice shot.</td>', 'Nice place you''ve found here.  I think a higher angle, showing more of the other side, might have been more effective, maybe to where the waterline is fully halfway up the "portal."  Still, nice shot.', '2003-01-18 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(194089, 10871, 4159, '<td valign="top">I can''t really understand your composition here.  You seem to be shooting through the trees instead of using them to frame your picture, and they''re very distracting.</td>', 'I can''t really understand your composition here.  You seem to be shooting through the trees instead of using them to frame your picture, and they''re very distracting.', '2003-01-18 22:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(194090, 10965, 4159, '<td valign="top">You seem to have put a good deal of thought into the presentation of this picture, and I appreciate that, but the focus on the plant is a bit off, and it doesn''t feel like it''s in the right place.  The idea is good, though, and a reshoot would be well justified.</td>', 'You seem to have put a good deal of thought into the presentation of this picture, and I appreciate that, but the focus on the plant is a bit off, and it doesn''t feel like it''s in the right place.  The idea is good, though, and a reshoot would be well justified.', '2003-01-18 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194091, 10737, 4159, '<td valign="top">I always have to envy moonshots because I don''t have the equipment to take them.   I really would''ve liked for the curve to end instead of being cut off in the picture at the top left corner, but other than that, it''s well executed.</td>', 'I always have to envy moonshots because I don''t have the equipment to take them.   I really would''ve liked for the curve to end instead of being cut off in the picture at the top left corner, but other than that, it''s well executed.', '2003-01-18 22:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(194092, 10870, 4159, '<td valign="top">It is unfortunately not much more than a winter place from where I''m sitting - I''d like something to catch my interest, or at least produce some recognizable effect on me, and this does neither.</td>', 'It is unfortunately not much more than a winter place from where I''m sitting - I''d like something to catch my interest, or at least produce some recognizable effect on me, and this does neither.', '2003-01-18 22:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(194094, 11036, 4159, '<td valign="top">This does feel very dry, and you''ve gotten that idea across well.  Composition good, too.  The only problem I have is a lack of something really interesting, but that''s hard to find in landscapes; good picture.</td>', 'This does feel very dry, and you''ve gotten that idea across well.  Composition good, too.  The only problem I have is a lack of something really interesting, but that''s hard to find in landscapes; good picture.', '2003-01-18 23:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(194095, 10756, 4159, '<td valign="top">I know everyone is saying something about how this picture ought to have been bigger, but I have to say it too; it looks like it had a lot of potential as a photograph, but I can''t make out what''s in it.</td>', 'I know everyone is saying something about how this picture ought to have been bigger, but I have to say it too; it looks like it had a lot of potential as a photograph, but I can''t make out what''s in it.', '2003-01-18 23:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(194097, 10768, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really nice, especially the choice of B &amp; W.  It just seems a bit soft on focus. Good job.</td>', 'Really nice, especially the choice of B & W.  It just seems a bit soft on focus. Good job.', '2003-01-18 23:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(194098, 10811, 4159, '<td valign="top">For some ridiculous reason this gave me the impression of a bunch of boats lined up to go to church... Heh.  Your picture is very nice in many aspects, well done.</td>', 'For some ridiculous reason this gave me the impression of a bunch of boats lined up to go to church... Heh.  Your picture is very nice in many aspects, well done.', '2003-01-18 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(194100, 10992, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but the skyline detracts from it.  Colors are good, but it feels too humanly cluttered (which may or may not have been what you intended), and it doesn''t quite work for me.</td>', 'Nice sky, but the skyline detracts from it.  Colors are good, but it feels too humanly cluttered (which may or may not have been what you intended), and it doesn''t quite work for me.', '2003-01-18 23:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(194101, 10959, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat photo although I''m not sure it qualifies as a Landscape. The trees seem to be so sharply in focus for being in the undulating water. Cool.</td>', 'This is a really neat photo although I''m not sure it qualifies as a Landscape. The trees seem to be so sharply in focus for being in the undulating water. Cool.', '2003-01-18 23:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(194102, 10815, 3280, '<td valign="top">This sure looks familiar, like it is Cades Cove in the Smokies. Nice shot.</td>', 'This sure looks familiar, like it is Cades Cove in the Smokies. Nice shot.', '2003-01-18 23:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(194103, 10996, 4159, '<td valign="top">I can see this hanging above a hotel bed.  The water texture is nice, as are the plants in front; I can''t say I care much for the naked trees in the back, but they''re really hard to present well.  Nice picture.</td>', 'I can see this hanging above a hotel bed.  The water texture is nice, as are the plants in front; I can''t say I care much for the naked trees in the back, but they''re really hard to present well.  Nice picture.', '2003-01-18 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(194104, 10917, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very neat shot.  I''m not sure how much it meets the challenge but it is a great abstract.</td>', 'Very neat shot.  I''m not sure how much it meets the challenge but it is a great abstract.', '2003-01-18 23:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(194105, 10711, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great color, I really like the way the fields of cornstalks merge at different angles.  Great job.</td>', 'Great color, I really like the way the fields of cornstalks merge at different angles.  Great job.', '2003-01-18 23:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(194106, 10891, 4159, '<td valign="top">The colors are brilliant here, but the sky looks a bit grainy.  I think you might have been well off with a little less of it, actually.</td>', 'The colors are brilliant here, but the sky looks a bit grainy.  I think you might have been well off with a little less of it, actually.', '2003-01-18 23:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194107, 10963, 3280, '<td valign="top">OK, so what is it that makes the bumps here?  A neat shot. May have worked a bit better if you used the entire 150 kb file size instead of just 60kb, would have been a little sharper.</td>', 'OK, so what is it that makes the bumps here?  A neat shot. May have worked a bit better if you used the entire 150 kb file size instead of just 60kb, would have been a little sharper.', '2003-01-18 23:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(194108, 10801, 3280, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that the sign adds anything here. As a matter of fact It may be a distraction.</td>', 'I don''t think that the sign adds anything here. As a matter of fact It may be a distraction.', '2003-01-18 23:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(194109, 10912, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wow, great color and focus.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Wow, great color and focus.  I like this a lot.', '2003-01-18 23:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(194110, 11037, 3280, '<td valign="top">The mist is really cool. Very surreal looking. Great job.</td>', 'The mist is really cool. Very surreal looking. Great job.', '2003-01-18 23:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(194112, 10932, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat falls and nice job!</td>', 'Neat falls and nice job!', '2003-01-18 23:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(194122, 10956, 1863, '<td valign="top">What a lovely bright picture. One I almost over looked. The composition is excellent. I cannot really fault it. Perhaps if you had cropped a tiny bit off the bottom of the photograph it would have been that little touch better. I give you a 9! -Annida</td>', 'What a lovely bright picture. One I almost over looked. The composition is excellent. I cannot really fault it. Perhaps if you had cropped a tiny bit off the bottom of the photograph it would have been that little touch better. I give you a 9! -Annida', '2003-01-19 00:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(194123, 10978, 1863, '<td valign="top">This photograph certainly doesn''t need a border.. the natural frame is stunning. The mountain in the background is also very beautiful.  The strange thing is that the colours are a bit dull.... A beautiful photograph nonetheless! Congratulations 8 -Annida</td>', 'This photograph certainly doesn''t need a border.. the natural frame is stunning. The mountain in the background is also very beautiful.  The strange thing is that the colours are a bit dull.... A beautiful photograph nonetheless! Congratulations 8 -Annida', '2003-01-19 00:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(194126, 10914, 3540, '<td valign="top">If this photo was a little clearer, it would help.  The general composition doesn''t have a lot of balance to it.  The sky color is great.  - Inspzil</td>', 'If this photo was a little clearer, it would help.  The general composition doesn''t have a lot of balance to it.  The sky color is great.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 00:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(194127, 10906, 3540, '<td valign="top">Landscape?  No.  Great picture?  Oh yea baby.  This is awesome.  Well composed, well balanced, well taken.  Well done! - Inspzil</td>', 'Landscape?  No.  Great picture?  Oh yea baby.  This is awesome.  Well composed, well balanced, well taken.  Well done! - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 00:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(194128, 10870, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too much stuff.  Landscape shots should show a little more land.  Several square miles or acres shown with unique stuff scattered about.  This is a little more like 100-200 square feet with a ton of branches and stuff.  It''s so close you can''t see very much sky.  Sorry! - Inspzil</td>', 'Too much stuff.  Landscape shots should show a little more land.  Several square miles or acres shown with unique stuff scattered about.  This is a little more like 100-200 square feet with a ton of branches and stuff.  It''s so close you can''t see very much sky.  Sorry! - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 00:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(194129, 10904, 4267, '<td valign="top">do you know the number for airline reservations? I am on my way!</td>', 'do you know the number for airline reservations? I am on my way!', '2003-01-19 00:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(194130, 10905, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool sky.  Good silhouette of this very photogenic tree.  Well taken from a good perspective. - Inspzil</td>', 'Cool sky.  Good silhouette of this very photogenic tree.  Well taken from a good perspective. - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 00:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194131, 10948, 4267, '<td valign="top">seems more like digital art than photography... kind of over processed.. I would love to see this shot as it was taken...</td>', 'seems more like digital art than photography... kind of over processed.. I would love to see this shot as it was taken...', '2003-01-19 00:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(194133, 10862, 5268, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot. I''m not sure about DOF. It could have been better or maybe I just need new glasses ;-)  Cub</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot. I''m not sure about DOF. It could have been better or maybe I just need new glasses ;-)  Cub', '2003-01-19 00:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194134, 11010, 4267, '<td valign="top">great rainbow capture.... but is this more of a waterscape pic rather than a landscape pic? anyway, I like it to much so I won\''t lower the score for that!<br/>plus you need to enter that in the other DPC competition for cash... that would be a nice entry for this months topic!</td>', 'great rainbow capture.... but is this more of a waterscape pic rather than a landscape pic? anyway, I like it to much so I won\''t lower the score for that!plus you need to enter that in the other DPC competition for cash... that would be a nice entry for this months topic!', '2003-01-19 00:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(194135, 10937, 4267, '<td valign="top">a lower apature setting would give more depth of field bringing some of the farther away trees into focus... which I would like better... and a more even crop so the trees on each side are spaced evenly from center would help too... but you did make a nice choice of subjects for the competition...</td>', 'a lower apature setting would give more depth of field bringing some of the farther away trees into focus... which I would like better... and a more even crop so the trees on each side are spaced evenly from center would help too... but you did make a nice choice of subjects for the competition...', '2003-01-19 00:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(194137, 10701, 4267, '<td valign="top">great sky! but where''s the land?</td>', 'great sky! but where''s the land?', '2003-01-19 01:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194138, 10918, 4267, '<td valign="top">great use of black and white!</td>', 'great use of black and white!', '2003-01-19 01:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(194142, 10909, 1863, '<td valign="top">A very lovely view of a little river! I find the picture a little bit noisy, and there''s a weird blue and purple dot in the middle of the photo! I think it would have beena touch better if you had taken the photo in the landscape way, and not the portrait way. I wish I could see more of the left side of the photo. A lovely idea though :)  -Annida</td>', 'A very lovely view of a little river! I find the picture a little bit noisy, and there''s a weird blue and purple dot in the middle of the photo! I think it would have beena touch better if you had taken the photo in the landscape way, and not the portrait way. I wish I could see more of the left side of the photo. A lovely idea though :)  -Annida', '2003-01-19 02:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(194144, 10850, 1863, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! One of the nicer cloud photographs :) I like the texture of the clouds, the the tall jutting branch on the right hand side. The front of the photograph is a bit dark, but I love the way there''s jutting whitish grass (?), bushes (?) in the front, they''re just amazing. I love the silhouettes. -8- Annida</td>', 'What a great idea! One of the nicer cloud photographs :) I like the texture of the clouds, the the tall jutting branch on the right hand side. The front of the photograph is a bit dark, but I love the way there''s jutting whitish grass (?), bushes (?) in the front, they''re just amazing. I love the silhouettes. -8- Annida', '2003-01-19 02:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(194145, 10953, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photograph of a waterfall, and it is well taken, and the composition is very well put together. My only gripe is that I can''t see more of the area around it! 7! -Annida</td>', 'This is a very nice photograph of a waterfall, and it is well taken, and the composition is very well put together. My only gripe is that I can''t see more of the area around it! 7! -Annida', '2003-01-19 02:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(194146, 10852, 1863, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how I can fault this. Too bad you couldn''t actually take the photo from the surface of the moon! 9 -Annida</td>', 'I don''t know how I can fault this. Too bad you couldn''t actually take the photo from the surface of the moon! 9 -Annida', '2003-01-19 02:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(194147, 10824, 1863, '<td valign="top">A pretty photograph! I think if you had been standing on the left hand side next to the tree, and had taken the photograph that way, and if the current of the water followed deeper into the photograph, it would make more sense to me. I do like how the little stream curves to the left though, that is stunning! -Annida</td>', 'A pretty photograph! I think if you had been standing on the left hand side next to the tree, and had taken the photograph that way, and if the current of the water followed deeper into the photograph, it would make more sense to me. I do like how the little stream curves to the left though, that is stunning! -Annida', '2003-01-19 02:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(194148, 10818, 1863, '<td valign="top">A good idea! I wish you had taken the photo from another perspective though, maybe from the green area where the water is still?  It would have been nice to see more green :) -Annida</td>', 'A good idea! I wish you had taken the photo from another perspective though, maybe from the green area where the water is still?  It would have been nice to see more green :) -Annida', '2003-01-19 02:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(194149, 10901, 1863, '<td valign="top">That looks like a huge armchair of ice to me! Just stunning! it''s a shame that you couldn''t be further back to get more of this stunning structure.. maybe where it touches the bottom would have been a nice touch to add :) 7 - Annida</td>', 'That looks like a huge armchair of ice to me! Just stunning! it''s a shame that you couldn''t be further back to get more of this stunning structure.. maybe where it touches the bottom would have been a nice touch to add :) 7 - Annida', '2003-01-19 02:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(194150, 10870, 1863, '<td valign="top">A good idea, and quite a busy photo! I don''t quite know where to start looking at it :) My eyes are constantly drawn to the right hand side of the photo where there seems to be some structure with the tree covered in snow. I think it may have worked a bit better if you were further back though :) Still a lovely photo! -Annida</td>', 'A good idea, and quite a busy photo! I don''t quite know where to start looking at it :) My eyes are constantly drawn to the right hand side of the photo where there seems to be some structure with the tree covered in snow. I think it may have worked a bit better if you were further back though :) Still a lovely photo! -Annida', '2003-01-19 02:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(194151, 10814, 1863, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe how amazing the trees are in all these photographs, and this is one of them. A gem of nature! My only gripe with this photograph is that if you had walked about hmm... 30 more paces to the right, and had taken the photo, you would have been able to get the picture with the tree silhouetted in the sky, and the peak of the mountain showing in its own glory :) I give you an 8! lovely work! -Annida</td>', 'I can''t believe how amazing the trees are in all these photographs, and this is one of them. A gem of nature! My only gripe with this photograph is that if you had walked about hmm... 30 more paces to the right, and had taken the photo, you would have been able to get the picture with the tree silhouetted in the sky, and the peak of the mountain showing in its own glory :) I give you an 8! lovely work! -Annida', '2003-01-19 02:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(194157, 10953, 4514, '<td valign="top">Wonder what this would have looked like with a slower shutter speed. <br/></td>', 'Wonder what this would have looked like with a slower shutter speed. ', '2003-01-19 03:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(194158, 10942, 4514, '<td valign="top">Light is very harsh on the south side of the house.</td>', 'Light is very harsh on the south side of the house.', '2003-01-19 03:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(194159, 10929, 4514, '<td valign="top">Wonderful</td>', 'Wonderful', '2003-01-19 03:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(194162, 10838, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours. This has to be in Iceland! It feels like there''s a little bit too much glare on the snow, but how you would avoid that I don''t really know.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours. This has to be in Iceland! It feels like there''s a little bit too much glare on the snow, but how you would avoid that I don''t really know.', '2003-01-19 03:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(194163, 10832, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice city shot. I like the composition, but the colouring is a little bit brownish. Some work on the hue/saturation, etc. would brighten it up a little.</td>', 'Nice city shot. I like the composition, but the colouring is a little bit brownish. Some work on the hue/saturation, etc. would brighten it up a little.', '2003-01-19 03:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(194165, 10913, 1037, '<td valign="top">The light in the sky is really interesting. Very atmospheric and moody, with those silhouettes. The photo itself has a bit of noise (ironic?). Using Neatimage could sort it out.</td>', 'The light in the sky is really interesting. Very atmospheric and moody, with those silhouettes. The photo itself has a bit of noise (ironic?). Using Neatimage could sort it out.', '2003-01-19 03:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(194166, 11033, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and atmospheric. Great composition. I think I''d like the darkest tones to be a little darker, but that''s my only nitpick.</td>', 'Very beautiful and atmospheric. Great composition. I think I''d like the darkest tones to be a little darker, but that''s my only nitpick.', '2003-01-19 04:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(194167, 10786, 1863, '<td valign="top">I like the wild tree branches and the way they intertwine, but I feel this picture had a lot more potential if you had lowered the camera a bit, to get what''s actually behind these trees. It''s also quite blurry which is a bit distracting. Keep working on it! -Annida</td>', 'I like the wild tree branches and the way they intertwine, but I feel this picture had a lot more potential if you had lowered the camera a bit, to get what''s actually behind these trees. It''s also quite blurry which is a bit distracting. Keep working on it! -Annida', '2003-01-19 04:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(194169, 10773, 1863, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the space on this picture. Everything was positioned properly, and the colours are beautiful, I cannot fault it. 10!! - Annida</td>', 'I like the use of the space on this picture. Everything was positioned properly, and the colours are beautiful, I cannot fault it. 10!! - Annida', '2003-01-19 04:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(194170, 11017, 1863, '<td valign="top">Stunning -10 -Annida</td>', 'Stunning -10 -Annida', '2003-01-19 04:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(194171, 10996, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but I''m sure many people have mentioned that it''s a little small. I like the fact that this reduces it more to the level of textures and colours, because details become indistinct... but is that what you wanted? The border is very thick, but maybe in this case that works.</td>', 'Very pretty, but I''m sure many people have mentioned that it''s a little small. I like the fact that this reduces it more to the level of textures and colours, because details become indistinct... but is that what you wanted? The border is very thick, but maybe in this case that works.', '2003-01-19 04:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(194172, 10971, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition of the fence in this photo. The colours are soft and beautiful. Other elements are a little busy though.</td>', 'Very nice composition of the fence in this photo. The colours are soft and beautiful. Other elements are a little busy though.', '2003-01-19 04:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(194173, 10911, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the rich tones in this photo, and the composition of that river. It has the feeling, though, that you used noise removal or some aggressive compression on it... maybe that''s not the case, but some areas of shrubbery are kind of smudgy. I''m not going to mark down for that, because I could be wrong.</td>', 'I love the rich tones in this photo, and the composition of that river. It has the feeling, though, that you used noise removal or some aggressive compression on it... maybe that''s not the case, but some areas of shrubbery are kind of smudgy. I''m not going to mark down for that, because I could be wrong.', '2003-01-19 04:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(194174, 10792, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the camera angle on the bridge itself (it brings out the curves nicely), however the trees behind it make areas of the lattice work on the railings indistinct. Some other angles may have worked better?</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the camera angle on the bridge itself (it brings out the curves nicely), however the trees behind it make areas of the lattice work on the railings indistinct. Some other angles may have worked better?', '2003-01-19 04:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(194175, 10943, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Not many landscape photos in this challenge tell a story or make a point beyond aesthetic pleasantry. This one stands out, and is very nicely composed and well photographed also. 10 from me.</td>', 'Very cool! Not many landscape photos in this challenge tell a story or make a point beyond aesthetic pleasantry. This one stands out, and is very nicely composed and well photographed also. 10 from me.', '2003-01-19 04:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(194176, 11044, 1037, '<td valign="top">A little bit dull. The sky is overexposed (easy to do, I know), and the 3 areas of landscape, while being serene, yes, are featureless. I like the pebbles, but there isn''t much to hold my interest.</td>', 'A little bit dull. The sky is overexposed (easy to do, I know), and the 3 areas of landscape, while being serene, yes, are featureless. I like the pebbles, but there isn''t much to hold my interest.', '2003-01-19 04:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(194177, 10808, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love this. The shallow DOF is great, the narrow cropping, and the small size (plus the big border) all work together in this image. My attention comes right down to that one, smooth pebble on a timeless beach. Very littoral :) (I love that word). 10 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love this. The shallow DOF is great, the narrow cropping, and the small size (plus the big border) all work together in this image. My attention comes right down to that one, smooth pebble on a timeless beach. Very littoral :) (I love that word). 10 from me.', '2003-01-19 04:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(194178, 10850, 1037, '<td valign="top">Atmospheric photo, but the straggly seedling in the foreground doesn''t really set it off well. Nice clouds.</td>', 'Atmospheric photo, but the straggly seedling in the foreground doesn''t really set it off well. Nice clouds.', '2003-01-19 04:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(194179, 10811, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like the light in this photo, and your camera angle. Very nice.</td>', 'I really like the light in this photo, and your camera angle. Very nice.', '2003-01-19 04:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(194180, 10831, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very, very strong composition, and great colours despite strong sunlight. Nice photo.</td>', 'Very, very strong composition, and great colours despite strong sunlight. Nice photo.', '2003-01-19 04:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(194181, 10879, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, interesting landscape. Something I''ve never seen before. Very weird.</td>', 'Wow, interesting landscape. Something I''ve never seen before. Very weird.', '2003-01-19 04:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(194183, 10958, 6087, '<td valign="top">Very Pretty</td>', 'Very Pretty', '2003-01-19 04:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(194184, 10965, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting, bold composition and colours. The way the lighting edges that plant in the foreground is lovely. Overall, it doesn''t really grab me, however. It seems too stark and cold.</td>', 'Interesting, bold composition and colours. The way the lighting edges that plant in the foreground is lovely. Overall, it doesn''t really grab me, however. It seems too stark and cold.', '2003-01-19 04:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(194186, 10995, 6087, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2003-01-19 04:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194188, 10892, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m probably not alone in saying that I''m not sure this qualifies for a "landscape" picture. It''s a very nice macro, and worth high marks, but I have to take one or so off for not meeting the challenge (I don''t mark down hugely for that).</td>', 'I''m probably not alone in saying that I''m not sure this qualifies for a "landscape" picture. It''s a very nice macro, and worth high marks, but I have to take one or so off for not meeting the challenge (I don''t mark down hugely for that).', '2003-01-19 05:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(194189, 10998, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo has a nice, narrative feel to it. I can imagine a little story to describe who lives at the house, who''s visiting them in the car, etc. I like the composition around the gate, the driveway, and the centred house. Nice photo.</td>', 'This photo has a nice, narrative feel to it. I can imagine a little story to describe who lives at the house, who''s visiting them in the car, etc. I like the composition around the gate, the driveway, and the centred house. Nice photo.', '2003-01-19 05:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(194190, 10990, 4090, '<td valign="top">composition is great .... 10</td>', 'composition is great .... 10', '2003-01-19 05:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(194191, 10910, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like the cropping and composition of this. The roofs could be distracting, but the way they''re stepped looks nice juxtaposed against the mountains in the background. I feel like I''m standing on a street, hemmed in by houses, looking out at the mountains. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like the cropping and composition of this. The roofs could be distracting, but the way they''re stepped looks nice juxtaposed against the mountains in the background. I feel like I''m standing on a street, hemmed in by houses, looking out at the mountains. Nice work.', '2003-01-19 05:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(194192, 10929, 4090, '<td valign="top">the sheer size is amazing, and composition ... 10</td>', 'the sheer size is amazing, and composition ... 10', '2003-01-19 05:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(194193, 10838, 4090, '<td valign="top">to me this is the winner ....10/10</td>', 'to me this is the winner ....10/10', '2003-01-19 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(194195, 10852, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool, but I had to give you a 9 instead of a 10 because I couldn''t find the American flag the astronauts left up there.  Maybe it was on the dark side of the moon this day! I can''t explain why, but the white portion of the border is a little over bearing.  Maybe a thin white border with a thicker black border would give it more balance.</td>', 'This is pretty cool, but I had to give you a 9 instead of a 10 because I couldn''t find the American flag the astronauts left up there.  Maybe it was on the dark side of the moon this day! I can''t explain why, but the white portion of the border is a little over bearing.  Maybe a thin white border with a thicker black border would give it more balance.', '2003-01-19 05:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194197, 10909, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition here. It reminds me of a chinese landscape painting, with that mist. I like the effect of the lens flare.</td>', 'Very nice composition here. It reminds me of a chinese landscape painting, with that mist. I like the effect of the lens flare.', '2003-01-19 05:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(194198, 10735, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The composition around those rocks is spot on.</td>', 'Very pretty. The composition around those rocks is spot on.', '2003-01-19 05:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(194200, 10944, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but a little too bright, busy and washed out.</td>', 'Nice photo, but a little too bright, busy and washed out.', '2003-01-19 05:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(194201, 10965, 5475, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.  My shot this week is a similar concept (foreground object the main focus of the image).  I like the very simple lines of the tree line horizon, the clear sky.  I also like the graduation of tones in the foreground.  I keep trying to imagine this shot without the branch to the right of the stem.  I think I would either like this better without the branch, or crop lower so the branch doesn''t start at the very bottom of the frame.  Nice image and good luck in the challenge...8</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.  My shot this week is a similar concept (foreground object the main focus of the image).  I like the very simple lines of the tree line horizon, the clear sky.  I also like the graduation of tones in the foreground.  I keep trying to imagine this shot without the branch to the right of the stem.  I think I would either like this better without the branch, or crop lower so the branch doesn''t start at the very bottom of the frame.  Nice image and good luck in the challenge...8', '2003-01-19 06:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(194202, 10714, 5475, '<td valign="top">I love the tones in this image.  I like the sillohuette of the trees as well.  The only thing I''m not too crazy about is the horizon near the center of the frame.  Cropping out a little on the bottom would offset your horizon a little, adding balance to the photo (IMHO).  Still a great shot and I give it an 8!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the tones in this image.  I like the sillohuette of the trees as well.  The only thing I''m not too crazy about is the horizon near the center of the frame.  Cropping out a little on the bottom would offset your horizon a little, adding balance to the photo (IMHO).  Still a great shot and I give it an 8!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 06:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(194203, 11007, 5475, '<td valign="top">The use of infrared gives this shot a lot of drama and emotion.  I like the range of tones from blacks to whites. This almost has an illustration quality to it.  The only thing I''m not liking is the horizon at the center of the frame.  I like seeing the horizon offset, either higher or lower in the frame.  The diagonal lines in the foreground are a very stong element in this photo, as are the dramatic clouds.  Even though they are both strong elements, I still think cropping to place your horizon near the 1/3 or 2/3 line would help.    Nice shot and nice use of black and white!  8</td>', 'The use of infrared gives this shot a lot of drama and emotion.  I like the range of tones from blacks to whites. This almost has an illustration quality to it.  The only thing I''m not liking is the horizon at the center of the frame.  I like seeing the horizon offset, either higher or lower in the frame.  The diagonal lines in the foreground are a very stong element in this photo, as are the dramatic clouds.  Even though they are both strong elements, I still think cropping to place your horizon near the 1/3 or 2/3 line would help.    Nice shot and nice use of black and white!  8', '2003-01-19 06:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(194204, 10962, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! One of the best reflection shots I''ve seen in this challenge so far. The composition around that little house is great, giving the image a sense of scale. I just love the incredible sense of texture here, almost to the point of being abstract. A 10 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful! One of the best reflection shots I''ve seen in this challenge so far. The composition around that little house is great, giving the image a sense of scale. I just love the incredible sense of texture here, almost to the point of being abstract. A 10 from me.', '2003-01-19 06:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(194205, 10951, 1037, '<td valign="top">Stunning tree silhouette, as nice as many in the "Without the Hand of Man" members challenge from a few weeks back. It''s not quite a landscape photo though.</td>', 'Stunning tree silhouette, as nice as many in the "Without the Hand of Man" members challenge from a few weeks back. It''s not quite a landscape photo though.', '2003-01-19 06:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(194206, 11035, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting atmospheric shot. I love the panoramic cropping. This photo really appeals to me. Good work!</td>', 'Interesting atmospheric shot. I love the panoramic cropping. This photo really appeals to me. Good work!', '2003-01-19 06:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(194207, 10922, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very rich black and white, with great clouds and beautiful, textured trees/shrubs. The subtle element of the ... whatever that geological formation is!... in the background ties the photo together beautifully.</td>', 'Very rich black and white, with great clouds and beautiful, textured trees/shrubs. The subtle element of the ... whatever that geological formation is!... in the background ties the photo together beautifully.', '2003-01-19 06:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194209, 10855, 2780, '<td valign="top">There seems to be some results of over-sharpening on the tree, but i really like the simplicity of the photo, and the high contrasts. 8</td>', 'There seems to be some results of over-sharpening on the tree, but i really like the simplicity of the photo, and the high contrasts. 8', '2003-01-19 07:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(194210, 10702, 2780, '<td valign="top">really nice and simple, i think its great! The one thing i must say is that the trees look a bit blurry, and I''d like to see more detail in the branches. 8</td>', 'really nice and simple, i think its great! The one thing i must say is that the trees look a bit blurry, and I''d like to see more detail in the branches. 8', '2003-01-19 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(194211, 10746, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent scene. I really like the cloud cover on top of the mountain. The colours seem a bit off however, I can''t really explain what I mean. 8</td>', 'Excellent scene. I really like the cloud cover on top of the mountain. The colours seem a bit off however, I can''t really explain what I mean. 8', '2003-01-19 07:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(194212, 10971, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the flow of the fence, it adds a nice bit of interest to the scene. Good composition. I''m being picky here but I think it could look better with those few branches of tree in the top-left cropped out. 8</td>', 'I really like the flow of the fence, it adds a nice bit of interest to the scene. Good composition. I''m being picky here but I think it could look better with those few branches of tree in the top-left cropped out. 8', '2003-01-19 07:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(194214, 10823, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colours seem a bit faded though. Try upping the saturation. 8</td>', 'Nice composition, colours seem a bit faded though. Try upping the saturation. 8', '2003-01-19 07:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(194215, 11037, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice rolling hills, and the mist looks great. I think it could do with a small sharpen filter though. 8</td>', 'Really nice rolling hills, and the mist looks great. I think it could do with a small sharpen filter though. 8', '2003-01-19 07:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(194216, 10731, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great! The lack of detail doesnt bother me in the slightest, the misty atmosphere adds all the interest to this photo. I really like it! 8</td>', 'Great! The lack of detail doesnt bother me in the slightest, the misty atmosphere adds all the interest to this photo. I really like it! 8', '2003-01-19 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(194217, 10847, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice. Good detail in the trees, and the different shades of white and grey make this very interesting. Composition is good too. 8</td>', 'Really nice. Good detail in the trees, and the different shades of white and grey make this very interesting. Composition is good too. 8', '2003-01-19 07:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(194218, 10840, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I think tho it would look better with the horses coming into the frame, instead of leaving it, and maybe even better if they aeren''t so close to the edge of the photo.</td>', 'Nice photo. I think tho it would look better with the horses coming into the frame, instead of leaving it, and maybe even better if they aeren''t so close to the edge of the photo.', '2003-01-19 07:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(194219, 10801, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice! Black and white works well here. I like the sign in the forground, it makes the shot that much more interesting. 8</td>', 'Really nice! Black and white works well here. I like the sign in the forground, it makes the shot that much more interesting. 8', '2003-01-19 07:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(194220, 10835, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the detail of the ripples in the water, and the subtle beams of sunlight over the horizon look great! 8</td>', 'I like the detail of the ripples in the water, and the subtle beams of sunlight over the horizon look great! 8', '2003-01-19 07:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(194234, 10791, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the snow and the grass both showing.  Also the road sign is a great addition.  Nice view!!  well taken photo to boot - Inspzil</td>', 'I like the snow and the grass both showing.  Also the road sign is a great addition.  Nice view!!  well taken photo to boot - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 08:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(194236, 10818, 3540, '<td valign="top">The subject is great.   There is much potential for this shot.  I think taking the pic from the level of the calm water would make it seem bigger.  It could be a little clearer too.  - Inspzil</td>', 'The subject is great.   There is much potential for this shot.  I think taking the pic from the level of the calm water would make it seem bigger.  It could be a little clearer too.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 08:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(194237, 10784, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the "window" perspective.  Great colors in the sky.  Very picturesque.  It sucks that the coolest part of the sky is right over the power pole and wires!!  Nice capture - Inspzil</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the "window" perspective.  Great colors in the sky.  Very picturesque.  It sucks that the coolest part of the sky is right over the power pole and wires!!  Nice capture - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 08:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(194238, 10731, 3540, '<td valign="top">How creepy is this?  This has a different appeal than any of the pics I''ve seen so far.  But it is no less great.  With something for a minor focal point, I''d have to give it a 10, but I''d take a nine...I hope you feel the same. - Inspzil</td>', 'How creepy is this?  This has a different appeal than any of the pics I''ve seen so far.  But it is no less great.  With something for a minor focal point, I''d have to give it a 10, but I''d take a nine...I hope you feel the same. - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 08:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(194240, 10917, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a great abstract.  The patterns are really cool.  This is not a good pic for this challenge IMO.  The light and dark split of this make it even more cool.  - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a great abstract.  The patterns are really cool.  This is not a good pic for this challenge IMO.  The light and dark split of this make it even more cool.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 08:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(194243, 10990, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too much clouds.  Black and white was a good choice for this pic.  Nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'Too much clouds.  Black and white was a good choice for this pic.  Nice job - Inspzil', '2003-01-19 08:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(194252, 10821, 1037, '<td valign="top">Strange..... that looks like a pyramid back there. Is this Eqypt? It doesn''t look enough like a desert.<br/> <br/>Very interesting and exotic. I like the panoramic cropping. That sun is spectacular. I''m giving this 10 for being unique and beautiful.</td>', 'Strange..... that looks like a pyramid back there. Is this Eqypt? It doesn''t look enough like a desert. Very interesting and exotic. I like the panoramic cropping. That sun is spectacular. I''m giving this 10 for being unique and beautiful.', '2003-01-19 09:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(194253, 10905, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. It looks a bit like some kind of Japanese painting, or a woodblock print from the Art Nouveau era. So intricate and oranate. 10 from me!</td>', 'Beautiful. It looks a bit like some kind of Japanese painting, or a woodblock print from the Art Nouveau era. So intricate and oranate. 10 from me!', '2003-01-19 09:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(194254, 10742, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very pleasant, peaceful scene, but photographically is a bit busy. The composition isn''t tight enough to keep the viewer interested in any one particular thing.</td>', 'This is a very pleasant, peaceful scene, but photographically is a bit busy. The composition isn''t tight enough to keep the viewer interested in any one particular thing.', '2003-01-19 09:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(194255, 10728, 1037, '<td valign="top">The light in this photo is great, and I love those long, pale blue shadows. However I think the composition of the other elements is a bit lacking. If you''d cut out more or left in more, it may have worked.</td>', 'The light in this photo is great, and I love those long, pale blue shadows. However I think the composition of the other elements is a bit lacking. If you''d cut out more or left in more, it may have worked.', '2003-01-19 09:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(194256, 10733, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting... I can see that you were attempting something cool here, but I''m not sure that it works. The rock and the tower compete with one another too much.</td>', 'Interesting... I can see that you were attempting something cool here, but I''m not sure that it works. The rock and the tower compete with one another too much.', '2003-01-19 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(194259, 10969, 1037, '<td valign="top">The colours and textures in this photo are very warm and beautiful. For some reason it gives me the feeling of a scene from a movie.</td>', 'The colours and textures in this photo are very warm and beautiful. For some reason it gives me the feeling of a scene from a movie.', '2003-01-19 09:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(194265, 10731, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, dark and weird. It reminds me of a painting... it''s called "The Wanderer above the Mists" by Caspar David Friedrich (I just looked that up in a book of mine), although there is no wanderer in this photo. The viewer is put in that position.<br/> <br/>However, there isn''t enough tonal depth. Some work on the levels in this image would give it a lot of impact. It also has a very small file size, suggesting that you compressed it too much when you saved it.<br/> <br/>Here is what I got when I tried fiddling with it, adjusting the levels and sharpening it, but the amount of compression has hurt it.<br/> <br/>//lisa3d.org/images/photos/dpc/Meteora_changed.jpg</td>', 'Very interesting, dark and weird. It reminds me of a painting... it''s called "The Wanderer above the Mists" by Caspar David Friedrich (I just looked that up in a book of mine), although there is no wanderer in this photo. The viewer is put in that position. However, there isn''t enough tonal depth. Some work on the levels in this image would give it a lot of impact. It also has a very small file size, suggesting that you compressed it too much when you saved it. Here is what I got when I tried fiddling with it, adjusting the levels and sharpening it, but the amount of compression has hurt it. //lisa3d.org/images/photos/dpc/Meteora_changed.jpg', '2003-01-19 09:58:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(194267, 10975, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, creatively photographed. It doesn''t really grab me, but it''s technically a very good photo.</td>', 'Interesting idea, creatively photographed. It doesn''t really grab me, but it''s technically a very good photo.', '2003-01-19 10:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(194268, 11040, 1570, '<td valign="top">i can tell that it looked very pretty when you were taking this picture, but techinically it didn''t "come out" well because the plants don''t stand out...</td>', 'i can tell that it looked very pretty when you were taking this picture, but techinically it didn''t "come out" well because the plants don''t stand out...', '2003-01-19 10:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(194272, 11018, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours, lovely composition that puts the viewer right on that path, looking into the horizon. Nice work.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours, lovely composition that puts the viewer right on that path, looking into the horizon. Nice work.', '2003-01-19 10:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(194273, 11004, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow... cool, weird colours and dramatic composition. I really like this photo.</td>', 'Wow... cool, weird colours and dramatic composition. I really like this photo.', '2003-01-19 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(194274, 10870, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a busy photo, but all the detail merges in a pleasant way to create a feeling of texture, with just enough features standing out to provide focus. A bit like a Jackson Pollock painting.</td>', 'This is a busy photo, but all the detail merges in a pleasant way to create a feeling of texture, with just enough features standing out to provide focus. A bit like a Jackson Pollock painting.', '2003-01-19 10:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(194275, 10716, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this could do with a tiny bit more tonal depth, by adjusting the levels and increasing the saturation. The composition is very strong.</td>', 'I think this could do with a tiny bit more tonal depth, by adjusting the levels and increasing the saturation. The composition is very strong.', '2003-01-19 10:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(194278, 10871, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a different, refreshing photo. It seems to glow in black and white, and there is a lovely marriage of bark textures and the twigs against the snow and the darker background of trees. 10 from me!</td>', 'This is a different, refreshing photo. It seems to glow in black and white, and there is a lovely marriage of bark textures and the twigs against the snow and the darker background of trees. 10 from me!', '2003-01-19 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(194279, 10972, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, with an overall merging of trees and twigs into a lovely, textured whole. However, the darkest tones aren''t dark enough (on my monitor, which is properly calibrated).</td>', 'Interesting photo, with an overall merging of trees and twigs into a lovely, textured whole. However, the darkest tones aren''t dark enough (on my monitor, which is properly calibrated).', '2003-01-19 10:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(194281, 10884, 6202, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.', '2003-01-19 10:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(194282, 10863, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous weird colours and tight composition. I like this one a lot.</td>', 'Gorgeous weird colours and tight composition. I like this one a lot.', '2003-01-19 10:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(194284, 11007, 1037, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS! Absolutely perfect. I love it! 10.</td>', 'GORGEOUS! Absolutely perfect. I love it! 10.', '2003-01-19 10:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(194286, 11042, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool... I love the colours in this, and the textures in that old house. Nice photo.</td>', 'Cool... I love the colours in this, and the textures in that old house. Nice photo.', '2003-01-19 10:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(194287, 10745, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Great sense of space and scale. The composition is tight, the colours are glorious, and there are some very tactile textures in the rocks and grass. 10 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous. Great sense of space and scale. The composition is tight, the colours are glorious, and there are some very tactile textures in the rocks and grass. 10 from me.', '2003-01-19 10:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(194288, 10917, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to "landscape". I like it.</td>', 'Interesting approach to "landscape". I like it.', '2003-01-19 10:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(194290, 10963, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and differeint. I love the lumpy look to the snow, and the fence breaks it up, adding perfect focus and scale to pull the photo together. I''m giving this 10.</td>', 'Very interesting and differeint. I love the lumpy look to the snow, and the fence breaks it up, adding perfect focus and scale to pull the photo together. I''m giving this 10.', '2003-01-19 10:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(194291, 10788, 1037, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours. A little bit lacking in subject matter. There isn''t much to draw your eye.</td>', 'Amazing colours. A little bit lacking in subject matter. There isn''t much to draw your eye.', '2003-01-19 10:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(194305, 10944, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love this riot of colors!  And those tall buildings look so meek beside the towering mountain.  Awesome!</td>', 'I love this riot of colors!  And those tall buildings look so meek beside the towering mountain.  Awesome!', '2003-01-19 11:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(194308, 10821, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love this!  The burning sun gives such a fiery intensity to this.  The haze is incredible, but the dome (is it a mosque?) is not obscured.  Awesome!</td>', 'Wow!  I love this!  The burning sun gives such a fiery intensity to this.  The haze is incredible, but the dome (is it a mosque?) is not obscured.  Awesome!', '2003-01-19 11:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(194309, 11017, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow..... this makes me think there should be a poem written to accompany it!  What a glorious scene you captured!  The delicate glow of the moonlight lends such a sacred tone to this.  How lovely!</td>', 'Wow..... this makes me think there should be a poem written to accompany it!  What a glorious scene you captured!  The delicate glow of the moonlight lends such a sacred tone to this.  How lovely!', '2003-01-19 12:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(194310, 10912, 1379, '<td valign="top">Yaggggh!  Your photo is such a wonderful surprise, mixed in with all of the serene, lonely "nature" photos!  This is so alive and vibrant, with the cars streaming by, and the Fridays that is HERE!  I love that the entire frame is filled with this electric life!</td>', 'Yaggggh!  Your photo is such a wonderful surprise, mixed in with all of the serene, lonely "nature" photos!  This is so alive and vibrant, with the cars streaming by, and the Fridays that is HERE!  I love that the entire frame is filled with this electric life!', '2003-01-19 12:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(194311, 10970, 1379, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, lens flares!  I really love the hint of green in the foreground.  Excellent composition, with that manly cactus on the right. Cool!</td>', 'Ooooh, lens flares!  I really love the hint of green in the foreground.  Excellent composition, with that manly cactus on the right. Cool!', '2003-01-19 12:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(194313, 10841, 1379, '<td valign="top">Barnacle Bill, where are you?  I love this detail!</td>', 'Barnacle Bill, where are you?  I love this detail!', '2003-01-19 12:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(194316, 10953, 1185, '<td valign="top">Creative shutter speed. Most of these shots blur the waterfalls much more - yours is just enough to still sense the actual motion. Stare at this long enough and it looks like the water is really moving. Good job.</td>', 'Creative shutter speed. Most of these shots blur the waterfalls much more - yours is just enough to still sense the actual motion. Stare at this long enough and it looks like the water is really moving. Good job.', '2003-01-19 12:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(194320, 10725, 4615, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the wall as a frame.  what we see through it, is definetly a landscape, but is also very muted and monochromatic.  Okay, its winter, of course, thats what there is, but maybe sharpen the trees, or increase saturation, something to brighten it up.   Probably needs more DOF.</td>', 'I like the use of the wall as a frame.  what we see through it, is definetly a landscape, but is also very muted and monochromatic.  Okay, its winter, of course, thats what there is, but maybe sharpen the trees, or increase saturation, something to brighten it up.   Probably needs more DOF.', '2003-01-19 12:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(194321, 10898, 332, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Like the colors in the sky. Good job.</td>', 'Good composition. Like the colors in the sky. Good job.', '2003-01-19 12:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
