(194351, 10990, 332, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Excellent composition. I can''t find anything wrong with this picture. It''s just perfect. I''m not used to give out 10''s. But here ya go: 10!</td>', 'Great shot! Excellent composition. I can''t find anything wrong with this picture. It''s just perfect. I''m not used to give out 10''s. But here ya go: 10!', '2003-01-19 12:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
