(194354, 10990, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like this, especially with black and white, but for me there is just too much sky.When I view it I scroll down so the top part is cut off and wow, it takes my breathe away.  With all the clouds, that is all you see, I don''t focus on the scenery at all, I just focus on the clouds. THere is just so much of them! 7.</td>', 'I like this, especially with black and white, but for me there is just too much sky.When I view it I scroll down so the top part is cut off and wow, it takes my breathe away.  With all the clouds, that is all you see, I don''t focus on the scenery at all, I just focus on the clouds. THere is just so much of them! 7.', '2003-01-19 12:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(194357, 10929, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very pretty view, and nicely captured too.</td>', 'Very pretty view, and nicely captured too.', '2003-01-19 13:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(194361, 10888, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good eye for catching this scene. If the subject is the tree, I would have cropped at least 1/2 of the ground in front. Details seem a little soft - would prefer crisper detail on the tree trunk.</td>', 'Good eye for catching this scene. If the subject is the tree, I would have cropped at least 1/2 of the ground in front. Details seem a little soft - would prefer crisper detail on the tree trunk.', '2003-01-19 13:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(194362, 11010, 3419, '<td valign="top">Yikes - that looks really cold. Good capture of the mood, ice, and the rainbow.</td>', 'Yikes - that looks really cold. Good capture of the mood, ice, and the rainbow.', '2003-01-19 13:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(194363, 10850, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. The sun is a little bright, but not that distracting. I love the sillouhette of the taller trees.</td>', 'Very good composition. The sun is a little bright, but not that distracting. I love the sillouhette of the taller trees.', '2003-01-19 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(194364, 10795, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very different presentation of landscape - composition is very unusual and very creative.</td>', 'Very different presentation of landscape - composition is very unusual and very creative.', '2003-01-19 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(194368, 10814, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very aptly titled. Good capture of mood, colors, and detail.</td>', 'Very aptly titled. Good capture of mood, colors, and detail.', '2003-01-19 13:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(194369, 10951, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like this shot for what it is, but I don''t see much land.  I love the blue sky and the way the sun is a dull white spot in the background.  The shape of the tree is very good, although I would like it better if the branch on the right were not cut off at the edge of the frame.  I also would have liked it if the branch at the bottom was showed attaching to the trunk.  I understand you can''t get rid of the power lines due to spot editing rules, so they are ok.  A fun shot, but I give it a 6 for this challenge because it says "picture of a sillohuetted tree" instead of "landscape"!</td>', 'I like this shot for what it is, but I don''t see much land.  I love the blue sky and the way the sun is a dull white spot in the background.  The shape of the tree is very good, although I would like it better if the branch on the right were not cut off at the edge of the frame.  I also would have liked it if the branch at the bottom was showed attaching to the trunk.  I understand you can''t get rid of the power lines due to spot editing rules, so they are ok.  A fun shot, but I give it a 6 for this challenge because it says "picture of a sillohuetted tree" instead of "landscape"!', '2003-01-19 13:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(194370, 11006, 3419, '<td valign="top">The scene is very pretty, but colors look over-saturated. I''d prefer to see this photo in larger format.</td>', 'The scene is very pretty, but colors look over-saturated. I''d prefer to see this photo in larger format.', '2003-01-19 14:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(194375, 10855, 2199, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and really nice tonal range. Excellent work. 10  LanSnake</td>', 'Beautiful composition and really nice tonal range. Excellent work. 10  LanSnake', '2003-01-19 14:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(194401, 10885, 527, '<td valign="top">It was an interesting decision to make this a black and white. Was there some specific colors that you didn''t like? I think I would have preferred it in color. The large dark area of bushes on the right side is distracting. It feels too dominating of the scene. I do really like the lilipads in the water as well as the fine detail in the trees and around the building. The bright areas appear a little too bright and I wish the sky could be darker. I like the composition in the way that the river leads the eye to the building. Technically it looks very good, clean and sharp.  6  -T</td>', 'It was an interesting decision to make this a black and white. Was there some specific colors that you didn''t like? I think I would have preferred it in color. The large dark area of bushes on the right side is distracting. It feels too dominating of the scene. I do really like the lilipads in the water as well as the fine detail in the trees and around the building. The bright areas appear a little too bright and I wish the sky could be darker. I like the composition in the way that the river leads the eye to the building. Technically it looks very good, clean and sharp.  6  -T', '2003-01-19 15:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(194403, 10770, 5869, '<td valign="top">surfin USA ??????????  .....do I remember a similar shot in song titles?...still great colours etc.</td>', 'surfin USA ??????????  .....do I remember a similar shot in song titles?...still great colours etc.', '2003-01-19 15:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(194404, 10788, 527, '<td valign="top">First of all, this is a very lovely image. However, when I see an image like this with very interesting foreground elements, I tend to wonder if it may have been better to show even more of it. But since I wasn''t there I can''t know that. I just love the darkness and subtle highlights that reveal the shapes of the rocks. Is this Seattle? Hmmmm. the colors seem just right, the exposure is perfect and technically, it looks very sharp and clean. Nice job.  9  -T</td>', 'First of all, this is a very lovely image. However, when I see an image like this with very interesting foreground elements, I tend to wonder if it may have been better to show even more of it. But since I wasn''t there I can''t know that. I just love the darkness and subtle highlights that reveal the shapes of the rocks. Is this Seattle? Hmmmm. the colors seem just right, the exposure is perfect and technically, it looks very sharp and clean. Nice job.  9  -T', '2003-01-19 16:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
