(194476, 10875, 4648, '<td valign="top">Right now I''m stuck betwee a 9 and a 10.  The sky almost pushes it to a 10.  I love how it goes from beautiful blue and bright to black and  menacing.  The framing with the weed in front and tree in back is great.  Great one.</td>', 'Right now I''m stuck betwee a 9 and a 10.  The sky almost pushes it to a 10.  I love how it goes from beautiful blue and bright to black and  menacing.  The framing with the weed in front and tree in back is great.  Great one.', '2003-01-19 18:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
