(194526, 10981, 1647, '<td valign="top">This photo has something special about it.  I love the rolling rills and the way each ridge becomes progressively more grey - the haze really works well for your photo.  What a lovely house that would be to live in.  Great work - this is a pano worthy of going to the printers and framers</td>', 'This photo has something special about it.  I love the rolling rills and the way each ridge becomes progressively more grey - the haze really works well for your photo.  What a lovely house that would be to live in.  Great work - this is a pano worthy of going to the printers and framers', '2003-01-19 18:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
