(194551, 10978, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful framing to photo.  Don''t suppose the tree grew together and made a complete circle?  Didn''t think so.  Coldn''t be that lucky.  Love looking at the mountain through the trees.  I might have centered the mountain myself, taking a step or two to the right.  Still a wonderful photo.  Deserves this 8.</td>', 'Beautiful framing to photo.  Don''t suppose the tree grew together and made a complete circle?  Didn''t think so.  Coldn''t be that lucky.  Love looking at the mountain through the trees.  I might have centered the mountain myself, taking a step or two to the right.  Still a wonderful photo.  Deserves this 8.', '2003-01-19 19:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(194555, 10971, 2125, '<td valign="top">love it 9</td>', 'love it 9', '2003-01-19 19:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(194557, 10831, 2125, '<td valign="top">I like this because it has three elements  rocks tree and mountains.... pics work better that way in my opinion, it is my rule of thirds lol  9</td>', 'I like this because it has three elements  rocks tree and mountains.... pics work better that way in my opinion, it is my rule of thirds lol  9', '2003-01-19 19:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
