(194559, 10970, 2125, '<td valign="top">i like this concept maybe shoot with sun at your back to avoid lens flare or get a hood ,</td>', 'i like this concept maybe shoot with sun at your back to avoid lens flare or get a hood ,', '2003-01-19 19:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(194561, 10745, 2125, '<td valign="top">i like the area maybe take this early morn or sunset  seems high noonish to me</td>', 'i like the area maybe take this early morn or sunset  seems high noonish to me', '2003-01-19 19:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(194562, 11023, 2125, '<td valign="top">nice mood this envokes</td>', 'nice mood this envokes', '2003-01-19 19:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(194563, 10928, 332, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that border. I would change the blue one for a white one. The picture is good and I woun''t rate it worse because of the border. Good job and good luck :)</td>', 'I don''t like that border. I would change the blue one for a white one. The picture is good and I woun''t rate it worse because of the border. Good job and good luck :)', '2003-01-19 19:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(194564, 11026, 332, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors. Good choice of borders! Excellent composition.</td>', 'Lovely colors. Good choice of borders! Excellent composition.', '2003-01-19 19:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(194566, 10916, 332, '<td valign="top">Þetta virðist vera íslenskt?</td>', 'Þetta virðist vera íslenskt?', '2003-01-19 19:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(194571, 10948, 1863, '<td valign="top">I adore this picture, it looks like it is more of a 3d piece of artwork. I''d love to find out how you did this. I cannot really fault it in any way. My favourite part is the branches of the tree hanging down, and the light reflects off it. *drools* This is a 10!!!! thanks for submitting it :)  -Annida</td>', 'I adore this picture, it looks like it is more of a 3d piece of artwork. I''d love to find out how you did this. I cannot really fault it in any way. My favourite part is the branches of the tree hanging down, and the light reflects off it. *drools* This is a 10!!!! thanks for submitting it :)  -Annida', '2003-01-19 19:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(194572, 10821, 332, '<td valign="top">Perlan stendur alltaf fyrir sínu :)</td>', 'Perlan stendur alltaf fyrir sínu :)', '2003-01-19 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(194573, 10895, 332, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Good composition. That sky looks great!</td>', 'Beautiful. Good composition. That sky looks great!', '2003-01-19 19:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(194576, 11040, 1863, '<td valign="top">This one is so hard to decide on. I like the different textures in the photo. what I think is a bit distracting is the straight line just at the bottom of the photo, I wish you had cropped that out. Perhaps it would have been easier to follow with your eyes into the photo. Right now, my eyes stop right at the bottom of it. -Annida</td>', 'This one is so hard to decide on. I like the different textures in the photo. what I think is a bit distracting is the straight line just at the bottom of the photo, I wish you had cropped that out. Perhaps it would have been easier to follow with your eyes into the photo. Right now, my eyes stop right at the bottom of it. -Annida', '2003-01-19 19:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(194581, 10884, 332, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Don''t like that border. A simple white instead of that green one. I woun''t rate it worse because of that border though :)</td>', 'Great picture. Don''t like that border. A simple white instead of that green one. I woun''t rate it worse because of that border though :)', '2003-01-19 19:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(194582, 11018, 2125, '<td valign="top">Love how the path leads into the picture and the very blue sky nice going!! 10</td>', 'Love how the path leads into the picture and the very blue sky nice going!! 10', '2003-01-19 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(194583, 10725, 2125, '<td valign="top">i love naturally framed pics a nice snowy window you made here 9</td>', 'i love naturally framed pics a nice snowy window you made here 9', '2003-01-19 19:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(194598, 10990, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love this so much, so simple yet so dramatic! This would be fantastic, framed and on the wall. 10</td>', 'I love this so much, so simple yet so dramatic! This would be fantastic, framed and on the wall. 10', '2003-01-19 19:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(194601, 10862, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of a dreary day, but I like the colors.  The darkness works for me.  Focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  I like how you have included the road in the pic, and the fence also.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of a dreary day, but I like the colors.  The darkness works for me.  Focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  I like how you have included the road in the pic, and the fence also.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(194602, 10994, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not too fond of the powerlines, but the sunset is very pretty.  I like the colors, and this silhouettes are good.  Focus looks good.  Angle and framing/cropping are alright as well.  The powerlines look like they are tilting.  Could just be an illusion or something, but I think that''s why they bother me a bit.  Nice view. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not too fond of the powerlines, but the sunset is very pretty.  I like the colors, and this silhouettes are good.  Focus looks good.  Angle and framing/cropping are alright as well.  The powerlines look like they are tilting.  Could just be an illusion or something, but I think that''s why they bother me a bit.  Nice view. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(194604, 10933, 3080, '<td valign="top">Did you take this with a wide angle lens?  Your buildings are strangely tilting inward.  That sometimes happens with wide angle lenses.  Not much landscape, but i understand your point.  The sky is a nice color.  The photo doesn''t make me jump out of my seat with excitement, however it is very nicely done.  Good focus and clarity, nice color, and the framing/cropping are alright as well.  it''s nice how you have the trees framing the edges of the photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Did you take this with a wide angle lens?  Your buildings are strangely tilting inward.  That sometimes happens with wide angle lenses.  Not much landscape, but i understand your point.  The sky is a nice color.  The photo doesn''t make me jump out of my seat with excitement, however it is very nicely done.  Good focus and clarity, nice color, and the framing/cropping are alright as well.  it''s nice how you have the trees framing the edges of the photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(194605, 11037, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Interesting. Looks like a really big cotton blanket draped over the hills.  The angle and framing/cropping is excelent.  i love the color. subtle, but still there.  The focus and clarity is nice for this shot, in my opinion.  It''s kind of soft, but I think it works nicely here.  Very nice view, and great landscape.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  Interesting. Looks like a really big cotton blanket draped over the hills.  The angle and framing/cropping is excelent.  i love the color. subtle, but still there.  The focus and clarity is nice for this shot, in my opinion.  It''s kind of soft, but I think it works nicely here.  Very nice view, and great landscape.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(194609, 11017, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is really nice!</td>', 'this is really nice!', '2003-01-19 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(194611, 10741, 3080, '<td valign="top">Bobby''s pond is kind of icky looking, but the landscape in general is very nice.  I like the rolling hills.  Colors are great, and focus and clarity are really good as well.  The reflections are nice, but I think that the dead grass in the water kind of takes away from it a bit.  Doesn''t damage the photo, but does cut through the reflections.  Lighting conditions look like they were in your favor for the shot.  Nice find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Bobby''s pond is kind of icky looking, but the landscape in general is very nice.  I like the rolling hills.  Colors are great, and focus and clarity are really good as well.  The reflections are nice, but I think that the dead grass in the water kind of takes away from it a bit.  Doesn''t damage the photo, but does cut through the reflections.  Lighting conditions look like they were in your favor for the shot.  Nice find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(194612, 10939, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is just such a perfect bright winter day picture!</td>', 'this is just such a perfect bright winter day picture!', '2003-01-19 20:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(194615, 10912, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is an excelent photo.  Not what I think of when I think of landscapes though.  A "city landscape" would in fact be a ''cityscape''.  But since I''m no landscape expert, I''m being pretty lienient.  Great colors and focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping are great too.  It''s an excelent photo.  Very nicely executed.  Great eye. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an excelent photo.  Not what I think of when I think of landscapes though.  A "city landscape" would in fact be a ''cityscape''.  But since I''m no landscape expert, I''m being pretty lienient.  Great colors and focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping are great too.  It''s an excelent photo.  Very nicely executed.  Great eye. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(194616, 10762, 1570, '<td valign="top">well, this is just snow...</td>', 'well, this is just snow...', '2003-01-19 20:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(194619, 10814, 3080, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the strong diagonal at the bottom.  The angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  Great lighting conditions.  The tree is great, and the background behind the tree is beautiful.  Great focus and clarity.  The clouds are almost too bright, but not quite.  wouldn''t want them any brighter though.  Great view. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the colors and the strong diagonal at the bottom.  The angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  Great lighting conditions.  The tree is great, and the background behind the tree is beautiful.  Great focus and clarity.  The clouds are almost too bright, but not quite.  wouldn''t want them any brighter though.  Great view. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(194621, 10846, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of dull looking this time of year, but that''s not your fault that the landscape challenge fell in the middle of winter. lol.  My family all lives in KY and I live in MI.  I like going down there to see the mountains, but like it up here too.  This photo was taken at a nice angle.  The framing/cropping are good.  I like the angles in the land, and the little pond is placed nicely within the photo.  Good focus and clarity.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of dull looking this time of year, but that''s not your fault that the landscape challenge fell in the middle of winter. lol.  My family all lives in KY and I live in MI.  I like going down there to see the mountains, but like it up here too.  This photo was taken at a nice angle.  The framing/cropping are good.  I like the angles in the land, and the little pond is placed nicely within the photo.  Good focus and clarity.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(194624, 10851, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  What more can I say, really.  The angle and framing/cropping is perfect. Focus and clarity are great.  the lighting is wonderful too.  Great colors and such a pretty view.  Nothing to complain about here.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful.  What more can I say, really.  The angle and framing/cropping is perfect. Focus and clarity are great.  the lighting is wonderful too.  Great colors and such a pretty view.  Nothing to complain about here.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:39:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(194625, 10975, 3419, '<td valign="top">I know the subject is the thorns, but my eyes keep moving back to the barns, and them being out of focus really bothers me. Perhaps lowering the camera would make the thorns more prominent. Colors are good.</td>', 'I know the subject is the thorns, but my eyes keep moving back to the barns, and them being out of focus really bothers me. Perhaps lowering the camera would make the thorns more prominent. Colors are good.', '2003-01-19 20:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(194626, 10751, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice pink sky.  Good color there.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice.  I like how the cliff comes in from the right and you have left space to the left.  Looks like a good job leveling the photo too.  Focus and clarity look good, although it''s kind of hard to tell beint a silhouetted kind of photo.  Great view. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice pink sky.  Good color there.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice.  I like how the cliff comes in from the right and you have left space to the left.  Looks like a good job leveling the photo too.  Focus and clarity look good, although it''s kind of hard to tell beint a silhouetted kind of photo.  Great view. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(194630, 10959, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like a reflection of trees in water.  Not really seeing the connection to a landscape here.  It is an interesting shot though.  The wavy look on the trees is pretty neat and the color of the sky is good too.  it''s a nice angle and the framing/cropping works as well.  I guess my only problem is linking this to the challenge.  Still very nicely done. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a reflection of trees in water.  Not really seeing the connection to a landscape here.  It is an interesting shot though.  The wavy look on the trees is pretty neat and the color of the sky is good too.  it''s a nice angle and the framing/cropping works as well.  I guess my only problem is linking this to the challenge.  Still very nicely done. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-19 20:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(194632, 10893, 3205, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! What a totally awesome photograph...both technically and visually!! ...perfect!! 10!!</td>', 'Wow!!! What a totally awesome photograph...both technically and visually!! ...perfect!! 10!!', '2003-01-19 20:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(194635, 10794, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moment. The rainbow and the side lighting at the right of the photo really make this photo for me. Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Nice capture of the moment. The rainbow and the side lighting at the right of the photo really make this photo for me. Beautiful colors.', '2003-01-19 20:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(194637, 10941, 3419, '<td valign="top">Stunning! Beautiful colors and clarity, and nice composition.</td>', 'Stunning! Beautiful colors and clarity, and nice composition.', '2003-01-19 20:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(194639, 10811, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured. Colors, detail, and composition are wonderful.</td>', 'Very nicely captured. Colors, detail, and composition are wonderful.', '2003-01-19 21:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(194642, 11007, 2716, '<td valign="top">them be big houses.  Good job.  love the tones.</td>', 'them be big houses.  Good job.  love the tones.', '2003-01-19 21:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(194644, 10853, 2221, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like the dramatic blue sky but the small size really ruins your photo :-(<br/></td>', 'Good composition. I like the dramatic blue sky but the small size really ruins your photo :-(', '2003-01-19 21:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(194646, 10793, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks just like Peticotiac River in Moncton, where I''m from.  Good shot,  I like the  curves.  Jacko</td>', 'Wow, looks just like Peticotiac River in Moncton, where I''m from.  Good shot,  I like the  curves.  Jacko', '2003-01-19 21:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(194648, 10789, 2221, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like how you conveyred the tightness of the building of the city. Creative take on the challenge subject!</td>', 'Good composition. I like how you conveyred the tightness of the building of the city. Creative take on the challenge subject!', '2003-01-19 21:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(194650, 10965, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great use of the back lighting. The subject unfortunately is a bit unsharp. Seems your camera focused on the background. But then again, your title suggests that the treetops actually were your subject ;-)</td>', 'Great use of the back lighting. The subject unfortunately is a bit unsharp. Seems your camera focused on the background. But then again, your title suggests that the treetops actually were your subject ;-)', '2003-01-19 21:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(194651, 11004, 2221, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of colour :-) But I like it. Also a good composition (in my opinion).</td>', 'Interesting use of colour :-) But I like it. Also a good composition (in my opinion).', '2003-01-19 21:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(194652, 10993, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space. Expresses the wideness of the lake well. I would have cropped out the upper part with the woods and the shore, so that only the lake is visible. That would increase that expression even more.</td>', 'I like the negative space. Expresses the wideness of the lake well. I would have cropped out the upper part with the woods and the shore, so that only the lake is visible. That would increase that expression even more.', '2003-01-19 21:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(194654, 10975, 806, '<td valign="top">this is so pretty! what detail! great use of dof!!!</td>', 'this is so pretty! what detail! great use of dof!!!', '2003-01-19 21:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(194655, 10778, 3317, '<td valign="top">(penis)</td>', '(penis)', '2003-01-19 21:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(194656, 10984, 2221, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately there is nothing which expresses in the photo that this is a winter day. Well, you can''t make snow when there is none, but for example capturing the breath of the horse would be a good thing. I mean this exhalation (? warning this is a dictionary translaion, mabye steam is the better word?) on cold days.</td>', 'Unfortunately there is nothing which expresses in the photo that this is a winter day. Well, you can''t make snow when there is none, but for example capturing the breath of the horse would be a good thing. I mean this exhalation (? warning this is a dictionary translaion, mabye steam is the better word?) on cold days.', '2003-01-19 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(194657, 10756, 2716, '<td valign="top">Two words: too small.  Seems like an awesome picture, but I can''t see the details.  I''ll still give you a 9 because the whole composition is breath taking.  Jacko.</td>', 'Two words: too small.  Seems like an awesome picture, but I can''t see the details.  I''ll still give you a 9 because the whole composition is breath taking.  Jacko.', '2003-01-19 21:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(194658, 10756, 3317, '<td valign="top">bigger please</td>', 'bigger please', '2003-01-19 21:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(194660, 10808, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF. A bit too shallow for mytaste, I would have liked to see foregound in focus, too. Creative cropping. Normally people would have used landscape format. But I really like the format you chose. The border is a bit too wide. Making the actual photo a bit bigger would be a better use for that space.</td>', 'Great use of DOF. A bit too shallow for mytaste, I would have liked to see foregound in focus, too. Creative cropping. Normally people would have used landscape format. But I really like the format you chose. The border is a bit too wide. Making the actual photo a bit bigger would be a better use for that space.', '2003-01-19 21:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(194661, 10942, 806, '<td valign="top">I love this title. The tones are wonderful, and the mood exceptional!</td>', 'I love this title. The tones are wonderful, and the mood exceptional!', '2003-01-19 21:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(194662, 10737, 2716, '<td valign="top">Gotta love those shots.  What lens did you use; scope?  Good job.  10.</td>', 'Gotta love those shots.  What lens did you use; scope?  Good job.  10.', '2003-01-19 21:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(194663, 10910, 806, '<td valign="top">I''d like to have seen this in horizontal.. because of the mountains....</td>', 'I''d like to have seen this in horizontal.. because of the mountains....', '2003-01-19 21:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(194665, 10716, 2221, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like how the background vanishes in the mist.</td>', 'Good composition. I like how the background vanishes in the mist.', '2003-01-19 21:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(194667, 10737, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great focus for such a shot. I like your creative take on this challenge theme.</td>', 'Wow. Great focus for such a shot. I like your creative take on this challenge theme.', '2003-01-19 21:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(194670, 10965, 806, '<td valign="top">how unique looking (to me) and peaceful, and beautiful!!!<br/></td>', 'how unique looking (to me) and peaceful, and beautiful!!!', '2003-01-19 21:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(194671, 10953, 4615, '<td valign="top">an elment of a landscape, rather than a landscape.  as a photo, technically good, if a bit empty</td>', 'an elment of a landscape, rather than a landscape.  as a photo, technically good, if a bit empty', '2003-01-19 21:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(194673, 11036, 4615, '<td valign="top">perspective seems to be distorted.  could be a stream from a few feet away, or a river in a canyon, taken from the air, might need tighter focus.</td>', 'perspective seems to be distorted.  could be a stream from a few feet away, or a river in a canyon, taken from the air, might need tighter focus.', '2003-01-19 21:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(194675, 10841, 4615, '<td valign="top">there are nice colors here, and a interesting subject in the barnacles encrusted keel, which should be in sharper fiocus.  I try to give a lot of leeway about the challenge perameters, but this isn''t even close to being a landscape.</td>', 'there are nice colors here, and a interesting subject in the barnacles encrusted keel, which should be in sharper fiocus.  I try to give a lot of leeway about the challenge perameters, but this isn''t even close to being a landscape.', '2003-01-19 22:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(194679, 10874, 671, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Colors, composition, focus all wonderful.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Colors, composition, focus all wonderful.', '2003-01-19 22:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(194681, 10885, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unusual choice of B+W but a nice photo anyway.</td>', 'Unusual choice of B+W but a nice photo anyway.', '2003-01-19 22:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(194682, 10911, 671, '<td valign="top">Beaautiful composition.  BW format works very well here.</td>', 'Beaautiful composition.  BW format works very well here.', '2003-01-19 22:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(194684, 10866, 671, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.  Light is wonderful.</td>', 'excellent composition.  Light is wonderful.', '2003-01-19 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(194685, 10733, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF to maintain illusory look; good tone control of white on white.</td>', 'Nice DOF to maintain illusory look; good tone control of white on white.', '2003-01-19 22:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
