(194690, 10939, 4615, '<td valign="top">I think if you had cropped heavily to focus more on the track in the snow this would have been more impactful. that part of the picture is sharply in focus.  The rest, less so.   the table (?) appears a little flattened.</td>', 'I think if you had cropped heavily to focus more on the track in the snow this would have been more impactful. that part of the picture is sharply in focus.  The rest, less so.   the table (?) appears a little flattened.', '2003-01-19 22:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
