(194860, 10914, 2829, '<td valign="top">A visit from the critique club :)<br/> <br/>Wow, I really like this photo. The photo is very sharp, well lit and has a lot of detail. <br/> <br/>One thing I don''t understand however, is that the moon in the photo or dust or something? I have mixed feelings on it, it seems oddly shaped and is kind of in the middle of nowhere just drawing your eye to it even though we should be looking at the landscape. <br/> <br/>I love the old tall tree to the left contrasting to the much smaller tree a few feet back. It has a lot of detail in the bark and the branches.<br/> <br/>Snow is also a nice touch to the scene. Perfectly exposed as well.</td>', 'A visit from the critique club :) Wow, I really like this photo. The photo is very sharp, well lit and has a lot of detail.  One thing I don''t understand however, is that the moon in the photo or dust or something? I have mixed feelings on it, it seems oddly shaped and is kind of in the middle of nowhere just drawing your eye to it even though we should be looking at the landscape.  I love the old tall tree to the left contrasting to the much smaller tree a few feet back. It has a lot of detail in the bark and the branches. Snow is also a nice touch to the scene. Perfectly exposed as well.', '2003-01-20 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(194869, 10990, 2829, '<td valign="top">A visit from the critique club (again) ;)<br/> <br/>Wow, this photo is excellent. I simply love the negative space use here. The sky is so large and clouds add so much depth. <br/> <br/>I love the detail in the mountain and the water around it. I think you did very well getting this much detail into the photo. <br/> <br/>What more is there to say to such a good photo? I think you did very well.</td>', 'A visit from the critique club (again) ;) Wow, this photo is excellent. I simply love the negative space use here. The sky is so large and clouds add so much depth.  I love the detail in the mountain and the water around it. I think you did very well getting this much detail into the photo.  What more is there to say to such a good photo? I think you did very well.', '2003-01-20 00:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(194877, 11004, 3205, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments!  To answer many of you, this was taken using a tobacco gradient filter over the lense.  I had to shoot this real fast, as I was on the side of a busy highway, with my son yelling "Hurry Daddy there is another car coming!"  So, I could not take much time to compose it properly.  I should have shot it without the fence, like many of you suggested.</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments!  To answer many of you, this was taken using a tobacco gradient filter over the lense.  I had to shoot this real fast, as I was on the side of a busy highway, with my son yelling "Hurry Daddy there is another car coming!"  So, I could not take much time to compose it properly.  I should have shot it without the fence, like many of you suggested.', '2003-01-20 00:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(194880, 10975, 2700, '<td valign="top">geez I thought surely this would be top 10 material... I''m sure you will agree...</td>', 'geez I thought surely this would be top 10 material... I''m sure you will agree...', '2003-01-20 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
