(196536, 10799, 5982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Annida:</b></div><hr/><i>A bit bright on the eyes at the top middle/right, and it''s a tiny bit small. It would have looked perhaps a bit better if you had removed the half of the building on the right and made the photo a bit bigger. -Annida</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Quite right about the building!  Thanks for your comment, very helpful!<br/>Nathalie</td>', 'Originally posted by Annida:A bit bright on the eyes at the top middle/right, and it''s a tiny bit small. It would have looked perhaps a bit better if you had removed the half of the building on the right and made the photo a bit bigger. -Annida  Quite right about the building!  Thanks for your comment, very helpful!Nathalie', '2003-01-20 21:33:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(196538, 10799, 5982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gina Rothfels:</b></div><hr/><i>Nice photo, but I''d have liked to see it a bit bigger, also a darker border (the colour of the house perhaps) would have worked better.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I would have to try that!  Thanks for your comment!<br/> <br/>Nathalie</td>', 'Originally posted by Gina Rothfels:Nice photo, but I''d have liked to see it a bit bigger, also a darker border (the colour of the house perhaps) would have worked better.  I would have to try that!  Thanks for your comment! Nathalie', '2003-01-20 21:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
