(1488914, 10898, 8377, '<td valign="top">I chose this as one of my favorites a long time ago, but I never commented. This is a great picture and what really draws my eye in is the colors in the sky. The shadows and the lights enhance the picture so much., and it''s just a beautiful image.</td>', 'I chose this as one of my favorites a long time ago, but I never commented. This is a great picture and what really draws my eye in is the colors in the sky. The shadows and the lights enhance the picture so much., and it''s just a beautiful image.', '2005-06-28 17:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
