(3522755, 10714, 28742, '<td valign="top">If I went back in time and commented on this, I would say "Give it up, you''ll never make it in this business" - but I would go back and say that to all the best photogs on DPC, then the ribbons would be MINE. MINE, I tell ya! :)<br/> <br/>But since I can''t go back in time, I''ll be honest and say this is really a fantastic shot. A few times I tried to do foggy shots, I found it is not as easy as it would seem to make them come out right. I''d also like to comment on the title, which may be an intentional or unintentional play on a common phrase: "Road to Forgiveness" - which is what I thought it said at first glance. :)<br/> <br/>Good luck on DPC, you''ll probably do well here. :P</td>', 'If I went back in time and commented on this, I would say "Give it up, you''ll never make it in this business" - but I would go back and say that to all the best photogs on DPC, then the ribbons would be MINE. MINE, I tell ya! :) But since I can''t go back in time, I''ll be honest and say this is really a fantastic shot. A few times I tried to do foggy shots, I found it is not as easy as it would seem to make them come out right. I''d also like to comment on the title, which may be an intentional or unintentional play on a common phrase: "Road to Forgiveness" - which is what I thought it said at first glance. :) Good luck on DPC, you''ll probably do well here. :P', '2007-04-05 16:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
